#. from gnome:evolution-data-server
msgid "How many days the reminders-past can hold back. Reminders older than these days are automatically removed from the list of the past reminders. Use '0' to not remove old reminders."
msgstr "Hur många dagar som reminders-past kan behållas. Påminnelser äldre än detta antal dagar tas automatiskt bort från listan över tidigare påminnelser. Använd ”0” för att inte ta bort gamla påminnelser."

#. from gnome:evolution-data-server
msgid "Reminder programs"
msgstr "Påminnelseprogram"

#. from gnome:evolution-data-server
msgid "Programs that are allowed to be run by reminders"
msgstr "Program som tillåts att köras av påminnelser"

#. from gnome:evolution-data-server
msgid "Enable desktop notifications"
msgstr "Aktivera skrivbordsaviseringar"

#. from gnome:evolution-data-server
#. from gnome:reviewed/evolution-data-server/master
msgid "When set to true, the desktop/system notifications are shown"
msgstr "När värdet är true (sant) visas skrivbords-/systemaviseringarna"

#. from gnome:evolution-data-server
msgid "Enable audio notifications"
msgstr "Aktivera ljudaviseringar"

#. from gnome:evolution-data-server
#. from gnome:reviewed/evolution-data-server/master
msgid ""
"When set to true, the audio reminders will be played, otherwise audio "
"reminders will be silently ignored"
msgstr ""
"När värdet är true (sant) spelas ljudpåminnelser upp, annars ignoreras de "
"tyst"

#. from gnome:evolution-data-server
msgid "Show reminders in notification tray only"
msgstr "Visa påminnelser endast i aviseringsytan"

#. from gnome:evolution-data-server
#. from gnome:reviewed/evolution-data-server/master
msgid ""
"When set to true, the reminders are shown only in the notification tray, "
