msgstr "Du måste konfigurera ett konto innan du kan skriva meddelanden."

#. from gnome:evolution
msgid "An error occurred while saving to your Outbox folder."
msgstr "Ett fel inträffade vid sparning till din utkorgmapp."

#. from gnome:evolution
msgid "The reported error was “{0}”. The message has not been sent."
msgstr "Det rapporterade felet var ”{0}”. Meddelandet har inte skickats."

