#. from gnome:gnome-subtitles
msgid "Frames to add or subtract when adjusting frames in spinbutton controls (e.g., start, end and duration)."
msgstr "Bildrutor att lägga till eller subtrahera när bildrutor justeras i stegningsrutor (t.ex. start, slut och längd)."

#. from gnome:gnome-subtitles
msgid "Time between subtitles"
msgstr "Tid mellan undertexter"

#. from gnome:gnome-subtitles
msgid "Recommended time between subtitles, in milliseconds, used for example when splitting a subtitle in two."
