msgstr "Rättigheter"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Information about rights held in and over the document"
msgstr "Information om rättigheter som hålls i och över dokumentet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "A related document from which this document is derived"
msgstr "Ett relaterat dokument från vilket detta dokument härleds"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "The nature or genre of the document"
msgstr "Naturen eller genren för dokumentet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "The PDF version of the document"
msgstr "PDF-versionen för dokumentet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Metadata Date"
msgstr "Metadatadatum"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Date and time that any metadata for this resource was last changed"
msgstr "Datum och tid när metadata för denna resurs senast ändrades"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Initial Generator"
msgstr "Ursprungligen genererat av"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Name of the first known tool used to create the document"
msgstr "Namn på det första kända verktyg som använts för dokumentets skapande"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "PDF/A Part"
msgstr "PDF/A-del"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"The part of the PDF/A standard that the document conforms to (e.g., 1, 2, 3)"
msgstr "Delen av PDF/A-standarden som dokumentet följer (t.ex. 1, 2, 3)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "PDF/A Conformance"
msgstr "PDF/A-följsamhet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "The conformance level within the PDF/A standard (e.g., A, B, U)"
msgstr "Följsamhetsnivån inom PDF/A-standarden (t.ex. A, B, U)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"A plugin for extracting metadata from documents in OpenDocument "
"(OpenOffice/LibreOffice), Open XML (Microsoft Office) and PDF formats."
msgstr ""
"En insticksmodul för att extrahera metadata från dokument i OpenDocument- "
"(OpenOffice/LibreOffice), Open XML- (Microsoft Office) och PDF-format."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"PDF handling requires pypdf package for Python to be installed on your "
"system."
msgstr ""
"PDF-hantering kräver att paketet pypdf för Python är installerat på ditt "
"system."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Package pypdf for Python is not installed on your system, PDF handling has "
"been disabled."
msgstr ""
"Paketet pypdf för Python är inte installerat på ditt system, PDF-hantering "
"har inaktiverats."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "User-Defined:"
msgstr "Användardefinierad:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Thumbnail"
msgstr "Miniatyrbild"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Subfile Type"
msgstr "Underfilstyp"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "The number of bits per image component."
msgstr "Antalet bitar per bildkomponent."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"The compression scheme used for the image data. When thumbnails use JPEG "
"compression, this tag value is set to 6."
msgstr ""
"Använd komprimeringsmetod för bilddata. När miniatyrbilder använder JPEG-"
"komprimering så sätts värdet i denna tagg till 6."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "The pixel composition."
msgstr "Bildpunkskompositionen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Thresholding"
msgstr "Tröskelvärde"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"For black and white TIFF files that represent shades of gray, the technique "
"used to convert from gray to black and white pixels."
msgstr ""
"För svartvita TIFF-filer som representerar gråskala, tekniken som används "
"för att konvertera från gråa till svarta och vita bildpunkter."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Cell Width"
msgstr "Cellbredd"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"The width of the dithering or halftoning matrix used to create a dithered or"
" halftoned bilevel file."
msgstr ""
"Bredden för färgutjämnings- eller halvtoningsmatrisen som används för att "
"skapa en färgutjämnad eller halvtonad tvånivåfil."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Cell Length"
msgstr "Cellängd"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"The length of the dithering or halftoning matrix used to create a dithered "
"or halftoned bilevel file."
msgstr ""
"Längden för färgutjämnings- eller halvtoningsmatrisen som används för att "
"skapa en färgutjämnad eller halvtonad tvånivåfil."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "The logical order of bits within a byte"
msgstr "Den logiska ordningen för bitar i en byte"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "The name of the document from which this image was scanned."
msgstr "Namnet på dokumentet från vilket denna bild lästes in."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "A character string giving the title of the image."
msgstr "En teckensträng som ger bildens titel."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"The manufacturer of the recording equipment. This is the manufacturer of the"
" DSC, scanner, video digitizer or other equipment that generated the image."
msgstr ""
"Tillverkaren av bildupptagningsutrustningen. Här anges tillverkaren av den "
"digitala stillbildskameran, skanner, videokamera eller annan utrustning som "
"genererat bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"The model name or model number of the equipment. This is the model name or "
"number of the DSC, scanner, video digitizer or other equipment that "
"generated the image."
msgstr ""
"Modellnamnet eller numret på utrustningen. Detta är modellnamn eller nummer "
"på digital stillbildskamera, skanner, videokamera eller annan utrustning som"
" genererat bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "The number of components per pixel."
msgstr "Antalet komponenter per bildpunkt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"The number of rows per strip. This is the number of rows in the image of one"
" strip when an image is divided into strips."
msgstr ""
"Antalet rader per remsa. Detta är antalet rader i bilden för en remsa när en"
" bild delas upp i remsor."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "SMin Sample Value"
msgstr "SMin-samplingsvärde"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "This field specifies the minimum sample value."
msgstr "Detta fält anger det minimala samplingsvärdet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "SMax Sample Value"
msgstr "SMax-samplingsvärde"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "This field specifies the maximum sample value."
msgstr "Detta fält anger det maximala samplingsvärdet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "X-Resolution"
msgstr "X-upplösning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"The number of pixels per <ResolutionUnit> in the <ImageWidth> direction. "
"When the image resolution is unknown, 72 [dpi] is designated."
msgstr ""
"Antal bildpunkter per <ResolutionUnit> i riktningen <ImageWidth>. När "
"bildupplösningen inte är känd antas 72 [dpi]."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Y-Resolution"
msgstr "Y-upplösning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"The number of pixels per <ResolutionUnit> in the <ImageLength> direction. "
"The same value as <XResolution> is designated."
msgstr ""
"Antalet bildpunkter per <ResolutionUnit> i riktningen <ImageLength>. Samma "
"värde som <XResolution> ges."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Indicates whether pixel components are recorded in a chunky or planar "
"format."
msgstr ""
"Indikerar huruvida bildpunktskomponenter sparas i ett blockvis eller plant "
"format."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Page Name"
msgstr "Sidnamn"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "The name of the page from which this image was scanned."
msgstr "Namnet på sidan från vilket denna bild lästes in."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "X Position"
msgstr "X-position"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"X position of the image. The X offset in ResolutionUnits of the left side of"
" the image, with respect to the left side of the page."
msgstr ""
"X-position för bilden. X-förskjutningen i ResolutionUnits för bildens "
"vänstra sida med avseende på sidans vänstra sida."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Y Position"
msgstr "Y-position"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Y position of the image. The Y offset in ResolutionUnits of the top of the "
"image, with respect to the top of the page. In the TIFF coordinate scheme, "
"the positive Y direction is down, so that YPosition is always positive."
msgstr ""
"Y-position för bilden. Y-förskjutningen i ResolutionUnits för bildens "
"översida med avseende på sidans översida. I TIFF-koordinatschemat är den "
"positiva Y-riktningen nedåt, så YPosition alltid är positiv."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Gray Response Unit"
msgstr "Gråsvarsenhet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "The precision of the information contained in the GrayResponseCurve."
msgstr "Precision för informationen som lagras i gråsvarskurva."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Gray Response Curve"
msgstr "Gråsvarskurva"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "For grayscale data, the optical density of each possible pixel value."
msgstr ""
"För gråskala är det här den optiska densiteten för varje möjligt "
"bildpunktsvärde."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "T4 Options"
msgstr "T4-alternativ"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "T.4-encoding options."
msgstr "T.4-kodningsalternativ."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "T6 Options"
msgstr "T6-alternativ"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "T.6-encoding options."
msgstr "T.6-kodningsalternativ."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"The unit for measuring <XResolution> and <YResolution>. The same unit is "
"used for both <XResolution> and <YResolution>."
msgstr ""
"Enheten för att mäta <XResolution> och <YResolution>. Samma enhet används "
"för både <XResolution> och <YResolution>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Page Number"
msgstr "Sidnummer"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "The page number of the page from which this image was scanned."
msgstr "Sidnumret på sidan från vilket denna bild lästes in."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "A transfer function for the image, described in tabular style."
msgstr "En överföringsfunktion för bilden, beskriven i tabellstil."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"This tag records the name and version of the software or firmware of the "
"camera or image input device used to generate the image."
msgstr ""
"Denna tagg anger namnet och versionen på programmet eller den fasta "
"programvaran för kameran eller bildindataenheten som användes för att skapa "
"bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"The date and time of image creation. In Exif standard, it is the date and "
"time the file was changed."
msgstr ""
"Datumet och tiden för bildskapande. I Exif-standard är det datumet och tiden"
" då filen ändrades."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"This tag records the name of the camera owner, photographer or image "
"creator."
msgstr ""
"Denna tagg anger namnet på kameraägaren, fotografen eller bildskaparen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Host Computer"
msgstr "Värddator"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"This tag records information about the host computer used to generate the "
"image."
msgstr ""
"Denna tagg anger information om värddatorn som använts för att generera "
"bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Predictor"
msgstr "Förutsägare"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"A predictor is a mathematical operator that is applied to the image data "
"before an encoding scheme is applied."
msgstr ""
"En förutsägare är en matematisk operator som tillämpas på bilddata före ett "
"kodningsschema tillämpas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "The chromaticity of the white point of the image."
msgstr "Kromaticiteten för vitpunkten i bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "The chromaticity of the three primary colors of the image."
msgstr "Kromaticiteten för de tre primärfärgerna för bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Color Map"
msgstr "Färgkarta"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"A color map for palette color images. This field defines a Red-Green-Blue "
"color map (often called a lookup table) for palette-color images. In a "
"palette-color image, a pixel value is used to index into an RGB lookup "
"table."
msgstr ""
"En färgkarta för palettfärgbilder. Detta fält definierar en Röd-Grön-Blå "
"färgkarta (ofta kallad en uppslagstabell) för palettfärgbilder. I en "
"palettfärgbild används ett bildpunktsvärde för att indexera till en RGB-"
"uppslagstabell."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Halftone Hints"
msgstr "Halvtonstips"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"The purpose of the HalftoneHints field is to convey to the halftone function"
" the range of gray levels within a colorimetrically-specified image that "
"should retain tonal detail."
msgstr ""
"Syftet med HalftoneHints-fältet är att framföra till halvtonsfunktionen "
"intervallet av grånivåer i en kolorimetriskt angiven bild som ska bevara "
"nyansdetalj."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Tile Width"
msgstr "Rutbredd"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "The tile width in pixels. This is the number of columns in each tile."
msgstr "Rutbredden i bildpunkter. Detta är antalet kolumner i varje ruta."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Tile Length"
msgstr "Rutlängd"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"The tile length (height) in pixels. This is the number of rows in each tile."
msgstr ""
"Rutlängden (höjden) i bildpunkter. Detta är antalet rader i varje ruta."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Ink Set"
msgstr "Bläckuppsättning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"The set of inks used in a separated (PhotometricInterpretation=5) image."
msgstr ""
"Uppsättningen bläck som används i en separerad (PhotometricInterpretation=5)"
" bild."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Ink Names"
msgstr "Bläcknamn"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"The name of each ink used in a separated (PhotometricInterpretation=5) "
"image."
msgstr ""
"Namnet på varje bläck som används i en separerad "
"(PhotometricInterpretation=5) bild."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Number Of Inks"
msgstr "Antal bläck"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "The number of inks."
msgstr "Antal bläck."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Dot Range"
msgstr "Punktintervall"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "The component values that correspond to a 0% dot and 100% dot."
msgstr "Komponentvärdena som motsvarar en 0% punkt och 100% punkt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Target Printer"
msgstr "Målskrivare"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"A description of the printing environment for which this separation is "
"intended."
msgstr "En beskrivning av utskriftsmiljön för vilken separeringen avses."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Extra Samples"
msgstr "Extra samplingar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Specifies that each pixel has m extra components whose interpretation is "
"defined by one of the values listed below."
msgstr ""
"Anger att varje bildpunkt har m extra komponenter vars tolkning definieras "
"av ett av värdena listade nedan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Sample Format"
msgstr "Samplingsformat"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "This field specifies how to interpret each data sample in a pixel."
msgstr "Detta fält anger hur varje datasampling ska tolkas i en bildpunkt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Expands the range of the TransferFunction"
msgstr "Utökar intervallet för TransferFunction"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Clip Path"
msgstr "Beskärningsbana"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"A TIFF ClipPath is intended to mirror the essentials of PostScript's path "
"creation functionality."
msgstr ""
"En TIFF-ClipPath avses visa det viktiga i Postscripts "
"banskaparfunktionalitet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "JPEG tables"
msgstr "JPEG-tabeller"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"This optional tag may be used to encode the JPEG quantization and Huffman "
"tables for subsequent use by the JPEG decompression process."
msgstr ""
"Den här valfria taggen kan användas för att koda JPEG-kvantisering och "
"Huffman-tabeller för senare användning under JPEG-dekomprimeringsprocessen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "JPEG Process"
msgstr "JPEG-process"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "This field indicates the process used to produce the compressed data"
msgstr ""
"Detta fält indikerar processen som används för att producera komprimerade "
"data"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"The matrix coefficients for transformation from RGB to YCbCr image data."
msgstr ""
"Matriskoefficienterna för transformering från RGB till YCbCr-bilddata."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"The sampling ratio of chrominance components in relation to the luminance "
"component."
msgstr ""
"Samplingsproportionerna av krominanskomponenterna i förhållande till "
"luminanskomponenten."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"The position of chrominance components in relation to the luminance "
"component."
msgstr ""
"Positionen för krominanskomponenterna i förhållande till "
"luminanskomponenten."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "The reference black point value and reference white point value."
msgstr "Svartpunktens referensvärde och vitpunktens referensvärde."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Windows Rating"
msgstr "Windows-betyg"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Rating tag used by Windows"
msgstr "Betygstagg som används av Windows"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "CFA Repeat Pattern Dimension"
msgstr "CFA repeterande mönsterdimension"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Contains two values representing the minimum rows and columns to define the "
"repeating patterns of the color filter array"
msgstr ""
"Innehåller två värden som representerar minsta antal rader och kolumner för "
"att definiera de upprepade mönstren för färgfiltervektorn"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Indicates the color filter array (CFA) geometric pattern of the image sensor"
" when a one-chip color area sensor is used."
msgstr ""
"Indikerar det geometriska mönstret hos sensorns färgfilter (CFA - Color "
"Filter Array) när en 1-chipsensor används."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Contains a value of the battery level as a fraction or string"
msgstr "Innehåller ett värde för batterinivån som ett bråk eller en sträng"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Copyright information."
msgstr "Upphovsrättslig information."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "FNumber"
msgstr "Bländartal"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "The F number."
msgstr "Bländartalet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Contains an InterColor Consortium (ICC) format color space "
"characterization/profile"
msgstr ""
"Innehåller en färgrymdskaraktär/profil i formatet InterColor Consortium "
"(ICC)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Indicates the spectral sensitivity of each channel of the camera used."
msgstr ""
"Indikerar den spektrala känsligheten för varje kamerakanal som används."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Indicates the ISO Speed and ISO Latitude of the camera or input device as "
"specified in ISO 12232."
msgstr ""
"Indikerar kamerans eller sensorns ISO-latitud och ISO-ljuskänslighet enligt "
"specifikation ISO 12232."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Indicates the Opto-Electric Conversion Function (OECF) specified in ISO "
"14524."
msgstr ""
"Indikerar den optoelektroniska konverteringsfunktionen (OECF) specificerad i"
" ISO 14524."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/gimp-help-3-0
msgid "Interlace"
msgstr "Fläta"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Indicates the field number of multifield images."
msgstr "Indikerar fältnumret för flerfältsbilder."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Time Zone Offset"
msgstr "Tidszonsförskjutning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"This optional tag encodes the time zone of the camera clock (relative to "
"Greenwich Mean Time) used to create the DataTimeOriginal tag-value when the "
"picture was taken. It may also contain the time zone offset of the clock "
"used to create the DateTime tag-value when the image was modified."
msgstr ""
"Den här valfria taggen kodar tidszonen för kamerans klocka (relativt till "
"Greenwich Mean Time) som användes för att skapa taggvärdet för "
"DataTimeOriginal när bilden togs. Den kan också innehålla "
"tidszonsförskjutningen för klockan som användes för att skapa taggvärdet för"
" DateTime när bilden ändrades."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Self Timer Mode"
msgstr "Självutlösarläge"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Number of seconds image capture was delayed from button press."
msgstr "Antal sekunder som bildtagning fördröjdes från knapptryck."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "The version of this standard supported."
msgstr "Versionen som stöds av denna standard."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Date Time Original"
msgstr "Datum och tid (original)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "The date and time when the original image data was generated."
msgstr "Datum och tid när den ursprungliga bilden genererades."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Offset Time"
msgstr "Tidsförskjutning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Time difference from Universal Time Coordinated including daylight saving "
"time of DateTime tag."
msgstr "Tidsskillnad från UTC inklusive sommartid för taggen DateTime."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Offset Time Original"
msgstr "Tidsförskjutning (original)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Time difference from Universal Time Coordinated including daylight saving "
"time of DateTimeOriginal tag."
msgstr ""
"Tidsskillnad från UTC inklusive sommartid för taggen DateTimeOriginal."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Offset Time Digitized"
msgstr "Tidsförskjutning (digitaliserad)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Time difference from Universal Time Coordinated including daylight saving "
"time of DateTimeDigitized tag."
msgstr ""
"Tidsskillnad från UTC inklusive sommartid för taggen DateTimeDigitized."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Information specific to compressed data."
msgstr "Information specifik för komprimerade data."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Compressed Bits Per Pixel"
msgstr "Komprimerade databitar per bildpunkt"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Specific to compressed data; states the compressed bits per pixel."
msgstr ""
"Specifik för komprimerade data, anger komprimerade bitar per bildpunkt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Shutter Speed Value"
msgstr "Värde på slutartid"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Shutter speed."
msgstr "Slutartid."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "The lens aperture."
msgstr "Objektivbländare."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Brightness Value"
msgstr "Ljusstyrkevärde"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "The value of brightness."
msgstr "Värdet för ljusstyrka."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Exposure Bias Value"
msgstr "Värde på exponeringskompensation"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "The exposure bias."
msgstr "Exponeringskompensationen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "The smallest F number of the lens."
msgstr "Objektivets minsta bländartal."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Indicates the status of flash when the image was shot."
msgstr "Indikerar använd status för blixt när bilden togs."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "The actual focal length of the lens, in mm."
msgstr "Den verkliga brännvidden för objektivet i mm."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Amount of flash energy (BCPS)."
msgstr "Mängden blixtstyrka (BCPS)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "SFR of the camera."
msgstr "Kamerans SFR."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Noise"
msgstr "Brus"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Noise measurement values."
msgstr "Brus-mätvärden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Image Number"
msgstr "Bildnummer"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Number assigned to an image, e.g., in a chained image burst."
msgstr "Bildens tilldelade nummer, till exempel vid sekventiell tagning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Security Classification"
msgstr "Säkerhetsklassificering"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Security classification assigned to the image."
msgstr "Säkerhetsklassificering som är tilldelad bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Image History"
msgstr "Bildhistorik"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Record of what has been done to the image."
msgstr "Förteckning över vad som gjorts med bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"This tag indicates the location and area of the main subject in the overall "
"scene."
msgstr "Denna tagg indikerar platsen och området för huvudmotivet i scenen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Encodes the camera exposure index setting when image was captured."
msgstr "Kodar kamerans exponeringsindexinställning när bilden togs."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Contains four ASCII characters representing the TIFF/EP standard version of "
"a TIFF/EP file, eg '1', '0', '0', '0'"
msgstr ""
"Innehåller fyra ASCII-tecken som representerar TIFF/EP-standardversionen av "
"en TIFF/EP-fil, t.ex. ”1”, ”0”, ”0”, ”0”"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"A tag for manufacturers of Exif writers to record any desired information."
msgstr ""
"En tagg för tillverkare av Exif-lagrande utrustning för att lagra all sorts "
"information."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"A tag for Exif users to write keywords or comments on the image besides "
"those in <ImageDescription>, and without the character code limitations of "
"the <ImageDescription> tag."
msgstr ""
"En tagg där Exif-användare kan skriva in nyckelord eller kommentarer för "
"bilden vid sidan av dem i <ImageDescription>, och utan "
"teckenkodsbegränsningarna i taggen <ImageDescription>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Sub-seconds Time"
msgstr "Delsekundstid"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "A tag used to record fractions of seconds for the <DateTime> tag."
msgstr ""
"En tag som används för att ange delar av sekunder för taggen <DateTime>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Sub-seconds Time Original"
msgstr "Delsekundstid (ursprunglig)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"A tag used to record fractions of seconds for the <DateTimeOriginal> tag."
msgstr ""
"En tag som används för att ange delar av sekunder för taggen "
"<DateTimeOriginal>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Sub-seconds Time Digitized"
msgstr "Delsekundstid (digitaliserad)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"A tag used to record fractions of seconds for the <DateTimeDigitized> tag."
msgstr ""
"En tag som används för att ange delar av sekunder för taggen "
"<DateTimeDigitized>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Windows Title"
msgstr "Windows-titel"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Title tag used by Windows, encoded in UCS2"
msgstr "Titeltagg som används av Windows, kodad i UCS2"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Windows Comment"
msgstr "Windows-kommentar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Comment tag used by Windows, encoded in UCS2"
msgstr "Kommentarstagg som används av Windows, kodad i UCS2"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Windows Author"
msgstr "Windows-författare"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Author tag used by Windows, encoded in UCS2"
msgstr "Författartagg som används av Windows, kodad i UCS2"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Windows Keywords"
msgstr "Windows-nyckelord"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Keywords tag used by Windows, encoded in UCS2"
msgstr "Nyckelordstagg som används av Windows, kodad i UCS2"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Windows Subject"
msgstr "Windows-ämne"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Subject tag used by Windows, encoded in UCS2"
msgstr "Ämnestagg som används av Windows, kodad i UCS2"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"The color space information tag is always recorded as the color space "
"specifier."
msgstr ""
"Färgrymdsinformationstaggen lagras alltid som färgrymdsspecificeraren."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"This tag is used to record the name of an audio file related to the image "
"data."
msgstr ""
"Denna tagg används för att lagra namnet för en ljudfil relaterad till "
"bilddata."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Focal Plane X Resolution"
msgstr "X-upplösning i fokalplanet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Number of pixels per FocalPlaneResolutionUnit (37392) in ImageWidth "
"direction for main image."
msgstr ""
"Antalet bildpunkter per FocalPlaneResolutionUnit (37392) i ImageWidth-"
"riktningen för huvudbild."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Focal Plane Y Resolution"
msgstr "Y-upplösning i fokalplanet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Number of pixels per FocalPlaneResolutionUnit (37392) in ImageLength "
"direction for main image."
msgstr ""
"Antalet bildpunkter per FocalPlaneResolutionUnit (37392) i ImageLength-"
"riktningen för huvudbild."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Unit of measurement for FocalPlaneXResolution(37390) and "
"FocalPlaneYResolution(37391)."
msgstr ""
"Mätenhet för FocalPlaneXResolution(37390) och FocalPlaneYResolution(37391)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Indicates the location and area of the main subject in the overall scene."
msgstr "Indikerar platsen och området för huvudmotivet i scenen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Type of image sensor."
msgstr "Typ av bildsensor."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Indicates the type of scene. If a DSC recorded the image, this tag value "
"must always be set to 1, indicating that the image was directly "
"photographed."
msgstr ""
"Indikerar typen av scen. Om en digital stillbildskamera sparat bilden måste "
"taggvärdet alltid vara 1, vilket indikerar att bilden tagits direkt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"This tag indicates the use of special processing on image data, such as "
"rendering geared to output."
msgstr ""
"Denna tagg indikerar användningen av speciell behandling av bilddata såsom "
"rendering avsedd för utmatning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"This tag indicates the exposure mode set when the image was shot. In auto-"
"bracketing mode, the camera shoots a series of frames of the same scene at "
"different exposure settings."
msgstr ""
"Denna tagg indikerar exponeringsläget som var inställt då bilden togs. I "
"autogafflingsläget tar kameran en serie av bilder av samma scen vid olika "
"exponeringsinställningar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "This tag indicates the white balance mode set when the image was shot."
msgstr "Denna tagg indikerar vitbalansläget som var inställt då bilden togs."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"This tag indicates the digital zoom ratio when the image was shot. If the "
"numerator of the recorded value is 0, this indicates that digital zoom was "
"not used."
msgstr ""
"Denna tagg indikerar det digital zoomförhållandet när bilden togs. Om "
"täljaren för det inspelade värdet är 0 indikerar detta att digitalzoom inte "
"använts."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"This tag indicates the equivalent focal length assuming a 35mm film camera, "
"in mm. A value of 0 means the focal length is unknown."
msgstr ""
"Denna tagg indikerar den ekvivalenta brännvidden för en 35mm filmkamera i "
"mm. Ett värde som är 0 innebär att brännvidden är okänd."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "This tag indicates the type of scene that was shot."
msgstr "Denna tagg indikerar typen av scen som tagits."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"This tag indicates the direction of contrast processing applied by the "
"camera when the image was shot."
msgstr ""
"Denna tagg indikerar riktningen för kontrastbehandling som tillämpats av "
"kameran när bilden togs."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"This tag indicates the direction of saturation processing applied by the "
"camera when the image was shot."
msgstr ""
"Denna tagg indikerar riktningen för mättnadsbehandling som tillämpades av "
"kameran när bilden togs."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"This tag indicates the direction of sharpness processing applied by the "
"camera when the image was shot."
msgstr ""
"Denna tagg indikerar riktningen av skärpebehandling som tillämpades av "
"kameran när bilden togs."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"This tag indicates information on the picture-taking conditions of a "
"particular camera model."
msgstr ""
"Denna tagg indikerar information om bildtagningsförhållandena för en viss "
"kameramodell."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "This tag indicates the distance to the subject."
msgstr "Denna tagg indikerar avståndet till motivet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "This tag indicates an identifier assigned uniquely to each image."
msgstr ""
"Denna tagg indikerar en identifierare unikt tilldelad till varje bild."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Camera Owner Name"
msgstr "Kameraägarens namn"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"This tag records the owner of a camera used in photography as an ASCII "
"string."
msgstr ""
"Denna tagg anger ägaren för en kamera som använts vid fotografering som en "
"ASCII-sträng."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Body Serial Number"
msgstr "Kamerahusets serienummer"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"This tag records the serial number of the body of the camera that was used "
"in photography as an ASCII string."
msgstr ""
"Denna tagg anger serienummer för kamerahuset för kameran som använts vid "
"fotografering som en ASCII-sträng."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Lens Specification"
msgstr "Objektivspecifikation"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"This tag notes minimum focal length, maximum focal length, minimum F number "
"in the minimum focal length, and minimum F number in the maximum focal "
"length, which are specification information for the lens that was used in "
"photography. When the minimum F number is unknown, the notation is 0/0"
msgstr ""
"Taggen anger minimal brännvidd, maximal brännvidd, minsta F-nummer i den "
"minsta brännvidden och minsta F-nummer i den maximala brännvidden, vilket är"
" specifikationsinformation för objektivet som användes i fotografiet. När "
"det minsta F-numret är okänt är notationen 0/0"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Lens Make"
msgstr "Objektivmärke"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "This tag records the lens manufactor as an ASCII string."
msgstr "Denna tagg anger objektivets tillverkare som en ASCII-sträng."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Lens Model"
msgstr "Objektivmodell"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"This tag records the lens's model name and model number as an ASCII string."
msgstr ""
"Denna tagg anger objektivets modellnamn och modellnummer som en ASCII-"
"sträng."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Lens Serial Number"
msgstr "Serienummer för objektiv"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"This tag records the serial number of the interchangeable lens that was used"
" in photography as an ASCII string."
msgstr ""
"Denna tagg anger serienummer för kamerahuset för det utbytbara objektivet "
"som använts vid fotografering som en ASCII-sträng."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Black Level"
msgstr "Svartnivå"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Specifies the zero light (a.k.a. thermal black or black current) encoding "
"level, as a repeating pattern. The origin of this pattern is the top-left "
"corner of the ActiveArea rectangle. The values are stored in row-column-"
"sample scan order."
msgstr ""
"Anger noll-ljusets (s.k. termiskt svart eller svart ström) kodningsnivå, som"
" ett upprepat mönster. Mönstrets origo är det översta vänstra hörnet i "
"ActiveArea-rektangeln. Värdena lagras i ordningen rad-kolumn-"
"samplingskanning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Indicates the identification of the Interoperability rule."
msgstr "Indikerar identifieringen av interoperabilitetsregeln."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Interoperability version"
msgstr "Interoperabilitetsversion"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "File format of image file"
msgstr "Bildfilens filformat"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Image width"
msgstr "Bildbredd"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Image height"
msgstr "Bildhöjd"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "GPS Version ID"
msgstr "GPS-version-ID"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Indicates the version of <GPSInfoIFD>. The version is given as 2.0.0.0."
msgstr "Anger version av <GPSInfoIFD>. Versionen ges som 2.0.0.0."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "GPS Latitude Reference"
msgstr "GPS-latitudreferens"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Indicates whether the latitude is north or south latitude. The ASCII value "
"'N' indicates north latitude, and 'S' is south latitude."
msgstr ""
"Indikerar huruvida latituden är nord eller syd. ASCII-värdet ”N” indikerar "
"nord-latitud, och ”S” syd-latitud."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "GPS Latitude"
msgstr "GPS-latitud"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "GPS Longitude Reference"
msgstr "GPS-longitudreferens"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Indicates whether the longitude is east or west longitude. ASCII 'E' "
"indicates east longitude, and 'W' is west longitude."
msgstr ""
"Indikerar huruvida longituden är öst eller väst. ASCII-värdet ”E” indikerar "
"öst, och värdet ”W” indikerar väst-longitud."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "GPS Longitude"
msgstr "GPS-longitud"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "GPS Altitude"
msgstr "GPS-höjd"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Indicates the altitude based on the reference in GPSAltitudeRef. Altitude is"
" expressed as one RATIONAL value. The reference unit is meters."
msgstr ""
"Indikerar höjden baserat på referensen i GPSAltitudeRef. Höjd anges som ett "
"RATIONELLT värde. Referensvärdet anges i meter."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "GPS Time Stamp"
msgstr "GPS-tidsstämpel"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Indicates the time as UTC (Coordinated Universal Time). <TimeStamp> is "
"expressed as three RATIONAL values giving the hour, minute, and second "
"(atomic clock)."
msgstr ""
"Indikerar tiden som UTC (Coordinated Universal Time). <TimeStamp> uttrycks "
"som tre RATIONELLA värden som ger timme, minut och sekund (atomur)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "GPS Satellites"
msgstr "GPS-satelliter"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Indicates the GPS satellites used for measurements. This tag can be used to "
"describe the number of satellites, their ID number, angle of elevation, "
"azimuth, SNR and other information in ASCII notation."
msgstr ""
"Indikerar GPS-satelliterna som används för mätningar. Denna tag kan användas"
" för att beskriva antalet satelliter, deras ID-nummer, elevationsvinkel, "
"azimut, SNR och annan information i ASCII-notation."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "GPS Status"
msgstr "GPS-status"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Indicates the status of the GPS receiver when the image is recorded. \"A\" "
"means measurement is in progress, and \"V\" means the measurement is "
"Interoperability."
msgstr ""
"Indikerar status för GPS-mottagaren när bilden sparades. ”A” betyder att "
"mätningen pågår och ”V” betyder att mätningen är interoperabilitet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "GPS Measure Mode"
msgstr "Läge för GPS-mätning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Indicates the GPS measurement mode. \"2\" means two-dimensional measurement "
"and \"3\" means three-dimensional measurement is in progress."
msgstr ""
"Indikerar GPS-mätningsläget. ”2” betyder tvådimensionell mätning och ”3” "
"innebär att en tredimensionell mätning pågår."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "GPS Data Degree of Precision"
msgstr "Grad av GPS-dataprecision"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Indicates the GPS DOP (data degree of precision). An HDOP value is written "
"during two-dimensional measurement, and PDOP during three-dimensional "
"measurement."
msgstr ""
"Indikerar GPS DOP (data degree of precision). Ett HDOP-värde skrivs vid "
"tvådimensionell mätning och PDOP vid tredimensionell mätning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "GPS Speed Reference"
msgstr "GPS-hastighetsreferens"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Indicates the unit used to express the GPS receiver speed of movement. \"K\""
" \"M\" and \"N\" represents kilometers per hour, miles per hour, and knots."
msgstr ""
"Indikerar enheten som används för att uttrycka GPS-mottagarens hastighet. "
"”K”, ”M” och ”N” representerar kilometer per timme, engelska mil per timme "
"och knop."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "GPS Speed"
msgstr "GPS-hastighet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "Indicates the speed of GPS receiver movement."
msgstr "Indikerar GPS-mottagarens hastighet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "GPS Track Ref"
msgstr "GPS-spårreferens"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Indicates the reference for giving the direction of GPS receiver movement. "
"\"T\" denotes true direction and \"M\" is magnetic direction."
msgstr ""
"Indikerar referensen för att ange riktningen för GPS-mottagarens rörelse. "
"”T” betecknar sann riktning och ”M” magnetisk riktning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "GPS Track"
msgstr "GPS-spår"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Indicates the direction of GPS receiver movement. The range of values is "
"from 0.00 to 359.99."
msgstr ""
"Indikerar riktningen för GPS-mottagarrörelse. Värdeintervallet är från 0.00 "
"till 359.99."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "GPS Image Direction Reference"
msgstr "GPS-bildriktningsreferens"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Indicates the reference for giving the direction of the image when it is "
"captured. \"T\" denotes true direction and \"M\" is magnetic direction."
msgstr ""
"Indikerar referensen för angivelse av bildriktningen då den togs. ”T” "
"betecknar sann riktning och ”M” magnetisk riktning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "GPS Image Direction"
msgstr "GPS-bildriktning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Indicates the direction of the image when it was captured. The range of "
"values is from 0.00 to 359.99."
msgstr ""
"Indikerar bildens riktning då den togs. Värdeintervallet är från 0.00 till "
"359.99."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "GPS Map Datum"
msgstr "GPS-kartreferenssystem"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Indicates the geodetic survey data used by the GPS receiver. If the survey "
"data is restricted to Japan, the value of this tag is \"TOKYO\" or "
"\"WGS-84\"."
msgstr ""
"Indikerar geodetiska undersökningsdata som används av GPS-mottagaren. Om "
"undersökningsdata är begränsade till Japan kommer värdet för denna tagg att "
"vara ”TOKYO” eller ”WGS-84”"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "GPS Destination Latitude Reference"
msgstr "GPS-destinationslatitudreferens"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Indicates whether the latitude of the destination point is north or south "
"latitude. The ASCII value \"N\" indicates north latitude, and \"S\" is south"
" latitude."
msgstr ""
"Indikerar huruvida latituden för destinationspunkten är nord eller syd. "
"ASCII-värdet ”N” indikerar nord-latitud, och ”S” syd-latitud."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "GPS Destination Latitude"
msgstr "GPS-destinationslatitud"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Indicates the latitude of the destination point. The latitude is expressed "
"as three RATIONAL values giving the degrees, minutes, and seconds, "
"respectively. If latitude is expressed as degrees, minutes and seconds, a "
"typical format would be dd/1,mm/1,ss/1. When degrees and minutes are used "
"and, for example, fractions of minutes are given up to two decimal places, "
"the format would be dd/1,mmmm/100,0/1."
msgstr ""
"Indikerar latituden till destinationspunkten. Latituden uttrycks som tre "
"RATIONELLA värden som anger grader, minuter respektive sekunder. Om latitud "
"uttrycks som grader, minuter och sekunder är formatet typiskt "
"dd/1,mm/1,ss/1. När grader och minuter används och till exempel delar av "
"minuter anges upp till två decimaler skulle formatet vara dd/1,mmmm/100,0/1."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "GPS Destination Longitude Reference"
msgstr "GPS-destinationslongitudreferens"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Indicates whether the longitude of the destination point is east or west "
"longitude. ASCII \"E\" indicates east longitude, and \"W\" is west "
"longitude."
msgstr ""
"Indikerar huruvida longituden för destinationspunkten är öst eller väst. "
"ASCII-värdet ”E” indikerar öst, och värdet ”W” indikerar väst-longitud."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "GPS Destination Longitude"
msgstr "GPS-destinationslongitud"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
"Indicates the longitude of the destination point. The longitude is expressed"
" as three RATIONAL values giving the degrees, minutes, and seconds, "
"respectively. If longitude is expressed as degrees, minutes and seconds, a "
"typical format would be ddd/1,mm/1,ss/1. When degrees and minutes are used "
"and, for example, fractions of minutes are given up to two decimal places, "
"the format would be ddd/1,mmmm/100,0/1."
msgstr ""
"Indikerar longituden till destinationspunkten. Longituden uttrycks som tre "
"RATIONELLA värden som anger grader, minuter respektive sekunder. Om longitud"
" uttrycks som grader, minuter och sekunder är formatet typiskt "
"ddd/1,mm/1,ss/1. När grader och minuter används och till exempel delar av "
"minuter anges upp till två decimaler skulle formatet vara "
"ddd/1,mmmm/100,0/1."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid "GPS Destination Bearing Reference"
msgstr "GPS-destinationsbäringsreferens"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnome-commander/main
msgid ""
