#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "%(username)s - GNOME Contributor"
msgstr "%(username)s - GNOME-bidragsgivare"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "View on application’s backend"
msgstr "Visa på programmets bakände"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Change your details and settings"
msgstr "Ändra dina uppgifter och inställningar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Manage external authentication providers"
msgstr "Hantera externa autentiseringsleverantörer"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Create an authentication token"
msgstr "Skapa ett autentiseringstoken"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete your authentication token?"
msgstr "Är du säker på att du vill ta bort ditt autentiseringstoken?"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Delete the authentication token"
msgstr "Ta bort autentiseringstoken"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Change your details"
msgstr "Ändra dina uppgifter"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Update personal details"
msgstr "Uppdatera personlig information"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Delete your account"
msgstr "Ta bort ditt konto"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Permanently delete your account and all associated data."
msgstr "Ta permanent bort ditt konto och alla associerade data."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Delete my account"
msgstr "Ta bort mitt konto"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"You are about to permanently delete your account. This action cannot be "
"undone."
msgstr ""
"Du håller på att permanent ta bort ditt konto. Denna åtgärd kan inte ångras."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"All your personal information will be removed from the system. Your "
"translation contributions and activity history will remain in the system, "
"but they will no longer be associated with your account."
msgstr ""
"All din personliga information kommer tas bort från systemet. Dina "
"översättningsbidrag och aktivitetshistorik kommer kvarstå i systemet, men de"
" kommer inte längre vara associerade med ditt konto."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"You will receive a confirmation email once your account has been deleted."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer att få ett bekräftelsemeddelande på e-post då ditt konto har "
"tagits bort."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Uid"
msgstr "Uid"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Connected since"
msgstr "Ansluten sedan"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"When your password is not set and you have only one provider connected, you "
"cannot disconnect it."
msgstr ""
"När ditt lösenord inte ställts in och du endast har en leverantör ansluten "
"så kan du inte koppla från den."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Disconnect %(provider_name)s"
msgstr "Koppla från %(provider_name)s"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Connect with %(provider_name)s"
msgstr "Anslut med %(provider_name)s"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "GNOME Contributors"
msgstr "GNOME-bidragsgivare"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "GNOME is being developed by following people:"
msgstr "GNOME utvecklas av följande personer:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Create a New Account or Log in with a Connection Link"
msgstr "Skapa ett nytt konto eller logga in med en anslutningslänk"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"<b> You are trying to connect with a third party provider, and we don’t know"
" you with this identity yet. </b> </br> If you already have a Damned Lies "
"account, please log in using the Legacy Connection process and fill in your "
"e-mail address to receive a connection link. You will be able to connect "
"third party providers from your profile page."
msgstr ""
"<b> Du försöker ansluta med en tredjepartsleverantör, och vi känner inte "
"till dig med denna identitet ännu. </b> </br> Om du redan har ett Förbannade"
" lögner-konto, logga in med den äldre anslutningsprocessen och fyll i din "
"e-postadress för att få en anslutningslänk. Du kommer kunna ansluta "
"tredjepartsleverantörer från din profilsida."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"Alternatively, if you don’t have a Damned Lies account, you can continue the"
" process normally and create a new account."
msgstr ""
"Alternativt, om du inte har ett Förbannade lögner-konto, kan du fortsätta "
"processen normalt och skapa ett nytt konto."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Legacy Connection"
msgstr "Äldre anslutning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Continue and Create a New Account"
msgstr "Fortsätt och skapa ett nytt konto"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Create a New Account"
msgstr "Skapa ett nytt konto"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"You are about to create a new account on Damned Lies. Please note that if "
"you already have an account, the new account you create will not be linked "
"to your existing account. You will not find your existing contributions in "
"this account."
msgstr ""
"Du håller på att skapa ett nytt konto på Förbannade lögner. Notera att om du"
" redan har ett konto kommer det nya kontot som du skapar inte länkas till "
"ditt befintliga konto. Du kommer inte hitta dina befintliga bidrag på detta "
"konto."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"<p> This is an automated message sent from <a "
"href=\"%(site_domain)s\">Damned Lies</a> to inform you that <a "
"href=\"%(site_domain)s/%(person_slug_url)s\">%(username)s</a> has just "
"joined the team <a href=\"%(site_domain)s/%(team_slug_url)s\">%(team)s</a> "
"you coordinate. </p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Detta är ett automatiskt meddelande från <a "
"href=\"%(site_domain)s\">Förbannade lögner</a> för att informera dig om att "
"<a href=\"%(site_domain)s/%(person_slug_url)s\">%(username)s</a> just gått "
"med i gruppen <a href=\"%(site_domain)s/%(team_slug_url)s\">%(team)s</a> som"
" du koordinerar. </p>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"This is an automated message sent from Damned Lies (%(site_domain)s) to "
"inform you that %(username)s (%(site_domain)s/%(person_slug_url)s) has just "
"joined the team %(team)s (%(site_domain)s/%(team_slug_url)s) you coordinate."
msgstr ""
"Detta är ett automatiskt meddelande från Förbannade lögner (%(site_domain)s)"
" för att informera dig om att %(username)s "
"(%(site_domain)s/%(person_slug_url)s) just gått med i gruppen %(team)s "
"(%(site_domain)s/%(team_slug_url)s) som du koordinerar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "avatar icon"
msgstr "profilbildsikon"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "generic person icon"
msgstr "allmän personikon"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "i18n coordination team member"
msgstr "Medlem i gruppen för i18n-koordinering"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "The requested user does not exist."
msgstr "Den begärda användaren finns inte."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"You did not register a GitLab account in your profile and are the "
"coordinator of a translation team. If you do not have any yet, please "
"register on the GNOME GitLab platform (%s) and indicate your username in "
"your Damned Lies profile."
msgstr ""
"Du har inte registrerat något Gitlab-konto i din profil och är koordinator "
"för en översättningsgrupp. Om du inte har något konto ännu kan du registrera"
" dig på GNOMEs Gitlab-plattform (%s) och ange ditt användarnamn i din "
"Förbannade lögner-profil."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"You did not fill your real name in your profile. Your work can only be added"
" to the project in your name if you fill it in."
msgstr ""
"Du fyllde inte i ditt riktiga namn i din profil. Ditt arbete kan bara läggas"
" till i projektet i ditt namn om du fyller i det."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"The GNOME GitLab username you set in your profile does not exist on %s. "
"Please check your username or create an account if this is not done yet."
msgstr ""
"GNOME Gitlab-användarnamnet du angav i din profil finns inte på %s. "
"Kontrollera ditt användarnamn eller skapa ett konto om du inte gjort detta "
"ännu."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"Someone requested to change the email address of your Damned Lies account"
msgstr ""
"Någon efterfrågade en ändring av e-postadressen för ditt Förbannade lögner-"
"konto"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Confirm your new email address on Damned Lies"
msgstr "Bekräfta din nya e-postadress på Förbannade lögner"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"You asked to modify the email of your account. You will receive an email to "
"confirm your identity."
msgstr ""
"Du efterfrågade att ändra e-posten för ditt konto. Du kommer få ett "
"e-postmeddelande för att bekräfta din identitet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Sorry, the form is not valid."
msgstr "Formuläret är tyvärr inte giltigt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Your Damned Lies account has been deleted"
msgstr "Ditt konto på Förbannade lögner har tagits bort"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"The account ‘%(username)s’ has been successfully deleted from Damned Lies."
msgstr "Kontot ”%(username)s” har tagits bort från Förbannade lögner."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"You have not joined any translation team yet. You can do it from the <a "
"href=\"%(url)s\">list of teams</a>."
msgstr ""
"Du har inte gått med i någon översättningsgrupp än. Du kan göra det från <a "
"href=\"%(url)s\">grupplistan</a>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Login unsuccessful. Please verify your username and password."
msgstr "Inloggningen misslyckades. Verifiera ditt användarnamn och lösenord."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Your link to connect to Damned Lies"
msgstr "Din länk för att ansluta till Förbannade lögner"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"We have sent, at the email address you provided, a magic link to connect to "
"your account. Open this link and you will be automatically connected. "
"Beware, it expires after 5 minutes."
msgstr ""
"Vi har skickat en magisk länk för att ansluta till ditt konto till "
"e-postadressen som du tillhandahållit. Öppna denna länk så kommer du "
"automatiskt anslutas. Se upp, den slutar gälla efter 5 minuter."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "This magic link has expired. Please request a new one."
msgstr "Denna magiska länk är inaktuell. Begär en ny."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "The token you are trying to login with is invalid."
msgstr "Den token du försöker logga in med är ogiltig."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "This magic link belongs to a different account."
msgstr "Denna magiska länk hör till ett annat konto."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "The token you are using to validate your email is invalid."
msgstr "Den token som du använder för att validera din e-post är ogiltig."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "This email update link belongs to a different account."
msgstr "Denna e-postuppdateringslänk hör till ett annat konto."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"%(username)s, your email has been successfully updated to %(new_email)s."
msgstr "%(username)s, din e-post har uppdaterats till %(new_email)s."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"The authentication link you provided is invalid and cannot be used to login."
" The authentication token may have expired or never existed."
msgstr ""
"Autentiseringslänken du tillhandahöll är ogiltig och kan inte användas för "
"att logga in. Din autentiseringstoken kan ha gått ut eller kanske aldrig "
"funnits."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Forge"
msgstr "Smedja"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Repository"
msgstr "Arkiv"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Link check"
msgstr "Länkkontroll"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "DOAP file"
msgstr "DOAP-fil"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Branches without release"
msgstr "Grenar utan någon utgåva"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "POT Generation Parameters"
msgstr "POT-genereringsparametrar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Domain restriction over branches"
msgstr "Domänbegränsning över grenar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Please copy only one release at a time"
msgstr "Kopiera bara en utgåva åt gången"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "New release %(name)s created"
msgstr "Ny utgåva %(name)s skapad"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Copy release (and associated branches)"
msgstr "Kopiera utgåva (och tillhörande grenar)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Delete release (and associated branches)"
msgstr "Ta bort utgåva (och tillhörande grenar)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Application catalog"
msgstr "Programkatalog"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "You have to provide a category when a version is specified."
msgstr "Du måste tillhandahålla en kategori när en version anges."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "This branch already has this release assigned."
msgstr "Denna gren har redan denna utgåva tilldelad."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "This field is required."
msgstr "Detta fält är obligatoriskt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"There is already an entry for branch %(branch)s. Edit that one if you want "
"to remove the release link."
msgstr ""
"Det finns redan en post för grenen %(branch)s. Redigera den om du vill ta "
"bort utgåvelänken."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "The new branch %s has been added"
msgstr "Den nya grenen %s har lagts till"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Error adding the branch '%(branch_name)s': %(error)s"
msgstr "Fel vid tillägg av grenen ”%(branch_name)s”: %(error)s"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"Opening a merge or pull request is not supported for the selected forge."
msgstr ""
"Det går inte att öppna en merge- eller pull-begäran för den valda smedjan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Cannot clone repository for module: %s"
msgstr "Kan inte klona arkiv för modul: %s"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Content of the DOAP file of your module."
msgstr "Innehållet i DOAP-filen för din modul."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "GitLab"
msgstr "GitLab"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "GitHub"
msgstr "GitHub"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Other / unknown forge"
msgstr "Annan / okänd smedja"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Directly pushed to the repository"
msgstr "Direkt skickad till arkivet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Through a merge/pull request"
msgstr "Genom en merge/pull-förfrågan"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Single checkout shared by all branches"
msgstr "Ensam utcheckning delad av alla grenar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "One worktree per branch"
msgstr "Ett arbetsträd per gren"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"The homepage URL is automatically updated if the module contains a .doap "
"file."
msgstr ""
"Webbside-URL:en uppdateras automatiskt om modulen innehåller en .doap-fil."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"A short description of the module. It will be displayed on the module page, "
"close to the module name."
msgstr ""
"En kort beskrivning av modulen. Den kommer visas på modulsidan, nära "
"modulnamnet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Comment & more"
msgstr "Kommentar med mera"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"A comment about the module. It is used to display additional information on "
"the module page such as context, explanation or put external links."
msgstr ""
"En kommentar om modulen. Den används för att visa ytterligare information på"
" modulsidan såsom kontext, förklaring eller för att lägga in externa länkar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Commit message template"
msgstr "Incheckningsmeddelandemall"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"A Django template used to render the title line of translation commits, "
"overriding the default “Add/Update {{ language }} translation” message. "
"Available variables: {{ module }}, {{ branch }}, {{ domain }}, {{ language "
"}} and {{ po_file_already_exists }} (true when updating an existing "
"translation, false when adding a new one). Leave empty to use the default "
"message."
msgstr ""
"En Django-mall som används för att rendera titelraden i "
"översättningsincheckningar, vilket åsidosätter standardmeddelandet "
"”Add/Update {{ language }} translation”. Tillgängliga variabler: {{ module "
"}}, {{ branch }}, {{ domain }}, {{ language }} och {{ po_file_already_exists"
" }} (true när en befintlig översättning uppdateras, false när en ny läggs "
"till). Lämna tom för att använda standardmeddelandet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "The forge hosting this module’s repository."
msgstr "Smedjan som står värd för denna moduls arkiv."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Push action"
msgstr "Sändåtgärd"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"How changes are published to this module. Direct push is the default; "
"opening a merge or pull request is only supported on GitLab and GitHub."
msgstr ""
"Hur ändringar publiceras till denna modul. Direkt ”push” är standard, stöd "
"finns för merge- eller pull-förfrågningar för GitLab och GitHub."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Checkout type"
msgstr "Utcheckningstyp"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"How the module’s branches are checked out on disk. A single shared checkout "
"is the default; one worktree per branch allows concurrent checkouts of the "
"module’s branches. Switch to worktree mode if the repository has a lot of "
"objects and checking out from one branch to another takes a very long time."
msgstr ""
"Hur modulens grenar checkas ut på disk. En ensam delad utcheckning är "
"standard; ett arbetsträd per gren tillåter samtidiga utcheckningar av "
"modulens grenar. Växla till arbetsträdsläge om arkivet har många objekt och "
"att checka ut från en gren till en annan tar väldigt lång tid."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Issue tracker URL"
msgstr "URL till ärendehanteringssystem"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "The URL to the module’s bug tracker."
msgstr "URL:en till modulens felhanteringssystem."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Version Control System URL (SSH)"
msgstr "URL för versionshanteringssystem (SSH)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"The URL to the module’s version control system. In order to commit changes, "
"it has to be a SSH URL."
msgstr ""
"URL:en till modulens versionshanteringssystem. För att checka in ändringar "
"behöver det vara en SSH-URL."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Version Control System URL (Web)"
msgstr "URL för versionshanteringssystem (webb)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "The URL to the module’s version control system web interface."
msgstr "URL:en till webbgränssnittet för modulens versionshanteringssystem."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "External platform"
msgstr "Extern platform"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"URL to external translation platform, if any. It has to be an unsupported "
"platform, without Git access, the only supported protocol."
msgstr ""
"URL till extern översättningsplattform om någon finns. Måste vara en "
"plattform som inte stöds, utan Git-åtkomst, det enda protokoll som stöds."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
#. from gnome:reviewed/Endeavour/main
msgid "Archived"
msgstr "Arkiverad"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"If checked, the module is considered as archived and will not be updated."
msgstr "Om ikryssad anses modulen vara arkiverad och kommer inte uppdateras."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"The list of maintainers is automatically updated if the module contains a "
".doap file."
msgstr ""
"Listan över ansvariga uppdateras automatiskt om modulen innehåller en .doap-"
"fil."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Link check date"
msgstr "Datum för länkkontroll"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "The date and time when the module’s links were last checked."
msgstr "Datum och tid när modulens länkar senast kontrollerades."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Link check result"
msgstr "Resultat av länkkontroll"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "The result of the last link check, as a JSON object."
msgstr "Resultat av senaste länkkontroll, som ett JSON-objekt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "DOAP check date"
msgstr "Datum för DOAP-kontroll"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "The date and time when the module’s .doap file was last loaded."
msgstr "Datum och tid då modulens .doap-fil senast lästes in."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "DOAP check result"
msgstr "Resultat av DOAP-kontroll"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "The problems found the last time the module’s .doap file was loaded."
msgstr "Problemen som hittades när modulens .doap-fil senast lästes in."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "This name generates a slug that is already in use."
msgstr "Det här namnet ger en slug som redan används."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"Opening a merge or pull request is only supported on GitLab and GitHub. Set "
"the forge, or switch the push action to direct push."
msgstr ""
"Att öppna en merge- eller pull-förfrågan stöds endast på GitLab och GitHub. "
"Ställ in smedjan, eller växla sändåtgärden till direkt ”push”."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Invalid template syntax: %(error)s"
msgstr "Ogiltig mallsyntax: %(error)s"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"Translations for this module are externally hosted. Please go to the <a "
"href=\"%(link)s\">external platform</a> to see how you can submit your "
"translation."
msgstr ""
"Översättningar för denna modul hanteras externt. Gå till den <a "
"href=\"%(link)s\">externa plattformen</a> för att se hur du kan skicka in "
"din översättning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "The name of the branch, such as “master” or “gnome-3-10”."
msgstr "Namnet på grenen, såsom ”master” eller ”gnome-3-10”."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "VCS sub path"
msgstr "Undersökväg för versionshanteringssystem"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"Version Control System subpath. Where the .git is located for a Git managed "
"project."
msgstr ""
"Undersökväg för versionshanteringssystem. Där .git finns för ett projekt "
"hanterat med Git."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"Weight is used to order branches. The smaller weights are displayed first."
msgstr "Vikt används för att sortera grenar. De mindre vikterna visas först."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "File Hashes"
msgstr "Filhashar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"Indicates whether the branch is locked. Locked branches cannot receive "
"translations."
msgstr ""
"Indikerar huruvida grenen är låst. Låsta grenar kan inte ta emot nya "
"översättningar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "This branch is not linked from any release."
msgstr "Denna gren är inte länkad från någon utgåva."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"This branch name is ‘%(branch_name)s’ while there already exists a branch "
"that points to HEAD (called %(branch_head_names)s)."
msgstr ""
"Denna grens namn är ”%(branch_name)s” medan det redan finns en gren som "
"pekar på HEAD (med namnet %(branch_head_names)s)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"There are too many main branches for this module. Please report this issue "
"to the coordination team, some cleanup is needed."
msgstr ""
"Det finns för många huvudgrenar för denna modul. Rapportera detta problem "
"till koordineringsgruppen, rensning behövs."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "The name of the domain (ie. “po”, “help”…)"
msgstr "Namnet på domänen (t.ex. ”po”, ”help”…)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"A description of the domain. “%(ui)s” and “%(doc)s” are common descriptions "
"for modules."
msgstr ""
"En beskrivning av domänen. ”%(ui)s” och ”%(doc)s” är vanliga beskrivningar "
"för moduler."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Domain type"
msgstr "Domäntyp"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"Whether the Domain is for a user interface (%(ui)s) or a documentation "
"(%(doc)s)."
msgstr ""
"Huruvida domänen är för ett användargränssnitt (%(ui)s) eller dokumentation "
"(%(doc)s)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "PO files layout"
msgstr "PO-fillayout"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"The standard for the user interface is “%(po_layout_for_ui)s”. For the "
"documentation, it’s “%(po_layout_for_help)s”."
msgstr ""
"Standard för användargränssnittet är ”%(po_layout_for_ui)s”. För "
"dokumentationen är det ”%(po_layout_for_help)s”."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "POT generation method"
msgstr "POT-genereringsmetod"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "The method to generate the POT file."
msgstr "Metoden för att generera POT-filen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "POT generation parameters"
msgstr "POT-genereringsparametrar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"pot_method='url': URL, pot_method='shell': shell command, "
"pot_method='gettext': optional params"
msgstr ""
"pot_method='url': URL, pot_method='shell': skalkommando, "
"pot_method='gettext': valfria parametrar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Extra ITS directories"
msgstr "Extra ITS-kataloger"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"Colon-separated directories containing extra .its/.loc files for gettext and"
" shell methods"
msgstr ""
"Kolonseparerade kataloger som innehåller extra .its/.loc-filer för gettext "
"och skalmetoder"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "LINGUAS file location"
msgstr "Plats för LINGUAS-fil"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"Use “%s” for no LINGUAS check, or path/to/file#variable for a non-standard location.\n"
"Leave blank for standard location (ALL_LINGUAS in LINGUAS/configure.ac/.in for UI and DOC_LINGUAS in Makefile.am for DOC). This value is used to check if a language is correctly listed in the LINGUAS file. In many situations, the LINGUAS files should contain all the languages for which a translation exists."
msgstr ""
"Använd ”%s” för att inte ha någon LINGUAS-kontroll, eller sökväg/till/fil#variabel för en plats annan än den som är standard.\n"
"Lämna tom för standardplats (ALL_LINGUAS i LINGUAS/configure.ac/.in för UI och DOC_LINGUAS i Makefile.am för DOC). Detta värde används för att kontrollera om ett språk listas korrekt i LINGUAS-filen. I många situationer ska LINGUAS-filen innehålla alla språken som det finns en översättning för."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Reduced string filter"
msgstr "Filter för reducerade strängar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"A “%s” filter to strip po file from unprioritized strings (format: "
"location|string, “-” for no filter)"
msgstr ""
"Ett ”%s”-filter för att ta bort lågprioritetssträngar från po-filer (format:"
" plats|sträng, ”-” för inget filter)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Valid from branch"
msgstr "Giltig från gren"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "The domain is valid from the branch given, for all branches otherwise."
msgstr "Domänen är giltig från den angivna grenen, annars för alla grenar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Valid to branch"
msgstr "Giltig till gren"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"If empty, the domain is valid for all branches or until the branch given."
msgstr "Om tom är domänen giltig för alla grenar eller till grenen anges."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Unable to determine the PO path for this domain in language “%(lang)s”"
msgstr "Kunde inte avgöra PO-sökvägen för denna domän i språket ”%(lang)s”"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "This domain is not a documentation domain."
msgstr "Denna domän är inte en dokumentationsdomän."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"No check of the LINGUAS file. The “%(linguas_location)s” value is set to "
"“%(value)s”."
msgstr ""
"Ingen kontroll av LINGUAS-filen. Värdet ”%(linguas_location)s” är satt till "
"”%(value)s”."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"The LINGUAS file is stored at “%(linguas_location)s” but does not exist on "
"the disk. %(diagnostic)sPlease update the settings so that the LINGUAS file "
"could be found and updated."
msgstr ""
"LINGUAS-filen lagras på ”%(linguas_location)s” men finns inte på disken. "
"%(diagnostic)sUppdatera inställningarna så att LINGUAS-filen kan hittas och "
"uppdateras."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"A “%(makefile)s” file was found and lists languages in a variable instead of"
" a separate LINGUAS file; Damned Lies does not support editing that variable"
" yet. "
msgstr ""
"En ”%(makefile)s”-fil hittades och listar språk i en variabel i stället för "
"en separat LINGUAS-fil. Förbannade lögner stöder inte redigering av den "
"variabeln ännu. "

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"Entry for this language is not present in %(var)s variable in %(file)s file."
msgstr ""
"Post för det här språket finns inte i variabeln %(var)s i filen %(file)s."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Domain dtype should be “%(dtype_ui)s” or “%(dtype_doc)s”."
msgstr "Domänens dtype ska vara ”%(dtype_ui)s” eller ”%(dtype_doc)s”."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"The name of the release. You should use a slug, a unique identifier for this"
" release, such as “gnome-40”. This information is used in URLs."
msgstr ""
"Namnet på utgåvan. Du bör använda en ”slug”, en unik identifierare för denna"
" utgåva, som ”gnome-40”. Denna information används i URL:er."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "The real name of the release, such as “GIMP 2.8” or “GNOME 40”"
msgstr "Det riktiga namnet på utgåvan, som ”GIMP 2.8” eller ”GNOME 40”"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "String frozen"
msgstr "Strängfryst"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Whether the strings are frozen for this release."
msgstr "Huruvida strängarna är frysta för denna utgåva."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "The status of the release: whether it is official or not."
msgstr "Statusen för utgåvan: huruvida den är officiell eller inte."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"The weight is used to sort releases, higher on top, below 0 in archives."
msgstr ""
"Vikten används för att sortera utgåvor, högre högst upp, under 0 i arkiv."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Category name"
msgstr "Kategorinamn"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Full PO file"
msgstr "Fullständig PO-fil"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Partial PO file"
msgstr "Partiell PO-fil"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "%(lang_name)s (%(lang_locale)s)"
msgstr "%(lang_name)s (%(lang_locale)s)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "(%(messages)s — %(words)s, %(figures)s)"
msgstr "(%(messages)s — %(words)s, %(figures)s)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "(%(messages)s — %(words)s)"
msgstr "(%(messages)s — %(words)s)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Unable to summarize the POT statistics, the file is missing."
msgstr "Kunde inte sammanfatta POT-statistiken, filen saknas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Broken links detected for module ‘%(module_name)s’"
msgstr "Trasiga länkar upptäckta för modulen ”%(module_name)s”"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Module ‘%(module_name)s’ was automatically archived"
msgstr "Modulen ”%(module_name)s” arkiverades automatiskt"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "New branches automatically added to database"
msgstr "Nya grenar automatiskt tillagda till databas"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"Unable to initialize the GitLab client because the authentication failed."
msgstr ""
"Kunde inte initiera GitLab-klienten för att autentiseringen misslyckades."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Unable to create GitLab issue."
msgstr "Kunde inte skapa GitLab-ärende."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "The .doap file is not a valid XML document."
msgstr ".doap-filen är inte ett giltigt XML-dokument."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "The .doap file does not list any maintainer."
msgstr ".doap-filen listar ingen underhållare."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"A maintainer has no name (foaf:name), so they were not added to the module."
msgstr ""
"En underhållare saknar namn (foaf:name) och lades därför inte till i "
"modulen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"The maintainer %(name)s has no email (foaf:mbox), so they were not added to "
"the module."
msgstr ""
"Underhållaren %(name)s saknar e-postadress (foaf:mbox) och lades därför inte"
" till i modulen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"Unable to generate template file (POT). The POT generation process itself "
"did not fail, but the POT file does not exist on disk."
msgstr ""
"Kunde inte generera mallfil (POT). POT-genereringsprocessen i sig "
"misslyckades inte, men POT-filen finns inte på disk."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "The refresh process has not started yet."
msgstr "Uppdateringsprocessen har inte startat ännu."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "No refresh in progress."
msgstr "Ingen uppdatering pågår."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "The refresh process was aborted."
msgstr "Uppdateringsprocessen avbröts."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "The refresh process failed."
msgstr "Uppdateringsprocessen misslyckades."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "Processing domain “%(domain)s”: %(step)s"
msgstr "Bearbetar domänen ”%(domain)s”: %(step)s"

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "The refresh process completed successfully."
msgstr "Uppdateringsprocessen slutfördes."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid "The task failed without a specific error message."
msgstr "Uppgiften misslyckades utan något specifikt felmeddelande."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"An error occurred while starting the refresh process. Please try again later"
" or if the problem persists, contact the site administration."
msgstr ""
"Ett fel inträffade då uppdateringsprocessen startades. Försök igen senare, "
"eller kontakta webbplatsadministrationen om problemet kvarstår."

#. from gnome:reviewed/damned-lies/main
msgid ""
"The refresh service is currently unavailable. Please try again later or if "
