#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "ImageMap"
msgstr "Bildkarta"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Clickable image"
msgstr "Klickbar bild"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"In Web sensitive images are frequently used to get some effects when defined"
" areas are enabled by the pointer. Obviously the most used effect is a "
"dynamic link to another web page when one of the sensitive areas is clicked "
"on. This <quote>filter</quote> allows you to design easily sensitive areas "
"within an image. Web site design softwares have this as a standard function."
" In <acronym>GIMP</acronym> you can do this in a similar way."
msgstr ""
"På webben används ofta känsliga bilder för att ge effekter när pekaren "
"aktiverar definierade områden. Den vanligaste effekten är naturligtvis en "
"dynamisk länk till en annan webbsida när du klickar på ett känsligt område. "
"Med detta <quote>filter</quote> kan du enkelt utforma känsliga områden i en "
"bild. Program för webbdesign har detta som standardfunktion, och i "
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> kan du göra det på ett liknande sätt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This plug-in lets you design graphically and friendly all areas you want to "
"delimit over your displayed image. You get the relevant part of html tags "
"that must be merged into the right place in your page html code. You can "
"define some actions linked to these areas too."
msgstr ""
"Med denna insticksmodul kan du grafiskt och enkelt utforma alla områden du "
"vill avgränsa i den visade bilden. Du får den relevanta delen av HTML-"
"taggarna som ska infogas på rätt plats i sidans HTML-kod. Du kan också ange "
"åtgärder som kopplas till områdena."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This is a complex tool which is not completely described here (it works "
"about like Web page makers offering this function). However we want to "
"describe here some of the most current handlings. If you want, you can find "
"a more complete descriptions in Grokking the GIMP with the link <xref "
"linkend=\"bibliography-online-grokking-gimp-imagemap\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Detta är ett komplicerat verktyg som inte beskrivs fullständigt här; det "
"fungerar ungefär som verktygen för webbsidebyggare som erbjuder funktionen. "
"Här beskriver vi dock några av de vanligaste handgreppen. En mer fullständig"
" beskrivning finns i Grokking the GIMP via länken <xref "
"linkend=\"bibliography-online-grokking-gimp-imagemap\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"From an image window, you can find this filter through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Web</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>ImageMap</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
msgstr ""
"I ett bildfönster hittar du filtret under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Webb</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Bildkarta</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The window is a small one, but you can magnify it. The main useful areas "
"are:"
msgstr ""
"Fönstret är litet, men du kan förstora det. De huvudsakliga delarna är:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"completely on the left are vertically displayed icons, one for pointing, "
"three for calling tools to generate various shape areas, one to edit zone "
"properties, and finally one to erase a selected zone; you can call these "
"functions with the Mapping menu,"
msgstr ""
"längst till vänster visas ikoner lodrätt: en för pekaren, tre för verktyg "
"som skapar områden med olika former, en för att redigera zoners egenskaper "
"och slutligen en för att radera en markerad zon; du kan anropa funktionerna "
"med menyn Avbildning,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"just on the right is your working area where you can draw all the shapes "
"areas you want with the relevant tools,"
msgstr ""
"strax till höger finns arbetsytan där du kan rita de formområden du vill med"
" relevanta verktyg,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"on the right is displayed an icon vertical set; its use is obvious but a "
"help pop-up gives you some information about each function,"
msgstr ""
"till höger visas en lodrät uppsättning ikoner; användningen är självklar men"
" en hjälpruta ger information om varje funktion,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"finally, even on the right is a display area, as a property list of the "
"created areas. A click on one item of the list selects automatically the "
"corresponding shape in the working area,"
msgstr ""
"slutligen finns längst till höger ett visningsområde med en egenskapslista "
"över de skapade områdena. Ett klick på en post i listan markerar automatiskt"
" motsvarande form i arbetsytan,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Imagemap filter options"
msgstr "Filteralternativ för bildkarta"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Imagemap window"
msgstr "Bildkartefönster"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The Menu Bar"
msgstr "Menyraden"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The menu bar is similar to the image window menu bar, only a few menus or "
"menu entries are different:"
msgstr ""
"Menyraden liknar bildfönstrets menyrad; endast några få menyer eller "
"menyalternativ skiljer sig åt:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Save; Save As"
msgstr "Spara; Spara som"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Contrary to other filters, this plug-in doesn't make an image but a text "
"file. So you must save your work in a text format."
msgstr ""
"Till skillnad från andra filter skapar denna insticksmodul inte en bild utan"
" en textfil. Du måste alltså spara arbetet i ett textformat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"With "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Source</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
" you can preview this text file content."
msgstr ""
"Med "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Visa</guimenu><guimenuitem>Källa</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
" kan du förhandsvisa innehållet i textfilen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Open; Open recent"
msgstr "Öppna; Öppna senaste"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"In the plug-in you can open the saved text file. The areas defined in your "
"file will be loaded and overdisplayed; if the displayed image is not the "
"original one or not with the same size, <acronym>GIMP</acronym> will ask you"
" for adapting the scale."
msgstr ""
"I insticksmodulen kan du öppna den sparade textfilen. Områdena som "
"definieras i filen läses in och visas ovanpå bilden. Om den visade bilden "
"inte är originalet eller inte har samma storlek ber <acronym>GIMP</acronym> "
"dig anpassa skalan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Edit area info"
msgstr "Redigera områdesinformation"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Editing an imagemap area"
msgstr "Redigera ett bildkarteområde"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"In the settings dialog you can edit the area information of a selected area."
" This dialog will pop up automatically whenever you create a new area."
msgstr ""
"I inställningsdialogrutan kan du redigera områdesinformationen för ett "
"markerat område. Dialogrutan visas automatiskt varje gång du skapar ett nytt"
" område."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "This menu offers you special functions:"
msgstr "Denna meny erbjuder särskilda funktioner:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Area list"
msgstr "Områdeslista"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Here you can hide or show the selection area."
msgstr "Här kan du dölja eller visa markeringsområdet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Here you see the raw data as you would save it to or read it from a file."
msgstr "Här ser du rådata som den skulle sparas i eller läsas från en fil."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Color; Grayscale"
msgstr "Färg; Gråskala"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "You can select the image mode here and work with a Grayscale display."
msgstr "Här kan du välja bildläge och arbeta med en gråskalebild."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You will seldom use this menu, since you can more easily access selection "
"tools by clicking on icons on the left of the working area."
msgstr ""
"Du använder sällan denna meny eftersom du enklare når markeringsverktygen "
"genom att klicka på ikonerna till vänster om arbetsytan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The arrow here represents the Move tool. When activated tool is selected, "
"you can select and move an area on the image."
msgstr ""
"Pilen motsvarar här verktyget Flytta. När verktyget är aktivt kan du markera"
" och flytta ett område på bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"With a polygon, you can use the arrow to move one of the red points. Right-"
"click on a segment between two red points to open a pop-up menu that offers,"
" with several others, the possibility to add a new point. If you right-click"
" on a red point, you can remove it."
msgstr ""
"Med en polygon kan du använda pilen för att flytta en av de röda punkterna. "
"Högerklicka på ett segment mellan två röda punkter för att öppna en "
"snabbmeny som bland annat låter dig lägga till en ny punkt. Högerklickar du "
"på en röd punkt kan du ta bort den."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Rectangle; Circle; Polygon"
msgstr "Rektangel; Cirkel; Polygon"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"These tools let you create various shape areas: click on the image, move the"
" pointer, and click again."
msgstr ""
"Med dessa verktyg kan du skapa områden med olika former: klicka på bilden, "
"flytta pekaren och klicka igen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp/master
msgid "Edit Map Info"
msgstr "Redigera kartinformation"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Editing the imagemap data"
msgstr "Redigera bildkartsdata"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"With this simple dialog you can enter some items, which will be written to "
"the resulting output file; either as comments (<guilabel>Author</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Description</guilabel>) or as attribute values of the HTML tags "
"(<guilabel>Image name</guilabel>, <guilabel>Title</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Default URL</guilabel>)."
msgstr ""
"I denna enkla dialogruta kan du ange poster som skrivs till den färdiga "
"utdatafilen, antingen som kommentarer (<guilabel>Författare</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Beskrivning</guilabel>) eller som attributvärden för HTML-taggarna"
" (<guilabel>Bildnamn</guilabel>, <guilabel>Titel</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Standard-URL</guilabel>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"With the <quote>Tools</quote> menu you can create guides and even regularly "
"spaced rectangular areas."
msgstr ""
"Med menyn <quote>Verktyg</quote> kan du skapa stödlinjer och till och med "
"regelbundet placerade rektangulära områden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Grid; Grid settings"
msgstr "Rutnät; Rutnätsinställningar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Grid options"
msgstr "Rutnätsalternativ"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Here you can enable and disable the image grid or configure some grid "
"properties."
msgstr ""
"Här kan du aktivera och inaktivera bildrutnätet eller ange dess egenskaper."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Use GIMP guides; Create guides"
msgstr "Använd GIMP-stödlinjer; Skapa stödlinjer"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The guide lines are created at the border of the image but can be moved "
"around by clicking on the red squares on each line something similar to the "
"GIMP guide lines. By using the guides you are able to create active "
"rectangles in the image."
msgstr ""
"Stödlinjerna skapas vid bildens kant men kan flyttas genom att klicka på de "
"röda fyrkanterna på varje linje, på ett sätt som liknar GIMP:s stödlinjer. "
"Med stödlinjerna kan du skapa aktiva rektanglar i bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Create guides"
msgstr "Skapa hjälplinjer"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Guide options"
msgstr "Stödlinjealternativ"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The guide options"
msgstr "Stödlinjealternativen"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Instead of creating geometrical shapes to select the active areas you may "
"use an array of rectangles, each representing an active area, by clicking on"
" the <quote>Create guides</quote>. In the menu popping up you set the width "
"and height of the rectangles, the space between them, the number of rows and"
" columns, and the upper and left startpoint for the array. All messures are "
"in pixels. If you are not satisfied with the result you may adjust each "
"rectangle by moving the red squares as usual."
msgstr ""
"I stället för att skapa geometriska former för att välja aktiva områden kan "
"du använda en uppsättning rektanglar, där varje rektangel motsvarar ett "
"aktivt område, genom att klicka på <quote>Skapa stödlinjer</quote>. I menyn "
"som visas anger du rektanglarnas bredd och höjd, mellanrummet mellan dem, "
"antalet rader och kolumner samt uppsättningens övre och vänstra startpunkt. "
"Alla mått är i bildpunkter. Om du inte är nöjd med resultatet kan du som "
"vanligt justera varje rektangel genom att flytta de röda fyrkanterna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The Tool Bar"
msgstr "Verktygsraden"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Most entries here are just shortcuts for some functions already described. "
"Exceptions:"
msgstr ""
"De flesta poster här är bara genvägar till funktioner som redan beskrivits. "
"Undantag:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Move to Front; Send to Back"
msgstr "Flytta längst fram; Skicka längst bak"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Here you can move an area entry to the bottom (<quote>Move to Front</quote>)"
" or top (<quote>Send to Back</quote>) of the area list."
msgstr ""
"Här kan du flytta en områdespost till botten (<quote>Flytta längst "
"fram</quote>) eller toppen (<quote>Skicka längst bak</quote>) av "
"områdeslistan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The Working Area"
msgstr "Arbetsytan"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"In the main area of the imagemap window, on the left side, you will find "
"your working area where you can draw all the shapes areas you want with the "
"relevant tools."
msgstr ""
"I huvudområdet i bildkartefönstret, på vänster sida, finns arbetsytan där du"
" kan rita de formområden du vill med relevanta verktyg."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Beside the working area there are vertically displayed icons, one for "
"pointing, three for calling tools to generate various shape areas, one to "
"edit zone properties, and finally one to erase a selected zone; you can call"
" these functions with the Mapping menu too."
msgstr ""
"Bredvid arbetsytan visas ikoner lodrätt: en för pekaren, tre för verktyg som"
" skapar områden med olika former, en för att redigera zoners egenskaper och "
"slutligen en för att radera en markerad zon. Du kan också använda menyn "
"Avbildning för dessa funktioner."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Note that the areas should not overlap."
msgstr "Observera att områdena inte bör överlappa varandra."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The selection area"
msgstr "Markeringsområdet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"On the right is a display area, as a property list of the created areas. A "
"click on one item of the list selects automatically the corresponding shape "
"in the working area, then you can modify it."
msgstr ""
"Till höger finns ett visningsområde med en egenskapslista över de skapade "
"områdena. Ett klick på en post i listan markerar automatiskt motsvarande "
"form i arbetsytan, som du sedan kan ändra."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Beside the display are is an icon vertical set; its use is obvious but a "
"help pop-up gives you some information about each function,"
msgstr ""
"Bredvid visningsområdet finns en lodrät uppsättning ikoner. Användningen är "
"självklar, men en hjälpruta ger information om varje funktion,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, the arrow symbols for moving a list entry up or down do not "
"work here. But of course you carefully avoided to create overlapping areas, "
"so you do not use these functions at all."
msgstr ""
"Tyvärr fungerar inte pilsymbolerna för att flytta en listpost uppåt eller "
"nedåt här. Men du har naturligtvis noga undvikit att skapa överlappande "
"områden och behöver därför inte använda funktionerna alls."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/blur-taj-tblur.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T"
" EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/blur-taj-tblur.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T"
" EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/filters-blur-tileable.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/filters-blur-tileable.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Tileable Blur"
msgstr "Sömlös oskärpa"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Blur"
msgstr "Oskärpa"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Example for the <quote>Tileable</quote> filter"
msgstr "Exempel på filtret <quote>Sömlös</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Filter <quote>Tileable Blur</quote> applied"
msgstr "Filtret <quote>Sömlös oskärpa</quote> tillämpat"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This tool is used to soften tile seams in images used in tiled backgrounds. "
"It does this by blending and blurring the boundary between images that will "
"be next to each other after tiling."
msgstr ""
"Det här verktyget används för att mjuka upp skarvar mellan bildplattor i "
"bilder som används som kaklade bakgrunder. Det gör det genom att blanda och "
"göra gränsen mellan bilder som kommer att ligga bredvid varandra efter "
"plattläggningen oskarp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If you want to treat only images borders, you can't apply filter to the "
"whole image. The solution to get the wanted effect is as follows:"
msgstr ""
"Om du bara vill behandla bildens kanter kan du inte tillämpa filtret på hela"
" bilden. Gör så här för att få önskad effekt:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Duplicate layer (<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guimenuitem>Duplicate "
"Layer</guimenuitem></menuchoice>) and select it to work on it."
msgstr ""
"Duplicera lagret (<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guimenuitem>Duplicera"
" lager</guimenuitem></menuchoice>) och markera det för att arbeta med det."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Apply <quote>Tileable Blur</quote> filter with a 20 pixels radius to this "
"layer."
msgstr ""
"Tillämpa filtret <quote>Sömlös oskärpa</quote> med radien 20 bildpunkter på "
"detta lager."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Select all (<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>A</keycap></keycombo>) "
"and reduce selection "
"(<menuchoice><guimenu>Selection</guimenu><guimenuitem>Shrink</guimenuitem></menuchoice>)"
" to create a border with the wanted width."
msgstr ""
"Markera allt (<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>A</keycap></keycombo>) "
"och krymp markeringen "
"(<menuchoice><guimenu>Markera</guimenu><guimenuitem>Krymp</guimenuitem></menuchoice>)"
" för att skapa en kant med önskad bredd."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Give a feathered border to the selection by using "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Selection</guimenu><guimenuitem>Feather</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Ge markeringen en mjuk kant med "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Markera</guimenu><guimenuitem>Mjuka "
"upp</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Delete selection with "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>K</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"Ta bort markeringen med "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>K</keycap></keycombo>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Merge layers with <menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guimenuitem>Merge "
"down</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Sammanfoga lagren med "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guimenuitem>Sammanfoga "
"nedåt</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can find this filter in the image menu under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Blur</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Tileable"
" Blur</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar filtret i bildmenyn under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Oskärpa</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Sömlös"
" oskärpa</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<quote>Tileable Blur</quote> filter options"
msgstr "Filteralternativ för <quote>Sömlös oskärpa</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Blur Radius"
msgstr "Oskärperadie"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The bigger the radius, the more marked is the blur. By selecting "
"<guilabel>Horizontal</guilabel> and <guilabel>Vertical</guilabel>, you can "
"make the horizontal and vertical borders tileable."
msgstr ""
"Ju större radie, desto tydligare blir oskärpan. Genom att välja "
"<guilabel>Horisontellt</guilabel> och <guilabel>Vertikalt</guilabel> kan du "
"göra de vågräta och lodräta kanterna sömlösa."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Blur vertically / horizontally"
msgstr "Gör oskarp lodrätt/vågrätt"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "These options are self-explanatory."
msgstr "Dessa alternativ är självförklarande."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Blur Type"
msgstr "Typ av oskärpa"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Choose the algorithm to be applied:"
msgstr "Välj den algoritm som ska tillämpas:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "IIR"
msgstr "IIR"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "for photographic or scanned images."
msgstr "för fotografiska eller skannade bilder."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "RLE"
msgstr "RLE"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "for computer-generated images."
msgstr "för datorgenererade bilder."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/blur-taj-pixelise.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/blur-taj-pixelise.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/filters-blur-pixelize.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/filters-blur-pixelize.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Pixelise"
msgstr "Pixelisera"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Blur applied"
msgstr "Oskärpa tillämpad"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The Pixelize filter renders the image using large color blocks. It is very "
"similar to the effect seen on television when obscuring a criminal during "
"trial. It is used for the <quote>Abraham Lincoln effect</quote>: see <xref "
"linkend=\"bibliography-online-bach\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Filtret Pixelisera återger bilden med stora färgblock. Det liknar mycket den"
" effekt som syns i tv när en brottsling döljs under en rättegång. Det "
"används för <quote>Abraham Lincoln-effekten</quote>; se <xref "
"linkend=\"bibliography-online-bach\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can find this filter in the image menu through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Blur</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Pixelise</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
msgstr ""
"Du hittar filtret i bildmenyn under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Oskärpa</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Pixelisera</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<placeholder-1/> filter options"
msgstr "Filteralternativ för <placeholder-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Pixel Width"
msgstr "Bildpunktsbredd"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Here you can set the desired width of the blocks."
msgstr "Här kan du ange önskad bredd för blocken."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Pixel Height"
msgstr "Bildpunktshöjd"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Here you can set the height of the blocks."
msgstr "Här kan du ange blockens höjd."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Chain Button"
msgstr "Kedjeknapp"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If the chain is broken, you can set width and height separately. Otherwise, "
"they are linked."
msgstr ""
"Om kedjan är bruten kan du ange bredd och höjd var för sig. Annars är de "
"länkade."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Unit Input Box"
msgstr "Inmatningsruta för enhet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Here you can select the unit of measure for height and width."
msgstr "Här kan du välja måttenhet för höjd och bredd."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/blur-taj-mblur-linear.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/blur-taj-mblur-linear.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/blur-taj-mblur-radial.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/blur-taj-mblur-radial.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/blur-taj-mblur-zoom.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/blur-taj-mblur-zoom.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/options-blur-mblur.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/options-blur-mblur.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Starting example for Motion Blur filter"
msgstr "Utgångsexempel för filtret Rörelseoskärpa"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Linear blur"
msgstr "Linjär oskärpa"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Using example for Motion Blur filter"
msgstr "Exempel på användning av filtret Rörelseoskärpa"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Radial blur"
msgstr "Radiell oskärpa"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Zoom blur"
msgstr "Zoomoskärpa"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The Motion Blur filter creates a movement blur. The filter is capable of "
"Linear, Radial, and Zoom movements. Each of these movements can be further "
"adjusted, with Length, or Angle settings available."
msgstr ""
"Filtret Rörelseoskärpa skapar rörelseoskärpa. Filtret kan skapa linjära, "
"radiella och zoomande rörelser. Varje rörelse kan finjusteras med "
"inställningarna Längd och Vinkel."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can find this filter in the image menu under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Blur</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Motion"
" Blur</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
msgstr ""
"Du hittar filtret i bildmenyn under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Oskärpa</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Rörelseoskärpa</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Is a blur that travels in a single direction, horizontally, for example. In "
"this case, Length means as Radius in other filters:it represents the blur "
"intensity. More Length will result in more blurring. Angle describes the "
"actual angle of the movement. Thus, a setting of 90 will produce a vertical "
"blur, and a setting of 0 will produce a horizontal blur."
msgstr ""
"Är en oskärpa som rör sig i en riktning, till exempel vågrätt. I detta fall "
"har Längd samma betydelse som Radie i andra filter: den anger oskärpans "
"styrka. Större längd ger mer oskärpa. Vinkel beskriver rörelsens faktiska "
"vinkel. Inställningen 90 ger därför lodrät oskärpa, medan 0 ger vågrät "
"oskärpa."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"motion blur that creates a circular blur. The Length slider is not important"
" with this type of blur. Angle on the other hand, is the primary setting "
"that will affect the blur. More Angle will result in more blurring in a "
"circular direction. The Radial motion blur is similar to the effect of a "
"spinning object. The center of the spin in this case, is the center of the "
"image."
msgstr ""
"Rörelseoskärpa som skapar en cirkelformad oskärpa. Reglaget Längd är inte "
"viktigt för denna typ av oskärpa. Vinkel är däremot huvudinställningen som "
"påverkar oskärpan. Större vinkel ger mer oskärpa i cirkelformad riktning. "
"Radiell rörelseoskärpa liknar effekten hos ett snurrande objekt. Rotationens"
" centrum är i detta fall bildens centrum."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Produces a blur that radiates out from the center of the image. The center "
"of the image remains relatively calm, whilst the outer areas become blurred "
"toward the center. This filter option produces a perceived forward movement,"
" into the image. Length is the main setting here, and affects the amount of "
"speed, as it were, toward the center of the image."
msgstr ""
"Skapar en oskärpa som strålar ut från bildens centrum. Bildens centrum "
"förblir relativt lugnt medan de yttre områdena blir oskarpa mot centrum. "
"Filteralternativet ger intryck av en framåtrörelse in i bilden. Längd är "
"huvudinställningen här och påverkar hur snabb rörelsen mot bildens centrum "
"upplevs."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Blur settings"
msgstr "Oskärpeinställningar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "This slider controls the distance pixels are moved (1 - 256)"
msgstr "Detta reglage styr sträckan som bildpunkterna flyttas (1–256)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "As seen above, Angle slider effect depends on Blur type (0 - 360)."
msgstr ""
"Som framgår ovan beror vinkelreglagets effekt på typen av oskärpa (0–360)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Blur Center"
msgstr "Oskärpecentrum"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"With this option, you can set the starting point of movement. Effect is "
"different according to the Blur Type you have selected. With Radial Type for"
" instance, you set rotation center. With Zoom Type, vanishing point. This "
"option is greyed out with Linear type."
msgstr ""
"Med detta alternativ kan du ange rörelsens startpunkt. Effekten skiljer sig "
"åt beroende på vilken typ av oskärpa du valt. Med den radiella typen anger "
"du till exempel rotationscentrum, med zoomtypen flyktpunkten. Alternativet "
"är nedtonat för den linjära typen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You have to set the blur center coordinates. Unfortunately, you can't do "
"that by clicking on the image. But, by moving mouse pointer on the image, "
"you can see its coordinates in the lower left corner of the image window. "
"Only copy them out into the input boxes."
msgstr ""
"Du måste ange oskärpecentrets koordinater. Tyvärr går det inte att göra det "
"genom att klicka på bilden. Men när du flyttar muspekaren över bilden kan du"
" se koordinaterna i bildfönstrets nedre vänstra hörn. Kopiera dem sedan till"
" inmatningsrutorna."

