#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Original for demo"
msgstr "Original för demonstration"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This is a set of filters that blur images, or parts of them, in various "
"ways. If there is a selection, only the selected parts of an image will be "
"blurred. There may, however, be some leakage of colors from the unblurred "
"area into the blurred area. To help you pick the one you want, we will "
"illustrate what each does when applied to the image shown at right. These "
"are, of course, only examples: most of the filters have parameter settings "
"that allow you to vary the magnitude or type of blurring."
msgstr ""
"Detta är en samling filter som gör bilder, eller delar av dem, oskarpa på "
"olika sätt. Om det finns en markering görs bara de markerade delarna av "
"bilden oskarpa. Färger från det skarpa området kan dock läcka in i det "
"oskarpa området. För att hjälpa dig att välja illustrerar vi vad varje "
"filter gör när det tillämpas på bilden till höger. Detta är naturligtvis "
"bara exempel: de flesta filter har parameterinställningar som låter dig "
"variera oskärpans grad eller typ."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Gaussian blur (radius 10)"
msgstr "Gaussisk oskärpa (radie 10)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The most broadly useful of these is the Gaussian blur. (Don't let the word "
"\"Gaussian\" throw you: this filter makes an image blurry in the most basic "
"way.) It has an efficient implementation that allows it to create a very "
"blurry blur in a relatively short time."
msgstr ""
"Det mest användbara av dessa filter är gaussisk oskärpa. (Låt inte ordet "
"<quote>gaussisk</quote> avskräcka dig: filtret gör bilden oskarp på det mest"
" grundläggande sättet.) Det har en effektiv implementering som kan skapa "
"mycket kraftig oskärpa på relativt kort tid."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Simple blur"
msgstr "Enkel oskärpa"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If you only want to blur the image a little bit — to soften it, as it were —"
" you might use the simple \"Blur\" filter. This filter runs automatically, "
"without creating a dialog. The effect is subtle enough that you might not "
"even notice it, but you can get a stronger effect by repeating it. In GIMP "
"2.0 the filter shows a dialog that allows you to set a \"repeat count\". If "
"you want a strong blurring effect, this filter is too slow to be a good "
"choice: use a Gaussian blur instead."
msgstr ""
"Om du bara vill göra bilden lite oskarp, för att mjuka upp den, kan du "
"använda det enkla filtret <quote>Oskärpa</quote>. Filtret körs automatiskt "
"utan att någon dialogruta öppnas. Effekten är så diskret att du kanske inte "
"ens märker den, men du kan få en starkare effekt genom att upprepa den. I "
"GIMP 2.0 visar filtret en dialogruta där du kan ange ett "
"<quote>upprepningsantal</quote>. Om du vill ha en stark oskärpeeffekt är "
"filtret för långsamt för att vara ett bra val: använd gaussisk oskärpa i "
"stället."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Selective blur"
msgstr "Selektiv oskärpa"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The Selective Blur filter allows you to set a threshold so that only pixels "
"that are similar to each other are blurred together. It is often useful as a"
" tool for reducing graininess in photos without blurring sharp edges. (In "
"the example, note that the graininess of the background has been reduced.) "
"The implementation is much slower than a Gaussian blur, though, so you "
"should not use it unless you really need the selectivity."
msgstr ""
"Filtret Selektiv oskärpa låter dig ange ett tröskelvärde så att endast "
"bildpunkter som liknar varandra görs oskarpa tillsammans. Det är ofta "
"användbart för att minska kornighet i foton utan att göra skarpa kanter "
"oskarpa. (Observera i exemplet att bakgrundens kornighet har minskat.) "
"Implementeringen är dock mycket långsammare än gaussisk oskärpa, så använd "
"den inte om du inte verkligen behöver selektiviteten."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The Pixelize filter produces the well-known \"Abraham Lincoln\" effect by "
"turning the image into a set of large square pixels. (The <link "
"linkend=\"plug-in-oilify\">Oilify</link> filter, in the Artistic Filters "
"group, has a similar effect, but with irregular blobs instead of perfectly "
"square pixels.)"
msgstr ""
"Filtret Pixelisera skapar den välkända <quote>Abraham Lincoln-"
"effekten</quote> genom att omvandla bilden till stora fyrkantiga "
"bildpunkter. (Filtret <link linkend=\"plug-in-oilify\">Oljemåla</link> i "
"gruppen Konstnärliga filter har en liknande effekt, men med oregelbundna "
"fläckar i stället för helt fyrkantiga bildpunkter.)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can find a nice explanation of the Abraham Lincoln effect at <xref "
"linkend=\"bibliography-online-bach\"/>. You will see the Salvador Dali's "
"painting <quote>Gala Contemplating the Mediterranean Sea</quote> turning to "
"an Abraham Lincoln's portrait when looking at it from a distance."
msgstr ""
"En bra förklaring av Abraham Lincoln-effekten finns på <xref "
"linkend=\"bibliography-online-bach\"/>. Där ser du Salvador Dalís målning "
"<quote>Gala Contemplating the Mediterranean Sea</quote> förvandlas till ett "
"porträtt av Abraham Lincoln när du ser den på avstånd."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Motion blur"
msgstr "Rörelseoskärpa"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The Motion Blur filter blurs in a specific direction at each point, which "
"allows you to create a sense of motion: either linear, radial, or "
"rotational."
msgstr ""
"Filtret Rörelseoskärpa gör bilden oskarp i en viss riktning vid varje punkt,"
" vilket låter dig skapa en känsla av rörelse: linjär, radiell eller "
"roterande."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Finally, the Tileable Blur filter is really the same thing as a Gaussian "
"blur, except that it wraps around the edges of an image to help you reduce "
"edge effects when you create a pattern by tiling multiple copies of the "
"image side by side."
msgstr ""
"Slutligen är filtret Sömlös oskärpa egentligen samma sak som gaussisk "
"oskärpa, utom att det omsluter bildens kanter för att hjälpa dig minska "
"kanteffekter när du skapar ett mönster genom att lägga flera kopior av "
"bilden sida vid sida."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Tileable Blur is actually implemented by a Script-Fu script that invokes the"
" Gaussian blur plug-in."
msgstr ""
"Sömlös oskärpa är egentligen implementerat med ett Script-Fu-skript som "
"anropar insticksmodulen för gaussisk oskärpa."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/blur-taj-gauss.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T"
" EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/blur-taj-gauss.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T"
" EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/options-blur-gauss.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/options-blur-gauss.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The IIR Gaussian Blur plug-in acts on each pixel of the active layer or "
"selection, setting its Value to the average of all pixel Values present in a"
" radius defined in the dialog. A higher Value will produce a higher amount "
"of blur. The blur can be set to act in one direction more than the other by "
"clicking the Chain Button so that it is broken, and altering the radius. "
"GIMP supports two implementations of Gaussian Blur: IIR G.B. and RLE G.B. "
"They both produce the same results, but each one can be faster in some "
"cases."
msgstr ""
"Insticksmodulen IIR Gaussisk oskärpa verkar på varje bildpunkt i det aktiva "
"lagret eller markeringen och sätter dess värde till medelvärdet av alla "
"bildpunktsvärden inom en radie som anges i dialogrutan. Ett högre värde ger "
"mer oskärpa. Oskärpan kan göras starkare i en riktning än i den andra genom "
"att bryta kedjeknappen och ändra radien. GIMP har två implementeringar av "
"gaussisk oskärpa: IIR G.B. och RLE G.B. Båda ger samma resultat, men den ena"
" kan vara snabbare i vissa fall."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can find this filter in the image menu under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Blur</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Gaussian"
" Blur</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
msgstr ""
"Du hittar filtret i bildmenyn under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Oskärpa</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Gaussisk"
" oskärpa</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Gaussian"
msgstr "Gaussisk"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<placeholder-1/> filter parameters settings"
msgstr "Parameterinställningar för filtret <placeholder-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Here you can set the blur intensity. By altering the ratio of horizontal to "
"vertical blur, you can give the effect of a motion blur. You can choose the "
"unit with the drop list."
msgstr ""
"Här kan du ange oskärpans styrka. Genom att ändra förhållandet mellan vågrät"
" och lodrät oskärpa kan du ge intryck av rörelseoskärpa. Du kan välja enhet "
"i listrutan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Blur Method"
msgstr "Oskärpemetod"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>IIR</guilabel>: IIR stands for <quote>Infinite Impulse "
"Response</quote>.This blur works best for large radius values and for images"
" which are not computer generated."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>IIR</guilabel>: IIR står för <quote>Infinite Impulse "
"Response</quote>. Denna oskärpa fungerar bäst för stora radievärden och för "
"bilder som inte är datorgenererade."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>RLE</guilabel>: RLE stands for run-length encoding. RLE Gaussian "
"Blur is best used on computer-generated images or those with large areas of "
"constant intensity."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>RLE</guilabel>: RLE står för run-length encoding. RLE-gaussisk "
"oskärpa används bäst på datorgenererade bilder eller bilder med stora "
"områden med konstant intensitet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/blur-taj-selective.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/blur-taj-selective.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/filters-blur-gaussselect.png'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/filters-blur-gaussselect.png'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Selective Gaussian"
msgstr "Selektiv gaussisk"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The Selective Gaussian Blur filter"
msgstr "Filtret Selektiv gaussisk oskärpa"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Contrary to the other blur plug-ins, the Selective Gaussian Blur plug-in "
"doesn't act on all pixels: blur is applied only if the difference between "
"its value and the value of the surrounding pixels is less than a defined "
"Delta value. So, contrasts are preserved because difference is high on "
"contrast limits. It is used to blur a background so that the foreground "
"subject will stand out better. This add a sense of depth to the image with "
"only a single operation."
msgstr ""
"Till skillnad från andra insticksmoduler för oskärpa verkar Selektiv "
"gaussisk oskärpa inte på alla bildpunkter: oskärpa tillämpas bara om "
"skillnaden mellan dess värde och omgivande bildpunkters värde är mindre än "
"ett angivet deltavärde. Kontraster bevaras alltså eftersom skillnaden är "
"stor vid kontrastgränser. Filtret används för att göra en bakgrund oskarp så"
" att motiv i förgrunden framträder bättre. Det ger bilden en känsla av djup "
"med bara en åtgärd."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can find this filter in the image menu under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Blur</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Selective"
" Gaussian Blur</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
msgstr ""
"Du hittar filtret i bildmenyn under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Oskärpa</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Selektiv"
" gaussisk oskärpa</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<quote>Selective Gaussian</quote> filter parameters settings"
msgstr "Parameterinställningar för filtret <quote>Selektiv gaussisk</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Here you can set the blur intensity, in pixels."
msgstr "Här kan du ange oskärpans styrka i bildpunkter."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Max. Delta"
msgstr "Max. delta"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Here you can set the maximum difference (0-255) between the pixel value and "
"the surrounding pixel values. Above this Delta, blur will not be applied to "
"that pixel."
msgstr ""
"Här kan du ange den största skillnaden (0–255) mellan bildpunktens värde och"
" omgivande bildpunkters värden. Över detta delta tillämpas ingen oskärpa på "
"bildpunkten."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/blur-taj-blur.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/blur-taj-blur.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The Blur filter applied to a photograph"
msgstr "Filtret Oskärpa tillämpat på ett fotografi"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The simple Blur filter produces an effect similar to that of an out of focus"
" camera shot. To produce this blur effect, the filter takes the average of "
"the present pixel value and the value of adjacent pixels and sets the "
"present pixel to that average value."
msgstr ""
"Det enkla filtret Oskärpa ger en effekt som liknar ett foto taget med en ur "
"fokus-kamera. För att skapa oskärpan beräknar filtret medelvärdet av den "
"aktuella bildpunktens värde och intilliggande bildpunkters värden och sätter"
" den aktuella bildpunkten till detta medelvärde."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Filter advantage is its calculation speed. It suits big images."
msgstr "Filtrets fördel är dess beräkningshastighet. Det passar stora bilder."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Filter disadvantage is that its action is hardly perceptible on big images, "
"but very strong on small images."
msgstr ""
"Filtrets nackdel är att dess verkan knappt märks på stora bilder, men är "
"mycket stark på små bilder."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can find this filter through: "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Blur</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Blur</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
msgstr ""
"Du hittar filtret under: "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Oskärpa</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Oskärpa</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/using/crop-orig.png'; md5=907566831ae7973604b7bfd102f8b12b"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/using/crop-orig.png'; md5=907566831ae7973604b7bfd102f8b12b"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/using/crop-auto.png'; md5=bd48475d6b748c3a5a9d3bba64a61799"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/using/crop-auto.png'; md5=bd48475d6b748c3a5a9d3bba64a61799"

