"@@image: 'images/using/crop-zealous.png'; "
"md5=6fae2f2f2835961cc9653d993b8f16f6"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/using/crop-zealous.png'; "
"md5=6fae2f2f2835961cc9653d993b8f16f6"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Zealous Crop"
msgstr "Intensiv beskärning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "According to color"
msgstr "Efter färg"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Zealous Crop</guimenuitem> command crops an image using a "
"single solid color as a guide. It crops the edges, as with the <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-image-crop\">Autocrop</link> command, but it also crops the "
"areas in the middle of the image which have the same color (at least, in "
"principle)."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Intensiv beskärning</guimenuitem> beskär en bild med "
"en enda helfärg som vägledning. Det beskär kanterna, som kommandot <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-image-crop\">Beskär automatiskt</link>, men beskär även "
"områden mitt i bilden med samma färg (åtminstone i princip)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Please note that <guimenuitem>Zealous Crop</guimenuitem> crops all of the "
"layers, although it only analyzes the active layer. This may lead to a loss "
"of information from the other layers."
msgstr ""
"Observera att <guimenuitem>Intensiv beskärning</guimenuitem> beskär alla "
"lager, även om den bara analyserar det aktiva lagret. Detta kan leda till "
"att information går förlorad från de andra lagren."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<quote>Zealous Crop</quote> Example"
msgstr "Exempel på <quote>Intensiv beskärning</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<quote>Autocrop</quote> applied"
msgstr "<quote>Beskär automatiskt</quote> tillämpat"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<quote>Zealous Crop</quote> applied"
msgstr "<quote>Intensiv beskärning</quote> tillämpat"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
