#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The Study ID that identifies the specific study for which this image was "
"used."
msgstr ""
"Undersöknings-id:t som identifierar den specifika undersökning där bilden "
"användes."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp/master
msgid "Referring Physician"
msgstr "Remitterande läkare"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The physician that referred the patient."
msgstr "Läkaren som remitterade patienten."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp/master
msgid "Study Date"
msgstr "Undersökningsdatum"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The date that the study took place."
msgstr "Datumet då undersökningen ägde rum."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp/master
msgid "Study Description"
msgstr "Undersökningsbeskrivning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "A description of the study that was performed."
msgstr "En beskrivning av undersökningen som genomfördes."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The series number of this image."
msgstr "Serienumret för bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Modality"
msgstr "Modalitet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Series date"
msgstr "Seriedatum"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The date this series images was taken."
msgstr "Datumet då bilderna i serien togs."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Series Description"
msgstr "Seriebeskrivning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "A description of this series."
msgstr "En beskrivning av serien."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp/master
msgid "Equipment Institution"
msgstr "Utrustningens institution"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The institution that owns the equipment."
msgstr "Institutionen som äger utrustningen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp/master
msgid "Equipment Manufacturer"
msgstr "Utrustningens tillverkare"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The maker of the equipment."
msgstr "Tillverkaren av utrustningen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Importing and Exporting metadata"
msgstr "Importera och exportera metadata"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Select:</guilabel> drop-down button at the bottom of the "
"dialog, is where you can choose to Import or Export metadata. A good way to "
"have your metadata filled with pre-defined information, is to open a new "
"image without metadata, then in the metadata editor fill in all fields that "
"you care about. You then choose <guilabel>Export metadata</guilabel> here "
"and save it under a name you can remember. Next time you need to fill in "
"your information, you choose <guilabel>Import metadata</guilabel>, then "
"select the file to read that information from, and all metadata fields will "
"be overwritten or filled with the information you saved previously."
msgstr ""
"Med listruteknappen <guilabel>Välj:</guilabel> längst ned i dialogrutan kan "
"du välja att importera eller exportera metadata. Ett bra sätt att fylla "
"metadata med fördefinierad information är att öppna en ny bild utan metadata"
" och sedan fylla i de fält du vill använda i metadataeditorn. Välj sedan "
"<guilabel>Exportera metadata</guilabel> här och spara den under ett namn du "
"kommer ihåg. Nästa gång du behöver fylla i informationen väljer du "
"<guilabel>Importera metadata</guilabel>, väljer filen att läsa informationen"
" från, och alla metadatafält skrivs över eller fylls med informationen du "
"tidigare sparade."

