#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Value option of the <placeholder-1/> filter"
msgstr "Värdealternativet för filtret <placeholder-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<guilabel>Advanced</guilabel>: developed later."
msgstr "<guilabel>Avancerat</guilabel>: utvecklas senare."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Affected range"
msgstr "Påverkat område"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Allows you to set which brightness you want to work with."
msgstr "Låter dig ange vilket ljusstyrkeområde du vill arbeta med."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<guilabel>Shadows</guilabel>: dark tones."
msgstr "<guilabel>Skuggor</guilabel>: mörka toner."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Midtones"
msgstr "Mellantoner"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<guilabel>Highlights</guilabel>: bright tones"
msgstr "<guilabel>Högdagrar</guilabel>: ljusa toner"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Select pixels by"
msgstr "Markera bildpunkter efter"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Determines what HSV channel the selected range will affect. You can choose "
"between:"
msgstr ""
"Anger vilken HSV-kanal det valda området påverkar. Du kan välja mellan:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This slider sets how image will change when you click on a window: taking a "
"short step or a large one (0 - 1)."
msgstr ""
"Detta reglage anger hur mycket bilden ändras när du klickar i ett fönster: "
"ett litet eller stort steg (0–1)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Advanced options of the <placeholder-1/> filter"
msgstr "Avancerade alternativ för filtret <placeholder-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"These advanced options let you work more precisely on the changes applied to"
" the image and on the preview size."
msgstr ""
"Dessa avancerade alternativ låter dig arbeta mer exakt med ändringarna i "
"bilden och förhandsvisningens storlek."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Preview Size"
msgstr "Förhandsvisa storlek"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Something like a zoom on previews. Normal size is 80."
msgstr "Ungefär som zoomning av förhandsvisningarna. Normal storlek är 80."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"In spite of Preview Size option, this size is often too small. You can "
"compensate this by working on an enlarged selection, for instance a face on "
"a photo. Then, you invert selection to work on the other part of the image."
msgstr ""
"Trots alternativet Förhandsvisningsstorlek är denna storlek ofta för liten. "
"Du kan kompensera för det genom att arbeta med en förstorad markering, "
"exempelvis ett ansikte i ett foto. Invertera sedan markeringen för att "
"arbeta med den andra delen av bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Here, you can set the tone range that the filter will affect."
msgstr "Här kan du ange vilket tonområde filtret ska påverka."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The curve in this window represents the importance of the changes applied to"
" the image. The aspect of this curve depends on the Affected range you have "
"selected: Shadows, Midtons or Highlights. You can set the curve amplitude by"
" using the <guilabel>Roughness</guilabel> slider in the main window of the "
"filter."
msgstr ""
"Kurvan i detta fönster representerar hur viktiga ändringarna i bilden är. "
"Kurvans utseende beror på det Påverkade område som du valt: Skuggor, "
"Mellantoner eller Högdagrar. Du kan ange kurvans amplitud med reglaget "
"<guilabel>Grovhet</guilabel> i filtrets huvudfönster."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"By using the available controls (slider and triangles), you can precisely "
"set the form of this action curve."
msgstr ""
"Med de tillgängliga kontrollerna (reglage och trianglar) kan du exakt ange "
"formen på denna åtgärdskurva."

