"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guisubmenu>Show in File "
"Manager</guisubmenu></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Arkiv</guimenu><guisubmenu>Visa i "
"filhanteraren</guisubmenu></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This command opens the file manager in the directory containing the active "
"image"
msgstr ""
"Detta kommando öppnar filhanteraren i katalogen som innehåller den aktiva "
"bilden"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp/master
msgid "Send by Email"
msgstr "Skicka med e-post"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guisubmenu>Send by "
"Email…</guisubmenu></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Arkiv</guimenu><guisubmenu>Skicka med "
"e-post…</guisubmenu></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This command opens a small dialog with the name of the image to be sent (you"
" can edit it). Clicking on the <guibutton>Send</guibutton> button opens your"
" default mail software with the image attached."
msgstr ""
"Detta kommando öppnar en liten dialogruta med namnet på bilden som ska "
"skickas (du kan redigera det). När du klickar på knappen "
"<guibutton>Skicka</guibutton> öppnas ditt standardsystem för e-post med "
"bilden bifogad."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Save a Copy…"
msgstr "Spara en kopia…"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Save a copy"
msgstr "Spara en kopia"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Save a Copy</guimenuitem> command does the same thing as "
"the <guimenuitem>Save</guimenuitem> command, but with one important "
"difference. It always asks for a file name and saves the image into the XCF "
"file format, but it does not change the name of the active image or mark it "
"as <quote>clean</quote>. As a result, if you try to delete the image, or "
"exit from <acronym>GIMP</acronym>, you are informed that the image is "
"<quote>dirty</quote> and given an opportunity to save it."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Spara en kopia</guimenuitem> gör samma sak som "
"<guimenuitem>Spara</guimenuitem>, men med en viktig skillnad. Det frågar "
"alltid efter ett filnamn och sparar bilden i XCF-format, men ändrar inte "
"namnet på den aktiva bilden och markerar den inte som <quote>ren</quote>. Om"
" du sedan försöker ta bort bilden eller avsluta <acronym>GIMP</acronym> får "
"du veta att bilden är <quote>ändrad</quote> och möjlighet att spara den."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This command is useful when you want to save a copy of your image in its "
"current state, but continue to work with the original file without "
"interruption."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot är användbart när du vill spara en kopia av bilden i dess aktuella"
" tillstånd men fortsätta arbeta med originalfilen utan avbrott."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Save a "
"Copy…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. There is no default keyboard shortcut."
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Arkiv</guimenu><guimenuitem>Spara en "
"kopia…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Det har ingen standardtangentbordsgenväg."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/file/save-as.png'; "
"md5=147bcd9ccc96af74120d238c36a1014f"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/file/save-as.png'; "
"md5=147bcd9ccc96af74120d238c36a1014f"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Save as</guimenuitem> command displays the <quote>Save "
"Image</quote> dialog. The Save as dialog allows you to save your XCF image "
"with another name and/or to another folder. For other image file formats you"
" should use the <guimenuitem>Export As…</guimenuitem> command."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Spara som</guimenuitem> visar dialogrutan "
"<quote>Spara bild</quote>. Dialogrutan Spara som låter dig spara XCF-bilden "
"med ett annat namn och/eller i en annan mapp. För andra bildfilformat ska du"
" använda kommandot <guimenuitem>Exportera som…</guimenuitem>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Save "
"As…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Arkiv</guimenu><guimenuitem>Spara "
"som…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"or by using the keyboard shortcut "
"<keycombo><keycap>Shift</keycap><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>S</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"eller med tangentbordsgenvägen "
"<keycombo><keycap>Skift</keycap><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>S</keycap></keycombo>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The <quote>Save Image</quote> dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutan <quote>Spara bild</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The left panel is divided into two parts. The upper part lists your main "
"directories and your storage devices; you cannot modify this list. The lower"
" part lists your bookmarks; you can add or remove "
"<emphasis>bookmarks</emphasis>. To add a bookmark, select a directory or a "
"file in the middle panel and click on the <guibutton>Add</guibutton> button "
"at the bottom of the left panel. You can also use the <guilabel>Add to "
"bookmarks</guilabel> command in the context menu, which you get by clicking "
"the right mouse button. You can delete a bookmark by selecting it and "
"clicking on the <guibutton>Remove</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Den vänstra panelen är uppdelad i två delar. Den övre delen visar dina "
"huvudkataloger och lagringsenheter; du kan inte ändra listan. Den nedre "
"delen visar dina bokmärken; du kan lägga till eller ta bort "
"<emphasis>bokmärken</emphasis>. För att lägga till ett bokmärke väljer du en"
" katalog eller fil i mittpanelen och klickar på knappen <guibutton>Lägg "
"till</guibutton> längst ned i den vänstra panelen. Du kan också använda "
"kommandot <guilabel>Lägg till i bokmärken</guilabel> i snabbmenyn som visas "
"när du högerklickar. Du tar bort ett bokmärke genom att välja det och klicka"
" på knappen <guibutton>Ta bort</guibutton>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The middle panel displays a list of the files in the current directory. "
"Change your current directory by double left-clicking on a directory in this"
" panel. Select a file with a single left click. You can then save to the "
"file you have selected by clicking on the <guibutton>Save</guibutton> "
"button. Note that a double left click saves the file directly."
msgstr ""
"Mittpanelen visar en lista över filerna i den aktuella katalogen. Byt "
"aktuell katalog genom att dubbelklicka med vänster musknapp på en katalog i "
"panelen. Välj en fil med ett enkelt vänsterklick. Du kan sedan spara till "
"den valda filen genom att klicka på knappen <guibutton>Spara</guibutton>. "
"Observera att ett dubbelklick med vänster musknapp sparar filen direkt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can right click on the middle panel to access the <emphasis>Show Hidden "
"Files</emphasis> command."
msgstr ""
"Du kan högerklicka på mittpanelen för att komma åt kommandot <emphasis>Visa "
"dolda filer</emphasis>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The selected image is displayed in the <guilabel>Preview </guilabel> window."
" File size, resolution and image composition are displayed below the preview"
" window."
msgstr ""
"Den valda bilden visas i fönstret <guilabel>Förhandsvisning</guilabel>. "
"Filstorlek, upplösning och bildsammansättning visas under "
"förhandsvisningsfönstret."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If your image has been modified by another program, click on the preview to "
"update it."
msgstr ""
"Om bilden har ändrats av ett annat program klickar du på förhandsvisningen "
"för att uppdatera den."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Enter the filename of the new image file here."
msgstr "Ange filnamnet för den nya bildfilen här."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If the image has already been saved, <acronym>GIMP</acronym> suggests the "
"same filename to you. If you click on <emphasis>Save</emphasis>, the file is"
" overwritten."
msgstr ""
"Om bilden redan har sparats föreslår <acronym>GIMP</acronym> samma filnamn. "
"Om du klickar på <emphasis>Spara</emphasis> skrivs filen över."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Above the middle panel, the path of the current directory is displayed. You "
"can navigate along this path by clicking on one of the buttons."
msgstr ""
"Ovanför mittpanelen visas sökvägen till den aktuella katalogen. Du kan "
"navigera längs sökvägen genom att klicka på en av knapparna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If you want to save the image into a folder that doesn't yet exist, you can "
"create it by clicking on <guilabel>Create Folder</guilabel> and following "
"the instructions."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill spara bilden i en mapp som ännu inte finns kan du skapa den genom"
" att klicka på <guilabel>Skapa mapp</guilabel> och följa instruktionerna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"At <guilabel>Select File Type</guilabel>, you can select a compressed format"
" for your XCF file."
msgstr ""
"Under <guilabel>Välj filtyp</guilabel> kan du välja ett komprimerat format "
"för XCF-filen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "This command opens <xref linkend=\"gimp-save-dialog\"/>."
msgstr "Detta kommando öppnar <xref linkend=\"gimp-save-dialog\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp/master
msgid "Reload the image"
msgstr "Läs in bilden igen"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Revert (command)"
msgstr "Återställ (kommando)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Revert</guimenuitem> command reloads the image from disk, "
"so that it looks just like it did the last time it was saved — unless, that "
"is, you or some application other than <acronym>GIMP</acronym> have modified"
" the image file, in which case, the new contents are loaded."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Återställ</guimenuitem> läser in bilden från disken "
"igen, så att den ser ut precis som när den sparades senast — om inte du "
"eller något annat program än <acronym>GIMP</acronym> har ändrat bildfilen; "
"då läses det nya innehållet in."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"When <acronym>GIMP</acronym> reverts a file, it actually closes the existing"
" image and creates a new image. Because of this, reverting an image is not "
"undoable, and causes the undo history of the image to be lost. "
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> tries to protect you from losing your work in this "
"way by asking you to confirm that you really want to revert the image."
msgstr ""
"När <acronym>GIMP</acronym> återställer en fil stängs den befintliga bilden "
"och en ny bild skapas. Därför går det inte att ångra återställningen och "
"bildens ångringshistorik går förlorad. <acronym>GIMP</acronym> försöker "
"skydda dig från att förlora arbete på detta sätt genom att be dig bekräfta "
"att du verkligen vill återställa bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Revert</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
" There is no default keyboard shortcut."
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Arkiv</guimenu><guimenuitem>Återställ</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
" Det har ingen standardtangentbordsgenväg."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem> command causes <acronym>GIMP</acronym> "
"to close all images and exit. If there are any open images which contain "
"unsaved changes (that is, they are not marked as <quote>clean</quote>), "
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> notifies you and displays a list of the unsaved "
"images. You can then choose which images you would like to save, or you can "
"cancel the command. Note that if you have a large number of images open, or "
"are using a large part of the RAM on your system, it may take a little while"
" for everything to shut down."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Avsluta</guimenuitem> får <acronym>GIMP</acronym> att"
" stänga alla bilder och avslutas. Om det finns öppna bilder med osparade "
"ändringar (de är alltså inte markerade som <quote>rena</quote>) meddelar "
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> dig och visar en lista över de osparade bilderna. Du"
" kan sedan välja vilka bilder du vill spara eller avbryta kommandot. "
"Observera att det kan ta en stund innan allt avslutas om du har många bilder"
" öppna eller använder en stor del av datorns RAM-minne."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Arkiv</guimenu><guimenuitem>Avsluta</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"or by using the keyboard shortcut "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"eller med tangentbordsgenvägen "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"For most systems on which <acronym>GIMP</acronym> runs, you can also execute"
" it by clicking on a <quote>Close</quote> button somewhere on the main image"
" window's titlebar. The location and appearance of this button are "
"determined by the windowing system and the window manager. Clicking on this "
"button closes GIMP when no image is open."
msgstr ""
"På de flesta system där <acronym>GIMP</acronym> körs kan du också avsluta "
"det genom att klicka på en knapp för <quote>Stäng</quote> någonstans i "
"huvudbildfönstrets titelrad. Fönstersystemet och fönsterhanteraren avgör "
"knappens plats och utseende. När ingen bild är öppen avslutar ett klick på "
"knappen GIMP."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/file/print-tab3.png'; "
"md5=6150760e725a65d34697c4947acdb966"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/file/print-tab3.png'; "
"md5=6150760e725a65d34697c4947acdb966"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Print command"
msgstr "Kommandot Skriv ut"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> has its own printing module. You can set page and "
"image up. A preview button allows you to verify the result before printing."
msgstr ""
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> har en egen utskriftsmodul. Du kan ställa in sidan "
"och bilden. En förhandsvisningsknapp låter dig kontrollera resultatet före "
"utskrift."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The <quote>Print</quote> dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutan <quote>Skriv ut</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"See <link linkend=\"gimp-using-photography-printing\">Printing your "
"photos</link>."
msgstr ""
"Se <link linkend=\"gimp-using-photography-printing\">Skriva ut dina "
"foton</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Print</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Arkiv</guimenu><guimenuitem>Skriv "
"ut</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"or by using the keyboard shortcut "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>P</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"eller med tangentbordsgenvägen "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>P</keycap></keycombo>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/gimp-help-3-0
#. from gnome:reviewed/gitte/main
msgid "Open Recent"
msgstr "Öppna senaste"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Open recent"
msgstr "Öppna senaste"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Selecting <guimenuitem>Open Recent</guimenuitem> displays a submenu with the"
" names of the files that you have opened recently in "
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym>. Simply click on a name to reopen it. See the <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-document-dialog\">Document History dialog</link> at the "
"bottom of the Open Recent submenu if you cannot find your image."
msgstr ""
"När du väljer <guimenuitem>Öppna senaste</guimenuitem> visas en undermeny "
"med namnen på filerna som du nyligen har öppnat i <acronym>GIMP</acronym>. "
"Klicka på ett namn för att öppna filen igen. Se <link linkend=\"gimp-"
"document-dialog\">dialogrutan Dokumenthistorik</link> längst ner i "
"undermenyn Öppna senaste om du inte hittar bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Open "
"Recent</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Arkiv</guimenu><guimenuitem>Öppna "
"senaste</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This command opens the <quote>Open Location</quote> dialog that lets you "
"load an image from a network location, specified by a URI, in any of the "
"formats that <acronym>GIMP</acronym> supports."
msgstr ""
"Detta kommando öppnar dialogrutan <quote>Öppna plats</quote>, som låter dig "
"läsa in en bild från en nätverksplats som anges med en URI, i något av de "
"format som <acronym>GIMP</acronym> stöder."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the Toolbox menubar or the image menubar "
"through <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Open "
"Location…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från verktygslådans menyrad eller bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Arkiv</guimenu><guimenuitem>Öppna "
"plats…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Description of the dialog window"
msgstr "Beskrivning av dialogfönstret"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The most typical schemes to open images with are:"
msgstr "De vanligaste protokollen för att öppna bilder är:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "file://"
msgstr "file://"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "to open an image from a local drive"
msgstr "för att öppna en bild från en lokal enhet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can omit the <quote>file://</quote> prefix and open images simply by "
"putting an absolute or relative path and filename in here."
msgstr ""
"Du kan utelämna prefixet <quote>file://</quote> och öppna bilder genom att "
"bara ange en absolut eller relativ sökväg och ett filnamn här."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The default base directory for relative paths depends on your operating "
"system. It is typically <filename>/home/&lt;username&gt;/</filename> on "
"Linux, <filename role=\"html\">C:\\Documents and "
"Settings\\&lt;username&gt;\\My Documents\\My Images\\</filename><filename "
"role=\"tex\">C:\\\\Documents and Settings\\\\&lt;username&gt;\\\\My "
"Documents\\\\My Images\\\\</filename> on Windows and "
"<filename>/Users/&lt;username&gt;/</filename> on Mac OS X."
msgstr ""
"Standardbaskatalogen för relativa sökvägar beror på operativsystemet. Den är"
" vanligen <filename>/home/&lt;username&gt;/</filename> i Linux, <filename "
"role=\"html\">C:\\Documents and Settings\\&lt;username&gt;\\My Documents\\My"
" Images\\</filename><filename role=\"tex\">C:\\\\Documents and "
"Settings\\\\&lt;username&gt;\\\\My Documents\\\\My Images\\\\</filename> i "
"Windows och <filename>/Users/&lt;username&gt;/</filename> i Mac OS X."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "ftp://"
msgstr "ftp://"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "to open an image from a ftp server"
msgstr "för att öppna en bild från en FTP-server"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "http://"
msgstr "http://"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "to load an image from a website"
msgstr "för att läsa in en bild från en webbplats"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"When you are visiting an Internet site, you can right-click on an image and "
"choose <quote>Copy link address</quote> in the drop-down menu. Then paste it"
" in the <quote>Open Location</quote> dialog to open it in GIMP."
msgstr ""
"När du besöker en webbplats kan du högerklicka på en bild och välja "
"<quote>Kopiera länkadress</quote> i snabbmenyn. Klistra sedan in den i "
"dialogrutan <quote>Öppna plats</quote> för att öppna bilden i GIMP."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Even if this command makes it very easy to grab images from web sites: "
"<emphasis> Please respect the copyright! Images, even if published on the "
"Internet are not always free to be used for you. </emphasis>"
msgstr ""
"Även om kommandot gör det mycket enkelt att hämta bilder från webbplatser: "
"<emphasis>Respektera upphovsrätten! Bilder som publiceras på internet får "
"inte alltid användas fritt.</emphasis>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Open as Layers…"
msgstr "Öppna som lager…"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "As layers"
msgstr "Som lager"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Open image as layers"
msgstr "Öppna bild som lager"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Open as layers"
msgstr "Öppna som lager"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenu>Open Image as layers</guimenu> command opens the <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-file-open\">Open Image</link> dialog. The layers of the "
"selected file are added to the current image as the top layers in the stack."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenu>Öppna bild som lager</guimenu> öppnar dialogrutan <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-file-open\">Öppna bild</link>. Lagren i den valda filen läggs"
" till i den aktuella bilden som de översta lagren i stapeln."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Open as "
"layers…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Arkiv</guimenu><guimenuitem>Öppna som "
"lager…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"or by using the keyboard shortcut "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>Alt</keycap><keycap>O</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"eller med tangentbordsgenvägen "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>Alt</keycap><keycap>O</keycap></keycombo>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Open…</guimenuitem> command activates the <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-open-dialog\">Open Image</link> dialog that lets you select "
"an image to be loaded from your hard-drive or an external device."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Öppna…</guimenuitem> aktiverar dialogrutan <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-open-dialog\">Öppna bild</link>, där du kan välja en bild som"
" ska läsas in från hårddisken eller en extern enhet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"For other ways of opening files, see the commands described on the next "
"pages (<xref linkend=\"gimp-file-open-as-layer\"/> etc.)."
msgstr ""
"För andra sätt att öppna filer, se kommandona som beskrivs på nästa sidor "
"(<xref linkend=\"gimp-file-open-as-layer\"/> osv.)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/file/new.png'; md5=91c33dbb59296722126cb68b4e9060b1"
