#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "New Image"
msgstr "Ny bild"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Using the <quote>Create a New Image</quote> dialog, you can create a new "
"empty image and set its properties. The image is shown in a new image "
"window. You may have more than one image on your screen at the same time."
msgstr ""
"Med dialogrutan <quote>Skapa en ny bild</quote> kan du skapa en ny tom bild "
"och ange dess egenskaper. Bilden visas i ett nytt bildfönster. Du kan ha "
"flera bilder på skärmen samtidigt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>New…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt detta kommando från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Arkiv</guimenu><guimenuitem>Ny…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"or by using the keyboard shortcut "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>N</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"eller med tangentbordsgenvägen "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>N</keycap></keycombo>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp/master
msgid "Basic Options"
msgstr "Grundläggande alternativ"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The <quote>Create a New Image</quote> dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutan <quote>Skapa en ny bild</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "When creating"
msgstr "När den skapas"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The <quote>Template</quote> dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutan <quote>Mall</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Rather than entering all the values by hand, you can select some predefined "
"values for your image from a menu of templates, which represent image types "
"that are somewhat commonly useful. The templates set values for the size, "
"resolution, comments, etc. If there is a particular image shape that you use"
" often and it does not appear on the list, you can create a new template, "
"using the <link linkend=\"gimp-template-dialog\">Templates</link> dialog."
msgstr ""
"I stället för att ange alla värden för hand kan du välja fördefinierade "
"värden för bilden från en meny med mallar. Mallarna representerar bildtyper "
"som ibland är användbara och anger värden för storlek, upplösning, "
"kommentarer med mera. Om du ofta använder en viss bildform som inte finns i "
"listan kan du skapa en ny mall i dialogrutan <link linkend=\"gimp-template-"
"dialog\">Mallar</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Here you set the <guilabel>Width</guilabel> and <guilabel>Height</guilabel> "
"of the new image. The default units are pixels, but you can choose a "
"different unit if you prefer, using the adjoining menu. If you do, note that"
" the resulting pixel size is determined by the X and Y resolution (which you"
" can change in the <guilabel>Advanced Options</guilabel>), and by setting "
"<quote>Dot for Dot</quote> in the <guimenu>View</guimenu> menu."
msgstr ""
"Här anger du den nya bildens <guilabel>Bredd</guilabel> och "
"<guilabel>Höjd</guilabel>. Standardenheten är bildpunkter, men du kan välja "
"en annan enhet i menyn intill. Observera då att den resulterande storleken i"
" bildpunkter bestäms av X- och Y-upplösningen (som du kan ändra under "
"<guilabel>Avancerade alternativ</guilabel>) och av inställningen "
"<quote>Punkt för punkt</quote> i menyn <guimenu>Visa</guimenu>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If no image is open, the <quote>New</quote> image is opened in the empty "
"image window, with the default size you have determined. If you open the "
"<quote>New</quote>image when another is open (or has been), then it is "
"opened in another window, with the same size as the first image."
msgstr ""
"Om ingen bild är öppen visas den <quote>Nya</quote> bilden i det tomma "
"bildfönstret med den förvalda storlek du har angett. Om du öppnar en "
"<quote>Ny</quote> bild när en annan bild är eller har varit öppen, visas den"
" i ett annat fönster med samma storlek som den första bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Keep in mind that every pixel of an image is stored in memory. If you create"
" large files with a high pixel density, <acronym>GIMP</acronym> will need a "
"lot of time and memory for every function you apply to the image."
msgstr ""
"Tänk på att varje bildpunkt i en bild lagras i minnet. Om du skapar stora "
"filer med hög bildpunktstäthet behöver <acronym>GIMP</acronym> mycket tid "
"och minne för varje funktion du tillämpar på bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Portrait/Landscape mode"
msgstr "Stående/liggande format"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"There are two buttons which toggle between Portrait and Landscape mode. What"
" they actually do is to exchange the values for Width and Height. (If the "
"Width and Height are the same, these buttons are not activated.) If the X "
"and Y resolutions are not the same (which you can set in Advanced Options), "
"then these values are also exchanged. On the right of the dialog, image "
"size, screen resolution and color space are displayed."
msgstr ""
"Det finns två knappar som växlar mellan stående och liggande format. De "
"byter i själva verket värdena för bredd och höjd. (Om bredden och höjden är "
"samma aktiveras inte knapparna.) Om X- och Y-upplösningen skiljer sig åt, "
"vilket du kan ange under Avancerade alternativ, byts även de värdena. Till "
"höger i dialogrutan visas bildstorlek, skärmupplösning och färgrymd."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "8-bit, 16-bit, 32-bit"
msgstr "8 bitar, 16 bitar, 32 bitar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "New Image dialog (Advanced Options)"
msgstr "Dialogrutan Ny bild (avancerade alternativ)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Advanced Options</guilabel> are mostly of interest to more "
"advanced <acronym>GIMP</acronym> users. You can display these options by "
"clicking on the small triangle on the lower edge of the dialog window."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Avancerade alternativ</guilabel> är främst av intresse för mer "
"erfarna <acronym>GIMP</acronym>-användare. Du kan visa alternativen genom "
"att klicka på den lilla triangeln vid dialogfönstrets nedre kant."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Setting when creating"
msgstr "Inställning vid skapande"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The values in the <guilabel>X resolution</guilabel> and <guilabel>Y "
"resolution</guilabel> fields relate mainly to printing: they do not affect "
"the size of the image in pixels, but they may determine its physical size "
"when it is printed. The X and Y resolution values can determine how pixels "
"are translated into other measurement units, such as millimeters or inches."
msgstr ""
"Värdena i fälten <guilabel>X-upplösning</guilabel> och "
"<guilabel>Y-upplösning</guilabel> gäller främst utskrift: de påverkar inte "
"bildens storlek i bildpunkter, men kan avgöra dess fysiska storlek vid "
"utskrift. Värdena för X- och Y-upplösning kan avgöra hur bildpunkter "
"omvandlas till andra måttenheter, till exempel millimeter eller tum."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If you want to display the image on the screen at the correct dimensions, "
"select <menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Dot for "
"Dot</guimenuitem></menuchoice> Set the zoom factor to 100% to see the image "
"at its true screen size. The calibration of the screen size is normally done"
" when <acronym>GIMP</acronym> is installed, but if the image does not "
"display at the correct size, you may have to adjust the screen parameters in"
" <acronym>GIMP</acronym>. You can do this in the <link linkend=\"gimp-prefs-"
"display\">Preferences</link> dialog."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill visa bilden på skärmen i rätt mått väljer du "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Visa</guimenu><guimenuitem>Punkt för "
"punkt</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Ställ in zoomfaktorn på 100 % för att se "
"bilden i dess verkliga skärmstorlek. Skärmstorleken kalibreras normalt när "
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> installeras, men om bilden inte visas i rätt storlek"
" kan du behöva justera skärmparametrarna i <acronym>GIMP</acronym>. Det gör "
"du i dialogrutan <link linkend=\"gimp-prefs-display\">Inställningar</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can create the new image in different <link linkend=\"gimp-image-"
"mode\">color modes</link>, as either an <link linkend=\"glossary-"
"rgb\">RGB</link> image or a grayscale image."
msgstr ""
"Du kan skapa den nya bilden i olika <link linkend=\"gimp-image-"
"mode\">färglägen</link>, antingen som en <link linkend=\"glossary-"
"rgb\">RGB</link>-bild eller en gråskalebild."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "RGB color"
msgstr "RGB-färg"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The image is created in the Red, Green, Blue color system, which is the one "
"used by your monitor or your television screen."
msgstr ""
"Bilden skapas i färgsystemet rött, grönt, blått, som används av din "
"bildskärm eller tv-skärm."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The image is created in black and white, with various shades of gray. Aside "
"from your artistic interests, this type of image may be necessary for some "
"plug-ins. Nevertheless, <acronym>GIMP</acronym> allows you to <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-image-convert-grayscale\">change an RGB image into "
"grayscale</link>, if you would like."
msgstr ""
"Bilden skapas i svartvitt med olika grå nyanser. Utöver dina konstnärliga "
"intressen kan den här bildtypen vara nödvändig för vissa insticksmoduler. "
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> låter dig dock <link linkend=\"gimp-image-convert-"
"grayscale\">ändra en RGB-bild till gråskala</link>, om du vill."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You cannot create an indexed image directly with this menu, but of course "
"you can always convert the image to indexed mode after it has been created. "
"To do that, use the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Image</guimenu><guisubmenu>Mode</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Indexed</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
" command."
msgstr ""
"Du kan inte skapa en indexerad bild direkt med denna meny, men du kan "
"naturligtvis alltid konvertera bilden till indexerat läge efter att den har "
"skapats. Det gör du med kommandot "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Bild</guimenu><guisubmenu>Läge</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Indexerad</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"A huge step for GIMP: 16-32 bits per channel support is at last available. "
"You are now able to work with a lot more color information and detail in "
"your pictures. This support basically gives you the ability to create super-"
"smooth color transitions on your picture. Next improvement will be to have "
"RAW files edited with GIMP <emphasis>directly</emphasis> since there is "
"enough color space to bring back all the details that are stored inside a "
"RAW file – however this is not implemented yet."
msgstr ""
"Ett stort steg för GIMP: stöd för 16–32 bitar per kanal är äntligen "
"tillgängligt. Du kan nu arbeta med mycket mer färginformation och detalj i "
"bilderna. Stödet gör det i princip möjligt att skapa mycket jämna "
"färgövergångar i bilden. Nästa förbättring blir att kunna redigera RAW-filer"
" <emphasis>direkt</emphasis> med GIMP, eftersom färgrymden räcker för att få"
" tillbaka alla detaljer som lagras i en RAW-fil – men det är ännu inte "
"implementerat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Five options are available: <placeholder-1/>"
msgstr "Det finns fem alternativ: <placeholder-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If you wonder what the difference is between integer and floating point (in "
"the graphics area): If you have an image with 16-bit integer precision per "
"channel, then you have 65.536 shades of different red, green and blue color "
"tones – all of them equally stepped to each other (equal color distance). If"
" you have it in floating point, then there are no equal-wide steps – so you "
"can distribute the possible color values over selected ranges. For example: "
"if you know that you have a very dark image with many shades of dark red "
"color tones then you would benefit from floating point because you can "
"decrease the importance of the brighter color tones and get most color "
"detail out of only the darker reds."
msgstr ""
"Om du undrar vad skillnaden är mellan heltal och flyttal inom grafiken: om "
"du har en bild med 16-bitars heltalsprecision per kanal har du 65 536 "
"nyanser av rött, grönt och blått, alla med lika stora steg mellan sig (lika "
"färgavstånd). Med flyttal finns inga lika stora steg, så du kan fördela de "
"möjliga färgvärdena över valda intervall. Om du till exempel vet att du har "
"en mycket mörk bild med många mörkröda nyanser har du nytta av flyttal, "
"eftersom du kan minska betydelsen av ljusare färgtoner och få fram mesta "
"möjliga färgdetalj i de mörkare röda tonerna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Precision example"
msgstr "Exempel på precision"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Left image is 8-bit, right is 32-bit. You can see that there are much more "
"available colors between color transitions on the right image."
msgstr ""
"Den vänstra bilden är 8-bitars och den högra är 32-bitars. I den högra "
"bilden finns det betydligt fler tillgängliga färger mellan färgövergångarna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Here you can choose the <link linkend=\"glossary-channel-encoding\">channel "
"encoding</link> for your image. Choices are <guilabel>Non-linear</guilabel> "
"and <guilabel>Linear light</guilabel>. For 8-bit integer precision the "
"default is Non-linear, and for 32-bit floating point precision it is Linear "
"light. For more information see <link linkend=\"gimp-image-choosing-"
"precision-encoding\">which precision options should you choose</link>."
msgstr ""
"Här kan du välja <link linkend=\"glossary-channel-"
"encoding\">kanalkodning</link> för bilden. Alternativen är <guilabel>Icke-"
"linjär</guilabel> och <guilabel>Linjärt ljus</guilabel>. För 8-bitars "
"heltalsprecision är standardvärdet Icke-linjär, och för 32-bitars "
"flyttalsprecision är det Linjärt ljus. Mer information finns i <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-image-choosing-precision-encoding\">vilka "
"precisionsalternativ du bör välja</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Here you can choose a color profile to be used for your image. The default "
"is GIMP's standard color profile based on <guilabel>Color space</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Precision</guilabel>, and <guilabel>Gamma</guilabel>. If you "
"prefer to use a different color profile you can select an ICC color profile "
"file from a location on your computer by choosing <guilabel>Select color "
"profile from disk…</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Här kan du välja en färgprofil som ska användas för bilden. Standardvärdet "
"är GIMP:s standardfärgprofil baserad på <guilabel>Färgrymd</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Precision</guilabel> och <guilabel>Gamma</guilabel>. Om du vill "
"använda en annan färgprofil kan du välja en ICC-färgprofilfil på datorn med "
"<guilabel>Välj färgprofil från disk…</guilabel>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Here, you specify the background color that is used for your new image. It "
"is certainly possible to change the background of an image later, too. You "
"can find more information about doing that in the <link linkend=\"gimp-"
"layer-dialog\">Layer dialog</link>."
msgstr ""
"Här anger du den bakgrundsfärg som används för den nya bilden. Det går "
"naturligtvis även att ändra en bilds bakgrund senare. Mer information finns "
"i <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-dialog\">Lagerdialogrutan</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "There are several choices:"
msgstr "Det finns flera alternativ:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Fill the image with the current <guilabel>Foreground color</guilabel>, shown"
" in the Toolbox."
msgstr ""
"Fyll bilden med den aktuella <guilabel>Förgrundsfärgen</guilabel> som visas "
"i verktygslådan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Note that you can change the foreground color while the <quote>New "
"Image</quote> dialog window is open."
msgstr ""
"Observera att du kan ändra förgrundsfärgen medan dialogfönstret <quote>Ny "
"bild</quote> är öppet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Fill the image with the current <guilabel>Background color</guilabel>, shown"
" in the Toolbox. (You can change the background color too, while the dialog "
"window is open.)"
msgstr ""
"Fyll bilden med den aktuella <guilabel>Bakgrundsfärgen</guilabel> som visas "
"i verktygslådan. (Du kan också ändra bakgrundsfärgen medan dialogfönstret är"
" öppet.)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Fill the image with <guilabel>White</guilabel>."
msgstr "Fyll bilden med <guilabel>Vitt</guilabel>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Fill the image with <guilabel>Transparency</guilabel>. If you choose this "
"option, the image is created with an <link linkend=\"glossary-alpha-"
"channel\">alpha&nbsp;channel</link> and the background is transparent. The "
"transparent parts of the image are then displayed with a checkered pattern, "
"to indicate the transparency."
msgstr ""
"Fyll bilden med <guilabel>Genomskinlighet</guilabel>. Om du väljer detta "
"alternativ skapas bilden med en <link linkend=\"glossary-alpha-"
"channel\">alfakanal</link> och bakgrunden blir genomskinlig. Bildens "
"genomskinliga delar visas då med ett schackrutat mönster för att markera "
"genomskinligheten."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Fill the image with a <guilabel>Pattern</guilabel>. If you choose this "
"option, the image is filled with the currently active pattern (which you can"
" change while this dialog is open)."
msgstr ""
"Fyll bilden med ett <guilabel>Mönster</guilabel>. Om du väljer detta "
"alternativ fylls bilden med det för närvarande aktiva mönstret, som du kan "
"ändra medan dialogrutan är öppen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can write a descriptive comment here. The text is attached to the image "
"as a <link linkend=\"glossary-parasite\">parasite</link>, and is saved with "
"the image by some file formats (PNG, JPEG, GIF)."
msgstr ""
"Du kan skriva en beskrivande kommentar här. Texten fogas till bilden som en "
"<link linkend=\"glossary-parasite\">parasit</link> och sparas med bilden av "
"vissa filformat (PNG, JPEG, GIF)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can view and edit this comment in the <link linkend=\"gimp-image-"
"properties\">Image Properties</link> dialog."
msgstr ""
"Du kan visa och redigera kommentaren i dialogrutan <link linkend=\"gimp-"
"image-properties\">Bildegenskaper</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/using/export-image-dialog.png'; "
"md5=66b13a524ccadfb6d5547e7e571ba563"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/using/export-image-dialog.png'; "
"md5=66b13a524ccadfb6d5547e7e571ba563"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Export As…"
msgstr "Exportera som…"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Export As"
msgstr "Exportera som"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <command>Export As…</command> command allows you to store your image in "
"a format other than XCF."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <command>Exportera som…</command> låter dig lagra bilden i ett "
"annat format än XCF."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Please refer to <xref linkend=\"gimp-using-fileformats\"/> for information "
"about exporting in different file formats."
msgstr ""
"Se <xref linkend=\"gimp-using-fileformats\"/> för information om export i "
"olika filformat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Export "
"As…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Arkiv</guimenu><guimenuitem>Exportera "
"som…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"or by using the keyboard shortcut "
"<keycombo><keycap>Shift</keycap><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>E</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"eller med tangentbordsgenvägen "
"<keycombo><keycap>Skift</keycap><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>E</keycap></keycombo>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Export… and Overwrite…"
msgstr "Exportera… och skriv över…"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"When the opened image is a native XCF file this command is called "
"<quote>Export</quote>. In that case, it does the same thing as "
"<command>Export As…</command>."
msgstr ""
"När den öppna bilden är en ursprunglig XCF-fil kallas kommandot "
"<quote>Exportera</quote>. Då gör det samma sak som <command>Exportera "
"som…</command>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"When the opened image was imported, this command is called <quote>Overwrite "
"filename.extension</quote>. Using this command, you can export the imported "
"image directly in its original file format, without going through the export"
" dialog."
msgstr ""
"När den öppna bilden importerades kallas kommandot <quote>Skriv över "
"filnamn.filändelse</quote>. Med detta kommando kan du exportera den "
"importerade bilden direkt i dess ursprungliga filformat utan att gå via "
"exportdialogrutan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Create Template…"
msgstr "Skapa mall…"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Create Template"
msgstr "Skapa mall"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Create Template…</guimenuitem> command opens the "
"<quote>Create New Template</quote> dialog that allows you to create a "
"template with the same dimensions and color space as the current image. A "
"dialog pops up, which asks you to name the new template. Then the template "
"is saved and becomes available in the <link linkend=\"gimp-file-new\">New "
"Image</link> dialog. If you give a name that already exists, "
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> generates a unique name by appending a number to it."
" You can use the <link linkend=\"gimp-template-dialog\">Templates</link> "
"dialog to modify or delete templates."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Skapa mall…</guimenuitem> öppnar dialogrutan "
"<quote>Skapa ny mall</quote>, där du kan skapa en mall med samma mått och "
"färgrymd som den aktuella bilden. En dialogruta ber dig namnge den nya "
"mallen. Mallen sparas sedan och blir tillgänglig i dialogrutan <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-file-new\">Ny bild</link>. Om namnet redan finns skapar "
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> ett unikt namn genom att lägga till en siffra. Du "
"kan använda dialogrutan <link linkend=\"gimp-template-dialog\">Mallar</link>"
" för att ändra eller ta bort mallar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Create "
"Template…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. There is no default keyboard shortcut."
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Arkiv</guimenu><guimenuitem>Skapa "
"mall…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Det har ingen standardtangentbordsgenväg."

