#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Acquire an image"
msgstr "Hämta in en bild"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Acquire"
msgstr "Hämta in"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The <quote>Create</quote> submenu"
msgstr "Undermenyn <quote>Skapa</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Under Linux"
msgstr "Under Linux"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Under Windows"
msgstr "Under Windows"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"These commands vary somewhat, depending upon your system, since "
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> makes calls to system functions."
msgstr ""
"Kommandona varierar något beroende på systemet, eftersom "
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> anropar systemfunktioner."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this submenu from the Image menu bar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Create</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
msgstr ""
"Du når undermenyn från Bild-menyraden via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Arkiv</guimenu><guimenuitem>Skapa</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "From Clipboard"
msgstr "Från urklipp"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"When you copy a selection, it goes into the clipboard. Then you can create a"
" new image with it."
msgstr ""
"När du kopierar en markering hamnar den i urklipp. Sedan kan du skapa en ny "
"bild av den."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This command has the same action as the <link linkend=\"gimp-edit-paste-as-"
"new-image\">Paste as New Image</link> command."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot har samma effekt som kommandot <link linkend=\"gimp-edit-paste-as-"
"new-image\">Klistra in som ny bild</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <keycap>Print Screen</keycap> keyboard key captures the screen and puts "
"it in the clipboard. This command has the same action as <quote>taking a "
"screenshot of the entire screen</quote> in the <link linkend=\"plug-in-"
"screenshot\">Screenshot</link> dialog window. The "
"<keycombo><keycap>Alt</keycap><keycap>Print Screen</keycap></keycombo> key "
"combination grabs the active window in the screen with its decorations and "
"puts it in the clipboard."
msgstr ""
"Tangenten <keycap>Print Screen</keycap> fångar skärmen och lägger den i "
"urklipp. Kommandot har samma effekt som <quote>ta en skärmbild av hela "
"skärmen</quote> i dialogrutan <link linkend=\"plug-in-"
"screenshot\">Skärmbild</link>. Tangentkombinationen "
"<keycombo><keycap>Alt</keycap><keycap>Print Screen</keycap></keycombo> "
"fångar det aktiva fönstret med dekorationer och lägger det i urklipp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "From Web page"
msgstr "Från webbsida"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This command opens a dialog where you can enter the URL of a Web page and "
"get the image in GIMP."
msgstr ""
"Detta kommando öppnar en dialogruta där du kan ange URL:en till en webbsida "
"och hämta bilden i GIMP."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The command defaults to gimp.org. Please have a try to it."
msgstr "Kommandot har gimp.org som standard. Prova gärna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The <quote>Screenshot</quote> window"
msgstr "Fönstret <quote>Skärmbild</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Screenshot</guimenuitem> command opens a dialog with two "
"parts:"
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Skärmbild</guimenuitem> öppnar en dialogruta med två "
"delar:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp/master
msgid "Take a screenshot of a single window"
msgstr "Ta en skärmbild av ett fönster"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The mouse pointer becomes a cross. Click in the image window you want to "
"capture. A new image is created. If the <guilabel>Include window "
"decoration</guilabel> option is unchecked, the title bar and the blue frame "
"around the image will be removed."
msgstr ""
"Muspekaren blir ett hårkors. Klicka i det bildfönster som du vill fånga. En "
"ny bild skapas. Om alternativet <guilabel>Inkludera "
"fönsterdekoration</guilabel> inte är ikryssat tas titelraden och den blå "
"ramen runt bilden bort."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Take a screenshot of the entire screen"
msgstr "Ta en skärmbild av hela skärmen"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This is useful if you want to capture a pop menu. A delay is then necessary,"
" so that you have time to pull the pop menu down."
msgstr ""
"Detta är användbart om du vill fånga en snabbmeny. En fördröjning krävs då "
"så att du hinner öppna snabbmenyn."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If the <guilabel>Include mouse pointer</guilabel> option is checked, then "
"the mouse pointer and its coming with icon are also captured. The mouse "
"pointer is captured in a separate layer. So you can move it to another place"
" in the image."
msgstr ""
"Om alternativet <guilabel>Inkludera muspekare</guilabel> är ikryssat fångas "
"även muspekaren och dess ikon. Muspekaren fångas i ett separat lager, så att"
" du kan flytta den till en annan plats i bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp/master
msgid "Select a region to grab"
msgstr "Välj ett område att fånga"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The mouse pointer becomes a cross. Click and drag to create a rectangular "
"selection in the image window. This selection will be opened as a new image."
" Its size is adapted to the selection size. Note: this setting is not "
"available on Windows."
msgstr ""
"Muspekaren blir ett hårkors. Klicka och dra för att skapa en rektangulär "
"markering i bildfönstret. Markeringen öppnas som en ny bild. Dess storlek "
"anpassas till markeringens storlek. Observera: denna inställning är inte "
"tillgänglig i Windows."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"When taking a screenshot of the entire screen, the screen is captured after "
"this delay. In the other cases, the mouse pointer turns to a cross after "
"this delay."
msgstr ""
"När du tar en skärmbild av hela skärmen fångas skärmen efter denna "
"fördröjning. I de andra fallen blir muspekaren ett hårkors efter "
"fördröjningen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Scanner/Camera"
msgstr "Bildläsare/kamera"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This item is present in Windows operating system, using TWAIN. Image input "
"devices appear in the dialog, if they are plugged-in. On Linux, you need to "
"install third-party XSane plug-in which will be available in the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guisubmenu>Create</guisubmenu><guisubmenu>XSane</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Device"
" dialog…</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu."
msgstr ""
"Detta objekt finns i Windows och använder TWAIN. Bildinmatningsenheter visas"
" i dialogrutan om de är anslutna. I Linux måste du installera "
"insticksmodulen XSane från tredje part, som blir tillgänglig via menyn "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Arkiv</guimenu><guisubmenu>Skapa</guisubmenu><guisubmenu>XSane</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Enhetsdialog…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Scanner and Camera"
msgstr "Bildinläsare och kamera"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The kinds of devices used to take pictures are too varied to be described "
"here. Fortunately, their use is fairly intuitive. In the example shown "
"(under Windows 7), you can start a scanner or load an image from a camera "
"card."
msgstr ""
"Det finns alltför många olika typer av enheter för att ta bilder för att de "
"ska kunna beskrivas här. Lyckligtvis är de ganska intuitiva att använda. I "
"det visade exemplet (under Windows 7) kan du starta en bildläsare eller läsa"
" in en bild från ett kamerakort."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guisubmenu>Copy Image "
"Location</guisubmenu></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Arkiv</guimenu><guisubmenu>Kopiera "
"bildplats</guisubmenu></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This command copies the image path to the clipboard. So, you can past it in "
"a text."
msgstr ""
"Detta kommando kopierar bildens sökväg till urklipp. Du kan sedan klistra in"
" den i en text."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Close all"
msgstr "Stäng alla"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "This command closes all images you have opened."
msgstr "Detta kommando stänger alla bilder som du har öppnat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Close "
"All</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Arkiv</guimenu><guimenuitem>Stäng "
"alla</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"or by using the keyboard shortcut "
"<keycombo><keycap>Shift</keycap><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>W</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"eller med tangentbordsgenvägen "
"<keycombo><keycap>Skift</keycap><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>W</keycap></keycombo>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Close image"
msgstr "Stäng bild"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Close</guimenuitem> command closes the active image. It is "
"disabled if no image is open."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Stäng</guimenuitem> stänger den aktiva bilden. Det är"
" inaktiverat om ingen bild är öppen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Closing an image is not undoable: once it is closed, everything is gone, "
"including the undo history. If the image is not <quote>clean</quote> — that "
"is, if you have changed it since the last time you saved it — you are asked "
"to confirm that you really want to close it."
msgstr ""
"Det går inte att ångra att en bild stängs: när den har stängts är allt "
"borta, inklusive ångringshistoriken. Om bilden inte är <quote>ren</quote> — "
"det vill säga om du har ändrat den sedan du sparade den senast — ombeds du "
"bekräfta att du verkligen vill stänga den."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"An image is only marked as clean when it is saved as an XCF file. Exporting "
"to a different image format does not mark a changed image as clean, since it"
" does not preserve all the information in the image."
msgstr ""
"En bild markeras som ren endast när den sparas som en XCF-fil. Export till "
"ett annat bildformat markerar inte en ändrad bild som ren, eftersom all "
"information i bilden inte bevaras."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Close</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Arkiv</guimenu><guimenuitem>Stäng</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"or by using the keyboard shortcut "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>W</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"eller med tangentbordsgenvägen "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>W</keycap></keycombo>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"For most systems on which <acronym>GIMP</acronym> runs, you can also execute"
" it by clicking on a <quote>Close</quote> button somewhere on the image "
"window titlebar. The location and appearance of this button are determined "
"by the windowing system and the window manager. If no image is open, "
"clicking on this button closes GIMP."
msgstr ""
"På de flesta system där <acronym>GIMP</acronym> körs kan du också utföra "
"detta genom att klicka på en knapp för <quote>Stäng</quote> någonstans i "
"bildfönstrets titelrad. Fönstersystemet och fönsterhanteraren avgör knappens"
" plats och utseende. Om ingen bild är öppen avslutar ett klick på knappen "
"GIMP."

