#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Lighting Effects"
msgstr "Ljuseffekter"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Lighting effects"
msgstr "Ljuseffekter"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The same image, before and after applying Lighting filter"
msgstr "Samma bild före och efter att filtret Ljuseffekter har tillämpats"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Filter <quote>Lighting Effects</quote> applied"
msgstr "Filtret <quote>Ljuseffekter</quote> tillämpat"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This filter simulates the effect you get when you light up a wall with a "
"spot. It doesn't produce any drop shadows and, of course, doesn't reveal any"
" new details in dark zones."
msgstr ""
"Detta filter simulerar effekten av att lysa upp en vägg med en strålkastare."
" Det ger inga skuggor och avslöjar naturligtvis inga nya detaljer i mörka "
"zoner."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This filter is found in the image window menu under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Light and "
"Shadow</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Lighting Effects</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Filtret finns i bildfönstrets meny under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Ljus och "
"skugga</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Ljuseffekter</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"When <guilabel>Interactive</guilabel> is checked, parameter setting results "
"are interactively displayed in preview without modifying the image until you"
" click on <guilabel>OK</guilabel> button."
msgstr ""
"När <guilabel>Interaktiv</guilabel> är ikryssat visas resultaten av "
"parameterinställningarna interaktivt i förhandsvisningen utan att bilden "
"ändras förrän du klickar på <guilabel>OK</guilabel>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If <guilabel>Interactive</guilabel> is not checked, changes are displayed in"
" preview only when you click on the <guilabel>Update</guilabel> button. This"
" option is useful with a slow computer."
msgstr ""
"Om <guilabel>Interaktiv</guilabel> inte är ikryssat visas ändringar i "
"förhandsvisningen bara när du klickar på <guilabel>Uppdatera</guilabel>. "
"Alternativet är användbart på långsamma datorer."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<quote>Lighting</quote> filter general options"
msgstr "Allmänna alternativ för filtret <quote>Ljuseffekter</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
#. from gnome:reviewed/graphs/main
msgid "Transparent Background"
msgstr "Genomskinlig bakgrund"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Makes destination image transparent when bumpmap height is zero (height is "
"zero in black areas of the bumpmapped image)."
msgstr ""
"Gör målbilden genomskinlig när höjden i bumpmappningen är noll (höjden är "
"noll i bumpmappningsbildens svarta områden)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Create New Image"
msgstr "Skapa ny bild"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Creates a new image when applying filter."
msgstr "Skapar en ny bild när filtret tillämpas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "High Quality Preview"
msgstr "Förhandsvisning med hög kvalitet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "For quick CPU..."
msgstr "För snabb CPU …"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can specify the distance of the light source from the center of the "
"image with this slider. The range of values is from 0.0 to 2.0."
msgstr ""
"Med detta reglage kan du ange ljuskällans avstånd från bildens centrum. "
"Värdet går från 0,0 till 2,0."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<quote>Light</quote> Options of the Lighting filter"
msgstr "Alternativet <quote>Ljus</quote> i filtret Ljuseffekter"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"In this tab, you can set light parameters. With <guilabel>Light 1, "
"2,...6</guilabel>: You can create six light sources and work on each of them"
" separately."
msgstr ""
"På denna flik kan du ange ljusparametrar. Med <guilabel>Ljus 1, 2, … "
"6</guilabel> kan du skapa sex ljuskällor och arbeta med var och en separat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Light Type"
msgstr "Ljustyp"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This filter provides several <guilabel>Light Types </guilabel> in a drop-"
"down list:"
msgstr "Filtret erbjuder flera <guilabel>ljustyper</guilabel> i en listruta:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Point</emphasis>: displays a blue point at center of preview. You "
"can click and drag it to move light all over the preview."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Punkt</emphasis>: visar en blå punkt i förhandsvisningens centrum."
" Du kan klicka och dra den för att flytta ljuset över hela "
"förhandsvisningen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Directional</emphasis>: the blue point is linked to preview center"
" by a line which indicates the direction of light."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Riktat</emphasis>: den blå punkten är kopplad till "
"förhandsvisningens centrum med en linje som visar ljusets riktning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<emphasis>None</emphasis>: This deletes the light source (light may "
"persist...)."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Ingen</emphasis>: Tar bort ljuskällan (ljuset kan finnas kvar …)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Light Source Color"
msgstr "Ljuskällans färg"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"When you click on the color swatch, you bring a dialog up where you can "
"select the light source color."
msgstr ""
"När du klickar på färgrutan öppnas en dialogruta där du kan välja "
"ljuskällans färg."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Intensity"
msgstr "Intensitet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "With this option, you can set light intensity."
msgstr "Med detta alternativ kan du ange ljusets intensitet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Determines the light point position according to three coordinates: X "
"coordinate for horizontal position, Y for vertical position, Z for source "
"distance (the light darkens when distance increases). Values are from -1 to "
"+1."
msgstr ""
"Anger ljuspunktens position enligt tre koordinater: X för vågrät position, Y"
" för lodrät position och Z för källans avstånd (ljuset blir mörkare när "
"avståndet ökar). Värdena går från -1 till +1."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This option should allow you to fix the light direction in its three "
"<guilabel>X</guilabel>, <guilabel>Y</guilabel> and <guilabel>Z</guilabel> "
"coordinates."
msgstr ""
"Alternativet låter dig låsa ljusets riktning med koordinaterna "
"<guilabel>X</guilabel>, <guilabel>Y</guilabel> och <guilabel>Z</guilabel>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Isolate"
msgstr "Isolera"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"With this option, you can decide whether all light sources must appear in "
"the Preview, or only the source you are working on."
msgstr ""
"Med detta alternativ kan du välja om alla ljuskällor ska visas i "
"förhandsvisningen, eller endast den källa du arbetar med."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Lighting Preset"
msgstr "Förinställning för ljus"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can save your settings with the <guibutton>Save </guibutton> and get "
"them back later with the <guibutton>Open</guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan spara inställningarna med <guibutton>Spara</guibutton> och hämta dem "
"senare med <guibutton>Öppna</guibutton>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<placeholder-1/> tab of the Lighting filter"
msgstr "Fliken <placeholder-1/> i filtret Ljuseffekter"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"These options don't concern light itself, but light reflected by objects."
msgstr ""
"Dessa alternativ gäller inte själva ljuset, utan ljus som reflekteras av "
"objekt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Small spheres, on both ends of the input boxes, represent the action of "
"every option, from its minimum (on the left) to its maximum (on the right). "
"Help pop ups are more useful."
msgstr ""
"De små kloten i inmatningsrutornas båda ändar representerar varje "
"alternativs verkan, från minimivärdet (till vänster) till maximivärdet (till"
" höger). Hjälprutorna är mer användbara."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Glowing"
msgstr "Glöd"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"With these option, you can set the amount of original color to show where no"
" direct light falls."
msgstr ""
"Med detta alternativ kan du ange hur mycket av originalfärgen som ska visas "
"där inget direkt ljus faller."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Bright"
msgstr "Ljusstyrka"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"With this option, you can set the intensity of original color when hit "
"directly by a light source."
msgstr ""
"Med detta alternativ kan du ange originalfärgens intensitet när den träffas "
"direkt av en ljuskälla."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Shiny"
msgstr "Glans"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "This option controls how intense the highlight will be."
msgstr "Alternativet styr hur intensiv framhävningen blir."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Hell"
msgstr "Koncentration"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "With this option, higher values make the highlight more focused."
msgstr "Med detta alternativ gör högre värden framhävningen mer koncentrerad."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Metallic"
msgstr "Metallisk"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "When this option is checked, surfaces look metallic."
msgstr "När detta alternativ är ikryssat ser ytorna metalliska ut."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<placeholder-1/> options of the Lighting filter"
msgstr "Alternativ för <placeholder-1/> i filtret Ljuseffekter"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"In this tab, you can set filter options that give relief to the image. See "
"<link linkend=\"glossary-bumpmapping\">Bumpmapping</link>."
msgstr ""
"På denna flik kan du ange filteralternativ som ger bilden relief. Se <link "
"linkend=\"glossary-bumpmapping\">Bumpmappning</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Enable Bump Mapping"
msgstr "Aktivera bumpmappning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"With this option, bright parts of the image will appear raised and dark "
"parts will appear depressed. The aspect depends on the light source "
"position."
msgstr ""
"Med detta alternativ ser bildens ljusa delar upphöjda ut och de mörka "
"delarna nedsänkta. Utseendet beror på ljuskällans position."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Bump Map Image"
msgstr "Bumpmappningsbild"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You have to select there the grey-scale image that will act as a bump map."
msgstr "Här måste du välja den gråskalebild som ska fungera som bumpmappning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Four curve types are available: <emphasis>Linear</emphasis>, "
"<emphasis>Logarithmic</emphasis>, <emphasis>Sinusoidal</emphasis> and "
"<emphasis>Spherical</emphasis>. See <link linkend=\"plug-in-bump-map\">Bump "
"Map</link> plug-in for explanations."
msgstr ""
"Det finns fyra kurvtyper: <emphasis>Linjär</emphasis>, "
"<emphasis>Logaritmisk</emphasis>, <emphasis>Sinusformad</emphasis> och "
"<emphasis>Sfärisk</emphasis>. Se insticksmodulen <link linkend=\"plug-in-"
"bump-map\">Bumpmappning</link> för förklaringar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Maximum Height"
msgstr "Maximal höjd"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "This is the maximum height of bumps."
msgstr "Detta är den maximala höjden för upphöjningarna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Environment Map"
msgstr "Miljömappning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Environment map"
msgstr "Miljömappning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Enable Environment Mapping"
msgstr "Aktivera miljömappning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "When you check this box, the following option is enabled:"
msgstr "När du kryssar i denna ruta aktiveras följande alternativ:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Environment Image"
msgstr "Miljöbild"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You have to select there a RGB image, present on your screen. Please note "
"that for this option to work you should load another image with gimp "
"<emphasis>before</emphasis> using it."
msgstr ""
"Här måste du välja en RGB-bild som visas på skärmen. Observera att du måste "
"läsa in en annan bild med GIMP <emphasis>innan</emphasis> du använder detta "
"alternativ."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"An example can be found at <xref linkend=\"bibliography-online-golden-"
"text\"/>."
msgstr "Ett exempel finns i <xref linkend=\"bibliography-online-golden-text\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Light Effects"
msgstr "Ljuseffekter"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Glass Effects"
msgstr "Glaseffekter"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Here you will find three groups of filters:"
msgstr "Här finns tre grupper av filter:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The original <emphasis>Light Effects</emphasis> filters, which render "
"several illumination effects of the image."
msgstr ""
"De ursprungliga filtren <emphasis>Ljuseffekter</emphasis>, som återger flera"
" belysningseffekter i bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Some <emphasis>Script-Fu</emphasis> and <emphasis>Python-Fu</emphasis> "
"scripts, which create various kinds of shadows."
msgstr ""
"Vissa skript i <emphasis>Script-Fu</emphasis> och <emphasis>Python-"
"Fu</emphasis> som skapar olika sorters skuggor."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Glass Effects</emphasis> filters result in an image as if it were "
"seen through a lens or glass tiles."
msgstr ""
"Filtren <emphasis>Glaseffekter</emphasis> ger en bild som om den sågs genom "
"en lins eller glasblock."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/glass-taj-glass-tile.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/glass-taj-glass-tile.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/options-glass-tile.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/options-glass-tile.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The same image, before and after applying glass tile effect."
msgstr "Samma bild före och efter att glasblockseffekten tillämpats."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Filter <quote>Glass Tile</quote> applied"
msgstr "Filtret <quote>Glasblock</quote> tillämpat"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"After applying this filter, the active layer or selection is rendered as "
"through a glass brick wall."
msgstr ""
"När filtret har tillämpats återges det aktiva lagret eller markeringen som "
"genom en vägg av glasblock."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can find this filter through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Light and "
"Shadow</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Glass Tile</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
msgstr ""
"Du hittar filtret under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Ljus och "
"skugga</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Glasblock</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Parameters setting"
msgstr "Parameterinställningar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<guilabel>Tile width</guilabel>: Sets tile width (10-50 pixels)."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Blockbredd</guilabel>: Anger blockbredden (10–50 bildpunkter)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<guilabel>Tile length</guilabel>: Sets tile length (10-50 pixels)."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Blocklängd</guilabel>: Anger blocklängden (10–50 bildpunkter)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/light-taj-gflare.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
