#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The same image, before and after applying lens effect."
msgstr "Samma bild före och efter att linseffekten tillämpats."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Filter <quote>Apply lens</quote> applied"
msgstr "Filtret <quote>Tillämpa lins</quote> tillämpat"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"After applying this filter, a part of the active layer is rendered as "
"through a spherical lens."
msgstr ""
"När filtret har tillämpats återges en del av det aktiva lagret som genom en "
"sfärisk lins."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can find this filter in the image window menu through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Light and "
"Shadow</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Apply Lens</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
msgstr ""
"Du hittar filtret i bildfönstrets meny under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Ljus och "
"skugga</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Tillämpa lins</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Keep original surroundings"
msgstr "Behåll ursprunglig omgivning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The lens seems to be put on the active layer."
msgstr "Linsen verkar vara placerad på det aktiva lagret."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Set surroundings to background color"
msgstr "Sätt omgivningen till bakgrundsfärgen"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The part of the active layer outside the lens will have the background color"
" selected in the toolbox."
msgstr ""
"Den del av det aktiva lagret som ligger utanför linsen får den bakgrundsfärg"
" som valts i verktygslådan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Make surroundings transparent"
msgstr "Gör omgivningen genomskinlig"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The part of the active layer outside the lens will be transparent. This "
"option exists only if the active layer has an alpha channel."
msgstr ""
"Den del av det aktiva lagret som ligger utanför linsen blir genomskinlig. "
"Alternativet finns bara om det aktiva lagret har en alfakanal."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Lens refraction index"
msgstr "Linsens brytningsindex"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Lens will be more or less convergent (1-100)."
msgstr "Linsen blir mer eller mindre konvergent (1–100)."

