msgstr "j.h"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp/master
msgid "Small Tiles"
msgstr "Små brickor"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This filter reduces the image (active layer or selection) and displays it in"
" many copies inside the original image."
msgstr ""
"Detta filter förminskar bilden (det aktiva lagret eller markeringen) och "
"visar den i många kopior i den ursprungliga bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can find this filter through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Map</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Small"
" Tiles</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar detta filter via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Avbilda</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Små"
" brickor</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Number of Segments"
msgstr "Antal segment"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>n²</guilabel> means <quote>the image into n to the power of two "
"tiles</quote>, where <quote>n</quote> is the number you set with the slider "
"or its input box. n = 3 will make nine tiles in the image."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>n²</guilabel> betyder <quote>bilden i n upphöjt till två "
"brickor</quote>, där <quote>n</quote> är talet som du anger med "
"skjutreglaget eller indatafältet. n = 3 ger nio brickor i bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"With this slider and its input box, you can set the opacity of the resulting"
" image. This option is valid only if your image has an Alpha channel."
msgstr ""
"Med detta skjutreglage och dess indatafält kan du ange opaciteten för den "
"resulterande bilden. Alternativet gäller endast om bilden har en alfakanal."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can flip tiles according to the <guilabel>Horizontal</guilabel> or/and "
"<guilabel>Vertical</guilabel> axis by checking the corresponding option(s)."
msgstr ""
"Du kan vända brickor enligt den <guilabel>Horisontella</guilabel> och/eller "
"<guilabel>Vertikala</guilabel> axeln genom att kryssa i motsvarande "
"alternativ."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<guilabel>All tiles</guilabel>: no comment."
msgstr "<guilabel>Alla brickor</guilabel>: inga kommentarer."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<guilabel>Alternate tiles</guilabel>: only odd tiles will be flipped."
msgstr "<guilabel>Varannan bricka</guilabel>: endast udda brickor vänds."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Explicit tile</guilabel>: you can define, a particular tile by "
"using both <guilabel>Line</guilabel> and <guilabel>Column</guilabel> input "
"boxes. This tile will be marked with a box in Preview."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Angiven bricka</guilabel>: du kan ange en viss bricka med "
"indatafälten <guilabel>Rad</guilabel> och <guilabel>Kolumn</guilabel>. "
"Brickan markeras med en ruta i förhandsvisningen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "You can also decide which tiles will be flipped: <placeholder-1/>"
msgstr "Du kan också avgöra vilka brickor som ska vändas: <placeholder-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/map-taj-papertile.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/map-taj-papertile.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/options-map-papertile.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/options-map-papertile.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Papertile"
msgstr "Pappersbrickor"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<placeholder-1/> filter example."
msgstr "Exempel på filtret <placeholder-1/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Filter <quote>Papertile</quote> applied"
msgstr "Filtret <quote>Pappersbrickor</quote> har tillämpats"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This filter cuts the image (active layer or selection) into several pieces, "
"with square form, and then slides them so that they, more or less, overlap "
"or move apart. They can go out image borders a little."
msgstr ""
"Detta filter skär bilden (det aktiva lagret eller markeringen) i flera "
"fyrkantiga delar och förskjuter dem så att de mer eller mindre överlappar "
"varandra eller flyttas isär. De kan gå ut en bit över bildens kanter."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can find this filter through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Map</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Paper"
" Tile</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar detta filter via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Avbilda</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Pappersbrickor</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>X</guilabel>, <guilabel>Y</guilabel> and <guilabel> "
"Size</guilabel> parameters are linked, because filter starts cutting image "
"before it displaces pieces; so, piece size and number of pieces in "
"horizontal (X) and vertical (Y) directions must be convenient to image size."
msgstr ""
"Parametrarna <guilabel>X</guilabel>, <guilabel>Y</guilabel> och "
"<guilabel>Storlek</guilabel> är sammanlänkade, eftersom filtret börjar skära"
" bilden innan det förskjuter delarna. Därför måste storleken på delarna och "
"antalet delar i vågrät (X) och lodrät (Y) riktning passa bildstorleken."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Movement"
msgstr "Förflyttning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Max%</guilabel> is the maximum displacement percentage against the"
" side size of squares."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Max%</guilabel> är maximal förskjutning i procent av kvadraternas "
"sidlängd."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Wrap around</guilabel> : As tiles move, some can go out image "
"borders. If this option is checked, what goes out on one side goes in on the"
" opposite side."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Radbryt</guilabel>: När brickor förflyttas kan några hamna utanför"
" bildens kanter. Om detta alternativ är ikryssat kommer det som går ut på "
"ena sidan in på motsatt sida."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Fractional Pixels"
msgstr "Delbildpunkter"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Because of image cutting, original pixels can persist. There are three ways "
"treating them:"
msgstr ""
"På grund av bildskärningen kan ursprungliga bildpunkter bli kvar. De kan "
"behandlas på tre sätt:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Background</guilabel>: Remaining pixels will be replaced with the "
"background type defined in the following section."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Bakgrund</guilabel>: Återstående bildpunkter ersätts med den "
"bakgrundstyp som definieras i nästa avsnitt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Ignore</guilabel>: Background Type option is not taken into "
"account and remaining pixels are kept."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Ignorera</guilabel>: Alternativet Bakgrundstyp tas inte med i "
"beräkningen och återstående bildpunkter behålls."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<guilabel>Force</guilabel>: Remaining pixels will be cut also."
msgstr "<guilabel>Tvinga</guilabel>: Även återstående bildpunkter skärs bort."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Background Type"
msgstr "Bakgrundstyp"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can select the background type which will be used, if the "
"<guilabel>Background</guilabel> radio-button is checked, among six options:"
msgstr ""
"Om radioknappen <guilabel>Bakgrund</guilabel> är markerad kan du välja "
"bakgrundstyp bland sex alternativ:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<guilabel>Transparent</guilabel>: Background will be transparent."
msgstr "<guilabel>Genomskinlig</guilabel>: Bakgrunden blir genomskinlig."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Inverted image</guilabel>: Background colors will be inverted "
"(255-value in every color channel)."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Inverterad bild</guilabel>: Bakgrundsfärgerna inverteras "
"(255-värdet i varje färgkanal)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Image</guilabel>: Background colors will be unchanged. The "
"original image is the background."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Bild</guilabel>: Bakgrundsfärgerna ändras inte. Den ursprungliga "
"bilden är bakgrunden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Foreground Color</guilabel>: Remaining pixels will be replaced by "
"the Foreground color of Toolbox."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Förgrundsfärg</guilabel>: Återstående bildpunkter ersätts med "
"verktygslådans förgrundsfärg."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Background Color</guilabel>: Remaining pixels will be replaced by "
"the Background color of Toolbox."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Bakgrundsfärg</guilabel>: Återstående bildpunkter ersätts med "
"verktygslådans bakgrundsfärg."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Select here</guilabel>: When this radio-button is checked, "
"clicking in the color dwell will open a Color Selector where you can select "
"the color you want for background."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Välj här</guilabel>: När denna radioknapp är markerad öppnar ett "
"klick i färgrutan en färgväljare där du kan välja den färg som ska användas "
"för bakgrunden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Centering"
msgstr "Centrering"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, tiles will rather be gathered together in the "
"center of the image."
msgstr ""
"Om detta alternativ är ikryssat samlas brickorna snarare i bildens mitt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/map-taj-map-object.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/map-taj-map-object.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE "
