#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Filter <quote>Fractal Trace</quote> applied"
msgstr "Filtret <quote>Fractal Trace</quote> har tillämpats"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"With this filter, your image (active layer or selection) looks like a "
"kaleidoscope. This filter duplicates your image in many copies, more or less"
" dimmed and split, and puts them around the center of the image."
msgstr ""
"Med detta filter ser bilden (det aktiva lagret eller markeringen) ut som ett"
" kalejdoskop. Filtret duplicerar bilden i många kopior, mer eller mindre "
"nedtonade och uppdelade, och placerar dem kring bildens mittpunkt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This filter is found in the image window menu under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Map</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Illusion</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar detta filter i bildfönstrets meny under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Avbilda</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Illusion</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Divisions"
msgstr "Indelningar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"That's the number of copies you want to apply to image. This value varies "
"from -32 to 64. Negative values invert kaleidoscope rotation."
msgstr ""
"Detta är antalet kopior som du vill använda i bilden. Värdet kan vara mellan"
" -32 och 64. Negativa värden inverterar kalejdoskopets rotation."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "You have two arrangement modes for copies in image:"
msgstr "Det finns två arrangeringslägen för kopior i bilden:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "From left to right: original image, mode 1, mode 2, with Divisions=4"
msgstr ""
"Från vänster till höger: ursprunglig bild, läge 1, läge 2, med Indelningar=4"

