msgstr "Fraktalspår"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This filter transforms the image with the Mandelbrot fractal: it maps the "
"image to the fractal."
msgstr ""
"Detta filter omvandlar bilden med Mandelbrot-fraktalen: det avbildar bilden "
"på fraktalen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This filter is found in the image window menu under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Map</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Fractal"
" trace</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar detta filter i bildfönstrets meny under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Avbilda</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Fraktalspår</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Mandelbrot parameters"
msgstr "Mandelbrot-parametrar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "X1, X2, Y1, Y2, Depth"
msgstr "X1, X2, Y1, Y2, djup"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"These parameters are similar to X/YMIN, X/YMAX and ITER parameters of the "
"<link linkend=\"plug-in-fractalexplorer\">Fractal Explorer</link> filter. "
"They allow you to vary fractal spreading and detail depth."
msgstr ""
"Dessa parametrar liknar parametrarna X/YMIN, X/YMAX och ITER i filtret <link"
" linkend=\"plug-in-fractalexplorer\">Fractal Explorer</link>. De låter dig "
"variera fraktalens utbredning och detaljdjup."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Outside type"
msgstr "Typ utanför"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Mapping image to fractal may reveal empty areas. You can select to fill them"
" with <guilabel>Black</guilabel>, <guilabel>White</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Transparency</guilabel> or make what disappears on one side "
"reappear on the opposite side with <guilabel>Wrap</guilabel> option."
msgstr ""
"Att avbilda bilden på fraktalen kan ge tomma områden. Du kan välja att fylla"
" dem med <guilabel>Svart</guilabel>, <guilabel>Vit</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Genomskinlighet</guilabel> eller låta det som försvinner på ena "
"sidan återuppstå på motsatt sida med alternativet "
"<guilabel>Radbryt</guilabel>."

