#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"MyPaint is a free painting program that comes with a lot of brushes. Its "
"brush engine is quite different from the one used by the <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-tool-paintbrush\">Paintbrush tool</link>. "
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> embeds the MyPaint brush engine in the MyPaint Brush"
" tool."
msgstr ""
"MyPaint är ett fritt målningsprogram med många penslar. Dess penselmotor "
"skiljer sig mycket från den som används av <link linkend=\"gimp-tool-"
"paintbrush\">penselverktyget</link>. <acronym>GIMP</acronym> bäddar in "
"MyPaints penselmotor i verktyget MyPaint-pensel."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> ships with the same default brushes as MyPaint "
"itself. You can find more collections of third-party MyPaint brushes "
"throughout the Web, often in a compressed format, such as in a "
"<filename>.zip</filename> file. Unzip this file into a temp folder."
msgstr ""
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> levereras med samma standardpenslar som MyPaint. Du "
"kan hitta fler samlingar av MyPaint-penslar från tredje part på webben, ofta"
" i komprimerade format som en <filename>.zip</filename>-fil. Packa upp filen"
" i en tillfällig mapp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Installing MyPaint Brushes"
msgstr "Installera MyPaint-penslar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Under Linux</emphasis>: "
"<filename>/home/YourUserName/.mypaint/brushes</filename>. Take good note it "
"is a hidden directory."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>I Linux</emphasis>: "
"<filename>/home/DittAnvändarnamn/.mypaint/brushes</filename>. Observera att "
"detta är en dold katalog."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Open your file browser. Check the option <quote>Show hidden files</quote>. "
"Go to your personal MyPaint folder. If it does not exist yet, you have to "
"create it, with the brushes directory inside."
msgstr ""
"Öppna filhanteraren och välj <quote>Visa dolda filer</quote>. Gå till din "
"personliga MyPaint-mapp. Om den inte redan finns måste du skapa den, med "
"katalogen brushes inuti."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Copy-paste all the unzipped files from your temp folder to "
"<filename>home/YourUserName/.mypaint/brushes</filename>."
msgstr ""
"Kopiera och klistra in alla uppackade filer från den tillfälliga mappen till"
" <filename>home/DittAnvändarnamn/.mypaint/brushes</filename>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Under Windows 10</emphasis>: <filename>C:\\Users\\your-user-"
"name\\.mypaint\\brushes</filename>. Click on this item to select it and "
"click on the icon that opens a file browser. In the root of your home "
"folder, create a new folder \"mypaint\". The MyPaint path in Preferences "
"becomes <filename>C:\\Users\\your-user-name\\mypaint</filename>."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>I Windows 10</emphasis>: <filename>C:\\Users\\ditt-"
"användarnamn\\.mypaint\\brushes</filename>. Klicka på detta objekt för att "
"välja det och klicka på ikonen som öppnar en filhanterare. Skapa en ny mapp "
"med namnet \"mypaint\" i rotkatalogen för din hemmapp. MyPaint-sökvägen i "
"Inställningar blir <filename>C:\\Users\\ditt-"
"användarnamn\\mypaint</filename>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Copy-paste all the unzipped files from your temp folder to "
"<filename>C:\\Users\\your-user-name\\mypaint</filename>."
msgstr ""
"Kopiera och klistra in alla uppackade filer från den tillfälliga mappen till"
" <filename>C:\\Users\\ditt-användarnamn\\mypaint</filename>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"First go to "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Preferences</guimenu><guisubmenu>Folders</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>MyPaint"
" Brushes</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. There, you will find the path to your "
"personal Mypaint folder. <placeholder-1/>"
msgstr ""
"Gå först till "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Inställningar</guimenu><guisubmenu>Mappar</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>MyPaint-"
"penslar</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Där finns sökvägen till din personliga "
"MyPaint-mapp. <placeholder-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Activate the tool as below: you should have got a MyPaint brush icon in the "
"tool options dialog. Click on this icon to display all MyPaint brushes."
msgstr ""
"Aktivera verktyget enligt beskrivningen nedan. Du bör då få en MyPaint-"
"penselikon i dialogrutan Verktygsalternativ. Klicka på ikonen för att visa "
"alla MyPaint-penslar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"From the main menu: <menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</guimenu><guisubmenu>Paint "
"Tools</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>MyPaint Brush</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Från huvudmenyn: "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Verktyg</guimenu><guisubmenu>Målningsverktyg</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>MyPaint-"
"pensel</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "By pressing the <keycap>Y</keycap> keyboard shortcut."
msgstr "Genom att trycka på tangentbordsgenvägen <keycap>Y</keycap>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Options may act somewhat differently according to the MyPaint brush you use."
msgstr ""
"Alternativen kan fungera något olika beroende på vilken MyPaint-pensel du "
"använder."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"To set the opacity of the brush (0.0 - 100.0). Opacity depends on a base: "
"please see below."
msgstr ""
"Anger penselns opacitet (0,0–100,0). Opaciteten beror på ett grundvärde; se "
"nedan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The icon of the active brush is displayed. If you click on it, the MyPaint "
"brushes list is displayed and you can select another brush"
msgstr ""
"Ikonen för den aktiva penseln visas. Klicka på den för att visa listan med "
"MyPaint-penslar och välja en annan pensel."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "A collection of MyPaint brushes"
msgstr "En samling MyPaint-penslar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"In the bottom bar of the dialog, you have buttons for smaller or larger "
"icons, and view as list or as grid. The right most button opens the <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-mypaint-brush-dialog\">MyPaint Brushes Dialog</link>."
msgstr ""
"I dialogrutans nederkant finns knappar för mindre eller större ikoner och "
"för list- eller rutnätsvy. Knappen längst till höger öppnar <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-mypaint-brush-dialog\">dialogrutan MyPaint-penslar</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "To set the radius of the brush."
msgstr "Anger penselns radie."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"These values (0.00 - 2.00) are multiplying factors: if, for example, you set"
" this option to 0.50, the maximal opacity becomes 100 * 0.50 = 50, although "
"it is still 100.0 in the Opacity option."
msgstr ""
"Dessa värden (0,00–2,00) är multiplikationsfaktorer. Om du till exempel "
"sätter alternativet till 0,50 blir maximal opacitet 100 × 0,50 = 50, även om"
" värdet fortfarande är 100,0 i alternativet Opacitet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Base opacity example"
msgstr "Exempel på grundopacitet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "100"
msgstr "100"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "1.00"
msgstr "1.00"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "=100"
msgstr "=100"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "=50"
msgstr "=50"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "=25"
msgstr "=25"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "0.50"
msgstr "0.50"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "=12.5"
msgstr "=12.5"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "2.00"
msgstr "2.00"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Base opacity can exceed 1.00 up to 2.00. Of course, opacity can not exceed "
"100. In the example, you can see that an opacity option above 50 (100 * 2.00"
" = 200) is actually an opacity at 100, and 25 * 200 = 50 is equivalent to 50"
" * 1.00 = 50. But this possibility is useful when your Mypaint brush has a "
"default opacity less than 100."
msgstr ""
"Grundopaciteten kan överstiga 1,00 upp till 2,00. Opaciteten kan "
"naturligtvis inte överstiga 100. I exemplet syns att ett opacitetsvärde över"
" 50 (100 × 2,00 = 200) i praktiken blir 100, och 25 × 200 = 50 motsvarar 50 "
"× 1,00 = 50. Möjligheten är användbar när MyPaint-penseln har en "
"standardopacitet under 100."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The harder the brush the sharper the brush. When you reduce hardness, the "
"Mypaint brush may not act if the brush size is too small."
msgstr ""
"Ju hårdare penseln är, desto skarpare är den. När du minskar hårdheten "
"kanske MyPaint-penseln inte fungerar om penselstorleken är för liten."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Hardness example"
msgstr "Exempel på hårdhet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "0.90"
msgstr "0.90"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "0.80"
msgstr "0.80"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "0.70"
msgstr "0.70"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This setting changes the pressure gain of pressing down on the canvas with a"
" brush."
msgstr ""
"Den här inställningen ändrar tryckförstärkningen när du trycker penseln mot "
"ritytan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If you are using a tablet, then you can adjust this setting to make your "
"brush strokes softer or harder. If you are using a mouse, then you can "
"simulate the effects of pressure when painting."
msgstr ""
"Om du använder en ritplatta kan du justera inställningen för att göra "
"penseldragen mjukare eller hårdare. Om du använder en mus kan du simulera "
"tryckets effekter vid målning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, strokes are smoother. Two options are available:"
msgstr ""
"Om detta alternativ är ikryssat blir penseldragen jämnare. Två alternativ "
"finns tillgängliga:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<guilabel>Quality</guilabel>: Depth of smoothing."
msgstr "<guilabel>Kvalitet</guilabel>: Utjämningens djup."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<guilabel>Weight</guilabel>: Gravity of the pen."
msgstr "<guilabel>Vikt</guilabel>: Pennans tyngd."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, the brush acts as an eraser. As with the Eraser "
"tool, erased areas are transparent if there is an alpha layer, or the "
"background color if there is no alpha layer."
msgstr ""
"Om alternativet är ikryssat fungerar penseln som en suddare. Precis som för "
"suddarverktyget blir raderade områden genomskinliga om det finns en "
"alfakanal, eller får bakgrundsfärgen om det inte finns någon alfakanal."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, the brush will not decrease the alpha of pixels. "
"For example, if you blur an edge between opaque and transparent pixels, the "
"alpha of the transparent pixels will increase but the alpha of the opaque "
"pixels will not decrease."
msgstr ""
"Om detta alternativ är ikryssat minskar penseln inte bildpunkternas "
"alfavärde. Om du exempelvis gör en kant mellan ogenomskinliga och "
"genomskinliga bildpunkter oskarp, ökar alfavärdet hos de genomskinliga "
"bildpunkterna men alfavärdet hos de ogenomskinliga bildpunkterna minskar "
"inte."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "To Path"
msgstr "Till bana"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Transform selection to path"
msgstr "Omvandla markering till bana"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>To Path</guimenuitem> command converts a selection into a "
"path. The image does not seem to change, but you can see the new path in the"
" <link linkend=\"gimp-path-dialog\">Paths Dialog</link>. By using the <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-tool-path\">Path tool</link> in the Toolbox, you can "
"precisely adapt the outline of the selection. You can find further "
"information regarding paths in the <link linkend=\"gimp-path-dialog\">Paths "
"dialog</link> section."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Till bana</guimenuitem> omvandlar en markering till "
"en bana. Bilden verkar inte ändras, men du kan se den nya banan i <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-path-dialog\">Banor</link>. Med <link linkend=\"gimp-tool-"
"path\">Banverktyget</link> i verktygslådan kan du noggrant anpassa "
"markeringens kontur. Mer information om banor finns i avsnittet <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-path-dialog\">Banor</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menu bar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Select</guimenu><guimenuitem>To "
"Path</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Markera</guimenu><guimenuitem>Till "
"bana</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can also access it from the <link linkend=\"gimp-selection-"
"dialog\">Selection Editor</link> or from the <link linkend=\"gimp-path-"
"dialog\">Paths Dialog</link> which offers you a lot of <link "
"linkend=\"advanced-settings-for-selection-to-path\">Advanced Options</link>."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer även åt det från <link linkend=\"gimp-selection-"
"dialog\">Markeringsredigeraren</link> eller från <link linkend=\"gimp-path-"
"dialog\">dialogrutan Banor</link>, som erbjuder många <link "
"linkend=\"advanced-settings-for-selection-to-path\">avancerade "
"alternativ</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Save to Channel"
msgstr "Spara till kanal"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Save selection to channel"
msgstr "Spara markering till kanal"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Select to Channel</guimenuitem> command saves the selection"
" as a channel. The channel can then be used as a channel selection mask. You"
" can find more information about them in the <link linkend=\"gimp-channel-"
"dialog\">Channel Dialog</link> section."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Spara markering till kanal</guimenuitem> sparar "
"markeringen som en kanal. Kanalen kan sedan användas som en kanalbaserad "
"markeringsmask. Mer information finns i avsnittet <link linkend=\"gimp-"
"channel-dialog\">Kanaler</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You will find a simple example how to use this command in the introduction "
"of <xref linkend=\"filters-alpha-to-logo\"/>. It shows how to convert a "
"selection to an alpha channel so that you can apply an alpha to logo filter "
"to this selection."
msgstr ""
"Ett enkelt exempel på hur kommandot används finns i introduktionen till "
"<xref linkend=\"filters-alpha-to-logo\"/>. Där visas hur du omvandlar en "
"markering till en alfakanal så att du kan tillämpa ett filter för alfa till "
"logotyp på markeringen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Select</guimenu><guimenuitem>Save to "
"Channel</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Markera</guimenu><guimenuitem>Spara till "
"kanal</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can also access it from the <link linkend=\"gimp-selection-"
"dialog\">Selection Editor</link>."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer även åt det från <link linkend=\"gimp-selection-"
"dialog\">Markeringsredigeraren</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/shrink-selection-dialog.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/shrink-selection-dialog.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Shrink the size of selection"
msgstr "Förminska markeringen"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Shrink</guimenuitem> command reduces the size of the "
"selected area by moving each point on the edge of the selection a certain "
"distance further away from the nearest edge of the image (toward the center "
"of the selection). Feathering is preserved, but the shape of the feathering "
"may be altered at the corners or at points of sharp curvature."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Förminska</guimenuitem> minskar den markerade ytan "
"genom att flytta varje punkt längs markeringens kant ett visst avstånd bort "
"från bildens närmaste kant (mot markeringens centrum). Fjädring bevaras, men"
" formen på fjädringen kan ändras vid hörn eller punkter med kraftig "
"krökning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Select</guimenu><guimenuitem>Shrink...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Markera</guimenu><guimenuitem>Förminska…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Description of the <placeholder-1/> dialog"
msgstr "Beskrivning av dialogrutan <placeholder-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The <placeholder-1/> dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutan <placeholder-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Enter the amount by which to reduce the selection in the text box. The "
"default unit is pixels, but you can choose a different unit of measurement "
"from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Ange hur mycket markeringen ska förminskas i textrutan. Standardenheten är "
"bildpunkter, men du kan välja en annan måttenhet i rullgardinsmenyn."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Shrink from image border"
msgstr "Förminska från bildkanten"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This option is only of interest if the selection runs along the edge of the "
"image. If it does and this option is checked, then the selection shrinks "
"away from the edge of the image. If this option is not checked, the "
"selection continues to extend to the image border."
msgstr ""
"Detta alternativ är endast av intresse om markeringen löper längs bildens "
"kant. Om den gör det och alternativet är markerat, förminskas markeringen "
"bort från bildens kant. Om alternativet inte är markerat fortsätter "
"markeringen att sträcka sig till bildkanten."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Sharpen"
msgstr "Gör skarpare"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Remove the feathering of border selection"
msgstr "Ta bort markeringens fjädring"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Sharpen</guimenuitem> command reduces the amount of blur or"
" fuzziness around the edge of a selection. It reverses the effect of the "
"<link linkend=\"gimp-selection-feather\">Feather Selection</link> command. "
"The new edge of the selection follows the dotted line of the edge of the old"
" selection. Anti-aliasing is also removed."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Gör skarpare</guimenuitem> minskar mängden oskärpa "
"kring kanten av en markering. Det upphäver effekten av kommandot <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-selection-feather\">Fjädra markering</link>. Markeringens nya"
" kant följer den prickade linjen för den gamla markeringens kant. "
"Kantutjämning tas också bort."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Please do not confuse this command with the <link linkend=\"plug-in-"
"sharpen\">Sharpen</link> filter."
msgstr ""
"Blanda inte ihop detta kommando med filtret <link linkend=\"plug-in-"
"sharpen\">Gör skarpare</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Select</guimenu><guimenuitem>Sharpen</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Markera</guimenu><guimenuitem>Gör "
"skarpare</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/rounded-rect-dialog.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/rounded-rect-dialog.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Rounded Rectangle"
msgstr "Avrundad rektangel"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Rounded rectangle"
msgstr "Avrundad rektangel"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <quote>Rounded Rectangle</quote> Script-Fu command converts an existing "
"selection (rectangular, elliptical or other shape) into a rectangular "
"selection with rounded corners. The corners can be curved toward the inside "
"(concave) or toward the outside (convex). To do this, the command adds or "
"removes circles at the corners of the selection."
msgstr ""
"Script-Fu-kommandot <quote>Avrundad rektangel</quote> omvandlar en befintlig"
" markering (rektangulär, elliptisk eller med annan form) till en rektangulär"
" markering med avrundade hörn. Hörnen kan böjas inåt (konkava) eller utåt "
"(konvexa). För att åstadkomma detta lägger kommandot till eller tar bort "
"cirklar vid markeringens hörn."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menu bar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Select</guimenu><guimenuitem>Rounded "
"Rectangle</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Markera</guimenu><guimenuitem>Avrundad "
"rektangel</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Description of the <placeholder-1/> Dialog Window"
msgstr "Beskrivning av dialogfönstret <placeholder-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Radius (%)"
msgstr "Radie (%)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can enter the radius of the rounded corner in percent by using a slider "
"or a text field. This value is a percentage of the height or the width, "
"whichever is less."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ange radien för det avrundade hörnet i procent med ett skjutreglage "
"eller ett textfält. Värdet är en procentandel av den mindre av höjden och "
"bredden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If you check this box, the corners will be concave (curving toward the "
"inside), rather than convex (curving toward the outside)."
msgstr ""
"Om du markerar denna ruta blir hörnen konkava (böjda inåt) i stället för "
"konvexa (böjda utåt)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Toggle QuickMask"
msgstr "Växla snabbmask"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"It has the same action as clicking on the small button in the bottom left "
"corner of the image. See <link linkend=\"gimp-qmask\">Quick Mask</link>"
msgstr ""
"Det har samma funktion som att klicka på den lilla knappen i bildens nedre "
"vänstra hörn. Se <link linkend=\"gimp-qmask\">Snabbmask</link>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Select</guimenu><guimenuitem>Toggle "
"QuickMask</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Markera</guimenu><guimenuitem>Växla "
"snabbmask</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Default shortcut is "
"<keycombo><keycap>Shift</keycap><keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo>"
msgstr ""
"Standardtangent är "
"<keycombo><keycap>Skift</keycap><keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Delete selections"
msgstr "Ta bort markeringar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>None</guimenuitem> command cancels all selections in the "
"image. If there are no selections, the command doesn't do anything. Floating"
" selections are not affected."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Inget</guimenuitem> avbryter alla markeringar i "
"bilden. Om det inte finns några markeringar gör kommandot ingenting. "
"Flytande markeringar påverkas inte."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Select</guimenu><guimenuitem>None</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
" In addition, you can use the <link linkend=\"gimp-selection-"
"dialog\">Selection Editor</link> to access it."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Markera</guimenu><guimenuitem>Inget</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
" Dessutom kan du använda <link linkend=\"gimp-selection-"
"dialog\">Markeringsredigeraren</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can also use the keyboard shortcut "
"<keycombo><keycap>Shift</keycap><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>A</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också använda tangentbordsgenvägen "
"<keycombo><keycap>Skift</keycap><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>A</keycap></keycombo>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Invert selection"
msgstr "Invertera markering"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Invert</guimenuitem> command inverts the selection in the "
"current layer. That means that all of the layer contents which were "
"previously outside of the selection are now inside it, and vice versa. If "
"there was no selection before, the command selects the entire layer."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Invertera</guimenuitem> inverterar markeringen i det "
"aktuella lagret. Det betyder att allt lagerinnehåll som tidigare låg utanför"
" markeringen nu ligger innanför den och tvärtom. Om det inte fanns någon "
"markering tidigare markerar kommandot hela lagret."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Do not confuse this command with the <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-"
"invert\">Invert colors</link> command."
msgstr ""
"Blanda inte ihop detta kommando med kommandot <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-"
"invert\">Invertera färger</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Select</guimenu><guimenuitem>Invert</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Markera</guimenu><guimenuitem>Invertera</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can also use the keyboard shortcut "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>I</keycap></keycombo>,"
msgstr ""
"Du kan också använda tangentbordsgenvägen "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>I</keycap></keycombo>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"or click on the corresponding icon in the <link linkend=\"gimp-selection-"
"dialog\">Selection Editor</link>"
msgstr ""
"Du kan även klicka på motsvarande ikon i <link linkend=\"gimp-selection-"
"dialog\">Markeringsredigeraren</link>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/selection-grow.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/selection-grow.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/selection-grow-corners.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/selection-grow-corners.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Grow selection"
msgstr "Utöka markering"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Grow</guimenuitem> command increases the size of a "
"selection in the current image. It works in a similar way to the <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-selection-shrink\">Shrink</link> command, which reduces the "
"size of a selection."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Utöka</guimenuitem> ökar storleken på en markering i "
"den aktuella bilden. Det fungerar på liknande sätt som kommandot <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-selection-shrink\">Förminska</link>, som minskar storleken på"
" en markering."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Select</guimenu><guimenuitem>Grow</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Markera</guimenu><guimenuitem>Utöka</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The <placeholder-1/> dialog window"
msgstr "Dialogfönstret <placeholder-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can enter the amount by which to increase the selection in the text box."
" The default unit of measurement is pixels, but you can choose a different "
"unit by using the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Ange hur mycket markeringen ska utökas i textrutan. Standardenheten är "
"bildpunkter, men du kan välja en annan enhet i rullgardinsmenyn."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "A Peculiarity of Rectangular Selections"
msgstr "En egenhet hos rektangulära markeringar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"When you grow a rectangular selection, the resulting selection has rounded "
"corners. The reason for this is shown in the image below:"
msgstr ""
"När du utökar en rektangulär markering får den resulterande markeringen "
"avrundade hörn. Orsaken visas i bilden nedan:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Why growing a rectangular selection results in rounded corners"
msgstr "Varför en utökad rektangulär markering får avrundade hörn"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If you do not want rounded corners, you can use the <link linkend=\"script-"
"fu-selection-rounded-rectangle\">Rounded Rectangle</link> command with a 0% "
"radius."
msgstr ""
"Om du inte vill ha avrundade hörn kan du använda kommandot <link "
"linkend=\"script-fu-selection-rounded-rectangle\">Avrundad rektangel</link> "
"med radien 0 %."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/dialogs/stock-selection-16.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/dialogs/stock-selection-16.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "From Path"
msgstr "Från bana"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Create a selection from Path"
msgstr "Skapa en markering från bana"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>From Path</guimenuitem> command transforms the current path"
" into a selection. If the path is not closed, the command connects the two "
"end points with a straight line. The original path is unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Från bana</guimenuitem> omvandlar den aktuella banan "
"till en markering. Om banan inte är sluten förbinder kommandot de två "
"ändpunkterna med en rak linje. Den ursprungliga banan ändras inte."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Select</guimenu><guimenuitem>From "
"Path</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Markera</guimenu><guimenuitem>Från "
"bana</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"In addition, you can click on the <guibutton>Path to Selection</guibutton> "
"button <placeholder-1/> in the Path dialog to access the command."
msgstr ""
"Dessutom kan du klicka på knappen <guibutton>Bana till markering</guibutton>"
" <placeholder-1/> i dialogrutan Banor för att komma åt kommandot."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can also use the keyboard shortcut "
"<keycombo><keycap>Shift</keycap><keycap>V</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också använda tangentbordsgenvägen "
"<keycombo><keycap>Skift</keycap><keycap>V</keycap></keycombo>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Float"
msgstr "Flytande"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Floating selection (command)"
msgstr "Flytande markering (kommando)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Float</guimenuitem> command converts a normal selection "
"into a <quote>floating selection</quote>."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Flytande</guimenuitem> omvandlar en vanlig markering "
"till en <quote>flytande markering</quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"A floating selection (sometimes called a <quote>floating layer</quote>) is a"
" type of temporary layer which is similar in function to a normal layer, "
"except that before you can resume working on any other layers in the image, "
"a floating selection must be <emphasis>anchored</emphasis>. That is, you "
"have to attach it to a normal (non-floating) layer, usually the original "
"layer (the one which was active previously), for instance, by clicking on "
"the image outside of the floating selection (see below)."
msgstr ""
"En flytande markering (kallas ibland ett <quote>flytande lager</quote>) är "
"en typ av tillfälligt lager som fungerar ungefär som ett vanligt lager, med "
"undantaget att den flytande markeringen måste <emphasis>förankras</emphasis>"
" innan du kan fortsätta arbeta med andra lager i bilden. Det innebär att du "
"måste fästa den vid ett vanligt (icke-flytande) lager, vanligtvis "
"ursprungslagret (det som tidigare var aktivt), till exempel genom att klicka"
" på bilden utanför den flytande markeringen (se nedan)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You cannot perform any operations on other layers while the image has a "
"floating selection!"
msgstr ""
"Du kan inte utföra några åtgärder på andra lager medan bilden har en "
"flytande markering!"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can use various operations to change the image data on the floating "
"selection. There can only be one floating selection in an image at a time."
msgstr ""
"Du kan använda olika åtgärder för att ändra bilddata i den flytande "
"markeringen. Det kan bara finnas en flytande markering i en bild åt gången."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If you display the layer boundary by using the <link linkend=\"gimp-view-"
"show-layer-boundary\">Show Layer Boundary</link> command, you may have "
"difficulty selecting a precise area of the image which you want in a layer. "
"To avoid this problem, you can make a rectangular selection, transform it "
"into a floating selection and anchor it to a new layer. Then simply remove "
"the original layer."
msgstr ""
"Om du visar lagergränsen med kommandot <link linkend=\"gimp-view-show-layer-"
"boundary\">Visa lagergräns</link> kan det vara svårt att välja ett exakt "
"område i bilden som du vill ha i ett lager. För att undvika detta kan du "
"göra en rektangulär markering, omvandla den till en flytande markering och "
"förankra den i ett nytt lager. Ta sedan bort ursprungslagret."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"In early versions of <acronym>GIMP</acronym>, floating selections were used "
"for performing operations on a limited part of an image. You can do that "
"more easily now with layers, but you can still use this way of working with "
"images."
msgstr ""
"I tidiga versioner av <acronym>GIMP</acronym> användes flytande markeringar "
"för att utföra åtgärder på en begränsad del av en bild. Numera kan du göra "
"det enklare med lager, men du kan fortfarande använda detta sätt att arbeta "
"med bilder."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Select</guimenu><guimenuitem>Float</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Markera</guimenu><guimenuitem>Flytande</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"or by using the keyboard shortcut "
"<keycombo><keycap>Shift</keycap><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>L</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"eller med tangentbordsgenvägen "
"<keycombo><keycap>Skift</keycap><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>L</keycap></keycombo>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Creating a Floating Selection Automatically"
msgstr "Skapa en flytande markering automatiskt"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Some image operations create a floating selection automatically:"
msgstr "Vissa bildåtgärder skapar automatiskt en flytande markering:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <quote>paste</quote> operations, <link linkend=\"gimp-buffer-"
"dialog\">Paste Named Buffer</link>, <link linkend=\"gimp-edit-"
"paste\">Paste</link> or <link linkend=\"gimp-edit-paste-into\">Paste "
"Into</link>, also create a floating selection."
msgstr ""
"<quote>Klistra in</quote>-åtgärderna <link linkend=\"gimp-buffer-"
"dialog\">Klistra in namngiven buffert</link>, <link linkend=\"gimp-edit-"
"paste\">Klistra in</link> och <link linkend=\"gimp-edit-paste-into\">Klistra"
" in i</link> skapar också en flytande markering."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"In addition, the Transform tools, <link linkend=\"gimp-tool-"
"flip\">Flip</link>, <link linkend=\"gimp-tool-shear\">Shear</link>, <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-tool-scale\">Scale</link>, <link linkend=\"gimp-tool-"
"rotate\">Rotate</link> and <link linkend=\"gimp-tool-"
"perspective\">Perspective</link>, create a floating selection when they are "
"used on a selection, rather than a layer. When the "
"<guilabel>Affect</guilabel> mode is <emphasis>Transform Layer</emphasis> and"
" a selection already exists, these tools transform the selection and create "
"a floating selection with the result. If a selection does not exist, they "
"transform the current layer and do not create a floating selection. (If the "
"<guilabel>Affect</guilabel> mode is <emphasis>Transform "
"Selection</emphasis>, they also do not create a floating selection.)"
msgstr ""
"Dessutom skapar transformeringsverktygen <link linkend=\"gimp-tool-"
"flip\">Vänd</link>, <link linkend=\"gimp-tool-shear\">Skjuva</link>, <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-tool-scale\">Skala</link>, <link linkend=\"gimp-tool-"
"rotate\">Rotera</link> och <link linkend=\"gimp-tool-"
"perspective\">Perspektiv</link> en flytande markering när de används på en "
"markering i stället för på ett lager. När läget <guilabel>Påverka</guilabel>"
" är <emphasis>Transformera lager</emphasis> och en markering redan finns, "
"transformerar dessa verktyg markeringen och skapar en flytande markering med"
" resultatet. Om det inte finns någon markering transformerar de det aktuella"
" lagret och skapar ingen flytande markering. (Om läget "
"<guilabel>Påverka</guilabel> är <emphasis>Transformera markering</emphasis> "
"skapar de inte heller en flytande markering.)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"By click-and-dragging a selection while pressing the "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>Alt</keycap></keycombo> keys (see "
"<xref linkend=\"gimp-using-selections-moving\"/>) you also automatically "
"create a floating selection."
msgstr ""
"Genom att klicka och dra en markering medan du håller ned tangenterna "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>Alt</keycap></keycombo> (se <xref "
"linkend=\"gimp-using-selections-moving\"/>) skapar du också automatiskt en "
"flytande markering."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Anchor a Floating Selection"
msgstr "Förankra en flytande markering"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "You can anchor a floating selection in various ways:"
msgstr "Du kan förankra en flytande markering på olika sätt:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can anchor the floating selection to the current layer the selection is "
"originating from. To do this, click anywhere on the image except on the "
"floating selection. This merges the floating selection with the current "
"layer."
msgstr ""
"Du kan förankra den flytande markeringen i det aktuella lager som "
"markeringen kommer från. Klicka då var som helst i bilden utom på den "
"flytande markeringen. Detta sammanfogar den flytande markeringen med det "
"aktuella lagret."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Or you can use the <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-anchor\">Anchor layer</link> "
"command (<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>H</keycap></keycombo>)."
msgstr ""
"Eller så kan du använda kommandot <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-"
"anchor\">Förankra lager</link> "
"(<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>H</keycap></keycombo>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can also anchor the floating selection to the current layer by clicking "
"on the anchor button of the <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-dialog\">Layers "
"dialog</link>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också förankra den flytande markeringen till det aktuella lagret "
"genom att klicka på ankar-knappen i <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-"
"dialog\">lagerdialogen</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If you create a <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-new\">New Layer</link> while "
"there is a floating selection, the floating selection is anchored to this "
"newly created layer."
msgstr ""
"Om du skapar ett <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-new\">nytt lager</link> medan "
"det finns en flytande markering, förankras den flytande markeringen till det"
" nyss skapade lagret."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/selection-feather.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/selection-feather.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Feather selection edges"
msgstr "Fjädra markeringskanter"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Feather</guimenuitem> command feathers the edges of the "
"selection. This creates a smooth transition between the selection and its "
"surroundings. You normally feather selection borders with the <quote>Feather"
" Edges</quote> option of the selection tools, but you may feather them again"
" with this command."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Fjädra</guimenuitem> fjädrar markeringens kanter. "
"Detta skapar en mjuk övergång mellan markeringen och omgivningen. Vanligen "
"fjädar du markeringskanter med alternativet <quote>Fjädra kanter</quote> i "
"markeringsverktygen, men du kan fjädra dem på nytt med detta kommando."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Select</guimenu><guimenuitem>Feather</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Markera</guimenu><guimenuitem>Fjädra</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Description of the <placeholder-1/> dialog window"
msgstr "Beskrivning av dialogfönstret <placeholder-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Enter the width of the selection border feathering. The default units are "
"pixels, but you can also choose other units with the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Ange bredden på markeringens kantfjädring. Standardenheten är bildpunkter, "
"men du kan också välja andra enheter i rullgardinsmenyn."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/select/distort.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/select/distort.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Distort"
msgstr "Förvräng"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Distort Selection"
msgstr "Förvräng markering"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The <quote>Distort</quote> command deforms the selection contour."
msgstr "Kommandot <quote>Förvräng</quote> förvränger markeringens kontur."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menu bar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Select</guimenu><guimenuitem>Distort...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Markera</guimenu><guimenuitem>Förvräng…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Description of the <quote>Distort</quote> Dialog Window"
msgstr "Beskrivning av dialogfönstret <quote>Förvräng</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The <quote>Distort</quote> dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutan <quote>Förvräng</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This command has several options which allow to increase or reduce the "
"deformation. It is not possible to foresee the result and you have to "
"experiment."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot har flera alternativ som gör att du kan öka eller minska "
"förvrängningen. Det går inte att förutse resultatet; du måste experimentera."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"A higher threshold shrinks the distorted selection. A lower threshold makes "
"the selection bigger."
msgstr ""
"Ett högre tröskelvärde förminskar den förvrängda markeringen. Ett lägre "
"tröskelvärde gör markeringen större."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "A higher <quote>Spread</quote> increases the deformation."
msgstr "En större <quote>Spridning</quote> ökar förvrängningen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Granularity"
msgstr "Detaljgrad"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "A higher <quote>Granularity</quote> increases the deformation."
msgstr "En högre <quote>Detaljgrad</quote> ökar förvrängningen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"A higher <quote>Smooth</quote> decreases the deformation. You can "
"<guilabel>Smooth horizontally</guilabel> and/or "
"<guilabel>Vertically</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"En högre <quote>Utjämning</quote> minskar förvrängningen. Du kan "
"<guilabel>Jämna ut vågrätt</guilabel> och/eller "
"<guilabel>Lodrätt</guilabel>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "@@image: 'images/menus/select-editor.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/select-editor.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/selection-editor-click.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/selection-editor-click.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/selection-to-path-adv.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/selection-to-path-adv.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "@@image: 'images/menus/250px-Bezier.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr "@@image: 'images/menus/250px-Bezier.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Selection Editor</guimenuitem> command displays the "
"<quote>Selection Editor</quote> dialog window. This dialog window displays "
"the active selection in the current image and gives you easy access to the "
"selection-related commands. It is not really intended for editing selections"
" directly, but if you are working on a selection, it is handy to have the "
"selection commands all together, since it is easier to click on a button "
"than to search for commands in the command tree of the menubar. The "
"<quote>Selection Editor</quote> also offers some advanced options for the "
"<quote>Select to Path</quote> command."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Markeringsredigerare</guimenuitem> visar "
"dialogfönstret <quote>Markeringsredigerare</quote>. Dialogfönstret visar den"
" aktiva markeringen i den aktuella bilden och ger enkel åtkomst till "
"kommandon som rör markeringar. Det är inte avsett för direkt redigering av "
"markeringar, men när du arbetar med en markering är det praktiskt att ha "
"alla markeringskommandon samlade, eftersom det är enklare att klicka på en "
"knapp än att söka efter kommandon i menyradens kommandoträd. "
"<quote>Markeringsredigerare</quote> erbjuder också avancerade alternativ för"
" kommandot <quote>Markering till bana</quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Select</guimenu><guimenuitem>Selection "
"Editor</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Markera</guimenu><guimenuitem>Markeringsredigerare</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The Buttons"
msgstr "Knapparna"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <quote>Selection Editor</quote> dialog window has several buttons which "
"you can use to easily access selection commands:"
msgstr ""
"Dialogfönstret <quote>Markeringsredigerare</quote> har flera knappar som du "
"kan använda för att lätt komma åt markeringskommandon:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guiicon><inlinegraphic fileref=\"images/dialogs/stock-selection-"
"all-16.png\"/></guiicon> The <link linkend=\"gimp-selection-all\">Select "
"All</link> button."
msgstr ""
"<guiicon><inlinegraphic fileref=\"images/dialogs/stock-selection-"
"all-16.png\"/></guiicon> Knappen <link linkend=\"gimp-selection-"
"all\">Markera allt</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guiicon><inlinegraphic fileref=\"images/dialogs/stock-selection-"
"none-16.png\"/></guiicon> The <link linkend=\"gimp-selection-none\">Select "
"None</link> button."
msgstr ""
"<guiicon><inlinegraphic fileref=\"images/dialogs/stock-selection-"
"none-16.png\"/></guiicon> Knappen <link linkend=\"gimp-selection-"
"none\">Markera inget</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guiicon><inlinegraphic fileref=\"images/dialogs/stock-"
"invert-16.png\"/></guiicon> The <link linkend=\"gimp-selection-"
"invert\">Select Invert</link> button."
msgstr ""
"<guiicon><inlinegraphic fileref=\"images/dialogs/stock-"
"invert-16.png\"/></guiicon> Knappen <link linkend=\"gimp-selection-"
"invert\">Invertera markering</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guiicon><inlinegraphic fileref=\"images/dialogs/stock-selection-to-"
"channel-16.png\"/></guiicon> The <link linkend=\"gimp-selection-to-"
"channel\">Save to Channel</link> button."
msgstr ""
"<guiicon><inlinegraphic fileref=\"images/dialogs/stock-selection-to-"
"channel-16.png\"/></guiicon> Knappen <link linkend=\"gimp-selection-to-"
"channel\">Spara till kanal</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guiicon><inlinegraphic fileref=\"images/dialogs/stock-selection-to-"
"path-16.png\"/></guiicon> The <link linkend=\"selection-to-path\">To "
"Path</link> button. If you hold the <keycap>Shift</keycap> key while "
"clicking on this button, the <quote>Advanced Settings</quote> dialog is "
"displayed. Please see the next section for details about these options."
msgstr ""
"<guiicon><inlinegraphic fileref=\"images/dialogs/stock-selection-to-"
"path-16.png\"/></guiicon> Knappen <link linkend=\"selection-to-path\">Till "
"bana</link>. Om du håller ned <keycap>Skift</keycap> medan du klickar på "
"knappen visas dialogrutan <quote>Avancerade inställningar</quote>. Se nästa "
"avsnitt för information om dessa alternativ."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guiicon><inlinegraphic fileref=\"images/dialogs/stock-selection-"
"stroke-16.png\"/></guiicon> The <link linkend=\"gimp-selection-"
"stroke\">Stroke Selection</link> button."
msgstr ""
"<guiicon><inlinegraphic fileref=\"images/dialogs/stock-selection-"
"stroke-16.png\"/></guiicon> Knappen <link linkend=\"gimp-selection-"
"stroke\">Stryk markering</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The display window"
msgstr "Visningsfönstret"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"In the display window, selected areas of the image are white, non-selected "
"areas are black, and partially selected areas are in shades of gray. "
"Clicking in this window acts like <link linkend=\"gimp-selection-"
"by_color\">Select by Color</link>. See the example below."
msgstr ""
"I visningsfönstret är bildens markerade områden vita, omarkerade områden "
"svarta och delvis markerade områden visas i gråtoner. Ett klick i detta "
"fönster fungerar som <link linkend=\"gimp-selection-by_color\">Markera efter"
" färg</link>. Se exemplet nedan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Example of clicking in the <placeholder-1/> display window"
msgstr "Exempel på att klicka i visningsfönstret <placeholder-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Clicking in the <quote>Selection Editor</quote> display window to "
"<quote>Select By Color</quote>. Note that this figure could just as well "
"show the appearance of the <quote>Selection Editor</quote> display window "
"when <quote>Select By Color</quote> is used in the image window."
msgstr ""
"Ett klick i visningsfönstret <quote>Markeringsredigerare</quote> för att "
"<quote>markera efter färg</quote>. Observera att bilden lika gärna kunde "
"visa visningsfönstret <quote>Markeringsredigerare</quote> när <quote>Markera"
" efter färg</quote> används i bildfönstret."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp/master
msgid "Selection to Path Advanced Settings"
msgstr "Avancerade inställningar för markering till bana"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Advanced Settings"
msgstr "Avancerade inställningar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <quote>Selection to Path Advanced Settings</quote> dialog, that you get "
"by <keycap>Shift</keycap> clicking on the <guibutton> Selection to "
"Path</guibutton> button, contains a number of options, most of which you can"
" set with either a slider bar or a text box. There is also one check box. "
"These options are mostly used by advanced users. They are:"
msgstr ""
"Dialogrutan <quote>Avancerade inställningar för markering till bana</quote>,"
" som du får genom att <keycap>Skift</keycap>-klicka på knappen "
"<guibutton>Markering till bana</guibutton>, innehåller ett antal alternativ."
" De flesta kan ställas in med antingen ett skjutreglage eller en textruta. "
"Det finns även en kryssruta. Alternativen används främst av avancerade "
"användare:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Align Threshold</emphasis>: If two endpoints are closer than this "
"value, they are made to be equal."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Justeringsgräns</emphasis>: Om två ändpunkter ligger närmare "
"varandra än detta värde görs de lika."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Corner Always Threshold</emphasis>: If the angle defined by a "
"point and its predecessors and successors is smaller than this, it is a "
"corner, even if it is within <emphasis>Corner Surround</emphasis> pixels of "
"a point with a smaller angle."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Alltid hörn-gräns</emphasis>: Om vinkeln som definieras av en "
"punkt och dess föregångare och efterföljare är mindre än detta är den ett "
"hörn, även om den ligger inom <emphasis>Hörnomgivning</emphasis> bildpunkter"
" från en punkt med mindre vinkel."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Corner Surround</emphasis>: Number of points to consider when "
"determining if a point is a corner or not."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Hörnomgivning</emphasis>: Antal punkter att överväga när det "
"avgörs om en punkt är ett hörn eller inte."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Corner Threshold</emphasis>: If a point, its predecessors, and its"
" successors define an angle smaller than this, it is a corner."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Hörngräns</emphasis>: Om en punkt samt dess föregångare och "
"efterföljare definierar en vinkel som är mindre än detta är den ett hörn."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<quote>Spline</quote> is a mathematical term for a function which defines a "
"curve by using a series of control points, such as a Bézier curve. "
"<placeholder-1/> See Wikipedia for more information."
msgstr ""
"<quote>Spline</quote> är en matematisk term för en funktion som definierar "
"en kurva med hjälp av en serie kontrollpunkter, till exempel en Bézierkurva."
" <placeholder-1/> Se Wikipedia för mer information."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Error Threshold</emphasis>: Amount of error at which a fitted "
"spline <placeholder-1/> is unacceptable. If any pixel is further away than "
"this from the fitted curve, the algorithm tries again."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Felgräns</emphasis>: Mängden fel då en anpassad spline "
"<placeholder-1/> inte är godtagbar. Om någon bildpunkt ligger längre bort än"
" detta från den anpassade kurvan försöker algoritmen igen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Filter Alternative Surround</emphasis>: A second number of "
"adjacent points to consider when filtering."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Alternativ filteromgivning</emphasis>: Ett andra antal "
"intilliggande punkter att beakta vid filtrering."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Filter Epsilon</emphasis>: If the angles between the vectors "
"produced by <emphasis>Filter Surround</emphasis> and <emphasis>Filter "
"Alternative Surround</emphasis> points differ by more than this, use the one"
" from <emphasis>Filter Alternative Surround</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Filterepsilon</emphasis>: Om vinklarna mellan de vektorer som "
"skapas av punkter i <emphasis>Filteromgivning</emphasis> och "
"<emphasis>Alternativ filteromgivning</emphasis> skiljer sig mer än detta "
"används den från <emphasis>Alternativ filteromgivning</emphasis>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Filter Iteration Count</emphasis>: The number of times to smooth "
"the original data points. Increasing this number dramatically, to 50 or so, "
"can produce vastly better results. But if any points that "
"<quote>should</quote> be corners aren't found, the curve goes wild around "
"that point."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Antal filteriterationer</emphasis>: Antalet gånger som de "
"ursprungliga datapunkterna ska jämnas ut. En kraftig ökning av detta tal, "
"till ungefär 50, kan ge mycket bättre resultat. Men om punkter som "
"<quote>borde</quote> vara hörn inte hittas blir kurvan vild runt den "
"punkten."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Filter Percent</emphasis>: To produce the new point, use the old "
"point plus this times the neighbors."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Filterprocent</emphasis>: För att skapa den nya punkten används "
"den gamla punkten plus detta gånger grannpunkterna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Filter Secondary Surround</emphasis>: Number of adjacent points to"
" consider if <emphasis>Filter Surround</emphasis> points defines a straight "
"line."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Sekundär filteromgivning</emphasis>: Antal intilliggande punkter "
"att beakta om punkter i <emphasis>Filteromgivning</emphasis> definierar en "
"rak linje."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Filter Surround</emphasis>: Number of adjacent points to consider "
"when filtering."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Filteromgivning</emphasis>: Antal intilliggande punkter att beakta"
" vid filtrering."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Keep Knees</emphasis>: This check box says whether or not to "
"remove <quote>knee</quote> points after finding the outline."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Behåll knän</emphasis>: Denna kryssruta anger om "
"<quote>knäpunkter</quote> ska tas bort efter att konturen har hittats."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Line Reversion Threshold</emphasis>: If a spline is closer to a "
"straight line than this value, it remains a straight line, even if it would "
"otherwise be changed back to a curve. This is weighted by the square of the "
"curve length, to make shorter curves more likely to be reverted."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Gräns för återställning till linje</emphasis>: Om en spline ligger"
" närmare en rak linje än detta värde förblir den en rak linje, även om den "
"annars skulle ändras tillbaka till en kurva. Detta viktas med kvadraten på "
"kurvlängden för att kortare kurvor ska återställas oftare."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Line Threshold</emphasis>: How many pixels (on the average) a "
"spline can diverge from the line determined by its endpoints before it is "
"changed to a straight line."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Linjegräns</emphasis>: Hur många bildpunkter en spline i "
"genomsnitt får avvika från linjen som definieras av ändpunkterna innan den "
"ändras till en rak linje."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Reparametrize Improvement</emphasis>: If reparameterization "
"doesn't improve the fit by this much percent, the algorithm stops doing it."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Förbättring vid omparametrisering</emphasis>: Om "
"omparametriseringen inte förbättrar anpassningen med så här många procent "
"slutar algoritmen med den."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Reparametrize Threshold</emphasis>: Amount of error at which it is"
" pointless to reparameterize. This happens, for example, when the algorithm "
"is trying to fit the outline of the outside of an <quote>O</quote> with a "
"single spline. The initial fit is not good enough for the Newton-Raphson "
"iteration to improve it. It may be that it would be better to detect the "
"cases where the algorithm didn't find any corners."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Gräns för omparametrisering</emphasis>: Mängden fel då det är "
"meningslöst att omparametrisera. Detta händer till exempel när algoritmen "
"försöker anpassa konturen på utsidan av ett <quote>O</quote> med en enda "
"spline. Den första anpassningen är inte tillräckligt bra för att "
"Newton–Raphson-iterationen ska förbättra den. Det kan vara bättre att "
"upptäcka de fall där algoritmen inte hittade några hörn."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Subdivide Search</emphasis>: Percentage of the curve away from the"
" worst point to look for a better place to subdivide."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Sökning efter delning</emphasis>: Den procentandel av kurvan bort "
"från den sämsta punkten där en bättre plats för delning söks."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Subdivide Surround</emphasis>: Number of points to consider when "
"deciding whether a given point is a better place to subdivide."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Delningsomgivning</emphasis>: Antal punkter att beakta när det "
"avgörs om en given punkt är en bättre plats för delning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Subdivide Threshold</emphasis>: How many pixels a point can "
"diverge from a straight line and still be considered a better place to "
"subdivide."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Delningsgräns</emphasis>: Hur många bildpunkter en punkt kan "
"avvika från en rak linje och ändå anses vara en bättre plats för delning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Tangent Surround</emphasis>: Number of points to look at on either"
" side of a point when computing the approximation to the tangent at that "
"point."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Tangentomgivning</emphasis>: Antal punkter på vardera sidan om en "
"punkt som ska beaktas när approximationen av tangenten vid punkten beräknas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "By Color"
msgstr "Efter färg"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "By Color select"
msgstr "Markera efter färg"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Select By Color</guimenuitem> command is an alternate way "
"of accessing the <quote>Select By Color</quote> tool, one of the basic "
"selection tools. You can find more information about using this tool in "
"<link linkend=\"gimp-tool-by-color-select\">Select By Color</link>."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Markera efter färg</guimenuitem> är ett annat sätt "
"att komma åt verktyget <quote>Markera efter färg</quote>, ett av de "
"grundläggande markeringsverktygen. Mer information om verktyget finns i "
"<link linkend=\"gimp-tool-by-color-select\">Markera efter färg</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Select</guimenu><guimenuitem>By "
"Color</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Markera</guimenu><guimenuitem>Efter "
"färg</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"or by using the keyboard shortcut "
"<keycombo><keycap>Shift</keycap><keycap>O</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"eller med tangentbordsgenvägen "
"<keycombo><keycap>Skift</keycap><keycap>O</keycap></keycombo>."

