#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Create a selection border"
msgstr "Skapa en markeringskant"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Example of creating a border from a selection"
msgstr "Exempel på att skapa en kant från en markering"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "An image with a selection"
msgstr "En bild med en markering"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "After <quote>Select Border</quote>"
msgstr "Efter <quote>Markera kant</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Select Border</guimenuitem> command creates a new selection"
" along the edge of an existing selection in the current image. The edge of "
"the current selection is used as a form and the new selection is then "
"created around it. You enter the width of the border, in pixels or some "
"other unit, in the dialog window. Half of the new border lies inside of the "
"selected area and half outside of it."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Markera kant</guimenuitem> skapar en ny markering "
"längs kanten av en befintlig markering i den aktuella bilden. Den aktuella "
"markeringens kant används som form och den nya markeringen skapas runt den. "
"Du anger kantens bredd i bildpunkter eller någon annan enhet i dialogrutan. "
"Hälften av den nya kanten ligger innanför det markerade området och hälften "
"utanför."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Select</guimenu><guimenuitem>Border</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Markera</guimenu><guimenuitem>Kant</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Enter the width of the border selection in the box. The default units are "
"pixels, but you can also choose the units with the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Ange markeringskantens bredd i rutan. Standardenheten är bildpunkter, men du"
" kan också välja enhet i rullgardinsmenyn."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Feather border"
msgstr "Fjädra kant"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, the edges of the selection will be feathered. "
"This creates a smooth transition between the selection and its surroundings."
" Note than you can't use the <guilabel>Feather Edges</guilabel> option of "
"the selection tools for this purpose."
msgstr ""
"Om alternativet är markerat fjädras markeringens kanter. Detta skapar en "
"mjuk övergång mellan markeringen och omgivningen. Observera att du inte kan "
"använda alternativet <guilabel>Fjädra kanter</guilabel> i "
"markeringsverktygen för detta."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Lock selection to image edges"
msgstr "Lås markering till bildkanter"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"With this option enabled, an edge of an (usually rectangle) selection "
"remains unchanged if it is aligned with an edge of the image; no new "
"selection will be created around it."
msgstr ""
"När alternativet är aktiverat förblir en kant på en (vanligtvis rektangulär)"
" markering oförändrad om den är i linje med bildens kant; ingen ny markering"
" skapas runt den."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Lock to image edges"
msgstr "Lås till bildkanter"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Select border with and without <placeholder-1/>"
msgstr "Markera kant med och utan <placeholder-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Select border without (middle) and with (right) locked selection."
msgstr "Markera kant utan (i mitten) och med (till höger) låst markering."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Same selections filled with red."
msgstr "Samma markeringar fyllda med rött."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Select All</guimenuitem> command creates a new selection "
"which contains everything on the current layer."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Markera allt</guimenuitem> skapar en ny markering som"
" innehåller allt i det aktuella lagret."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Select</guimenu><guimenuitem>All</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Markera</guimenu><guimenuitem>Allt</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"or by using the keyboard shortcut "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>A</keycap></keycombo>. You can also "
"access it with the <link linkend=\"gimp-selection-dialog\">Selection "
"Editor</link>."
msgstr ""
"eller med tangentbordsgenvägen "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>A</keycap></keycombo>. Du kommer även"
" åt det via <link linkend=\"gimp-selection-"
"dialog\">Markeringsredigeraren</link>."

