#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Ripple filter"
msgstr "Filtret Krusning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Filter <quote>Ripple</quote> applied"
msgstr "Filtret <quote>Krusning</quote> tillämpat"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"It displaces the pixels of the active layer or selection to waves or ripples"
" reminding a reflection on disturbed water."
msgstr ""
"Det förskjuter bildpunkterna i det aktiva lagret eller markeringen till "
"vågor eller krusningar som påminner om en reflektion i upprört vatten."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can find this filter through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Distotrts</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Ripple</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar filtret via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Förvrängningar</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Krusning</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Antialiasing</guilabel>: This improves the scaled look the image "
"borders may have."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Kantutjämning</guilabel>: Detta förbättrar det skalade utseende "
"som bildkanterna kan få."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Retain Tileability"
msgstr "Behåll sömlöshet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Retain Tileability</guilabel>: This preserves the seamless "
"properties if your image is a tile pattern."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Behåll sömlöshet</guilabel>: Detta bevarar de sömlösa egenskaperna"
" om bilden är ett kakelmönster."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"That's the <guilabel>Horizontal</guilabel> or <guilabel>Vertical</guilabel> "
"direction of waves."
msgstr ""
"Detta är vågornas <guilabel>vågräta</guilabel> eller "
"<guilabel>lodräta</guilabel> riktning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Edges"
msgstr "Kanter"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Because ripples cause pixel displacement, some pixels may be missing on the "
"image sides:"
msgstr ""
"Eftersom krusningar förskjuter bildpunkter kan vissa saknas vid bildens "
"sidor:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"With <guilabel>Wrap</guilabel>, pixels going out one side will come back on "
"the other side, replacing so the missing pixels."
msgstr ""
"Med <guilabel>Radbryt</guilabel> kommer bildpunkter som går ut på ena sidan "
"tillbaka på den andra sidan och ersätter därmed de saknade bildpunkterna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"With <guilabel>Smear</guilabel>, the adjacent pixels will spread out to "
"replace the mixing pixels."
msgstr ""
"Med <guilabel>Smeta ut</guilabel> sprids angränsande bildpunkter för att "
"ersätta de saknade bildpunkterna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"With <guilabel>Black</guilabel>, the missing pixels will be replaced by "
"black pixels."
msgstr ""
"Med <guilabel>Svart</guilabel> ersätts de saknade bildpunkterna med svarta "
"bildpunkter."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Wave Type"
msgstr "Vågtyp"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
