msgstr "Polära koordinater"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Example for Polar Coords filter"
msgstr "Exempel på filtret Polära koordinater"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<quote>Polar Coords</quote> filter applied"
msgstr "Filtret <quote>Polära koordinater</quote> tillämpat"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"It gives a circular or a rectangular representation of your image with all "
"the possible intermediates between both."
msgstr ""
"Det ger en cirkulär eller rektangulär representation av bilden med alla "
"möjliga mellanlägen mellan de båda."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can find this filter through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Distorts</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Polar"
" Coords</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar filtret via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Förvrängningar</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Polära"
" koordinater</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Circle Depth in Percent"
msgstr "Cirkeldjup i procent"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Slider and input box allow you to set the \"circularity\" of the "
"transformation, from rectangle (0%) to circle (100%)."
msgstr ""
"Skjutreglaget och inmatningsrutan låter dig ange omvandlingens "
"”cirkularitet”, från rektangel (0 %) till cirkel (100 %)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Offset Angle"
msgstr "Förskjutningsvinkel"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This option controls the angle the drawing will start from (0 - 359°), and "
"so turns it around the circle center."
msgstr ""
"Detta alternativ styr vinkeln där ritningen börjar (0–359°) och roterar den "
"därmed kring cirkelns centrum."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Map Backwards"
msgstr "Avbilda baklänges"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"When this option is checked, the drawing will start from the right instead "
"of the left."
msgstr ""
"När alternativet är markerat börjar ritningen från höger i stället för "
"vänster."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Map from Top"
msgstr "Avbilda från överkanten"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If unchecked, the mapping will put the bottom row in the middle and the top "
"row on the outside. If checked, it will be the opposite."
msgstr ""
"Om alternativet inte är markerat placerar avbildningen den nedre raden i "
"mitten och den övre raden utanför. Om det är markerat blir det tvärtom."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "To Polar"
msgstr "Till polärt"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If unchecked, the image will be circularly mapped into a rectangle (odd "
"effect). If checked, the image will be mapped into a circle."
msgstr ""
"Om alternativet inte är markerat avbildas bilden cirkulärt till en rektangel"
" (udda effekt). Om det är markerat avbildas bilden till en cirkel."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "With text"
msgstr "Med text"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If you have just written the text, you must Flatten the image before using "
"the filter."
msgstr ""
"Om du nyss har skrivit texten måste du platta till bilden innan filtret "
"används."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "With two horizontal bars"
msgstr "Med två vågräta staplar"

