#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp/master
msgid "Page Curl"
msgstr "Vik upp sida"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Example for the Page Curl filter"
msgstr "Exempel på filtret Vik upp sida"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Filter <quote>Page Curl</quote> applied"
msgstr "Filtret <quote>Vik upp sida</quote> tillämpat"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This filter curls a corner of the current layer or selection into a kind of "
"cornet showing the underlying layer in the cleared area. A new \"Curl "
"Layer\" and a new Alpha channel are created. The part of the initial layer "
"corresponding to this cleared area is also transparent."
msgstr ""
"Detta filter viker upp ett hörn av det aktuella lagret eller markeringen "
"till en slags strut och visar det underliggande lagret i det frilagda "
"området. Ett nytt ”uppvikningslager” och en ny alfakanal skapas. Den del av "
"ursprungslagret som motsvarar det frilagda området blir också genomskinlig."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This filter is found in the image window menu under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Distorts</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Page"
" Curl</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Filtret finns i bildfönstrets meny under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Förvrängningar</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Vik"
" upp sida</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Curl Location"
msgstr "Uppvikningsplats"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You have there four radio buttons to select the corner you want raise. The "
"Preview is redundant and doesn't respond to other options."
msgstr ""
"Där finns fyra alternativknappar för att välja det hörn du vill vika upp. "
"Förhandsvisningen är överflödig och reagerar inte på andra alternativ."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Curl Orientation"
msgstr "Uppvikningsriktning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Horizontal</emphasis> and <emphasis>Vertical</emphasis> refer to "
"the border you want raise."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Vågrät</emphasis> och <emphasis>Lodrät</emphasis> syftar på den "
"kant du vill vika upp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Shadow under curl"
msgstr "Skugga under uppvikning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "This is the shadow inside the cornet."
msgstr "Detta är skuggan inne i struten."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Use current gradient instead of FG/FB-color"
msgstr "Använd aktuell toning i stället för förgrunds-/bakgrundsfärg"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "This color refers to the outer face of the cornet."
msgstr "Färgen avser strutens utsida."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Curl Opacity"
msgstr "Uppvikningens opacitet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Refers to the visibility of the layer part underlying the cornet. It may be "
"set also in the Layer Dialog."
msgstr ""
"Avser synligheten för den lagerdel som ligger under struten. Den kan också "
"ställas in i lagerdialogrutan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/distort-taj-newsprint.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/distort-taj-newsprint.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"

