"DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/filters-distort-newsprint.png'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/newsprint.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/newsprint.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Applying example for the Newsprint filter"
msgstr "Tillämpningsexempel för filtret Tidningstryck"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Filter <quote>Newsprint</quote> applied"
msgstr "Filtret <quote>Tidningstryck</quote> tillämpat"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This filter halftones the image using a clustered-dot dither. Halftoning is "
"the process of rendering an image with multiple levels of grey or colour "
"(i.e. a continuous tone image) on a device with fewer tones; often a bi-"
"level device such as a printer or typesetter."
msgstr ""
"Filtret rasteriserar bilden med punktraster. Rasterisering är processen att "
"återge en bild med flera nivåer av grått eller färg (det vill säga en bild "
"med kontinuerliga toner) på en enhet med färre toner, ofta en enhet med två "
"nivåer såsom en skrivare eller sättmaskin."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The basic premise is to trade off resolution for greater apparent tone depth"
" (this is known as spatial dithering)."
msgstr ""
"Grundprincipen är att byta upplösning mot större upplevt tondjup (så kallad "
"rumslig rastrering)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"There are many approaches to this, the simplest of which is to throw away "
"the low-order bits of tone information; this is what the posterize filter "
"does. Unfortunately, the results don't look too good. However, no spatial "
"resolution is lost."
msgstr ""
"Det finns många sätt att göra detta. Det enklaste är att kasta bort de minst"
" betydelsefulla bitarna av toninformationen; det är vad filtret Posterisera "
"gör. Tyvärr ser resultatet inte särskilt bra ut. Ingen rumslig upplösning "
"går dock förlorad."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This filter uses a clustered-dot ordered dither, which reduces the "
"resolution of the image by converting cells into spots which grow or shrink "
"according to the intensity that cell needs to represent."
msgstr ""
"Filtret använder ett ordnat punktraster, som minskar bildens upplösning "
"genom att omvandla celler till punkter som växer eller krymper enligt den "
"intensitet som cellen ska representera."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Imagine a grid super-imposed on the original image. The image is divided "
"into cells by the grid - each cell will ultimately hold a single spot made "
"up of multiple output pixels in order to approximate the darkness of the "
"original image in that cell."
msgstr ""
"Tänk dig ett rutnät lagt ovanpå ursprungsbilden. Bilden delas in i celler av"
" rutnätet – varje cell kommer till slut att innehålla en enda punkt "
"bestående av flera utgående bildpunkter för att approximera mörkret i "
"ursprungsbilden i cellen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Obviously, a large cell size results in a heavy loss in resolution! The "
"spots in the cells typically start off as circles, and grow to be diamond "
"shaped. This change in shape is controlled by a <guilabel>spot "
"function</guilabel>. By using different spot functions, the evolution in the"
" shape of the spots as the cell goes from fully black to fully white may be "
"controlled."
msgstr ""
"En stor cellstorlek medför förstås en kraftig förlust av upplösning. "
"Punkterna i cellerna börjar vanligen som cirklar och växer till diamantform."
" Denna formändring styrs av en <guilabel>punktfunktion</guilabel>. Genom att"
" använda olika punktfunktioner kan utvecklingen av punkternas form styras "
"när cellen går från helt svart till helt vit."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Starting filter"
msgstr "Starta filtret"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can find this filter through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Distorts</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Newsprint</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar filtret via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Förvrängningar</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Tidningstryck</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"All your setting changes will appear in the Preview without affecting the "
"image until you click on <guilabel>OK</guilabel>. Note that the preview "
"displays the whole image, even if the final result will concern a selection."
" Don't keep <emphasis>Do Preview</emphasis> checked if your computer is too "
"much slow."
msgstr ""
"Alla ändringar av dina inställningar visas i förhandsvisningen utan att "
"påverka bilden förrän du klickar på <guilabel>OK</guilabel>. Observera att "
"förhandsvisningen visar hela bilden, även om slutresultatet gäller en "
"markering. Låt inte <emphasis>Förhandsvisa</emphasis> vara markerat om "
"datorn är för långsam."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This group controls the cell size, either by setting the input and output "
"resolutions, or directly."
msgstr ""
"Denna grupp styr cellstorleken, antingen genom att ange in- och "
"utdataupplösningarna eller direkt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Input SPI"
msgstr "Inmatnings-SPI"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Input SPI</guilabel> : Resolution of the original input image, in "
"Samples Per Inch (SPI). This is automatically initialised to the input "
"image's resolution."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Inmatnings-SPI</guilabel>: Ursprunglig inmatningsbilds upplösning "
"i prov per tum (SPI). Den initieras automatiskt till inmatningsbildens "
"upplösning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Output LPI"
msgstr "Utmatnings-LPI"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Output LPI</guilabel>: Desired output resolution, in Lines Per "
"Inch (LPI)."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Utmatnings-LPI</guilabel>: Önskad utdataupplösning i linjer per "
"tum (LPI)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Cell Size</guilabel>: Resulting cell size, in pixels. Most often "
"you will want to set this directly."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Cellstorlek</guilabel>: Resulterande cellstorlek i bildpunkter. "
"Oftast vill du ange detta direkt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Separate To RGB, CMYK, Intensity"
msgstr "Separera till RGB, CMYK, intensitet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Separate To RGB, CMYK, Intensity</guilabel>: Select which "
"colorspace you wish to operate in. In <emphasis>RGB</emphasis> mode, no "
"colorspace conversion is performed. In <emphasis>CMYK</emphasis>, the image "
"is first internally converted to CMYK, then each colour channel is "
"separately halftoned, before finally being recombined back to an RGB image. "
"In <emphasis>Intensity</emphasis> mode, the image is internally converted to"
" grayscale, halftoned, then the result used as the alpha channel for the "
"input image. This is good for special effects, but requires a little "
"experimentation to achieve best results. Hint: try CMYK if you don't know "
"which to go for initially."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Separera till RGB, CMYK, intensitet</guilabel>: Välj den färgrymd "
"du vill arbeta i. I läget <emphasis>RGB</emphasis> utförs ingen "
"färgrymdsomvandling. I <emphasis>CMYK</emphasis> omvandlas bilden först "
"internt till CMYK, sedan rasteriseras varje färgkanal separat innan de till "
"slut kombineras till en RGB-bild igen. I läget "
"<emphasis>Intensitet</emphasis> omvandlas bilden internt till gråskala, "
"rasteriseras och resultatet används som alfakanal för inmatningsbilden. "
"Detta passar specialeffekter men kräver lite experimenterande för bästa "
"resultat. Tips: prova CMYK om du inte vet vad du ska välja från början."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Black Pullout (%)"
msgstr "Svartutdrag (%)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Black Pullout (%)</guilabel> When doing RGB-&gt;CMYK conversion, "
"how much K (black) should be used?"
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Svartutdrag (%)</guilabel>: Hur mycket K (svart) ska användas vid "
"RGB-&gt;CMYK-omvandling?"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Lock Channels"
msgstr "Lås kanaler"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Lock Channels</guilabel>: Make channel modifications apply to all "
"channels."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Lås kanaler</guilabel>: Låt kanaländringar gälla alla kanaler."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Factory Defaults"
msgstr "Fabriksinställningar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Factory Defaults</guilabel>: Restore the default settings which "
"should give pleasing results."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Fabriksinställningar</guilabel>: Återställ "
"standardinställningarna, som bör ge tilltalande resultat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<guilabel>Angle</guilabel>: Cell grid angle for this channel."
msgstr "<guilabel>Vinkel</guilabel>: Cellrutnätets vinkel för denna kanal."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Spot Function"
msgstr "Punktfunktion"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Spot Function</guilabel>: Spot function to be used for this "
"channel (see preview in blue cell-boxes)."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Punktfunktion</guilabel>: Funktionen som ska användas för denna "
"kanal (se förhandsvisningen i blå cellrutor)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Proper halftoning does not need antialiasing: the aim is to reduce the "
"colour depth after all! However, since this plugin is mainly for special "
"effects, the results are displayed on screen rather than by a black/white "
"printer. So it is often useful to apply a little anti-aliasing to simulate "
"ink smearing on paper. If you do want to print the resulting image then set "
"the antialising to 1 (ie, off)."
msgstr ""
"Korrekt rasterisering behöver ingen kantutjämning: målet är ju att minska "
"färgdjupet. Eftersom denna insticksmodul främst används för specialeffekter "
"visas resultaten på skärmen i stället för av en svartvit skrivare. Därför är"
" det ofta användbart med lite kantutjämning för att simulera utsmetat bläck "
"på papper. Om du vill skriva ut den resulterande bilden sätter du "
"kantutjämningen till 1 (det vill säga av)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Oversample"
msgstr "Översampla"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Oversample</guilabel>: Number of subpixels to sample to produce "
"each output pixel. Set to 1 to disable this feature. Warning: large numbers "
"here will lead to very long filter runtimes!"
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Översampla</guilabel>: Antal delbildpunkter som samplas för att "
"skapa varje utgående bildpunkt. Sätt till 1 för att inaktivera funktionen. "
"Varning: stora tal här ger mycket långa körtider för filtret!"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Example for Newsprint"
msgstr "Exempel på Tidningstryck"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "An example from plug-in author"
msgstr "Ett exempel från insticksmodulens upphovsperson"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/distort-taj-mosaic.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/distort-taj-mosaic.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/filters-distort-mosaic.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/filters-distort-mosaic.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Filter <quote>Mosaic</quote> applied"
msgstr "Filtret <quote>Mosaik</quote> tillämpat"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"It cuts the active layer or selection into many squares or polygons which "
"are slightly raised and separated by joins, giving so an aspect of mosaic."
msgstr ""
"Det delar upp det aktiva lagret eller markeringen i många kvadrater eller "
"polygoner som är lätt upphöjda och åtskilda av fogar, vilket ger ett "
"mosaikliknande utseende."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can find this filter through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Distorts</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Mosaic</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar filtret via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Förvrängningar</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Mosaik</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "This option reduces the stepped aspect that may have borders."
msgstr ""
"Detta alternativ minskar det trappstegsliknande utseende som kanter kan få."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Color Averaging"
msgstr "Färgmedelvärdesbildning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"When this option is unchecked, the image drawing can be recognized inside "
"tiles. When checked, the colors inside tiles are averaged into a single "
"color."
msgstr ""
"När alternativet inte är markerat kan motivet i bilden kännas igen inne i "
"plattorna. När det är markerat beräknas medelvärdet för färgerna i plattorna"
" till en enda färg."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Allows Tile Splitting"
msgstr "Tillåt delning av plattor"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This option splits tiles in areas with many colors, and so allows a better "
"color gradation and more details in these areas."
msgstr ""
"Alternativet delar upp plattor i områden med många färger och möjliggör "
"därmed bättre färggradering och fler detaljer i dessa områden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Pitted Surfaces"
msgstr "Gropiga ytor"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "With this option tile surface looks pitted."
msgstr "Med detta alternativ ser plattans yta gropig ut."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "FG/BG Lighting"
msgstr "FG/BG-belysning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"When this option is checked, tiles are lit by the foreground color of the "
"toolbox, and shadow is colored by the background color. Joins have the "
"background color."
msgstr ""
"När alternativet är markerat belyses plattor av verktygslådans förgrundsfärg"
" och skuggan färgas med bakgrundsfärgen. Fogarna har bakgrundsfärgen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Parameter setting"
msgstr "Parameterinställning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Tile Size"
msgstr "Rutstorlek"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Slider and input box allow you to set the size of tile surface."
msgstr "Skjutreglaget och inmatningsrutan låter dig ange plattans yta."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Tile Height"
msgstr "Platthöjd"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"That's ledge, relief of tiles. Value is width of the lit border in pixels."
msgstr ""
"Detta är plattornas avsats eller relief. Värdet är bredden på den belysta "
"kanten i bildpunkter."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Tile Spacing"
msgstr "Plattavstånd"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "That's width of the join between tiles."
msgstr "Detta är bredden på fogen mellan plattor."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Tile Neatness"
msgstr "Plattjämnhet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"When set to 1, most of tiles have the same size. With 0 value, size is "
"determined at random and this may lead to shape variation."
msgstr ""
"När värdet är 1 har de flesta plattor samma storlek. Med värdet 0 avgörs "
"storleken slumpmässigt, vilket kan leda till varierande former."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Light Direction"
msgstr "Ljusriktning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"By default light comes from the upper left corner (135°). You can change "
"this direction from 0 to 360 (counter clockwise)."
msgstr ""
"Som standard kommer ljuset från det övre vänstra hörnet (135°). Du kan ändra"
" riktningen från 0 till 360 (moturs)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Color Variation"
msgstr "Färgvariation"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Color Variation</guilabel>: Each tile has only one color. So, the "
"number of colors is reduced, compared to the original image. Here, you can "
"increase the number of colors, a little."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Färgvariation</guilabel>: Varje platta har bara en färg. Antalet "
"färger minskar alltså jämfört med ursprungsbilden. Här kan du öka antalet "
"färger något."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Tile Primitives"
msgstr "Grundformer för plattor"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "This options are self-understanding:"
msgstr "Dessa alternativ är självförklarande:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<guilabel>Hexagons</guilabel>: (hexa = 6)"
msgstr "<guilabel>Hexagoner</guilabel>: (hexa = 6)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<guilabel>Octagons and Squares</guilabel>: (octa = 8)"
msgstr "<guilabel>Oktagoner och kvadrater</guilabel>: (okta = 8)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<guilabel>Triangles</guilabel>: (tri = 3)"
msgstr "<guilabel>Trianglar</guilabel>: (tri = 3)"

