#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<quote>Lens Distortion</quote> applied"
msgstr "<quote>Linsdistorsion</quote> tillämpat"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This filter lets you simulate but also correct the typical distortion effect"
" introduced in photo images by the glasses contained in the camera lenses."
msgstr ""
"Med filtret kan du simulera men också korrigera den typiska "
"distorsionseffekt som uppstår i foton genom glaset i kameraobjektiv."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This filter is found in the image window menu under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Distorts</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Lens"
" Distortion</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Filtret finns i bildfönstrets meny under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Förvrängningar</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Linsdistorsion</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The allowed range of all options is from -100.0 to 100.0."
msgstr ""
"Det tillåtna intervallet för alla alternativ är från −100,0 till 100,0."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The amount of spherical correction to introduce. Positive values make the "
"image convex while negative ones make it concave. The whole effect is "
"similar to wrapping the image inside or outside a sphere."
msgstr ""
"Mängden sfärisk korrigering som ska tillföras. Positiva värden gör bilden "
"konvex, medan negativa värden gör den konkav. Hela effekten liknar att svepa"
" bilden på insidan eller utsidan av en sfär."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Example result of Main option"
msgstr "Exempelresultat för alternativet Huvud"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "-100.0"
msgstr "-100,0"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "0.0"
msgstr "0,0"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "+100.0"
msgstr "+100,0"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Specifies the amount of additional spherical correction at image edges."
msgstr "Anger mängden ytterligare sfärisk korrigering vid bildkanterna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Example result of Edge option (Main set to 50.0)"
msgstr "Exempelresultat för alternativet Kant (Huvud är satt till 50,0)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "-60.0"
msgstr "-60,0"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "+60.0"
msgstr "+60,0"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Specifies the amount of the image enlargement or reduction caused by the "
"hypothetical lens."
msgstr ""
"Anger mängden bildförstoring eller bildförminskning som orsakas av det "
"hypotetiska objektivet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Example result of Zoom option"
msgstr "Exempelresultat för alternativet Zooma"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Brighten"
msgstr "Gör ljusare"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The amount of the <quote>vignetting</quote> effect: the brightness "
"decrease/increase due to the lens curvature that produces a different light "
"absorption."
msgstr ""
"Mängden <quote>vinjettering</quote>: den minskning eller ökning av "
"ljusstyrkan som beror på objektivets krökning och ger ett annorlunda "
"ljusupptag."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Main</guilabel> or <guilabel>Edge</guilabel> options must be "
"non zero for this option to produce noticeable results."
msgstr ""
"Alternativet <guilabel>Huvud</guilabel> eller <guilabel>Kant</guilabel> "
"måste vara skilt från noll för att detta alternativ ska ge synliga resultat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Example result of Brigthen option (Main set to 75.0)"
msgstr ""
"Exempelresultat för alternativet Gör ljusare (Huvud är satt till 75,0)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "-25.0"
msgstr "-25,0"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "+25.0"
msgstr "+25,0"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "X shift; Y shift"
msgstr "X-förskjutning; Y-förskjutning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"These two options specify the shift of the image produced by not perfectly "
"centered pairs of lenses."
msgstr ""
"Dessa två alternativ anger bildförskjutningen som uppstår genom objektivpar "
"som inte är perfekt centrerade."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"As above this option produces visible results only if the "
"<guilabel>Main</guilabel> or <guilabel>Edge</guilabel> options are non zero."
msgstr ""
"Som ovan ger alternativet synliga resultat endast om "
"<guilabel>Huvud</guilabel> eller <guilabel>Kant</guilabel> inte är noll."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Example result of X shift option (Main set to 70.0)"
msgstr ""
"Exempelresultat för alternativet X-förskjutning (Huvud är satt till 70,0)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/distort-taj-iwarp.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/distort-taj-iwarp.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/filters-distort-iwarp.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/filters-distort-iwarp.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/iwarp-options-2.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/iwarp-options-2.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "IWarp"
msgstr "IWarp"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Applying example for the IWarp filter"
msgstr "Tillämpningsexempel för filtret IWarp"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Filter <quote>IWarp</quote> applied"
msgstr "Filtret <quote>IWarp</quote> tillämpat"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This filter allows you to deform interactively some parts of the image and, "
"thanks to its Animate option, to create the elements of a fade in/fade out "
"animation between the original image and the deformed one, that you can play"
" and use in a Web page."
msgstr ""
"Med filtret kan du interaktivt förvränga delar av bilden och, tack vare "
"alternativet Animera, skapa delar av en tona in-/tona ut-animering mellan "
"ursprungsbilden och den förvrängda bilden, som du kan spela upp och använda "
"på en webbsida."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"To use it, first select a deform type then click on the Preview and drag the"
" mouse pointer."
msgstr ""
"För att använda filtret väljer du först en förvrängningstyp, klickar sedan i"
" förhandsvisningen och drar muspekaren."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can find this filter through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Distort</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Iwarp</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar filtret via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Förvräng</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>IWarp</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The options of this filter are so numerous that they come in two tabs. The "
"first tab contains general options. The second tab holds animation options."
msgstr ""
"Filtrets alternativ är så många att de delas upp i två flikar. Den första "
"fliken innehåller allmänna alternativ. Den andra innehåller "
"animeringsalternativ."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<placeholder-1/> filter options (Settings tab)"
msgstr "Filteralternativ för <placeholder-1/> (fliken Inställningar)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The Settings tab allows you to set parameters which will affect the preview "
"you are working on. So, you can apply different deform modes to different "
"parts of the preview."
msgstr ""
"Fliken Inställningar låter dig ange parametrar som påverkar den "
"förhandsvisning du arbetar med. Du kan alltså använda olika "
"förvrängningslägen på olika delar av förhandsvisningen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Here, the Preview is your work space: You click on the Preview and drag "
"mouse pointer. The underlying part of image will be deformed according to "
"the settings you have chosen. If your work is not convenient, press the "
"<emphasis>Reset</emphasis> button."
msgstr ""
"Här är förhandsvisningen din arbetsyta: du klickar i den och drar "
"muspekaren. Den underliggande bilddelen förvrängs enligt inställningarna du "
"har valt. Om arbetet inte blir bra trycker du på knappen "
"<emphasis>Återställ</emphasis>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Deform Mode"
msgstr "Förvrängningsläge"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Move</guilabel>: Allows you to <emphasis>stretch</emphasis> parts "
"of the image."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Flytta</guilabel>: Låter dig <emphasis>sträcka ut</emphasis> delar"
" av bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Remove</guilabel>: This remove the distortion where you drag the "
"mouse pointer, partially or completely. This allows you to avoid pressing "
"Reset button, working on the whole image. Be careful when working on an "
"animation: this option will affect one frame only."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Ta bort</guilabel>: Tar bort förvrängningen där du drar "
"muspekaren, delvis eller helt. På så vis slipper du trycka på Återställ och "
"arbeta om hela bilden. Var försiktig vid arbete med en animering: "
"alternativet påverkar bara en bildruta."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<guilabel>Grow</guilabel>: This option inflates the pointed pattern."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Utöka</guilabel>: Detta alternativ blåser upp det utpekade "
"mönstret."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<guilabel>Shrink</guilabel>: Self explanatory."
msgstr "<guilabel>Förminska</guilabel>: Självförklarande."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<guilabel>Swirl CCW </guilabel>: Create a vortex counter clockwise."
msgstr "<guilabel>Virvel moturs </guilabel>: Skapar en virvel moturs."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<guilabel>Swirl CW </guilabel>: Create a vortex clockwise."
msgstr "<guilabel>Virvel medurs </guilabel>: Skapar en virvel medurs."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Deform Radius"
msgstr "Förvrängningsradie"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Defines the radius, in pixels (5-100), of the filter action circle around "
"the pixel pointed by the mouse."
msgstr ""
"Anger radien i bildpunkter (5–100) för filtrets verkningscirkel runt den "
"bildpunkt som musen pekar på."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Deform Amount"
msgstr "Förvrängningsmängd"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Sets how much out of shape your image will be put (0.0-1.0)."
msgstr "Anger hur mycket bilden ska förvrängas (0,0–1,0)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Bilinear"
msgstr "Bilinjär"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "This option smooths the IWarp effect."
msgstr "Detta alternativ jämnar ut IWarp-effekten."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Adaptive Supersample"
msgstr "Adaptiv översampling"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This option renders a better image at the cost of increased calculation."
msgstr ""
"Detta alternativ ger en bättre bild på bekostnad av ökad beräkningstid."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Max Depth</guilabel>: this value limits the maximum sampling "
"iterations performed on each pixel."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Maxdjup</guilabel>: detta värde begränsar det maximala antalet "
"samplingsiterationer som utförs på varje bildpunkt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Threshold</guilabel>: when the value difference between a pixel "
"and the adjacent ones exceeds this threshold a new sampling iteration is "
"performed on the pixel."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Tröskelvärde</guilabel>: när värdeskillnaden mellan en bildpunkt "
"och angränsande bildpunkter överstiger detta tröskelvärde utförs en ny "
"samplingsiteration på bildpunkten."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<placeholder-1/> filter options (Animation tab)"
msgstr "Filteralternativ för <placeholder-1/> (fliken Animering)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This tab allows to generate several intermediate images between the original"
" image and the final deformation of this image. You can play this animation "
"thanks to the <link linkend=\"plug-in-playback\">Playback</link> plug-in."
msgstr ""
"Med denna flik kan du skapa flera mellanbilder mellan ursprungsbilden och "
"den slutliga förvrängningen av bilden. Du kan spela upp animeringen med "
"insticksmodulen <link linkend=\"plug-in-playback\">Uppspelning</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Number of Frames"
msgstr "Antal bildrutor"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"That's the number of images in your animation (2-100). These frames are "
"stored as layers attached to your image. Use the XCF format when saving it."
msgstr ""
"Detta är antalet bilder i animeringen (2–100). Bildrutorna lagras som lager "
"i bilden. Använd XCF-formatet när du sparar den."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "This option plays the animation backwards."
msgstr "Detta alternativ spelar upp animeringen baklänges."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Ping-Pong"
msgstr "Pingpong"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "When the animation ends one way, it goes backwards."
msgstr "När animeringen når slutet åt ena hållet går den baklänges."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The distort filters transform your image in many different ways."
msgstr "Förvrängningsfiltren omvandlar bilden på många olika sätt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
