#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Erase Every Other Row"
msgstr "Radera varannan rad"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Erase Every Other Row or Column"
msgstr "Radera varannan rad eller kolumn"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Erase Every Other row"
msgstr "Radera varannan rad"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<quote>Erase Every Other row</quote> applied"
msgstr "<quote>Radera varannan rad</quote> tillämpat"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This filter not only can erase each other row or column of the active layer "
"but also can change them to the background color."
msgstr ""
"Filtret kan inte bara radera varannan rad eller kolumn i det aktiva lagret, "
"utan också ändra dem till bakgrundsfärgen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This filter is found in the image window menu under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Distorts</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Erase"
" Every Other Row</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Filtret finns i bildfönstrets meny under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Förvrängningar</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Radera"
" varannan rad</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"These options are self-explanatory. Only one remark: if the active layer is "
"the background layer and has an Alpha channel, erased rows or columns will "
"be transparent. If it doesn't have an Alpha channel (then its name is in "
"bold letters in the Layer Dialog), the Background color of the toolbox will "
"be used."
msgstr ""
"Dessa alternativ är självförklarande. En anmärkning: om det aktiva lagret är"
" bakgrundslagret och har en alfakanal blir raderna eller kolumnerna som "
"raderas genomskinliga. Om det saknar alfakanal (då skrivs namnet med fetstil"
" i lagerdialogrutan) används verktygslådans bakgrundsfärg."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/distort-taj-engrave.png'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/distort-taj-engrave.png'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"

