#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<quote>Engrave</quote> applied"
msgstr "<quote>Gravyr</quote> tillämpat"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This filter produces an engraving effect: the image is turned black and "
"white and some horizontal lines of varying height are drawn depending on the"
" value of underlying pixels. The resulting effect reminds of engravings "
"found in coins and old book illustrations."
msgstr ""
"Filtret skapar en gravyr-effekt: bilden görs svartvit och vågräta linjer med"
" varierande höjd ritas beroende på värdet på de underliggande bildpunkterna."
" Den resulterande effekten påminner om gravyrer på mynt och i gamla "
"bokillustrationer."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <quote>Engrave</quote> filter operates only on floating selections and "
"layers with an alpha channel. If the active layer does not have an alpha "
"channel please <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-alpha-add\">add it</link> first."
msgstr ""
"Filtret <quote>Gravyr</quote> fungerar endast på flytande markeringar och "
"lager med en alfakanal. Om det aktiva lagret saknar alfakanal måste du först"
" <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-alpha-add\">lägga till den</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This filter is found in the image window menu under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Distorts</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Engrave</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Filtret finns i bildfönstrets meny under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Förvrängningar</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Gravyr</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This option specifies the height of the engraving lines. The value goes from"
" 2 to 16."
msgstr ""
"Detta alternativ anger höjden på gravyrens linjer. Värdet går från 2 till "
"16."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Limit line width"
msgstr "Begränsa linjebredd"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled thin lines are not drawn on contiguous color "
"areas. See the figure below for an example of this option result."
msgstr ""
"Om alternativet är aktiverat ritas inga tunna linjer på sammanhängande "
"färgområden. Se bilden nedan för ett exempel på resultatet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Example result of Limit line width option"
msgstr "Exempelresultat för alternativet Begränsa linjebredd"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Limit line width option enabled"
msgstr "Alternativet Begränsa linjebredd är aktiverat"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Limit line width option disabled"
msgstr "Alternativet Begränsa linjebredd är inaktiverat"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/distort-taj-emboss.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/distort-taj-emboss.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/emboss-options.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/emboss-options.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Applying example for the Emboss filter"
msgstr "Tillämpningsexempel för filtret Relief"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Filter <quote>Emboss</quote> applied"
msgstr "Filtret <quote>Relief</quote> tillämpat"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can use it only with RGB images. If your image is grayscale, it will be "
"grayed out in the menu."
msgstr ""
"Du kan bara använda filtret med RGB-bilder. Om bilden är i gråskala är det "
"nedtonat i menyn."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"It stamps and carves the active layer or selection, giving it relief with "
"bumps and hollows. Bright areas are raised and dark ones are carved. You can"
" vary the lighting."
msgstr ""
"Det stämplar och graverar det aktiva lagret eller markeringen och ger den en"
" relief med upphöjningar och fördjupningar. Ljusa områden höjs upp och mörka"
" graveras. Du kan variera belysningen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can find this filter through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Distorts</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Emboss</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar filtret via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Förvrängningar</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Relief</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Bumpmap</guilabel>: Relief is smooth and colors are preserved."
msgstr "<guilabel>Bumpmap</guilabel>: Reliefen är jämn och färgerna bevaras."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Emboss</guilabel>: It turns your image to grayscale and relief is "
"more marked, looking like metal."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Relief</guilabel>: Bilden görs till gråskala och reliefen blir "
"tydligare, med metalliknande utseende."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Azimuth"
msgstr "Azimut"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Azimuth</guilabel>: This is about lighting according to the points"
" of the compass (0 - 360). If you suppose South is at the top of your image,"
" then East (0°) is on the left. Increasing value goes counter-clockwise."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Azimut</guilabel>: Detta gäller belysning enligt väderstrecken "
"(0–360). Om du antar att söder är högst upp i bilden ligger öster (0°) till "
"vänster. Ökande värden går moturs."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Elevation</guilabel>: That's height from horizon (0°), in "
"principle up to zenith (90°), but here up to the opposite horizon (180°)."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Höjdvinkel</guilabel>: Detta är höjden från horisonten (0°), i "
"princip upp till zenit (90°), men här ända till den motsatta horisonten "
"(180°)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Depth</guilabel> Seems to be the distance of the light source. "
"Light decreases when value increases."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Djup</guilabel> verkar vara ljuskällans avstånd. Ljuset minskar "
"när värdet ökar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/distort-taj-curve-bend.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE"
" DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/distort-taj-curve-bend.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE"
" DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/filters-distort-curvebend.png'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/filters-distort-curvebend.png'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp/master
msgid "Curve Bend"
msgstr "Kurvböjning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Applying example for the Curve Bend filter"
msgstr "Tillämpningsexempel för filtret Kurvböjning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Filter <quote>Curve Bend</quote> applied"
msgstr "Filtret <quote>Kurvböjning</quote> tillämpat"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This filter allows you to create a curve that will be used to distort the "
"active layer or selection. The distortion is applied gradually from an image"
" or selection border to the other."
msgstr ""
"Med filtret kan du skapa en kurva som används för att förvränga det aktiva "
"lagret eller markeringen. Förvrängningen tillämpas gradvis från en bild- "
"eller markeringskant till den andra."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can find this filter through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Distorts</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Curve"
" Bend</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar filtret via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Förvrängningar</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Kurvböjning</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<quote>Curve bend</quote> filter options"
msgstr "Filteralternativ för <quote>Kurvböjning</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The preview displays changes to image or selection without modifying the "
"image until you press <emphasis>OK</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Förhandsvisningen visar ändringar i bilden eller markeringen utan att ändra "
"bilden förrän du trycker på <emphasis>OK</emphasis>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Preview Once"
msgstr "Förhandsvisa en gång"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "This button allows you to update the preview each time you need it."
msgstr ""
"Med denna knapp kan du uppdatera förhandsvisningen när du behöver det."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Automatic Preview"
msgstr "Automatisk förhandsvisning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"With this option, preview is changed in real time. This needs much "
"calculation and may lengthen work. It is particularly evident when using "
"\"Rotation\"."
msgstr ""
"Med detta alternativ ändras förhandsvisningen i realtid. Det kräver mycket "
"beräkning och kan göra arbetet långsammare. Det märks särskilt när "
"”Rotation” används."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"There, you can set the application angle of filter (0-360 counter-"
"clockwise). 0 is default setting: The curve will be applied from the upper "
"border and/or from the lower. Set to 90, it will be applied from left border"
" and/or from the right one."
msgstr ""
"Här kan du ange filtrets tillämpningsvinkel (0–360 moturs). 0 är "
"standardinställningen: kurvan tillämpas från den övre och/eller nedre "
"kanten. Vid 90 tillämpas den från den vänstra och/eller högra kanten."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Smoothing and Antialiasing"
msgstr "Utjämning och kantutjämning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The distort process may create hard and stepped borders. These two options "
"improve this aspect."
msgstr ""
"Förvrängningsprocessen kan skapa hårda och trappstegsliknande kanter. Dessa "
"två alternativ förbättrar detta."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Work on Copy"
msgstr "Arbeta på kopia"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This option creates a new layer called "
"<quote>Curve_bend_dummy_layer_b</quote> which becomes the active layer, "
"allowing you to see changes to your image in normal size without modifying "
"the original image until you press the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Detta alternativ skapar ett nytt lager med namnet "
"<quote>Curve_bend_dummy_layer_b</quote>, som blir det aktiva lagret. Då kan "
"du se ändringar i bilden i normal storlek utan att ändra ursprungsbilden "
"förrän du trycker på <guibutton>OK</guibutton>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Modify Curve"
msgstr "Ändra kurva"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"In this grid, you have a marked horizontal line, with a node at both ends, "
"which represents by default the upper border of image. If you click on this "
"curve, a new node appears, that you can drag to modify the curve as you "
"want. You can create several nodes on the curve."
msgstr ""
"I rutnätet finns en markerad vågrät linje, med en nod i varje ände, som "
"standard representerar bildens övre kant. Om du klickar på kurvan visas en "
"ny nod som du kan dra för att ändra kurvan som du vill. Du kan skapa flera "
"noder på kurvan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can have only two curves on the grid, one for the so named \"upper\" "
"border and the other for the so named \"lower\" border. You can activate one"
" of them by checking the <emphasis>Upper</emphasis> or "
"<emphasis>Lower</emphasis> radio button."
msgstr ""
"Du kan endast ha två kurvor i rutnätet, en för den så kallade ”övre” kanten "
"och en för den så kallade ”nedre” kanten. Du kan aktivera en av dem genom "
"att markera alternativknappen <emphasis>Övre</emphasis> eller "
"<emphasis>Nedre</emphasis>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If you use the <emphasis>Curve Type Free</emphasis> option, the curve you "
"draw will replace the active curve."
msgstr ""
"Om du använder alternativet <emphasis>Kurvtyp fri</emphasis> ersätter kurvan"
" du ritar den aktiva kurvan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Curve for Border"
msgstr "Kurva för kant"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"There you can select whether the active curve must be applied to the "
"<emphasis>Superior (or left)</emphasis> or the <emphasis>Inferior (or "
"right)</emphasis> border, according to the rotation."
msgstr ""
"Där kan du välja om den aktiva kurvan ska tillämpas på den <emphasis>övre "
"(eller vänstra)</emphasis> eller <emphasis>nedre (eller högra)</emphasis> "
"kanten, beroende på rotationen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Remember that the curve border depends on the rotation. For example, with "
"<emphasis>Rotate</emphasis> = 90° the upper curve will actually be applied "
"to the left border."
msgstr ""
"Kom ihåg att kurvkanten beror på rotationen. Med <emphasis>Rotera</emphasis>"
" = 90° tillämpas till exempel den övre kurvan på den vänstra kanten."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"With the <emphasis>Smooth</emphasis>, you get automatically a well rounded "
"curve when you drag a node."
msgstr ""
"Med <emphasis>Jämn</emphasis> får du automatiskt en väl avrundad kurva när "
"du drar en nod."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <emphasis>Free</emphasis> option allows you to draw a curve freely. It "
"will replace the active curve."
msgstr ""
"Alternativet <emphasis>Fri</emphasis> låter dig rita en kurva fritt. Den "
"ersätter den aktiva kurvan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Copy the active curve to the other border."
msgstr "Kopiera den aktiva kurvan till den andra kanten."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Mirror the active curve to the other border."
msgstr "Spegla den aktiva kurvan till den andra kanten."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Swap the <quote>superior</quote> and <quote>inferior</quote> curves."
msgstr "Växla de <quote>övre</quote> och <quote>nedre</quote> kurvorna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Reset the active curve."
msgstr "Återställ den aktiva kurvan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Load the curve from a file."
msgstr "Läs in kurvan från en fil."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Save the curve to a file."
msgstr "Spara kurvan till en fil."

