#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Transparency managing"
msgstr "Hantera transparens"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Threshold Alpha</guimenuitem> command converts semi-"
"transparent areas of the active layer into completely transparent or "
"completely opaque areas, based on a threshold you set, between 0 and 255. It"
" only works on layers of RGB images which have an alpha channel. If the "
"image is Grayscale or Indexed, or if the layer does not have an alpha "
"channel, the menu entry is insensitive and grayed out. If the <guilabel>Keep"
" transparency</guilabel> option is checked in the Layers dialog, the command"
" displays an error message."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Alfatröskel</guimenuitem> omvandlar halvgenomskinliga"
" områden i det aktiva lagret till helt genomskinliga eller helt "
"ogenomskinliga områden, baserat på ett tröskelvärde mellan 0 och 255 som du "
"anger. Det fungerar endast på lager i RGB-bilder som har en alfakanal. Om "
"bilden är i gråskala eller indexerad, eller om lagret saknar alfakanal, är "
"menyalternativet inaktivt och nedtonat. Om alternativet <guilabel>Behåll "
"transparens</guilabel> är markerat i dialogrutan Lager visar kommandot ett "
"felmeddelande."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transparency</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Threshold"
" Alpha</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transparens</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Alfatröskel</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Description of the Dialog Window"
msgstr "Beskrivning av dialogfönstret"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The only one option of the <placeholder-1/> dialog"
msgstr "Det enda alternativet i dialogrutan <placeholder-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can set the transparency value to be used as a threshold by using the "
"slider or by entering a value between 0 and 255 in the input box. All "
"transparency values below this threshold will become opaque and all "
"transparency values above it will become completely transparent. The "
"transition is abrupt."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ange transparensvärdet som ska användas som tröskelvärde med "
"skjutreglaget eller genom att mata in ett värde mellan 0 och 255 i "
"inmatningsrutan. Alla transparensvärden under tröskeln blir ogenomskinliga "
"och alla transparensvärden över den blir helt genomskinliga. Övergången är "
"abrupt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Threshold Alpha example"
msgstr "Exempel på alfatröskel"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "A transparency gradient 0-255."
msgstr "En transparensövertoning 0–255."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Threshold Alpha set to 92."
msgstr "Alfatröskel satt till 92."

