#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<placeholder-1/> Submenu"
msgstr "Undermenyn <placeholder-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The layer stack is simply the list of layers in the Layers dialog. The "
"<guimenu>Stack</guimenu> submenu contains operations which either select a "
"new layer as the active layer, or change the position of the active layer in"
" the layer stack. If your image has only one layer, these commands are "
"grayed out."
msgstr ""
"Lagerstacken är helt enkelt listan över lager i dialogrutan Lager. "
"Undermenyn <guimenu>Stack</guimenu> innehåller åtgärder som antingen väljer "
"ett nytt lager som aktivt lager eller ändrar det aktiva lagrets plats i "
"lagerstacken. Om bilden bara har ett lager är kommandona nedtonade."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this submenu from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guimenuitem>Stack</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt undermenyn från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guimenuitem>Stack</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
