"From the image Menu through: "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layers</guimenu><guisubmenu>Stack</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Reverse"
" Layer Order</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Från bildmenyn via: "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Stack</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Omvänd"
" lagerordning</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "@@image: 'images/menus/layer-scale.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr "@@image: 'images/menus/layer-scale.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Size managing"
msgstr "Storlekshantering"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Resize current layer and its content"
msgstr "Ändra storlek på aktuellt lager och dess innehåll"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Scale layer"
msgstr "Skala lager"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Scale Layer</guimenuitem> command resizes the layer and its"
" contents. The image loses some of its quality by being scaled. The command "
"displays a dialog where you can set parameters concerning the size of the "
"layer and the image quality."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Skala lager</guimenuitem> ändrar storlek på lagret "
"och dess innehåll. Bilden förlorar en del av sin kvalitet vid skalning. "
"Kommandot visar en dialogruta där du kan ange parametrar för lagrets storlek"
" och bildkvaliteten."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guimenuitem>Scale "
"Layer</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guimenuitem>Skala "
"lager</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Description of the <quote>Scale Layer</quote> Dialog"
msgstr "Beskrivning av dialogrutan <quote>Skala lager</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The <quote>Scale Layer</quote> dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutan <quote>Skala lager</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"When you enlarge a layer, <acronym>GIMP</acronym> has to calculate new "
"pixels from the existing ones. This procedure is called "
"<quote>interpolation</quote>. Please note that no matter which interpolation"
" algorithm is used, no new information is added to the image by "
"interpolation. If there are places in the layer which have no details, you "
"will not get any new ones by scaling it. It is much more likely that the "
"layer will look somewhat blurred after scaling. Similarly, when you reduce a"
" layer, the image loses some of its quality when pixels are removed."
msgstr ""
"När du förstorar ett lager måste <acronym>GIMP</acronym> beräkna nya "
"bildpunkter från de befintliga. Proceduren kallas "
"<quote>interpolation</quote>. Oavsett vilken interpoleringsalgoritm som "
"används tillförs ingen ny information till bilden. Om det finns områden i "
"lagret som saknar detaljer får du inga nya genom att skala det. Det är mer "
"sannolikt att lagret ser lite oskarpt ut efter skalning. På samma sätt "
"förlorar bilden en del kvalitet när bildpunkter tas bort vid förminskning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Width; Height"
msgstr "Bredd; Höjd"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The command displays a dialog which shows the dimensions of the original "
"layer in pixels. You can set the new <guilabel>Width</guilabel> and "
"<guilabel>Height</guilabel> for the layer in the two text boxes. If the "
"adjacent chain icon is unbroken, the width and height are automatically "
"adjusted to hold their ratio constant. If you break the chain by clicking on"
" it, you can set them separately, but this will result in distorting the "
"layer."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot visar en dialogruta med det ursprungliga lagrets mått i "
"bildpunkter. Du kan ange lagrets nya <guilabel>Bredd</guilabel> och "
"<guilabel>Höjd</guilabel> i de två textrutorna. Om den intilliggande "
"kedjeikonen är obruten justeras bredd och höjd automatiskt så att "
"proportionerna bevaras. Om du bryter kedjan genom att klicka på den kan du "
"ange dem var för sig, men då förvrängs lagret."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"However, you do not have to set the dimensions in pixels. You can choose "
"different units from the drop-down menu. If you choose percent as units, you"
" can set the layer size relative to its original size. You can also use "
"physical units, like inches or millimeters. However if you do that, you "
"should pay attention to the <guilabel>X/Y resolution</guilabel> of the "
"image."
msgstr ""
"Du behöver dock inte ange måtten i bildpunkter. Du kan välja andra enheter i"
" rullgardinsmenyn. Om du väljer procent som enhet kan du ange lagerstorleken"
" i förhållande till ursprungsstorleken. Du kan också använda fysiska "
"enheter, som tum eller millimeter. Då bör du uppmärksamma bildens "
"<guilabel>X/Y-upplösning</guilabel>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If you enlarge a layer, the missing pixels are calculated by interpolation, "
"but no new details are added. The more the layer is enlarged, and the more "
"times it is enlarged, the more blurred it becomes. The exact result of the "
"enlargement depends upon the interpolation method you choose. After scaling,"
" you can improve the result by using the <link linkend=\"plug-in-"
"sharpen\">Sharpen</link> filter, but it is much better for you to use a high"
" resolution when scanning, taking digital photographs or producing digital "
"images by other means. It is an inherent characteristic of raster images "
"that they do not scale up well."
msgstr ""
"När du förstorar ett lager beräknas de saknade bildpunkterna genom "
"interpolation, men inga nya detaljer läggs till. Ju mer och ju fler gånger "
"lagret förstoras, desto oskarpare blir det. Det exakta resultatet beror på "
"vald interpoleringsmetod. Efter skalning kan du förbättra resultatet med "
"filtret <link linkend=\"plug-in-sharpen\">Gör skarpare</link>, men det är "
"bättre att använda hög upplösning vid skanning, digital fotografering eller "
"annan framställning av digitala bilder. Rasterbilder har i sig svårt att "
"skalas upp väl."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"To change the size of the layer, <acronym>GIMP</acronym> either has to add "
"or remove pixels. The method it uses to do this has a considerable impact on"
" the quality of the result. You can choose the method of interpolating the "
"colors of the pixels from the <guilabel>Interpolation</guilabel> drop-down "
"menu."
msgstr ""
"För att ändra lagrets storlek måste <acronym>GIMP</acronym> antingen lägga "
"till eller ta bort bildpunkter. Metoden har stor inverkan på resultatets "
"kvalitet. Du kan välja metod för att interpolera bildpunkternas färger i "
"rullgardinsmenyn <guilabel>Interpolation</guilabel>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>None</guilabel>: No interpolation is used. Pixels are simply "
"enlarged or removed, as they are when zooming. This method is low in "
"quality, but very fast."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Ingen</guilabel>: Ingen interpolation används. Bildpunkter "
"förstoras eller tas helt enkelt bort, som vid zoomning. Metoden har låg "
"kvalitet men är mycket snabb."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Linear</guilabel>: This method is a good compromise between speed "
"and quality."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Linjär</guilabel>: En bra kompromiss mellan hastighet och "
"kvalitet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Cubic</guilabel>: This method takes a lot of time, but it produces"
" the best results."
msgstr "<guilabel>Kubisk</guilabel>: Tar lång tid men ger bäst resultat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Sinus cardinalis"
msgstr "Sinus cardinalis"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Sinc (Lanczos-3)</guilabel>: The Lanczos (pronounce "
"<quote>lanzosh</quote>) method uses the Sinc<placeholder-1/> mathematical "
"function to perform a high quality interpolation."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Sinc (Lanczos-3)</guilabel>: Lanczos-metoden (uttalas "
"<quote>lanzosj</quote>) använder den matematiska funktionen "
"Sinc<placeholder-1/> för interpolation av hög kvalitet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Arbitrary Rotation"
msgstr "Godtycklig rotation"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Arbitrary Rotation</guimenuitem> command rotates a layer by"
" a specified angle. It is an alternate way of accessing the <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-tool-rotate\">Rotate tool</link>. See the section about that "
"tool for more information."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Godtycklig rotation</guimenuitem> roterar ett lager "
"med en angiven vinkel. Det är ett annat sätt att komma åt <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-tool-rotate\">roteringsverktyget</link>. Se avsnittet om "
"verktyget för mer information."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transform</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Arbitrary"
" Rotation</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transformera</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Godtycklig"
" rotation</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"or by using the keyboard shortcut "
"<keycombo><keycap>Shift</keycap><keycap>R</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"eller med tangentbordsgenvägen "
"<keycombo><keycap>Skift</keycap><keycap>R</keycap></keycombo>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Rotate 90 degrees CW"
msgstr "Rotera 90 grader medurs"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Rotate 90° CW"
msgstr "Rotera 90° medurs"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Rotate 90 degrees CW</guimenuitem> command rotates the "
"active layer by 90° around the center of the layer, with no loss of pixel "
"data. The shape of the layer is not altered, but the rotation may cause the "
"layer to extend beyond the bounds of the image. This is allowed in "
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> and it does not mean that the layer is cropped. "
"However, you will not be able to see the parts which extend beyond the "
"boundary of the image unless you resize the image canvas or move the layer."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Rotera 90 grader medurs</guimenuitem> roterar det "
"aktiva lagret 90° kring lagrets mitt utan att bilddata går förlorade. "
"Lagrets form ändras inte, men rotationen kan göra att lagret sträcker sig "
"utanför bildens gränser. Detta är tillåtet i <acronym>GIMP</acronym> och "
"betyder inte att lagret beskärs. Du kan dock inte se de delar som sträcker "
"sig utanför bildens gräns utan att ändra storlek på bildytan eller flytta "
"lagret."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transform</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Rotate"
" 90 degrees CW</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transformera</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Rotera"
" 90 grader medurs</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Rotate 90 degrees CCW"
msgstr "Rotera 90 grader moturs"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Rotate 90° CCW"
msgstr "Rotera 90° moturs"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Rotate 90 degrees CCW</guimenuitem> command rotates the "
"active layer by 90° counter-clockwise around the center of the layer, with "
"no loss of pixel data. The shape of the layer is not altered, but the "
"rotation may cause the layer to extend beyond the bounds of the image. This "
"is allowed in <acronym>GIMP</acronym> and it does not mean that the layer is"
" cropped. However, you will not be able to see the parts which extend beyond"
" the boundary of the image unless you resize the image canvas or move the "
"layer."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Rotera 90 grader moturs</guimenuitem> roterar det "
"aktiva lagret 90° moturs kring lagrets mitt utan att bilddata går förlorade."
" Lagrets form ändras inte, men rotationen kan göra att lagret sträcker sig "
"utanför bildens gränser. Detta är tillåtet i <acronym>GIMP</acronym> och "
"betyder inte att lagret beskärs. Du kan dock inte se de delar som sträcker "
"sig utanför bildens gräns utan att ändra storlek på bildytan eller flytta "
"lagret."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transform</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Rotate"
" 90 degrees CCW</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transformera</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Rotera"
" 90 grader moturs</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Rotate 180 degrees"
msgstr "Rotera 180 grader"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Rotation 180°"
msgstr "Rotation 180°"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Rotate 180 degrees</guimenuitem> command rotates the active"
" layer by 180° around the center of the layer, with no loss of pixel data. "
"The shape of the layer is not altered. Since the layers have \" a "
"rectangular shape, a 180° rotation only invert them and they can't \" extend"
" beyond the image limits."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Rotera 180 grader</guimenuitem> roterar det aktiva "
"lagret 180° kring lagrets mitt utan att bilddata går förlorade. Lagrets form"
" ändras inte. Eftersom lagren är rektangulära inverterar en 180°-rotation "
"dem bara och de kan inte sträcka sig utanför bildens gränser."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transform</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Rotate"
" 180 degrees</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transformera</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Rotera"
" 180 grader</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "@@image: 'images/menus/layer-resize.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr "@@image: 'images/menus/layer-resize.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Layer Boundary Size"
msgstr "Lagergränsens storlek"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Resize current layer but not its content"
msgstr "Ändra storlek på aktuellt lager men inte dess innehåll"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"In <acronym>GIMP</acronym>, a layer is not always the same size as the image"
" it belongs to. It might be smaller or it might be larger, in which case "
"some parts of it are hidden. The <guimenuitem>Layer Boundary "
"Size</guimenuitem> command displays a dialog in which you can set the "
"dimensions for the active layer. This command changes the dimensions of the "
"layer, but it does not <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-scale\">scale</link> its "
"contents."
msgstr ""
"I <acronym>GIMP</acronym> har ett lager inte alltid samma storlek som bilden"
" det tillhör. Det kan vara mindre eller större, och delar av det kan då vara"
" dolda. Kommandot <guimenuitem>Lagergränsens storlek</guimenuitem> visar en "
"dialogruta där du kan ange måtten för det aktiva lagret. Kommandot ändrar "
"lagrets mått men <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-scale\">skalar</link> inte "
"innehållet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guimenuitem>Layer Boundary "
"Size</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guimenuitem>Lagergränsens "
"storlek</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The <placeholder-1/> Dialog"
msgstr "<placeholder-1/>-dialogrutan"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"When the dialog is displayed, the original dimensions of the active layer "
"are shown. You can change them by using the two text boxes. If these boxes "
"are linked together with a chain, the width-to-height ratio is automatically"
" maintained. If you break the chain by clicking on it, you can set the "
"dimensions independently of each other."
msgstr ""
"När dialogrutan visas syns det aktiva lagrets ursprungliga mått. Du kan "
"ändra dem i de två textrutorna. Om rutorna är sammanlänkade med en kedja "
"behålls förhållandet mellan bredd och höjd automatiskt. Om du bryter kedjan "
"genom att klicka på den kan du ange måtten oberoende av varandra."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The default unit of measurement is pixels. You can change this by using the "
"drop-down menu. For instance, you might use a <quote>%</quote> of the "
"current size."
msgstr ""
"Standardenheten är bildpunkter. Du kan ändra den i rullgardinsmenyn. Du kan "
"till exempel använda en <quote>%</quote>-andel av den aktuella storleken."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "X Offset; Y Offset"
msgstr "X-förskjutning; Y-förskjutning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"By default, the resized layer is placed in the upper left corner of the "
"image. Here, you can set the offset of the upper left corner of the layer "
"relative to the same corner of the image. The default unit of measurement is"
" pixels, but you can change it by using the drop-down menu. You can also "
"place the layer in the center of the image by clicking on the "
"<guibutton>Center</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Som standard placeras lagret med ändrad storlek i bildens övre vänstra hörn."
" Här kan du ange förskjutningen av lagrets övre vänstra hörn i förhållande "
"till bildens motsvarande hörn. Standardenheten är bildpunkter men kan ändras"
" i rullgardinsmenyn. Du kan även centrera lagret i bilden genom att klicka "
"på knappen <guibutton>Centrera</guibutton>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Resize current layer to image size"
msgstr "Ändra storlek på aktuellt lager till bildstorlek"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Layer to Image Size</guimenuitem> command resizes the layer"
" boundaries to match the image boundaries, without moving the contents of "
"the layer with respect to the image."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Lager till bildstorlek</guimenuitem> ändrar lagrets "
"gränser så att de motsvarar bildens gränser utan att flytta lagrets innehåll"
" i förhållande till bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guimenuitem>Layer to Image "
"Size</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guimenuitem>Lager till "
"bildstorlek</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Move current layer one position up"
msgstr "Flytta aktuellt lager en position upp"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Raise Layer</guimenuitem> command raises the active layer "
"one position in the layer stack. If the active layer is already at the top "
"or if there is only one layer, this menu entry is insensitive and grayed "
"out. If the active layer is at the bottom of the stack and it does not have "
"an alpha channel, it cannot be raised until you add an alpha channel to it."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Höj lager</guimenuitem> höjer det aktiva lagret en "
"position i lagerstacken. Om det aktiva lagret redan är överst eller om det "
"bara finns ett lager är menyalternativet inaktivt och nedtonat. Om det "
"aktiva lagret ligger längst ned i stacken och saknar alfakanal kan det inte "
"höjas förrän du lägger till en alfakanal."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Stack</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Raise"
" Layer</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Stack</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Höj"
" lager</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"or by clicking on the up-arrow icon at the bottom of the Layers dialog."
msgstr ""
"eller genom att klicka på uppåtpilsikonen längst ned i dialogrutan Lager."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Layer to Top"
msgstr "Lager överst"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Move current layer to the top of stack"
msgstr "Flytta aktuellt lager överst i stacken"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Layer to Top</guimenuitem> command raises the active layer "
"to the top of the layer stack. If the active layer is already at the top or "
"if there is only one layer, this menu entry is insensitive and grayed out. "
"If the active layer is at the bottom of the stack and it does not have an "
"alpha channel, you cannot raise it until you add an alpha channel to it."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Lager överst</guimenuitem> höjer det aktiva lagret "
"längst upp i lagerstacken. Om det aktiva lagret redan är överst eller om det"
" bara finns ett lager är menyalternativet inaktivt och nedtonat. Om det "
"aktiva lagret ligger längst ned i stacken och saknar alfakanal kan du inte "
"höja det förrän du lägger till en alfakanal."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Stack</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Layer"
" to Top</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Stack</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Lager"
" överst</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"or by pressing the <keycap>Shift</keycap> key and clicking on the up-arrow "
"icon at the bottom of the Layers dialog."
msgstr ""
"eller genom att hålla ned <keycap>Skift</keycap> och klicka på "
"uppåtpilsikonen längst ned i dialogrutan Lager."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Select Previous Layer"
msgstr "Välj föregående lager"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Previous layer"
msgstr "Föregående lager"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Select Previous Layer</guimenuitem> command selects the "
"layer just above the active layer in the layer stack. The command highlights"
" the layer in the Layers Dialog and makes it the new active layer. If the "
"active layer is already at the top of the stack, this menu entry is "
"insensitive and grayed out."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Välj föregående lager</guimenuitem> väljer lagret "
"precis ovanför det aktiva lagret i lagerstacken. Kommandot markerar lagret i"
" dialogrutan Lager och gör det till nytt aktivt lager. Om det aktiva lagret "
"redan är överst i stacken är menyalternativet inaktivt och nedtonat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Note that on a standard Windows-style English keyboard, the default shortcut"
" <keycap>Page_Up</keycap> does not refer to the key on the numeric keypad, "
"but to the other <keycap>Page_Up</keycap> key in the group of six keys to "
"the left of the numeric keypad."
msgstr ""
"Observera att standardtangentbordsgenvägen <keycap>Page_Up</keycap> på ett "
"vanligt engelskt tangentbord i Windows-stil inte avser tangenten på "
"sifferblocket, utan den andra <keycap>Page_Up</keycap>-tangenten i gruppen "
"med sex tangenter till vänster om sifferblocket."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The keyboard shortcuts for <guimenuitem>Select Previous Layer</guimenuitem> "
"and <guimenuitem>Select Next Layer</guimenuitem> may be very useful if you "
"frequently pick colors from one layer to use for painting on another layer, "
"especially when you use them with the color-picker tool, which you get by "
"holding down the <keycap>Ctrl</keycap> key with most of the painting tools."
msgstr ""
"Tangentbordsgenvägarna för <guimenuitem>Välj föregående lager</guimenuitem> "
"och <guimenuitem>Välj nästa lager</guimenuitem> kan vara mycket användbara "
"om du ofta plockar färger från ett lager för att måla på ett annat, särskilt"
" tillsammans med färgväljarverktyget, som du får genom att hålla ned "
"<keycap>Ctrl</keycap> med de flesta målningsverktyg."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Stack</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Select"
" Previous Layer</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Stack</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Välj"
" föregående lager</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "or by using the keyboard shortcut <keycap>Up</keycap>."
msgstr "eller med tangentbordsgenvägen <keycap>Upp</keycap>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/dialogs-offset-layer.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/dialogs-offset-layer.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Shift layer content"
msgstr "Förskjut lagerinnehåll"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Offset</guimenuitem> command shifts the "
"<emphasis>content</emphasis> of the active layer. Anything shifted outside "
"the layer boundary is cropped. This command displays a dialog which allows "
"you to specify how much to shift the layer and how to fill the space that is"
" left empty by shifting it."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Förskjut</guimenuitem> förskjuter "
"<emphasis>innehållet</emphasis> i det aktiva lagret. Allt som förskjuts "
"utanför lagergränsen beskärs. Kommandot visar en dialogruta där du kan ange "
"hur mycket lagret ska förskjutas och hur det tomma utrymme som uppstår ska "
"fyllas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transform</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Offset</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transformera</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Förskjut</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"or by using the keyboard shortcut "
"<keycombo><keycap>Shift</keycap><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>O</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"eller med tangentbordsgenvägen "
"<keycombo><keycap>Skift</keycap><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>O</keycap></keycombo>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Using the <quote>Offset</quote> Command"
msgstr "Använda kommandot <quote>Förskjut</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The <quote>Offset</quote> dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutan <quote>Förskjut</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "X; Y"
msgstr "X; Y"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"With these two values, you specify how far the contents of the layer should "
"be shifted in the horizontal (X) and vertical (Y) directions. You can enter "
"the offsets in the text boxes. Positive values move the layer to the right "
"and downward. The default unit is pixels, but you can choose a different "
"unit of measurement with the drop-down menu. A unit of <quote>%</quote> is "
"sometimes useful."
msgstr ""
"Med dessa två värden anger du hur långt lagerinnehållet ska förskjutas i "
"vågrät (X) och lodrät (Y) riktning. Du kan ange förskjutningarna i "
"textrutorna. Positiva värden flyttar lagret åt höger och nedåt. "
"Standardenheten är bildpunkter, men du kan välja en annan måttenhet i "
"rullgardinsmenyn. Enheten <quote>%</quote> är ibland användbar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Offset by x/2, y/2"
msgstr "Förskjut med x/2, y/2"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"With this button, you can automatically set the <guilabel>X</guilabel> and "
"<guilabel>Y</guilabel> offsets so that the contents are shifted by exactly "
"half the width and half the height of the image."
msgstr ""
"Med denna knapp kan du automatiskt ange <guilabel>X</guilabel>- och "
"<guilabel>Y</guilabel>-förskjutningarna så att innehållet förskjuts med "
"exakt halva bildens bredd och halva dess höjd."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can specify one of three ways to treat the areas left empty when the "
"contents of the layer are shifted:"
msgstr ""
"Du kan ange ett av tre sätt att hantera de områden som blir tomma när "
"lagerinnehållet förskjuts:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Wrap around</emphasis>: The empty space on one side of the layer "
"is filled with the part of the layer which is shifted out of the other side,"
" so none of the content is lost."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Radbryt</emphasis>: Det tomma utrymmet på ena sidan av lagret "
"fylls med den del av lagret som förskjuts ut på den andra sidan, så att "
"inget innehåll går förlorat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Fill with background color</emphasis>: The empty space is filled "
"with the background color, which is shown in the Color Area of the Toolbox."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Fyll med bakgrundsfärg</emphasis>: Det tomma utrymmet fylls med "
"bakgrundsfärgen som visas i verktygslådans färgområde."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Make transparent</emphasis>: The empty space is made transparent. "
"If the layer does not have an alpha channel, this choice is not available "
"(grayed out)."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Gör genomskinligt</emphasis>: Det tomma utrymmet görs "
"genomskinligt. Om lagret saknar alfakanal är detta val inte tillgängligt "
"(nedtonat)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Select Next Layer"
msgstr "Välj nästa lager"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Next layer"
msgstr "Nästa lager"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Select Next Layer</guimenuitem> command selects the layer "
"just underneath the active layer in the layer stack. The command highlights "
"the layer in the Layers Dialog and makes it the new active layer. If the "
"active layer is already at the bottom of the stack, this menu entry is "
"insensitive and grayed out."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Välj nästa lager</guimenuitem> väljer lagret precis "
"under det aktiva lagret i lagerstacken. Kommandot markerar lagret i "
"dialogrutan Lager och gör det till nytt aktivt lager. Om det aktiva lagret "
"redan är längst ned i stacken är menyalternativet inaktivt och nedtonat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Note that on a standard Windows-style English keyboard, the default shortcut"
" <keycap>Page_Down</keycap> does not refer to the key on the numeric keypad,"
" but to the other <keycap>Page_Down</keycap> key in the group of six keys to"
" the left of the numeric keypad."
msgstr ""
"Observera att standardtangentbordsgenvägen <keycap>Page_Down</keycap> på ett"
" vanligt engelskt tangentbord i Windows-stil inte avser tangenten på "
"sifferblocket, utan den andra <keycap>Page_Down</keycap>-tangenten i gruppen"
" med sex tangenter till vänster om sifferblocket."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Stack</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Select"
" Next Layer</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Stack</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Välj"
" nästa lager</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "or by using the keyboard shortcut <keycap>Down</keycap>."
msgstr "eller med tangentbordsgenvägen <keycap>Ned</keycap>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/dialogs/dialogs-new-layer.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/dialogs/dialogs-new-layer.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>New Layer</guimenuitem> command adds a new, empty layer to "
"the layer stack of the image, just above the active layer. The command "
"displays a dialog in which you can specify the size of the new layer."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Nytt lager</guimenuitem> lägger till ett nytt tomt "
"lager i bildens lagerstack, precis ovanför det aktiva lagret. Kommandot "
"visar en dialogruta där du kan ange det nya lagrets storlek."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guimenuitem>New "
"Layer</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guimenuitem>Nytt "
"lager</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Description of the <quote>New Layer</quote> Dialog"
msgstr "Beskrivning av dialogrutan <quote>Nytt lager</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The <quote>New Layer</quote> dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutan <quote>Nytt lager</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Under the title <quote>Create a new layer</quote> you can see the name of "
"the image for that you create this new layer and next to the title a "
"thumbnail of it. That is interesting to see if you have selected the good "
"image when there is more than one image open."
msgstr ""
"Under rubriken <quote>Skapa ett nytt lager</quote> ser du namnet på bilden "
"som det nya lagret skapas i och en miniatyrbild bredvid rubriken. Detta är "
"praktiskt om du vill se att rätt bild är vald när fler än en bild är öppen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Layer Name"
msgstr "Lagernamn"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The name of the new layer. It does not have any functional significance; it "
"is simply a convenient way for you to remember the purpose of the layer. The"
" default name is <quote>New Layer</quote>. If a layer with the name you "
"choose already exists, a number is automatically appended to it to make it "
"unique (e.g., <quote>New Layer#1</quote>) when you click on the "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Namnet på det nya lagret. Det har ingen funktionell betydelse utan är bara "
"ett bekvämt sätt att komma ihåg lagrets syfte. Standardnamnet är <quote>Nytt"
" lager</quote>. Om ett lager med valt namn redan finns läggs ett tal "
"automatiskt till så att namnet blir unikt (till exempel <quote>Nytt "
"lager#1</quote>) när du klickar på <guibutton>OK</guibutton>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The dimensions of the new layer. When the dialog appears, the values are "
"initialized to the dimensions of the image. You can change them by using the"
" two text boxes. You can also change the units in the pull-down menu to the "
"right."
msgstr ""
"Det nya lagrets mått. När dialogrutan visas är värdena inställda på bildens "
"mått. Du kan ändra dem i de två textrutorna. Du kan också ändra enhet i "
"rullgardinsmenyn till höger."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Layer Fill Type"
msgstr "Lagrets fyllningstyp"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"There are four options for the solid color that fills the layer: the current"
" <guilabel>Foreground color</guilabel>, the current <guilabel>Background "
"color</guilabel>, <guilabel>White</guilabel> and "
"<guilabel>Transparency</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Det finns fyra alternativ för den heldragna färg som fyller lagret: aktuell "
"<guilabel>Förgrundsfärg</guilabel>, aktuell "
"<guilabel>Bakgrundsfärg</guilabel>, <guilabel>Vit</guilabel> och "
"<guilabel>Transparens</guilabel>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "New From Visible"
msgstr "Nytt från synligt"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Create a new layer from visible layers"
msgstr "Skapa ett nytt lager från synliga lager"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This command merges the visible layers into a new layer at the top of the "
"layer stack."
msgstr ""
"Detta kommando sammanfogar de synliga lagren till ett nytt lager överst i "
"lagerstacken."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The aim is to further manipulate the result, but keep the steps that created"
" this situation. Example: You want to selectively blur some areas of your "
"multilayer image. You create a new layer from what you see, blur it and then"
" apply a layer mask to erase the parts you want your original work to show."
msgstr ""
"Syftet är att bearbeta resultatet vidare men behålla stegen som skapade "
"situationen. Exempel: Du vill göra vissa områden i en bild med flera lager "
"oskärpa. Du skapar ett nytt lager från det synliga, gör det oskarpt och "
"tillämpar sedan en lagermask för att radera de delar där originalarbetet ska"
" synas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guimenuitem>New From "
"Visible</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guimenuitem>Nytt från "
"synligt</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Merge current layer with the underlying layer"
msgstr "Sammanfoga aktuellt lager med det underliggande lagret"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Merge Down</guimenuitem> command merges the active layer "
"with the layer just below it in the stack, taking into account the various "
"properties of the active layer, such as its opacity and layer <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-concepts-layer-modes\">mode</link>. The resulting merged "
"layer will be in Normal mode, and will inherit the opacity of the layer "
"below. If the layer below is not opaque, or if it is in some mode other than"
" Normal, then this command will generally change the appearance of the "
"image."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Sammanfoga nedåt</guimenuitem> sammanfogar det aktiva"
" lagret med lagret direkt under i stacken, med hänsyn till det aktiva "
"lagrets egenskaper såsom opacitet och lager<link linkend=\"gimp-concepts-"
"layer-modes\">läge</link>. Det resulterande sammanfogade lagret får läget "
"Normal och ärver opaciteten från lagret under. Om lagret under inte är "
"ogenomskinligt eller har ett annat läge än Normal ändrar kommandot i "
"allmänhet bildens utseende."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The most common use of <guimenuitem>Merge Down</guimenuitem> is to construct"
" a layer, by starting with a <quote>base layer</quote> (usually opaque and "
"in Normal mode, so that you can see what you are doing), and adding a "
"<quote>modification layer</quote> on top of it, with whatever shape, "
"opacity, and layer mode you need. In this case, merging down the "
"modification layer will combine the two layers into one, without changing "
"the way the image looks."
msgstr ""
"Den vanligaste användningen av <guimenuitem>Sammanfoga nedåt</guimenuitem> "
"är att bygga upp ett lager genom att börja med ett <quote>baslager</quote> "
"(vanligtvis ogenomskinligt och i läget Normal så att du ser vad du gör) och "
"lägga till ett <quote>ändringslager</quote> ovanpå med den form, opacitet "
"och det lagerläge du behöver. I detta fall kombinerar en sammanfogning nedåt"
" ändringslagret med baslagret utan att ändra bildens utseende."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guimenuitem>Merge "
"Down</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guimenuitem>Sammanfoga "
"nedåt</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/menus-layer-mask.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/menus-layer-mask.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Mask"
msgstr "Mask"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenu>Mask</guimenu> submenu of the <guimenu>Layer</guimenu> menu "
"contains commands which work with masks: creating a mask, applying a mask, "
"deleting a mask or converting a mask into a selection. See the <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-layer-mask\">Layer Masks</link> section for more information "
"on layer masks and how to use them."
msgstr ""
"Undermenyn <guimenu>Mask</guimenu> i menyn <guimenu>Lager</guimenu> "
"innehåller kommandon som arbetar med masker: skapa, tillämpa, ta bort eller "
"omvandla en mask till en markering. Se avsnittet <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-"
"mask\">Lagermasker</link> för mer information om lagermasker och hur de "
"används."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this submenu from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guimenuitem>Mask</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt undermenyn från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guimenuitem>Mask</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The <guimenu>Mask</guimenu> submenu contains the following commands:"
msgstr "Undermenyn <guimenu>Mask</guimenu> innehåller följande kommandon:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Mask managing"
msgstr "Maskhantering"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Show Layer Mask (command)"
msgstr "Visa lagermask (kommando)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Show Layer Mask</guimenuitem> command lets you see the "
"layer mask better by turning the image invisible. When you click on the menu"
" entry, a check is displayed next to it and the layer mask's thumbnail in "
"the Layers Dialog is shown with a green border. The layer itself is not "
"modified; you can turn it visible again later."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Visa lagermask</guimenuitem> låter dig se lagermasken"
" bättre genom att göra bilden osynlig. När du klickar på menyalternativet "
"visas en markering intill det och lagermaskens miniatyr i dialogrutan Lager "
"visas med en grön kant. Själva lagret ändras inte; du kan göra det synligt "
"igen senare."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Mask</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Show"
" Layer Mask</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Mask</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Visa"
" lagermask</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"or by holding down the <keycap>Alt</keycap> key "
"(<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>Alt</keycap></keycombo> on some "
"systems) and single-clicking on the layer mask's thumbnail in the Layers "
"Dialog."
msgstr ""
"eller genom att hålla ned <keycap>Alt</keycap> "
"(<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>Alt</keycap></keycombo> på vissa "
"system) och enkelklicka på lagermaskens miniatyr i dialogrutan Lager."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can undo this action by unchecking the menu entry in the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guimenuitem>Mask</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
" submenu or by <keycap>Alt</keycap>-clicking (or "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>Alt</keycap></keycombo>-clicking) "
"again on the layer mask's thumbnail."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ångra åtgärden genom att avmarkera menyalternativet i undermenyn "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guimenuitem>Mask</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
" eller genom att <keycap>Alt</keycap>-klicka (eller "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>Alt</keycap></keycombo>-klicka) igen "
"på lagermaskens miniatyr."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/layer-mask-subtract.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/layer-mask-subtract.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Subtract Layer Mask from Selection"
msgstr "Subtrahera lagermask från markering"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Subtract layer mask from selection"
msgstr "Subtrahera lagermask från markering"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Subtract from Selection</guimenuitem> command converts the "
"layer mask of the active layer into a selection, which is subtracted from "
"the selection that is already active in the image. White areas of the layer "
"mask are selected, black areas are not selected, and gray areas are "
"converted into feathered selections. The layer mask itself is not modified "
"by this command."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Subtrahera från markering</guimenuitem> omvandlar det"
" aktiva lagrets lagermask till en markering som subtraheras från den "
"markering som redan är aktiv i bilden. Vita områden i lagermasken markeras, "
"svarta områden markeras inte och grå områden omvandlas till fjädrade "
"markeringar. Lagermasken ändras inte av kommandot."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Mask</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Subtract"
" from Selection</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Mask</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Subtrahera"
" från markering</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Illustration of Subtract Layer Mask from Selection"
msgstr "Illustration av att subtrahera lagermask från markering"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"On the left, the original image with a selection. In the middle, the Layers "
"Dialog with a layer mask created with the <quote>Layer's alpha "
"channel</quote> option. On the right, the result after applying <quote>Mask "
"to Selection</quote>: the selection of the non-transparent pixels of the "
"active layer is subtracted from the initial selection."
msgstr ""
"Till vänster syns ursprungsbilden med en markering. I mitten syns "
"dialogrutan Lager med en lagermask skapad med alternativet <quote>Lagrets "
"alfakanal</quote>. Till höger syns resultatet efter att <quote>Mask till "
"markering</quote> tillämpats: markeringen av det aktiva lagrets icke-"
"genomskinliga bildpunkter subtraheras från den ursprungliga markeringen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/layer-mask-replace.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/layer-mask-replace.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Mask to Selection"
msgstr "Mask till markering"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Convert layer mask to a selection"
msgstr "Omvandla lagermask till en markering"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Convert to a selection"
msgstr "Omvandla till en markering"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Mask to Selection</guimenuitem> command converts the layer "
"mask of the active layer into a selection, which replaces the selection that"
" is already active in the image. White areas of the layer mask are selected,"
" black areas are not selected, and gray areas are converted into feathered "
"selections. The layer mask itself is not modified by this command."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Mask till markering</guimenuitem> omvandlar det "
"aktiva lagrets lagermask till en markering som ersätter den markering som "
"redan är aktiv i bilden. Vita områden i lagermasken markeras, svarta områden"
" markeras inte och grå områden omvandlas till fjädrade markeringar. "
"Lagermasken ändras inte av kommandot."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Mask</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Mask"
" to Selection</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Mask</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Mask"
" till markering</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"or from the pop-up menu you get by right-clicking on the active layer in the"
" Layers Dialog."
msgstr ""
"eller från snabbmenyn som visas när du högerklickar på det aktiva lagret i "
"dialogrutan Lager."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Illustration of <quote>Layer Mask to Selection</quote>"
msgstr "Illustration av <quote>Lagermask till markering</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"On the left, the original image with a selection. In the middle, the Layers "
"Dialog with a layer mask created with the <quote>Layer's alpha "
"channel</quote> option. On the right, the result after applying <quote>Mask "
"to Selection</quote>: the selection of the non-transparent pixels of the "
"active layer replaces the initial selection."
msgstr ""
"Till vänster syns ursprungsbilden med en markering. I mitten syns "
"dialogrutan Lager med en lagermask skapad med alternativet <quote>Lagrets "
"alfakanal</quote>. Till höger syns resultatet efter att <quote>Mask till "
"markering</quote> tillämpats: markeringen av det aktiva lagrets icke-"
"genomskinliga bildpunkter ersätter den ursprungliga markeringen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/layer-mask-intersect.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/layer-mask-intersect.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Intersect Layer Mask with Selection"
msgstr "Skär lagermask med markering"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Intersect layer mask with selection"
msgstr "Skär lagermask med markering"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Intersect with selection"
msgstr "Skär med markering"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Intersect with Selection</guimenuitem> command converts the"
" layer mask of the active layer into a selection. The intersection of this "
"selection and the selection that is already active form the new selection "
"for the image. White areas of the layer mask are selected, black areas are "
"not selected, and gray areas are converted into feathered selections. The "
"layer mask itself is not modified by this command."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Skär med markering</guimenuitem> omvandlar det aktiva"
" lagrets lagermask till en markering. Snittet mellan denna markering och den"
" markering som redan är aktiv blir bildens nya markering. Vita områden i "
"lagermasken markeras, svarta områden markeras inte och grå områden omvandlas"
" till mjuka markeringar. Själva lagermasken ändras inte av detta kommando."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Mask</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Intersect"
" with Selection</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Mask</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Skär"
" med markering</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Illustration of Intersecting the Layer Mask with the Selection"
msgstr "Illustration av att skära lagermasken med markeringen"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"On the left, the original image with a selection. In the middle, the Layers "
"Dialog with a layer mask created with the <quote>Layer's alpha "
"channel</quote> option. On the right, the result after applying "
"<quote>Intersect Mask with Selection</quote>: the selection of the non-"
"transparent pixels of the active layer is the common part between the "
"initial selection and the mask."
msgstr ""
"Till vänster visas originalbilden med en markering. I mitten visas "
"lagerdialogen med en lagermask som skapats med alternativet <quote>Lagrets "
"alfakanal</quote>. Till höger visas resultatet efter att <quote>Skär mask "
"med markering</quote> tillämpats: markeringen av det aktiva lagrets icke-"
"genomskinliga bildpunkter är den gemensamma delen av den ursprungliga "
"markeringen och masken."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/layer-mask-add.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/layer-mask-add.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Add Layer Mask to Selection"
msgstr "Lägg till lagermask i markering"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Add layer mask to selection"
msgstr "Lägg till lagermask i markering"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Add to Selection</guimenuitem> command converts the layer "
"mask of the active layer into a selection, which is added to the selection "
"that is already active in the image. White areas of the layer mask are "
"selected, black areas are not selected, and gray areas are converted into "
"feathered selections. The layer mask itself is not modified by this command."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Lägg till i markering</guimenuitem> omvandlar det "
"aktiva lagrets lagermask till en markering, som läggs till den markering som"
" redan är aktiv i bilden. Vita områden i lagermasken markeras, svarta "
"områden markeras inte och grå områden omvandlas till mjuka markeringar. "
"Själva lagermasken ändras inte av detta kommando."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Mask</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Add"
" to Selection</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Mask</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Lägg"
" till i markering</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Illustration of Add Layer Mask to Selection"
msgstr "Illustration av att lägga till lagermask i markering"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"On the left, the original image with a selection. In the middle, the Layers "
"Dialog with a layer mask created with the <quote>Layer's alpha "
"channel</quote> option. On the right, the result after applying <quote>Mask "
"to Selection</quote>: the selection of the non-transparent pixels of the "
"active layer is added to the initial selection."
msgstr ""
"Till vänster visas originalbilden med en markering. I mitten visas "
"lagerdialogen med en lagermask som skapats med alternativet <quote>Lagrets "
"alfakanal</quote>. Till höger visas resultatet efter att <quote>Mask till "
"markering</quote> tillämpats: markeringen av det aktiva lagrets icke-"
"genomskinliga bildpunkter läggs till den ursprungliga markeringen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Edit Layer Mask"
msgstr "Redigera lagermask"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"When you click on the <guimenuitem>Edit Layer Mask</guimenuitem> item on the"
" <guimenu>Layer Mask</guimenu> submenu, a check is displayed next to it, the"
" layer mask becomes the active component of the current layer and the layer "
"mask is displayed in the Layers Dialog with a white border. When you uncheck"
" it, the layer itself becomes the active component and it is displayed with "
"a white border. You can also activate the component you want more simply by "
"clicking on it in the Layers Dialog."
msgstr ""
"När du klickar på <guimenuitem>Redigera lagermask</guimenuitem> på "
"undermenyn <guimenu>Lagermask</guimenu> visas en bock intill posten, "
"lagermasken blir den aktiva komponenten i det aktuella lagret och visas i "
"lagerdialogen med en vit ram. När du avmarkerar posten blir själva lagret "
"den aktiva komponenten och visas med en vit ram. Du kan också enklare "
"aktivera önskad komponent genom att klicka på den i lagerdialogen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Mask</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Edit"
" Layer Mask</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Mask</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Redigera"
" lagermask</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can undo this action by unchecking the menu entry in the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guimenuitem>Mask</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
" menu or by clicking on the layer component in the Layers Dialog."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ångra åtgärden genom att avmarkera menyposten på menyn "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guimenuitem>Mask</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
" eller genom att klicka på lagerkomponenten i lagerdialogen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"As soon as you create a layer mask, it acts on the image. The "
"<guimenuitem>Disable Layer Mask</guimenuitem> command allows you to suspend "
"this action. When you click on the menu entry, a check is displayed next to "
"it and the border of the layer mask's thumbnail in the Layers Dialog turns "
"red."
msgstr ""
"Så snart du skapar en lagermask påverkar den bilden. Med kommandot "
"<guimenuitem>Inaktivera lagermask</guimenuitem> kan du tillfälligt upphäva "
"denna påverkan. När du klickar på menyposten visas en bock intill den och "
"ramen runt lagermaskens miniatyr i lagerdialogen blir röd."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Mask</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Disable"
" Layer Mask</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Mask</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Inaktivera"
" lagermask</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"or by holding down the <keycap>Ctrl</keycap> key "
"(<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>Alt</keycap></keycombo> on some "
"systems) and single-clicking on the layer mask's thumbnail in the Layers "
"Dialog."
msgstr ""
"eller genom att hålla ned <keycap>Ctrl</keycap> "
"(<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>Alt</keycap></keycombo> på vissa "
"system) och enkelklicka på lagermaskens miniatyr i lagerdialogen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can undo this action by unchecking the menu entry in the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guimenuitem>Mask</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
" menu or by <keycap>Ctrl</keycap>-clicking (or "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>Alt</keycap></keycombo> -clicking) "
"again on the layer mask's thumbnail."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ångra åtgärden genom att avmarkera menyposten på menyn "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guimenuitem>Mask</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
" eller genom att <keycap>Ctrl</keycap>-klicka (eller "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>Alt</keycap></keycombo>-klicka) på "
"lagermaskens miniatyr igen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Delete Layer Mask</guimenuitem> command deletes the active "
"layer's layer mask, without modifying the active layer itself. If the active"
" layer does not have a layer mask, the menu entry is insensitive and grayed "
"out."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Ta bort lagermask</guimenuitem> tar bort det aktiva "
"lagrets lagermask utan att ändra själva lagret. Om det aktiva lagret saknar "
"en lagermask är menyposten inaktiv och nedtonad."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Mask</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Delete"
" Layer Mask</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Mask</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Ta"
" bort lagermask</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Apply Layer Mask (command)"
msgstr "Tillämpa lagermask (kommando)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Apply Layer Mask</guimenuitem> command merges the layer "
"mask with the current layer. The transparency information in the layer mask "
"is transferred to the alpha channel and the layer mask is removed. If the "
"active layer does not have a layer mask, the menu entry is insensitive and "
"grayed out. See the <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-mask\">Layer Masks</link> "
"section for more information."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Tillämpa lagermask</guimenuitem> sammanfogar "
"lagermasken med det aktuella lagret. Genomskinlighetsinformationen i "
"lagermasken överförs till alfakanalen och lagermasken tas bort. Om det "
"aktiva lagret saknar en lagermask är menyposten inaktiv och nedtonad. Se "
"avsnittet <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-mask\">Lagermasker</link> för mer "
"information."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Mask</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Apply"
" Layer Mask</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Mask</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Tillämpa"
" lagermask</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/dialogs/layer-mask-add.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/dialogs/layer-mask-add.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Add a mask"
msgstr "Lägg till en mask"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Add Layer Mask</guimenuitem> command adds a layer mask to "
"the active layer. It displays a dialog in which you can set the initial "
"properties of the mask. If the layer already has a layer mask, or if it "
"cannot have one because it does not have an alpha channel, the menu entry is"
" insensitive and grayed out."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Lägg till lagermask</guimenuitem> lägger till en "
"lagermask i det aktiva lagret. Det visar en dialogruta där du kan ange "
"maskens ursprungliga egenskaper. Om lagret redan har en lagermask, eller om "
"det inte kan ha en eftersom det saknar alfakanal, är menyalternativet "
"inaktivt och nedtonat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"A layer mask lets you define which parts of the layer are opaque, semi-"
"transparent or transparent. See the <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-mask\">Layer "
"Mask</link> section for more information."
msgstr ""
"Med en lagermask kan du definiera vilka delar av lagret som är "
"ogenomskinliga, halvgenomskinliga eller genomskinliga. Se avsnittet <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-layer-mask\">Lagermask</link> för mer information."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Mask</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Add"
" Layer Mask</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Mask</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Lägg"
" till lagermask</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Description of the <quote>Add Layer Mask</quote> Dialog"
msgstr "Beskrivning av dialogrutan <quote>Lägg till lagermask</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The <quote>Add Layer Mask</quote> dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutan <quote>Lägg till lagermask</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Initialize Layer Mask to"
msgstr "Initiera lagermask till"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This dialog allows you several choices for the initial contents of the layer"
" mask:"
msgstr ""
"Dialogrutan erbjuder flera val för lagermaskens ursprungliga innehåll:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "White (full opacity)"
msgstr "Vit (helt ogenomskinlig)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"With this option, the layer mask will make all of the layer fully opaque. "
"That means that you will not notice any difference in the appearance of the "
"layer until you paint on the layer mask."
msgstr ""
"Med detta alternativ gör lagermasken hela lagret helt ogenomskinligt. Du "
"märker alltså ingen skillnad i lagrets utseende förrän du målar på "
"lagermasken."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Black (full transparency)"
msgstr "Svart (helt genomskinlig)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"With this option, the layer mask will make all of the layer fully "
"transparent. This is represented in the image by a checkered pattern on "
"which you will need to paint to make any part of the layer visible."
msgstr ""
"Med detta alternativ gör lagermasken hela lagret helt genomskinligt. Detta "
"visas i bilden som ett schackrutigt mönster som du måste måla på för att "
"göra någon del av lagret synlig."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Layer's alpha channel"
msgstr "Lagrets alfakanal"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"With this option, the contents of the alpha channel are used to fill the "
"layer mask. The alpha channel itself is not altered, so the transparency of "
"partially visible areas is increased, leading to a more transparent layer."
msgstr ""
"Med detta alternativ används alfakanalens innehåll för att fylla "
"lagermasken. Själva alfakanalen ändras inte, så transparensen i delvis "
"synliga områden ökar och lagret blir mer genomskinligt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Transfer layer's alpha channel"
msgstr "Överför lagrets alfakanal"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This option sets the layer mask as the previous option, but resets the "
"layer's alpha channel to full opacity afterwards. The effect is to transfer "
"the transparency information from the alpha channel to the layer mask, "
"leaving the layer with the same appearance as before. The visibility of the "
"layer is now determined by the layer mask alone and not by the alpha "
"channel. If in doubt, select this option instead of <quote>Layer's alpha "
"channel</quote>, because it will leave the appearance unaltered."
msgstr ""
"Detta alternativ ställer in lagermasken som i föregående alternativ men "
"återställer sedan lagrets alfakanal till full opacitet. Effekten blir att "
"transparensinformationen överförs från alfakanalen till lagermasken, medan "
"lagret behåller samma utseende som tidigare. Lagrets synlighet bestäms nu "
"enbart av lagermasken och inte av alfakanalen. Om du är osäker bör du välja "
"detta alternativ i stället för <quote>Lagrets alfakanal</quote>, eftersom "
"utseendet då inte ändras."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This option converts the current selection into a layer mask, so that "
"selected areas are opaque, and unselected areas are transparent. If any "
"areas are partially selected, you can click on the <link linkend=\"gimp-"
"image-window-qmask-button\">QuickMask button</link> to help you predict what"
" the effects will be."
msgstr ""
"Detta alternativ omvandlar den aktuella markeringen till en lagermask, så "
"att markerade områden är ogenomskinliga och omarkerade områden är "
"genomskinliga. Om några områden är delvis markerade kan du klicka på knappen"
" <link linkend=\"gimp-image-window-qmask-button\">Snabbmask</link> för att "
"lättare förutse effekten."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Grayscale copy of layer"
msgstr "Gråskalekopia av lager"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This option converts the layer itself into a layer mask. It is particularly "
"useful when you plan to add new contents to the layer afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Detta alternativ omvandlar själva lagret till en lagermask. Det är särskilt "
"användbart när du planerar att lägga till nytt innehåll i lagret efteråt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"With this option the layer mask is initialized with a selection mask you "
"have created before, stored in the Channel dialog."
msgstr ""
"Med detta alternativ initieras lagermasken med en markeringsmask som du har "
"skapat tidigare och som lagras i dialogrutan Kanaler."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Invert Mask"
msgstr "Invertera mask"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If you check the <guilabel>Invert Mask</guilabel> box at the bottom of the "
"dialog, the resulting mask is inverted, so that transparent areas become "
"opaque and vice versa."
msgstr ""
"Om du markerar rutan <guilabel>Invertera mask</guilabel> längst ned i "
"dialogrutan inverteras den resulterande masken så att genomskinliga områden "
"blir ogenomskinliga och tvärtom."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"When you click on the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button, a thumbnail of the "
"layer mask appears to the right of the thumbnail of the layer in the Layers "
"Dialog."
msgstr ""
"När du klickar på knappen <guibutton>OK</guibutton> visas en miniatyr av "
"lagermasken till höger om lagrets miniatyr i dialogrutan Lager."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Lower layer</guimenuitem> command lowers the active layer "
"one position in the layer stack. If the active layer is already at the "
"bottom of the stack or if there is only one layer, this menu entry is "
"insensitive and grayed out."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Sänk lager</guimenuitem> sänker det aktiva lagret en "
"position i lagerstacken. Om det aktiva lagret redan är längst ned i stacken "
"eller om det bara finns ett lager är menyalternativet inaktivt och nedtonat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Stack</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Lower"
" Layer</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Stack</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Sänk"
" lager</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"or by clicking on the down-arrow icon at the bottom of the Layers dialog."
msgstr ""
"eller genom att klicka på nedåtpilsikonen längst ned i dialogrutan Lager."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Layer to Bottom"
msgstr "Lager längst ned"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Lower current layer to the bottom of stack"
msgstr "Sänk aktuellt lager längst ned i stacken"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Layer to bottom</guimenuitem> command lowers the active "
"layer to the bottom of the layer stack. If the active layer is already at "
"the bottom of the stack or if there is only one layer, this menu entry is "
"insensitive and grayed out."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Lager längst ned</guimenuitem> sänker det aktiva "
"lagret längst ned i lagerstacken. Om det aktiva lagret redan är längst ned i"
" stacken eller om det bara finns ett lager är menyalternativet inaktivt och "
"nedtonat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Stack</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Layer"
" to Bottom</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Stack</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Lager"
" längst ned</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"or by pressing the <keycap>Shift</keycap> key and clicking on the down-arrow"
" icon at the bottom of the Layers dialog."
msgstr ""
"eller genom att hålla ned <keycap>Skift</keycap> och klicka på "
"nedåtpilsikonen längst ned i dialogrutan Lager."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "@@image: 'images/menus/layer.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr "@@image: 'images/menus/layer.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "@@image: 'images/menus/layer-local.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr "@@image: 'images/menus/layer-local.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Introduction to the <quote>Layer</quote> Menu"
msgstr "Introduktion till menyn <quote>Lager</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The Contents of the <quote>Layer</quote> Menu"
msgstr "Innehållet i menyn <quote>Lager</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The items on the <guimenu>Layer</guimenu> menu allow you to work on layers."
msgstr ""
"Alternativen i menyn <guimenu>Lager</guimenu> låter dig arbeta med lager."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"In addition to accessing the <guimenu>Layer</guimenu> menu from the Image "
"menubar and by right-clicking on the image window, you can get to it by "
"right-clicking on the thumbnail of a layer in the Layers dialog. You can "
"also perform several of the operations on this menu by clicking on buttons "
"in the Layers dialog, for example, resizing a layer, managing layer "
"transparency and merging layers."
msgstr ""
"Utöver att komma åt menyn <guimenu>Lager</guimenu> från bildens menyrad och "
"genom att högerklicka i bildfönstret kan du nå den genom att högerklicka på "
"ett lagers miniatyr i dialogrutan Lager. Du kan också utföra flera av "
"åtgärderna i menyn genom att klicka på knappar i dialogrutan Lager, till "
"exempel ändra storlek på ett lager, hantera lagertransparens och sammanfoga "
"lager."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The Contents of the <quote>Layer</quote> local pop-menu"
msgstr "Innehållet i den lokala menyn <quote>Lager</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Flip vertically (layer)"
msgstr "Vänd lodrätt (lager)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Flip Vertically</guimenuitem> command reverses the active "
"layer vertically, that is, from top to bottom. It leaves the dimensions of "
"the layer and the pixel information unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Vänd lodrätt</guimenuitem> spegelvänder det aktiva "
"lagret lodrätt, alltså uppifrån och ned. Lagrets mått och "
"bildpunktsinformation förblir oförändrade."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transform</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Flip"
" Vertically</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transformera</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Vänd"
" lodrätt</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "@@image: 'images/menus/flip-h-1.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr "@@image: 'images/menus/flip-h-1.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "@@image: 'images/menus/flip-h-2.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr "@@image: 'images/menus/flip-h-2.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Flip horizontally (layer)"
msgstr "Vänd vågrätt (lager)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Flip Horizontally</guimenuitem> command reverses the active"
" layer horizontally, that is, from left to right. It leaves the dimensions "
"of the layer and the pixel information unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Vänd vågrätt</guimenuitem> spegelvänder det aktiva "
"lagret vågrätt, alltså från vänster till höger. Lagrets mått och "
"bildpunktsinformation förblir oförändrade."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transform</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Flip"
" Horizontally</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transformera</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Vänd"
" vågrätt</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Applying <quote>Flip Layer Horizontally</quote>"
msgstr "Tillämpa <quote>Vänd lager vågrätt</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Before applying the command"
msgstr "Innan kommandot tillämpas"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The layer after it has been flipped. It looks as if the image has been "
"reflected along the central <emphasis>vertical</emphasis> axis of the layer."
msgstr ""
"Lagret efter att det har vänts. Det ser ut som om bilden har speglats längs "
"lagrets centrala <emphasis>lodräta</emphasis> axel."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Layer duplicate"
msgstr "Lagerdubblett"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Duplicate Layer"
msgstr "Duplicera lager"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Duplicate Layer</guimenuitem> command adds a new layer to "
"the image which is a nearly identical copy of the active layer. The name of "
"the new layer is the same as the name of the original layer, but with "
"<quote> copy</quote> appended to it."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Duplicera lager</guimenuitem> lägger till ett nytt "
"lager i bilden som är en nästan identisk kopia av det aktiva lagret. Det nya"
" lagrets namn är samma som ursprungslagrets, men med <quote> kopia</quote> "
"tillagt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If you duplicate a background layer which does not have an alpha channel, "
"the new layer is provided with one. In addition, if there are any "
"<quote>parasites</quote> attached to the active layer, they are not "
"duplicated. (If your understanding of the word <quote>parasites</quote> is "
"limited to small, unpleasant creatures, please ignore the last sentence.)"
msgstr ""
"Om du duplicerar ett bakgrundslager utan alfakanal får det nya lagret en. Om"
" det finns <quote>parasiter</quote> kopplade till det aktiva lagret "
"dupliceras de inte. (Om du endast förstår <quote>parasiter</quote> som små "
"obehagliga varelser kan du ignorera den sista meningen.)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guimenuitem>Duplicate "
"Layer</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, or from the local pop-up menu that you get"
" by right-clicking on the Layer Dialog."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guimenuitem>Duplicera "
"lager</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, eller från den lokala snabbmeny som du får"
" genom att högerklicka på dialogrutan Lager."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Delete current layer"
msgstr "Ta bort aktuellt lager"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Delete Layer</guimenuitem> command deletes the current "
"layer from the image."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Ta bort lager</guimenuitem> tar bort det aktuella "
"lagret från bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guimenuitem>Delete "
"Layer</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, or from the local pop-up menu that you get"
" by right-clicking on the Layer Dialog."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guimenuitem>Ta bort "
"lager</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, eller från den lokala snabbmeny som du får"
" genom att högerklicka på dialogrutan Lager."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "@@image: 'images/menus/crop-layer.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr "@@image: 'images/menus/crop-layer.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Crop to Selection"
msgstr "Beskär till markering"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Crop according to selection"
msgstr "Beskär enligt markeringen"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Crop Layer"
msgstr "Beskär lager"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Crop to Selection</guimenuitem> command crops only the "
"active layer to the boundary of the selection by removing any strips at the "
"edge whose contents are all completely unselected. Areas which are partially"
" selected (for example, by feathering) are not cropped. If there is no "
"selection for the image, the menu entry is insensitive and grayed out."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Beskär till markering</guimenuitem> beskär endast det"
" aktiva lagret till markeringens gräns genom att ta bort remsor vid kanten "
"där innehållet är helt omarkerat. Områden som är delvis markerade, till "
"exempel med fjädring, beskärs inte. Om bilden saknar markering är "
"menyalternativet inaktivt och nedtonat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guimenuitem>Crop "
"toSelection</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guimenuitem>Beskär till "
"markering</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Applying <quote>Crop to Selection</quote>"
msgstr "Tillämpa <quote>Beskär till markering</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"On the left: before applying the command, the layer has a selection that has"
" feathered edges."
msgstr ""
"Till vänster: innan kommandot tillämpas har lagret en markering med fjädrade"
" kanter."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"On the right: after applying the command, the non-transparent pixels are not"
" cropped, even if they are only partially transparent."
msgstr ""
"Till höger: efter att kommandot tillämpats beskärs inte de icke-"
"genomskinliga bildpunkterna, även om de bara är delvis genomskinliga."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Make colors transparent"
msgstr "Gör färger genomskinliga"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This command is the same as "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transparency</guisubmenu></menuchoice>:"
" <xref linkend=\"plug-in-colortoalpha\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Detta kommando är detsamma som "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transparens</guisubmenu></menuchoice>:"
" <xref linkend=\"plug-in-colortoalpha\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Select Bottom Layer"
msgstr "Välj nedersta lagret"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Bottom layer"
msgstr "Nedersta lagret"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"With the <guimenuitem>Select Bottom Layer</guimenuitem> command, you can "
"make the bottom layer in the stack become the active layer for the image. It"
" is then highlighted in the Layers dialog. If the bottom layer of the stack "
"is already the active layer, this menu entry is insensitive and grayed out."
msgstr ""
"Med kommandot <guimenuitem>Välj nedersta lagret</guimenuitem> kan du göra "
"det nedersta lagret i stacken till bildens aktiva lager. Det markeras då i "
"dialogrutan Lager. Om det nedersta lagret redan är det aktiva lagret är "
"menyalternativet inaktivt och nedtonat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Stack</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Select"
" Bottom Layer</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Stack</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Välj"
" nedersta lagret</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "by using the keyboard shortcut <keycap>End</keycap>."
msgstr "med tangentbordsgenvägen <keycap>End</keycap>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "@@image: 'images/menus/crop-layer-1.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr "@@image: 'images/menus/crop-layer-1.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "@@image: 'images/menus/crop-layer-2.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr "@@image: 'images/menus/crop-layer-2.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Autocrop Layer"
msgstr "Beskär lager automatiskt"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Auto-crop"
msgstr "Beskär automatiskt"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Autocrop Layer</guimenuitem> command automatically crops "
"the active layer, unlike the <link linkend=\"gimp-tool-crop\">Crop "
"Tool</link>, or the <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-crop\">Crop Layer</link> "
"command which let you manually define the area to be cropped."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Beskär lager automatiskt</guimenuitem> beskär det "
"aktiva lagret automatiskt, till skillnad från <link linkend=\"gimp-tool-"
"crop\">beskärningsverktyget</link> eller kommandot <link linkend=\"gimp-"
"layer-crop\">Beskär lager</link>, där du definierar området manuellt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This command removes the largest possible area around the outside edge which"
" all has the same color. It does this by scanning the layer along a "
"horizontal line and a vertical line and cropping the layer as soon as it "
"encounters a different color, whatever its transparency."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot tar bort största möjliga område runt ytterkanten där allt har "
"samma färg. Det görs genom att lagret genomsöks längs en vågrät och en "
"lodrät linje och beskärs så snart en avvikande färg påträffas, oavsett "
"transparens."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can use this command to crop the layer to the dimensions of a subject "
"that is lost in a solid background which is too large."
msgstr ""
"Du kan använda kommandot för att beskära lagret till måtten på ett motiv som"
" är förlorat i en för stor enfärgad bakgrund."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guimenuitem>Autocrop "
"Layer</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guimenuitem>Beskär lager "
"automatiskt</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Before applying <quote>Autocrop Layer</quote>"
msgstr "Före tillämpning av <quote>Beskär lager automatiskt</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"After applying <quote>Autocrop Layer</quote>: the active layer, up, has been"
" cropped to the size of the circle it contains. Its size is reduced, and the"
" unoccupied part in the canvas is transparent, revealing the yellow and "
"green colors of the underlying layer."
msgstr ""
"Efter tillämpning av <quote>Beskär lager automatiskt</quote>: det aktiva "
"lagret ovan har beskurits till storleken på cirkeln det innehåller. Dess "
"storlek minskar och den lediga delen av arbetsytan är genomskinlig, så att "
"det underliggande lagrets gula och gröna färger syns."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Anchor the floating selection"
msgstr "Förankra den flytande markeringen"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Anchor Layer"
msgstr "Förankra lager"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If you have created a floating selection, a temporary layer, called a "
"<quote>floating layer</quote> or <quote>floating selection</quote>, is added"
" to the layer stack. As long as the floating layer persists, you can work "
"only on it. To work on the rest of the image, you must <quote>anchor</quote>"
" the floating layer to the former active layer with the <guimenuitem>Anchor "
"layer</guimenuitem> command. If the image does not contain a floating "
"selection, this menu entry is insensitive and grayed out."
msgstr ""
"Om du har skapat en flytande markering läggs ett tillfälligt lager, kallat "
"ett <quote>flytande lager</quote> eller en <quote>flytande "
"markering</quote>, till i lagerstacken. Så länge det flytande lagret finns "
"kan du endast arbeta med det. Om du vill arbeta med resten av bilden måste "
"du <quote>förankra</quote> det flytande lagret till det tidigare aktiva "
"lagret med kommandot <guimenuitem>Förankra lager</guimenuitem>. Om bilden "
"inte innehåller någon flytande markering är menyposten inaktiv och nedtonad."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If there is an active selection tool, the mouse pointer is displayed with an"
" anchor icon when it is outside of the selection."
msgstr ""
"Om ett markeringsverktyg är aktivt visas muspekaren med en ankarikon när den"
" befinner sig utanför markeringen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guimenuitem>Anchor "
"layer</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, and from the local pop-up menu you get by "
"right-clicking the Layer Dialog,"
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guimenuitem>Förankra "
"lager</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, och från den lokala snabbmeny som du får "
"genom att högerklicka i lagerdialogen,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"or by using the keyboard shortcut "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>H</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"eller med tangentbordsgenvägen "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>H</keycap></keycombo>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Alternative Ways of Anchoring a Floating Selection"
msgstr "Alternativa sätt att förankra en flytande markering"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "There are more ways to anchor a floating selection:"
msgstr "Det finns fler sätt att förankra en flytande markering:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can anchor the floating selection to the current layer the selection is "
"originating by clicking anywhere on the image except on the floating "
"selection."
msgstr ""
"Du kan förankra den flytande markeringen till det aktuella lager som "
"markeringen kommer från genom att klicka var som helst i bilden utom på den "
"flytande markeringen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Semi-flatten"
msgstr "Halvplatta ut"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Preserve anti-aliasing"
msgstr "Bevara kantutjämning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Semi-Flatten</guimenuitem> command is described in the "
"<link linkend=\"plug-in-semiflatten\">Semi-flatten</link> filter chapter. "
"The command is useful when you need an anti-aliased image with indexed "
"colors and transparency."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Halvplatta ut</guimenuitem> beskrivs i filterkapitlet"
" <link linkend=\"plug-in-semiflatten\">Halvplatta ut</link>. Kommandot är "
"användbart när du behöver en kantutjämnad bild med indexerade färger och "
"genomskinlighet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transparency</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Semi-"
"flatten</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Genomskinlighet</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Halvplatta"
" ut</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "@@image: 'images/menus/BBR.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr "@@image: 'images/menus/BBR.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/layer-alpha-sub.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/layer-alpha-sub.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Subtract non-transparent pixels from selection"
msgstr "Dra icke-genomskinliga bildpunkter från markeringen"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Subtract non-transparent pixels"
msgstr "Dra från icke-genomskinliga bildpunkter"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Subtract from Selection</guimenuitem> command creates a "
"selection in the current layer from the Alpha Channel. Opaque pixels are "
"fully selected, transparent pixels are unselected, and translucent pixels "
"are partially selected.This selection is <emphasis>subtracted</emphasis> "
"from the existing selection. The Alpha channel itself is not changed."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Dra från markering</guimenuitem> skapar en markering "
"i det aktuella lagret från alfakanalen. Ogenomskinliga bildpunkter markeras "
"helt, genomskinliga bildpunkter avmarkeras och halvgenomskinliga bildpunkter"
" markeras delvis. Denna markering <emphasis>dras från</emphasis> den "
"befintliga markeringen. Själva alfakanalen ändras inte."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transparency</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Subtract"
" from Selection</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Genomskinlighet</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Dra"
" från markering</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Applying <quote>Subtract from Selection</quote>"
msgstr "Tillämpa <quote>Dra från markering</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Non-transparent pixels of the active layer have been subtracted from the "
"existing rectangular selection."
msgstr ""
"Det aktiva lagrets icke-genomskinliga bildpunkter har dragits från den "
"befintliga rektangulära markeringen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/layer-alpha-replace.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/layer-alpha-replace.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Selection according to opacity"
msgstr "Markering efter opacitet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "According to opacity"
msgstr "Efter opacitet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Alpha to Selection</guimenuitem> command creates a "
"selection in the current layer from the alpha channel, which encodes "
"transparency. Opaque areas are fully selected, transparent areas are "
"unselected, and translucent areas are partially selected. This selection "
"<emphasis>replaces</emphasis> the existing selection. The alpha channel "
"itself is not changed."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Alfa till markering</guimenuitem> skapar en markering"
" i det aktuella lagret från alfakanalen, som kodar genomskinlighet. "
"Ogenomskinliga områden markeras helt, genomskinliga områden avmarkeras och "
"halvgenomskinliga områden markeras delvis. Denna markering "
"<emphasis>ersätter</emphasis> den befintliga markeringen. Själva alfakanalen"
" ändras inte."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The other commands in this group of operations are similar, except that "
"instead of completely replacing the existing selection with the selection "
"produced from the alpha channel, they either add the two selections, "
"subtract the alpha selection from the existing selection, or create a "
"selection that is the intersection of the two."
msgstr ""
"De andra kommandona i den här gruppen med åtgärder liknar detta, förutom att"
" de i stället för att helt ersätta den befintliga markeringen med den "
"markering som skapas från alfakanalen antingen lägger ihop de två "
"markeringarna, drar alfamarkeringen från den befintliga markeringen eller "
"skapar en markering som är snittet mellan de två."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transparency</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Alpha"
" to Selection</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Genomskinlighet</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Alfa"
" till markering</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"or from the pop-up menu which appears when you right-click on the active "
"layer in the Layer Dialog."
msgstr ""
"eller från snabbmenyn som visas när du högerklickar på det aktiva lagret i "
"lagerdialogen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Applying <quote>Alpha to Selection</quote>"
msgstr "Tillämpa <quote>Alfa till markering</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Non-transparent pixels of the active layer have replaced the existing "
"rectangular selection."
msgstr ""
"Det aktiva lagrets icke-genomskinliga bildpunkter har ersatt den befintliga "
"rektangulära markeringen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/layer-alpha-intersect.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/layer-alpha-intersect.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Intersect Alpha channel with Selection"
msgstr "Skär alfakanal med markering"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Intersect non-transparent areas with selection"
msgstr "Skär icke-genomskinliga områden med markering"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Intersect with Alpha channel"
msgstr "Skär med alfakanal"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Intersect with Selection</guimenuitem> command creates a "
"selection in the current layer from the Alpha Channel. Opaque pixels are "
"fully selected, transparent pixels are unselected, and translucent pixels "
"are partially selected. This selection is <emphasis>intersected</emphasis> "
"with the existing selection: only common parts of both selections are kept. "
"The alpha channel itself is not changed."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Skär med markering</guimenuitem> skapar en markering "
"i det aktuella lagret från alfakanalen. Ogenomskinliga bildpunkter markeras "
"helt, genomskinliga bildpunkter avmarkeras och halvgenomskinliga bildpunkter"
" markeras delvis. Denna markering <emphasis>skärs</emphasis> med den "
"befintliga markeringen: bara de delar som är gemensamma för båda "
"markeringarna behålls. Själva alfakanalen ändras inte."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transparency</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Intersect"
" with Selection</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Genomskinlighet</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Skär"
" med markering</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"or from the pop-up menu which appears when you right-click on the active "
"layer in the Layers Dialog."
msgstr ""
"eller från snabbmenyn som visas när du högerklickar på det aktiva lagret i "
"lagerdialogen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Applying <quote>Intersect with Selection</quote>"
msgstr "Tillämpa <quote>Skär med markering</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Non-transparent pixels of the active layer have been intersected with the "
"existing rectangular selection."
msgstr ""
"Det aktiva lagrets icke-genomskinliga bildpunkter har skurits med den "
"befintliga rektangulära markeringen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/layer-alpha-add.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/menus/layer-alpha-add.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Add Alpha channel to Selection"
msgstr "Lägg till alfakanal i markering"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Add non-transparent areas to selection"
msgstr "Lägg till icke-genomskinliga områden i markering"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Add to Selection</guimenuitem> command creates a selection "
"in the current layer from the Alpha Channel. Opaque pixels are fully "
"selected, transparent pixels are unselected, and translucent pixels are "
"partially selected. This selection is <emphasis>added</emphasis> to the "
"existing selection. The alpha channel itself is not changed."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Lägg till i markering</guimenuitem> skapar en "
"markering i det aktuella lagret från alfakanalen. Ogenomskinliga bildpunkter"
" markeras helt, genomskinliga bildpunkter avmarkeras och halvgenomskinliga "
"bildpunkter markeras delvis. Denna markering <emphasis>läggs till</emphasis>"
" den befintliga markeringen. Själva alfakanalen ändras inte."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The other commands in this group of operations are similar, except that "
"instead of adding to the existing selection with the selection produced from"
" the active layer, they either completely replace the selection with a "
"selection produced from the alpha selection, subtract the alpha selection "
"from the existing selection, or create a selection that is the intersection "
"of the two."
msgstr ""
"De andra kommandona i den här gruppen med åtgärder liknar detta, förutom att"
" de i stället för att lägga till den befintliga markeringen med den "
"markering som skapas från det aktiva lagret antingen helt ersätter "
"markeringen med en markering som skapas från alfamarkeringen, drar "
"alfamarkeringen från den befintliga markeringen eller skapar en markering "
"som är snittet mellan de två."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transparency</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Add"
" to Selection</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Genomskinlighet</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Lägg"
" till i markering</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Non-transparent pixels of the active layer have been added to the existing "
"selection."
msgstr ""
"Det aktiva lagrets icke-genomskinliga bildpunkter har lagts till den "
"befintliga markeringen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Remove Alpha channel"
msgstr "Ta bort alfakanal"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This command removes the Alpha channel of the active layer, keeping the Apha"
" channels of the other layers."
msgstr ""
"Det här kommandot tar bort det aktiva lagrets alfakanal men behåller de "
"andra lagrens alfakanaler."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If the active layer is the background layer and if you have not added an "
"Alpha channel before (then the layer name is in bold letters in the Layer "
"Dialog), the command is grayed out, inactive."
msgstr ""
"Om det aktiva lagret är bakgrundslagret och du inte tidigare har lagt till "
"en alfakanal (då visas lagernamnet med fet stil i lagerdialogen), är "
"kommandot nedtonat och inaktivt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If the active layer is not the background layer, transparency is replaced "
"with the background color of the Toolbox."
msgstr ""
"Om det aktiva lagret inte är bakgrundslagret ersätts genomskinligheten med "
"verktygslådans bakgrundsfärg."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transparency</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Remove"
" Alpha Channel</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, and from the local pop-up submenu"
" you get by right-clicking the Layer Dialog."
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Genomskinlighet</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Ta"
" bort alfakanal</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, och från den lokala "
"snabbundermeny som du får genom att högerklicka i lagerdialogen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Add Alpha channel to background layer"
msgstr "Lägg till alfakanal till bakgrundslager"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Add Alpha channel"
msgstr "Lägg till alfakanal"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Add Alpha Channel</guimenuitem>: An alpha channel is "
"automatically added into the Channel Dialog as soon as you add a second "
"layer to your image. It represents the transparency of the image. If your "
"image has only one layer, this background layer has no Alpha channel. In "
"this case, you can Add an Alpha channel with this command."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Lägg till alfakanal</guimenuitem>: En alfakanal läggs "
"automatiskt till i kanaldialogen så snart du lägger till ett andra lager i "
"bilden. Den representerar bildens genomskinlighet. Om bilden bara har ett "
"lager saknar detta bakgrundslager alfakanal. I så fall kan du lägga till en "
"alfakanal med det här kommandot."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transparency</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Add"
" alpha Channel</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, and from the local pop-up submenu"
" you get by right-clicking the Layer Dialog."
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Genomskinlighet</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Lägg"
" till alfakanal</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, och från den lokala "
"snabbundermeny som du får genom att högerklicka i lagerdialogen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "@@image: 'images/menus/view-zoom.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr "@@image: 'images/menus/view-zoom.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The <quote>Zoom</quote> submenu of the <quote>View</quote> menu"
msgstr "Undermenyn <quote>Zoom</quote> på menyn <quote>Visa</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Zoom</guimenuitem> submenu contains various commands which "
"affect the magnification of the image in the image window (zooming). "
"Enlarging an image (zooming in) is useful if you need to work with high "
"precision, making pixel-level image modifications or precise selections. On "
"the other hand, reducing an image (zooming out) is handy for getting an "
"overall impression of the image and seeing the results of changes which "
"affect the entire image. Please note that zooming is not undoable, since it "
"does not affect the image data, only the way it is displayed."
msgstr ""
"Undermenyn <guimenuitem>Zoom</guimenuitem> innehåller olika kommandon som "
"påverkar bildens förstoring i bildfönstret. Att förstora en bild är "
"användbart när du behöver arbeta med hög precision, göra ändringar av "
"bildpunkter eller skapa exakta markeringar. Att förminska en bild är däremot"
" praktiskt för att få ett helhetsintryck av bilden och se resultatet av "
"ändringar som påverkar hela bilden. Observera att zoomning inte kan ångras, "
"eftersom den inte påverkar bilddata utan bara hur bilden visas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Besides the entries in this submenu, there is also a zoom pull-down menu at "
"the bottom edge of the image window (if the <link linkend=\"gimp-view-show-"
"statusbar\">status bar</link> is displayed), where several preset zoom "
"levels are available."
msgstr ""
"Förutom posterna på denna undermeny finns även en rullgardinsmeny för zoom "
"vid bildfönstrets nederkant (om <link linkend=\"gimp-view-show-"
"statusbar\">statusraden</link> visas), där flera förinställda zoomnivåer "
"finns."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can also make settings regarding zooming in the <link linkend=\"gimp-"
"navigation-dialog\">Navigation dialog</link>. You can also use the <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-tool-zoom\">Magnify</link> tool which lets you zoom a "
"particular area of the image."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också göra inställningar för zoomning i <link linkend=\"gimp-"
"navigation-dialog\">navigeringsdialogen</link>. Du kan även använda "
"verktyget <link linkend=\"gimp-tool-zoom\">Förstora</link>, som låter dig "
"zooma ett visst område av bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Activate the Submenu"
msgstr "Aktivera undermenyn"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this submenu from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guisubmenu>Zoom</guisubmenu></menuchoice>."
" Note that the <quote>Zoom</quote> label on the <quote>View</quote> menu "
"shows the current zoom factor, for example, <guilabel>Zoom "
"(100%)</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Du når denna undermeny från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Visa</guimenu><guisubmenu>Zoom</guisubmenu></menuchoice>."
" Observera att etiketten <quote>Zoom</quote> på menyn <quote>Visa</quote> "
"visar den aktuella zoomfaktorn, till exempel <guilabel>Zoom (100 "
"%)</guilabel>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Contents of the <quote>Zoom</quote> submenu"
msgstr "Innehållet på undermenyn <quote>Zoom</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The various <quote>Zoom</quote> submenu commands are described below, along "
"with their default keyboard shortcuts, if any."
msgstr ""
"De olika kommandona på undermenyn <quote>Zoom</quote> beskrivs nedan, "
"tillsammans med deras eventuella standardtangentbordsgenvägar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Revert Zoom"
msgstr "Återställ zoom"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"(Shortcut: <keycap>`</keycap> [grave accent,<quote>backtick</quote>]) This "
"command will reset the zoom factor to the previous value, which is also "
"shown by this label, for example <guilabel>Revert Zoom (100%)</guilabel>. If"
" you never changed the zoom factor of the active image, this entry is "
"insensitive and grayed out."
msgstr ""
"(Genväg: <keycap>`</keycap> [grav accent, <quote>backtick</quote>]) Det här "
"kommandot återställer zoomfaktorn till det föregående värdet, som också "
"visas i etiketten, till exempel <guilabel>Återställ zoom (100 %)</guilabel>."
" Om du aldrig har ändrat zoomfaktorn för den aktiva bilden är posten inaktiv"
" och nedtonad."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"(Shortcut: <keycap>-</keycap>) Each time <quote>Zoom Out</quote> is used, "
"the zoom factor is decreased by about 30%. There is a minimum zoom level of "
"0.39%."
msgstr ""
"(Genväg: <keycap>-</keycap>) Varje gång <quote>Zooma ut</quote> används "
"minskas zoomfaktorn med ungefär 30 %. Den lägsta zoomnivån är 0,39 %."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"(Shortcut: <keycap>+</keycap>) Each time <quote>Zoom In</quote> is used, the"
" zoom factor is increased by about 30%. The maximum possible zoom level is "
"25600%."
msgstr ""
"(Genväg: <keycap>+</keycap>) Varje gång <quote>Zooma in</quote> används ökas"
" zoomfaktorn med ungefär 30 %. Högsta möjliga zoomnivå är 25 600 %."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The keyboard shortcut for <quote>Zoom In</quote> has been somewhat "
"controversial because this is a very common operation and on English "
"keyboards, the <keycap>Shift</keycap> key must be pressed to use it. (This "
"is not the case for European keyboards.) If you would like to have a "
"different keyboard shortcut, you can create a dynamic shortcut for it; see "
"the help section for <link linkend=\"gimp-prefs-interface\">User Interface "
"Preferences</link> for instructions."
msgstr ""
"Tangentbordsgenvägen för <quote>Zooma in</quote> har varit något "
"omdiskuterad eftersom detta är en mycket vanlig åtgärd och du på engelska "
"tangentbord måste trycka ned <keycap>Skift</keycap> för att använda den. "
"(Detta gäller inte för europeiska tangentbord.) Om du vill ha en annan "
"tangentbordsgenväg kan du skapa en dynamisk genväg; se hjälpavsnittet för "
"<link linkend=\"gimp-prefs-interface\">Inställningar för "
"användargränssnittet</link> för instruktioner."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Fit Image in Window"
msgstr "Anpassa bild i fönster"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"(Shortcut: "
"<keycombo><keycap>Shift</keycap><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>E</keycap></keycombo>)."
" This command zooms the image to be as large as possible, while still "
"keeping it completely within the window. There will usually be padding on "
"two sides of the image, but not on all four sides."
msgstr ""
"(Genväg: "
"<keycombo><keycap>Skift</keycap><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>E</keycap></keycombo>)."
" Det här kommandot zoomar bilden så stor som möjligt, men ser samtidigt till"
" att hela bilden ryms i fönstret. Vanligtvis blir det marginaler på två av "
"bildens sidor, men inte på alla fyra."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Fit Image to Window"
msgstr "Anpassa bild till fönster"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This command zooms the image as large as possible without requiring any "
"padding to be shown. This means that the image fits the window perfectly in "
"one dimension, but usually extends beyond the window borders in the other "
"dimension."
msgstr ""
"Det här kommandot zoomar bilden så stor som möjligt utan att några "
"marginaler behöver visas. Det innebär att bilden passar fönstret exakt i en "
"dimension, men vanligtvis sträcker sig utanför fönsterkanterna i den andra "
"dimensionen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "A:B (X%)"
msgstr "A:B (X %)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"With these commands, you can select one of the pre-set zoom levels. Each of "
"the menu labels gives a ratio, as well as a percentage value. The 100% zoom "
"level has a simple keyboard shortcut: <keycap>1</keycap>."
msgstr ""
"Med dessa kommandon kan du välja en av de förinställda zoomnivåerna. Varje "
"menyetikett anger både ett förhållande och ett procentvärde. Zoomnivån 100 %"
" har en enkel tangentbordsgenväg: <keycap>1</keycap>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This command brings up a dialog which allows you to choose any zoom level "
"you would like, within the range of 1:256 (0.39%) to 256:1 (25600%)."
msgstr ""
"Det här kommandot öppnar en dialogruta där du kan välja önskad zoomnivå i "
"intervallet 1:256 (0,39 %) till 256:1 (25 600 %)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"When you are working at the pixel level, you can use the <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-view-new\">New view</link> command. This allows you to see "
"what is happening to the image at its normal size at the same time."
msgstr ""
"När du arbetar på bildpunktsnivå kan du använda kommandot <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-view-new\">Ny vy</link>. Då kan du samtidigt se vad som "
"händer med bilden i dess normala storlek."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Snap to Active Path"
msgstr "Fäst mot aktiv slinga"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Snap to active path"
msgstr "Fäst mot aktiv slinga"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, when you move a selection or a layer, they appear"
" to pull on the next anchor point of the active path when it approaches. "
"This is useful for accurate placement of image elements."
msgstr ""
"Om alternativet är aktiverat verkar en markering eller ett lager dras mot "
"nästa ankarpunkt på den aktiva slingan när det kommer nära den. Detta är "
"användbart för exakt placering av bildelement."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Snap to "
"Path</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Visa</guimenu><guimenuitem>Fäst mot "
"slinga</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Snap to Guides"
msgstr "Fäst mot hjälplinjer"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Snap to Guides</guimenuitem> command enables and disables "
"snap to guides. When snap to guides is enabled, the guides you set (see "
"<link linkend=\"gimp-view-show-guides\">Show Guides</link>) almost seems "
"magnetic; when you move a layer or selection, the guides appear to pull on "
"it when it approaches. This is enormously useful for accurate placement of "
"image elements."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Fäst mot hjälplinjer</guimenuitem> aktiverar och "
"inaktiverar fästning mot hjälplinjer. När fästning mot hjälplinjer är "
"aktiverad verkar de hjälplinjer du har ställt in (se <link linkend=\"gimp-"
"view-show-guides\">Visa hjälplinjer</link>) nästan magnetiska; när du "
"flyttar ett lager eller en markering verkar hjälplinjerna dra den till sig "
"när den kommer nära. Detta är mycket användbart för exakt placering av "
"bildelement."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Snap to "
"Guides</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Visa</guimenu><guimenuitem>Fäst mot "
"hjälplinjer</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Snap to Grid"
msgstr "Fäst mot rutnät"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Snap to Grid</guimenuitem> command enables and disables "
"snap to grid. When snap to grid is enabled, the grid you set (see <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-view-show-grid\">Show Grid</link>) almost seems magnetic; "
"when you move a layer or selection, the grid points appear to pull on it "
"when it approaches. This is enormously useful for accurate placement of "
"image elements."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Fäst mot rutnät</guimenuitem> aktiverar och "
"inaktiverar fästning mot rutnät. När fästning mot rutnät är aktiverad verkar"
" det rutnät du har ställt in (se <link linkend=\"gimp-view-show-grid\">Visa "
"rutnät</link>) nästan magnetiskt; när du flyttar ett lager eller en "
"markering verkar rutnätets punkter dra den till sig när den kommer nära. "
"Detta är mycket användbart för exakt placering av bildelement."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Snap to "
"Grid</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Visa</guimenu><guimenuitem>Fäst mot "
"rutnät</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Snap to Canvas"
msgstr "Fäst mot arbetsyta"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Snap to canvas"
msgstr "Fäst mot arbetsyta"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, when you move a selection or a layer, they appear"
" to pull on the canvas edges when it approaches. This is useful for accurate"
" placement of image elements."
msgstr ""
"Om alternativet är aktiverat verkar en markering eller ett lager dras mot "
"arbetsytans kanter när det kommer nära dem. Detta är användbart för exakt "
"placering av bildelement."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Canvas edges are usually mingled with image edges: the canvas has, then, the"
" same size as the image. But you can change canvas size in "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Image</guimenu><guimenuitem>Canvas "
"Size</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Arbetsytans kanter sammanfaller vanligtvis med bildens kanter: arbetsytan "
"har då samma storlek som bilden. Du kan dock ändra arbetsytans storlek via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Bild</guimenu><guimenuitem>Arbetsytans "
"storlek</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Snap to "
"Canvas</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Visa</guimenu><guimenuitem>Fäst mot "
"arbetsyta</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Shrink Wrap"
msgstr "Anpassa fönster till bild"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Shrink Wrap</guimenuitem> command resizes the window so "
"that it is exactly the same size as the image at the current zoom factor. If"
" the image doesn't completely fit on the screen, the image window is "
"enlarged so that the largest possible part of the image is shown. Please "
"note that <acronym>GIMP</acronym> will do this automatically if you set the "
"<quote>Resize window on zoom</quote> and <quote>Resize window on image size "
"change</quote> options in the <link linkend=\"gimp-prefs-image-"
"window\">Image Window</link> page of the Preferences dialog."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Anpassa fönster till bild</guimenuitem> ändrar "
"fönstrets storlek så att den exakt motsvarar bildens storlek vid den "
"aktuella zoomfaktorn. Om bilden inte ryms helt på skärmen förstoras "
"bildfönstret så att största möjliga del av bilden visas. Observera att "
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> gör detta automatiskt om du anger alternativen "
"<quote>Ändra fönsterstorlek vid zoomning</quote> och <quote>Ändra "
"fönsterstorlek vid ändring av bildstorlek</quote> på sidan <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-prefs-image-window\">Bildfönster</link> i "
"inställningsdialogrutan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Please note also that the behavior described here is not performed by "
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> itself, but by the <quote>window manager</quote>, a "
"part of the operating system of your computer. For that reason, the "
"functionality described may be different on your computer, or in the worst "
"case, might not be available at all."
msgstr ""
"Observera också att beteendet som beskrivs här inte utförs av "
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> självt, utan av <quote>fönsterhanteraren</quote>, "
"som är en del av datorns operativsystem. Därför kan funktionen fungera "
"annorlunda på din dator eller i värsta fall inte vara tillgänglig alls."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Shrink "
"Wrap</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Visa</guimenu><guimenuitem>Anpassa fönster till "
"bild</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"or by using the keyboard shortcut "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>E</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"eller med tangentbordsgenvägen "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>E</keycap></keycombo>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Show Statusbar"
msgstr "Visa statusrad"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Show/Hide status bar"
msgstr "Visa/dölj statusrad"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Show Statusbar</guimenuitem> command enables and disables "
"displaying the status bar. It may be useful to disable it when you are "
"working in <link linkend=\"gimp-view-fullscreen\">full-screen mode</link>."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Visa statusrad</guimenuitem> aktiverar och "
"inaktiverar visningen av statusraden. Det kan vara praktiskt att inaktivera "
"den när du arbetar i <link linkend=\"gimp-view-"
"fullscreen\">helskärmsläge</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can set the default for the status bar in the <link linkend=\"gimp-"
"prefs-image-window\">Image Window Appearance</link> dialog."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ange standardinställningen för statusraden i dialogrutan <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-prefs-image-window\">Bildfönstrets utseende</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Show "
"Statusbar</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Visa</guimenu><guimenuitem>Visa "
"statusrad</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Selection boundary"
msgstr "Markeringskant"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Show/Mask selection boundary"
msgstr "Visa/dölj markeringskant"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Show Selection</guimenuitem> command enables and disables "
"displaying the dotted line surrounding the selection in the image window. "
"Please note that the selection still exists, even if displaying this line is"
" disabled."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Visa markering</guimenuitem> aktiverar och "
"inaktiverar visningen av den streckade linje som omger markeringen i "
"bildfönstret. Observera att markeringen fortfarande finns även om visningen "
"av denna linje är inaktiverad."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can set the default for displaying the selection in the <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-prefs-image-window\">Image Window Appearance</link> dialog."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ange standardinställningen för visning av markeringen i dialogrutan "
"<link linkend=\"gimp-prefs-image-window\">Bildfönstrets utseende</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Show "
"Selection</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Visa</guimenu><guimenuitem>Visa "
"markering</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"or by using the keyboard shortcut "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>T</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"eller med tangentbordsgenvägen "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>T</keycap></keycombo>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Show Scrollbars"
msgstr "Visa rullningslister"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Scroll-bars"
msgstr "Rullningslister"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Show/Mask scrollbars"
msgstr "Visa/dölj rullningslister"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Show Scrollbars</guimenuitem> command enables and disables "
"displaying the scrollbars. It may be useful to disable them if you are "
"working in <link linkend=\"gimp-view-fullscreen\">full-screen mode</link>."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Visa rullningslister</guimenuitem> aktiverar och "
"inaktiverar visningen av rullningslisterna. Det kan vara praktiskt att "
"inaktivera dem när du arbetar i <link linkend=\"gimp-view-"
"fullscreen\">helskärmsläge</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can set the default for the scrollbars in the <link linkend=\"gimp-"
"prefs-image-window\">Image Window Appearance</link> dialog."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ange standardinställningen för rullningslisterna i dialogrutan <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-prefs-image-window\">Bildfönstrets utseende</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Show "
"Scrollbars</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Visa</guimenu><guimenuitem>Visa "
"rullningslister</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Show Sample Points"
msgstr "Visa samplingspunkter"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This command enables and disables showing the sample points in the image "
"window. Sample points are used to display color informations of up to four "
"pixels in the <link linkend=\"gimp-sample-point-dialog\">sample points "
"dialog</link>."
msgstr ""
"Det här kommandot aktiverar och inaktiverar visning av samplingspunkterna i "
"bildfönstret. Samplingspunkter används för att visa färginformation för upp "
"till fyra bildpunkter i <link linkend=\"gimp-sample-point-"
"dialog\">samplingspunktsdialogen</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Show Sample "
"Points</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Visa</guimenu><guimenuitem>Visa "
"samplingspunkter</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Show Rulers"
msgstr "Visa linjaler"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Rulers"
msgstr "Linjaler"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Show/Mask rulers"
msgstr "Visa/dölj linjaler"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Show Rulers</guimenuitem> command enables and disables "
"displaying the rulers. It may be useful to disable them if you are working "
"in <link linkend=\"gimp-view-fullscreen\">full-screen mode</link>."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Visa linjaler</guimenuitem> aktiverar och inaktiverar"
" visningen av linjalerna. Det kan vara praktiskt att inaktivera dem när du "
"arbetar i <link linkend=\"gimp-view-fullscreen\">helskärmsläge</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can set the default for the rulers in the <link linkend=\"gimp-prefs-"
"image-window\">Image Window Appearance</link> dialog."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ange standardinställningen för linjalerna i dialogrutan <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-prefs-image-window\">Bildfönstrets utseende</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Show "
"Rulers</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Visa</guimenu><guimenuitem>Visa "
"linjaler</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"or by using the keyboard shortcut "
"<keycombo><keycap>Shift</keycap><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>R</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"eller med tangentbordsgenvägen "
"<keycombo><keycap>Skift</keycap><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>R</keycap></keycombo>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Show Menubar"
msgstr "Visa menyrad"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Menu-bar"
msgstr "Menyrad"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Show/Mask menu bar"
msgstr "Visa/dölj menyrad"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Show Menubar</guimenuitem> command enables and disables "
"displaying the menubar. It may be useful to disable it if you are working in"
" <link linkend=\"gimp-view-fullscreen\">full-screen mode</link>. If the "
"menubar is not displayed, you can right-click on the image to access the "
"menubar entries."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Visa menyrad</guimenuitem> aktiverar och inaktiverar "
"visningen av menyraden. Det kan vara praktiskt att inaktivera den när du "
"arbetar i <link linkend=\"gimp-view-fullscreen\">helskärmsläge</link>. Om "
"menyraden inte visas kan du högerklicka på bilden för att nå menyradens "
"poster."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can set the default for the menubar in the <link linkend=\"gimp-prefs-"
"image-window\">Image Window Appearance</link> dialog."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ange standardinställningen för menyraden i dialogrutan <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-prefs-image-window\">Bildfönstrets utseende</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Show "
"Menubar</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Visa</guimenu><guimenuitem>Visa "
"menyrad</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Show Layer Boundary"
msgstr "Visa lagerkant"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Layer boundary"
msgstr "Lagerkant"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Show/mask layer boundary"
msgstr "Visa/dölj lagerkant"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Show Layer Boundary</guimenuitem> command enables and "
"disables displaying the yellow dotted line that surrounds a layer in the "
"image window. The dotted line is actually only visible when the layer is "
"smaller than the image window. When the layer is the same size as the image "
"window, the layer boundary is obscured by the image border."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Visa lagerkant</guimenuitem> aktiverar och "
"inaktiverar visningen av den gula streckade linje som omger ett lager i "
"bildfönstret. Den streckade linjen syns i praktiken bara när lagret är "
"mindre än bildfönstret. När lagret har samma storlek som bildfönstret döljs "
"lagerkanten av bildens kant."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can set the default for the layer boundary in the <link linkend=\"gimp-"
"prefs-image-window\">Image Window Appearance</link> dialog."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ange standardinställningen för lagerkanten i dialogrutan <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-prefs-image-window\">Bildfönstrets utseende</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Show Layer "
"Boundary</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Visa</guimenu><guimenuitem>Visa "
"lagerkant</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Show Guides"
msgstr "Visa hjälplinjer"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Show/Mask Guides"
msgstr "Visa/dölj hjälplinjer"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Show Guides</guimenuitem> command enables and disables "
"displaying of <link linkend=\"glossary-guides\">Guides</link> in the image "
"window."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Visa hjälplinjer</guimenuitem> aktiverar och "
"inaktiverar visningen av <link linkend=\"glossary-"
"guides\">hjälplinjer</link> i bildfönstret."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can set the default for the guides in the <link linkend=\"gimp-prefs-"
"image-window\">Image Window Appearance</link> dialog."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ange standardinställningen för hjälplinjerna i dialogrutan <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-prefs-image-window\">Bildfönstrets utseende</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
