#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Padding Color"
msgstr "Arbetsytans färg"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Padding color of canvas"
msgstr "Arbetsytans färg"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Padding color"
msgstr "Arbetsytans färg"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Contents of the <quote>Padding Color</quote> submenu"
msgstr "Innehållet på undermenyn <quote>Arbetsytans färg</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can change the color of the canvas which surrounds the image by using "
"the <guimenuitem>Padding Color</guimenuitem> command. The canvas is the "
"surface the image lies on. It looks like a frame around the image in the "
"image window. This is just a matter of personal preference, since the "
"padding color does not have any effect on the image itself. Please note that"
" this color is not the same as the color used by the Fill tool."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ändra färgen på den arbetsyta som omger bilden med kommandot "
"<guimenuitem>Arbetsytans färg</guimenuitem>. Arbetsytan är den yta som "
"bilden ligger på. Den ser ut som en ram runt bilden i bildfönstret. Det är "
"bara en fråga om personlig smak, eftersom arbetsytans färg inte påverkar "
"själva bilden. Observera att denna färg inte är samma som den färg som "
"används av fyllverktyget."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Activating the submenu"
msgstr "Aktivera undermenyn"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this submenu from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Padding "
"Color</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du når denna undermeny från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Visa</guimenu><guimenuitem>Arbetsytans "
"färg</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<quote>Padding Color</quote> Options"
msgstr "Alternativ för <quote>Arbetsytans färg</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "From Theme"
msgstr "Från tema"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The color of the theme defined in <link linkend=\"gimp-prefs-"
"theme\">Preferences Theme</link> is used."
msgstr ""
"Färgen från det tema som angetts i <link linkend=\"gimp-prefs-"
"theme\">Inställningarnas tema</link> används."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Light/Dark Check Color"
msgstr "Ljus/mörk schackrutig färg"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The check representing transparency, which is defined in <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-prefs-display\">Preferences Display</link> is used."
msgstr ""
"Det schackmönster som representerar genomskinlighet och angetts i <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-prefs-display\">Inställningarnas visning</link> används."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Select Custom Color"
msgstr "Välj anpassad färg"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Opens the Color Selector window to let you choose a color to use."
msgstr "Öppnar färgväljarfönstret där du kan välja en färg att använda."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "As in Preferences"
msgstr "Som i inställningarna"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The color selected in the <link linkend=\"gimp-prefs-image-window-"
"appearance\">Image Window Appearance</link> is used."
msgstr ""
"Färgen som valts i <link linkend=\"gimp-prefs-image-window-"
"appearance\">Bildfönstrets utseende</link> används."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "New View"
msgstr "Ny vy"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>New View</guimenuitem> command creates a new image window "
"for the current image, which you can set up differently from the existing "
"display. You can create multiple views of any image, which are numbered .1, "
".2, etc., but only the zoom factor and other viewing options may be "
"different. Any changes, other than viewing changes, which you make in one "
"window also appear in the other displays which show the same image. The new "
"views are not separate image files; they are simply different aspects of the"
" same image. You might use multiple views, for example, if you were working "
"on individual pixels at a high zoom factor. You could then see the effects "
"your changes would have on the image at a normal size."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Ny vy</guimenuitem> skapar ett nytt bildfönster för "
"den aktuella bilden, som du kan ställa in annorlunda än den befintliga vyn. "
"Du kan skapa flera vyer av en bild, numrerade .1, .2 och så vidare, men "
"endast zoomfaktorn och andra visningsalternativ kan skilja sig åt. Alla "
"ändringar du gör i ett fönster, utom visningsändringar, visas också i de "
"andra vyerna som visar samma bild. De nya vyerna är inte separata bildfiler "
"utan bara olika sätt att se samma bild. Du kan till exempel använda flera "
"vyer när du arbetar med enskilda bildpunkter vid hög zoomfaktor. Då kan du "
"samtidigt se vilken effekt ändringarna får på bilden i normal storlek."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>New "
"View</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Visa</guimenu><guimenuitem>Ny "
"vy</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/using/stock-navigation-16.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/using/stock-navigation-16.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Navigation Window"
msgstr "Navigeringsfönster"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "View Navigation window"
msgstr "Visa navigeringsfönster"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Navigation Window</guimenuitem> command opens the <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-navigation-dialog\">navigation window</link>. This allows you"
" to easily navigate through the image, to set zoom levels and to move the "
"visible parts of the image. You can find more information about using it in "
"the <link linkend=\"gimp-navigation-dialog\">Navigation dialog</link> "
"chapter."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Navigeringsfönster</guimenuitem> öppnar <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-navigation-dialog\">navigeringsfönstret</link>. Där kan du "
"enkelt navigera i bilden, ställa in zoomnivåer och flytta bildens synliga "
"delar. Mer information om hur du använder det finns i kapitlet <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-navigation-dialog\">Navigeringsdialog</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Navigation "
"Window</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Visa</guimenu><guimenuitem>Navigeringsfönster</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can also access it more rapidly by clicking on the <placeholder-1/> icon"
" in the lower right corner of the image window."
msgstr ""
"Du når det även snabbare genom att klicka på ikonen <placeholder-1/> i "
"bildfönstrets nedre högra hörn."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "@@image: 'images/menus/view.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr "@@image: 'images/menus/view.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Contents of the View menu"
msgstr "Innehållet i Visa-menyn"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This section describes the <guimenu>View</guimenu> menu, which contains "
"commands that affect the visibility or appearance of the image and various "
"elements of the interface."
msgstr ""
"Detta avsnitt beskriver menyn <guimenu>Visa</guimenu>, som innehåller "
"kommandon som påverkar synligheten för bilden och olika element i "
"gränssnittet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Fullscreen</guimenuitem> command enables and disables "
"displaying the image window on the entire screen. When it is enabled, the "
"image window takes up the whole screen, but the image stays the same size. "
"When you enable full-screen mode, the menubar may not be displayed, but if "
"this happens, you can right-click on the image to access the image menu. You"
" can set the default appearance for full-screen mode in the <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-prefs-image-window-appearance\">Preferences</link> menu."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Helskärm</guimenuitem> aktiverar och inaktiverar "
"visning av bildfönstret över hela skärmen. När det är aktiverat upptar "
"bildfönstret hela skärmen, men bilden behåller samma storlek. När du "
"aktiverar helskärmsläge kanske menyraden inte visas, men då kan du "
"högerklicka på bilden för att nå bildmenyn. Du kan ange standardutseendet "
"för helskärmsläge i menyn <link linkend=\"gimp-prefs-image-window-"
"appearance\">Inställningar</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If you use <acronym>GIMP</acronym> on an Apple computer, full-screen mode "
"may not work, since Apple doesn't provide the necessary functionality. "
"Instead, you can maximize the image window by clicking on the "
"<emphasis>Green Button</emphasis>, so the image occupies most of the screen."
msgstr ""
"Om du använder <acronym>GIMP</acronym> på en Apple-dator kanske "
"helskärmsläget inte fungerar, eftersom Apple inte tillhandahåller den "
"nödvändiga funktionen. I stället kan du maximera bildfönstret genom att "
"klicka på <emphasis>den gröna knappen</emphasis>, så att bilden upptar "
"större delen av skärmen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Full "
"Screen</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Visa</guimenu><guimenuitem>Helskärm</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "or by using the keyboard shortcut <keycap>F11</keycap>."
msgstr "eller med tangentbordsgenvägen <keycap>F11</keycap>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Dot for Dot"
msgstr "Punkt för punkt"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Dot for Dot</guimenuitem> command enables and disables "
"<quote>Dot for Dot</quote> mode. If it is enabled (checked) and the zoom "
"factor is 100%, every pixel in the image is displayed as one pixel on the "
"screen. If it is disabled, the image is displayed at its <quote>real</quote>"
" size, the size it will have when it is printed."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Punkt för punkt</guimenuitem> aktiverar och "
"inaktiverar läget <quote>Punkt för punkt</quote>. Om det är aktiverat "
"(markerat) och zoomfaktorn är 100 % visas varje bildpunkt i bilden som en "
"bildpunkt på skärmen. Om det är inaktiverat visas bilden i sin "
"<quote>verkliga</quote> storlek, alltså den storlek den får vid utskrift."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The example below will illustrate this. Imagine the following image "
"properties:"
msgstr ""
"Exemplet nedan illustrerar detta. Föreställ dig följande bildegenskaper:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Image size: 100x100 pixels"
msgstr "Bildstorlek: 100 × 100 bildpunkter"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Image resolution: 300dpi (dots per inch)"
msgstr "Bildupplösning: 300 dpi (punkter per tum)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Image displayed with Zoom=100%, <quote>Dot for "
"Dot</quote><emphasis>enabled</emphasis>: 100x100 pixels"
msgstr ""
"Bild visas med Zoom=100 %, <quote>Punkt för "
"punkt</quote><emphasis>aktiverat</emphasis>: 100 × 100 bildpunkter"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Image displayed with Zoom=100%, <quote>Dot for "
"Dot</quote><emphasis>disabled</emphasis>:"
msgstr ""
"Bild visas med Zoom=100 %, <quote>Punkt för "
"punkt</quote><emphasis>inaktiverat</emphasis>:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "$100pixels \\div 300dpi = \\frac{1}{3} inch \\approx 0.85cm$"
msgstr "$100pixels \\div 300dpi = \\frac{1}{3} inch \\approx 0.85cm$"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"For Dot for Dot mode to work properly, the resolution of the image must be "
"the same as the screen resolution in the <link linkend=\"gimp-prefs-"
"display\">Preferences menu</link>."
msgstr ""
"För att läget Punkt för punkt ska fungera korrekt måste bildupplösningen "
"vara samma som skärmupplösningen i <link linkend=\"gimp-prefs-"
"display\">menyn Inställningar</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Enabling this mode is recommended if you are working on icons and web "
"graphics. If you are working on images intended to be printed, you should "
"disable Dot-for-Dot mode."
msgstr ""
"Det rekommenderas att du aktiverar detta läge när du arbetar med ikoner och "
"webbgrafik. Om du arbetar med bilder som ska skrivas ut bör du inaktivera "
"läget Punkt för punkt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Dot for "
"Dot</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du når kommandot från bildens menyrad via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Visa</guimenu><guimenuitem>Punkt för "
"punkt</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

