#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Soft Glow"
msgstr "Mjuk glöd"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "SoftGlow filter"
msgstr "Filtret Mjuk glöd"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Filter <quote>SoftGlow</quote> applied"
msgstr "Filtret <quote>Mjuk glöd</quote> har tillämpats"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This filter lights the image with a soft glow. Soft Glow produces this "
"effect by making bright areas of the image brighter."
msgstr ""
"Detta filter lyser upp bilden med en mjuk glöd. Mjuk glöd åstadkommer "
"effekten genom att göra bildens ljusa områden ljusare."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can find this file in the Image menu through: "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Atistic</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Soft"
" Glow</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar filtret i Bild-menyn via: "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Konstnärligt</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Mjuk"
" glöd</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Your changes are displayed in this preview before being applied to your "
"image."
msgstr ""
"Dina ändringar visas i denna förhandsgranskning innan de tillämpas på "
"bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Glow radius"
msgstr "Glödradie"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The glow radius parameter controls the sharpness of the effect, giving a "
"\"vaseline-on-the-lens\" effect."
msgstr ""
"Parametern Glödradie styr effektens skärpa och ger en ”vaselin-på-"
"linsen”-effekt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The brightness parameter controls the degree of intensification applied to "
"image highlights."
msgstr "Parametern Ljusstyrka styr hur mycket bildens högdagrar förstärks."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The sharpness parameter controls how defined or alternatively diffuse the "
"glow effect should be."
msgstr ""
"Parametern Skärpa styr hur tydligt avgränsad eller diffus glödeffekten ska "
"vara."

