#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Predator"
msgstr "Predator"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<quote>Predator</quote> applied"
msgstr "<quote>Predator</quote> har tillämpats"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This filter adds a <quote>Predator</quote> effect to the image. The predator"
" effect makes the image/selection look something like the view the predator "
"has in movies (kind of a thermogram and that type of thing). This will "
"reduce the image to edges in a few basic colors on a dark background."
msgstr ""
"Filtret lägger till en <quote>Predator</quote>-effekt i bilden. Predator-"
"effekten får bilden eller markeringen att likna det som rovdjuret ser i "
"filmer (ungefär ett termogram). Bilden reduceras till kanter i några "
"grundfärger mot en mörk bakgrund."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If there is an active selection, the filter effect will be applied to the "
"selected region, otherwise to the alpha channel (the filter will add an "
"alpha channel, if necessary). The filter works best on colorful RGB images."
msgstr ""
"Om det finns en aktiv markering tillämpas filtreffekten på det markerade "
"området, annars på alfakanalen (filtret lägger vid behov till en alfakanal)."
" Filtret fungerar bäst på färgrika RGB-bilder."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This filter is found in the image window menu under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Artistic</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Predator</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Filtret finns i bildfönstrets meny under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Konstnärligt</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Predator</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Edge amount"
msgstr "Kantmängd"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <quote>predator</quote> filter will detect edges using the Sobel <link "
"linkend=\"plug-in-edge\">edge detector</link>. The specified <quote>Edge "
"amount</quote> will be passed to the Sobel filter. A high value will result "
"in detecting more edges."
msgstr ""
"Filtret <quote>Predator</quote> upptäcker kanter med Sobels <link "
"linkend=\"plug-in-edge\">kantdetektor</link>. Den angivna "
"<quote>Kantmängd</quote> skickas till Sobel-filtret. Ett högt värde medför "
"att fler kanter upptäcks."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<placeholder-1/> examples"
msgstr "Exempel på <placeholder-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "16"
msgstr "16"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If checked, the filter will simplify the image into solid-colored squares "
"using the <link linkend=\"plug-in-pixelize\">Pixelise</link> filter before "
"the real predator effect will be applied. You can select the size of these "
"squares with the option <guilabel>Pixel amount</guilabel>, which will "
"heavily affect the result (see examples below)."
msgstr ""
"Om alternativet är markerat förenklar filtret bilden till helfärgade "
"kvadrater med filtret <link linkend=\"plug-in-pixelize\">Pixelisera</link> "
"innan den egentliga Predator-effekten tillämpas. Du kan välja kvadraternas "
"storlek med alternativet <guilabel>Pixelmängd</guilabel>, vilket påverkar "
"resultatet starkt (se exemplen nedan)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Pixel amount"
msgstr "Pixelmängd"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<quote>Pixel amount</quote> is the size of the color blocks the image will "
"be simplified to if <guilabel>Pixelize</guilabel> is checked. Actually you "
"are decreasing the resolution with this option. In the examples below, you "
"can see directly how increasing the pixel block size leads to something like"
" <quote>macro pixels</quote>:"
msgstr ""
"<quote>Pixelmängd</quote> är storleken på de färgblock som bilden förenklas "
"till om <guilabel>Pixelisera</guilabel> är markerat. Alternativet minskar i "
"praktiken upplösningen. I exemplen nedan ser du direkt hur större pixelblock"
" leder till något som liknar <quote>makropixlar</quote>:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If checked, the filter will be applied to the active selection. Else, it "
"will be applied to the active layer."
msgstr ""
"Om alternativet är markerat tillämpas filtret på den aktiva markeringen. "
"Annars tillämpas det på det aktiva lagret."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"When this option is checked, a copy of the active layer will be created "
"above the active layer and the filter will be applied to this copy, leaving "
"the original layer untouched. If not checked, the filter will be applied to "
"the active layer."
msgstr ""
"När alternativet är markerat skapas en kopia av det aktiva lagret ovanför "
"det aktiva lagret och filtret tillämpas på kopian, medan ursprungslagret "
"lämnas orört. Om alternativet inte är markerat tillämpas filtret på det "
"aktiva lagret."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Filter algorithm"
msgstr "Filteralgoritm"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Since this filter delegates the essential parts to two or three other "
"filters the algorithm is very simple:"
msgstr ""
"Eftersom filtret överlåter de väsentliga delarna till två eller tre andra "
"filter är algoritmen mycket enkel:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "predator"
msgstr "predator"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Making the <placeholder-1/> effect"
msgstr "Skapa <placeholder-1/>-effekten"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Min RGB"
msgstr "Minsta RGB"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Edge detection"
msgstr "Kantdetektering"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The original image."
msgstr "Den ursprungliga bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Optionally, the filter <link linkend=\"plug-in-pixelize\">pixelizes</link> "
"the image: it renders the image by using color blocks instead of pixels, "
"thus reducing the image resolution."
msgstr ""
"Filtret kan valfritt <link linkend=\"plug-in-pixelize\">pixelisera</link> "
"bilden: det återger bilden med färgblock i stället för bildpunkter och "
"minskar därmed bildens upplösning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The colors will be reduced to pure red, green, blue (and possibly gray "
"colors), using the <link linkend=\"plug-in-max-rgb\">minimal RGB</link> "
"channel for every pixel."
msgstr ""
"Färgerna reduceras till rent rött, grönt och blått (och möjligen gråtoner) "
"med <link linkend=\"plug-in-max-rgb\">minsta RGB</link>-kanalen för varje "
"bildpunkt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Applying the <link linkend=\"plug-in-edge\">Sobel edge detecting</link> "
"filter, the image will be reduced further on to edges, usually on a black "
"background, with very few colors."
msgstr ""
"När filtret <link linkend=\"plug-in-edge\">Sobels kantdetektering</link> "
"tillämpas reduceras bilden ytterligare till kanter, vanligen mot en svart "
"bakgrund och med mycket få färger."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/artistic-taj-photocopy.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE"
" DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/artistic-taj-photocopy.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE"
" DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/options-artistic-photocopy.png'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/options-artistic-photocopy.png'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Filter <quote>Photocopy</quote> applied"
msgstr "Filtret <quote>Fotokopia</quote> har tillämpats"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The Photocopy filter modifies the active layer or selection so that it looks"
" like a black and white photocopy, as if toner transferred was based on the "
"relative darkness of a particular region. This is achieved by darkening "
"areas of the image which are measured to be darker than a neighborhood "
"average, and setting other pixels to white."
msgstr ""
"Filtret Fotokopia ändrar det aktiva lagret eller markeringen så att den "
"liknar en svartvit fotokopia, som om överförd toner baserades på den "
"relativa mörkheten i ett visst område. Detta uppnås genom att göra områden i"
" bilden som bedöms vara mörkare än genomsnittet i sin omgivning mörkare och "
"sätta andra bildpunkter till vita."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You may use this filter to sharpen your image. Create a copy of the active "
"layer and use the filter on the copy. Set the <link linkend=\"gimp-concepts-"
"layer-modes\">Layer Mode</link> to <guilabel>Multiply</guilabel> and adjust "
"the opacity slider to get the best result."
msgstr ""
"Du kan använda filtret för att skärpa bilden. Skapa en kopia av det aktiva "
"lagret och använd filtret på kopian. Sätt <link linkend=\"gimp-concepts-"
"layer-modes\">Lagerläge</link> till <guilabel>Multiplicera</guilabel> och "
"justera opacitetsreglaget för bästa resultat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can find this filter from the image menu through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Artistic</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Photocopy</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar filtret i bildmenyn via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Konstnärligt</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Fotokopia</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Mask radius"
msgstr "Maskradie"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This parameter controls the size of the pixel neighbourhood over which the "
"average intensity is computed and then compared to each pixel in the "
"neighborhood to decide whether or not to darken it. Large values result in "
"very thick black areas bordering the regions of white and much less detail "
"for black areas. Small values result in less toner overall and more details "
"everywhere."
msgstr ""
"Parametern styr storleken på den bildpunktsomgivning vars genomsnittliga "
"intensitet beräknas och sedan jämförs med varje bildpunkt i omgivningen för "
"att avgöra om den ska göras mörkare. Stora värden ger mycket tjocka svarta "
"områden som gränsar till vita områden och betydligt mindre detaljrikedom i "
"svarta områden. Små värden ger mindre toner totalt och fler detaljer "
"överallt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "With this option, you can set photocopy sharpness, from 0.0 to 1.0."
msgstr ""
"Med alternativet kan du ställa in fotokopians skärpa från 0,0 till 1,0."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Percent black"
msgstr "Procent svart"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This parameter controls the amount of black color added to the image. Small "
"values make the blend from color regions to blackened areas smoother and "
"dark lines themselves thinner and less noticeable. Larger values make the "
"lines thicker, darker and sharper. The maximum value makes the lines "
"aliased. The best, most natural results are usually achieved with an "
"intermediate value. Values vary from 0.0 to 1.0."
msgstr ""
"Parametern styr mängden svart färg som läggs till i bilden. Små värden gör "
"övergången från färgområden till svärtade områden mjukare och de mörka "
"linjerna tunnare och mindre framträdande. Större värden gör linjerna "
"tjockare, mörkare och skarpare. Maximivärdet gör linjerna kantiga. Bäst och "
"mest naturligt resultat uppnås vanligen med ett mellanliggande värde. "
"Värdena varierar från 0,0 till 1,0."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Percent White"
msgstr "Procent vitt"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "This parameter increases white pixels percentage."
msgstr "Parametern ökar andelen vita bildpunkter."

