msgid "Filter <quote>Oilify</quote> applied"
msgstr "Filtret <quote>Oljemåla</quote> har tillämpats"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This filter makes the image look like an oil painting. The <parameter>Mask "
"Size</parameter> controls the outcome: a high value gives the image less "
"detail, as if you had used a larger brush."
msgstr ""
"Filtret får bilden att likna en oljemålning. "
"<parameter>Maskstorlek</parameter> styr resultatet: ett högt värde ger "
"bilden mindre detaljrikedom, som om du hade använt en större pensel."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The GIMPressionist filter can produce similar effects, but allows a much "
"wider variety of options."
msgstr ""
"Filtret GIMPressionist kan ge liknande effekter, men erbjuder ett mycket "
"större urval av alternativ."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This filter is found in the image menu through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Artistic</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Oilify...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
msgstr ""
"Du hittar filtret i bildmenyn via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Konstnärligt</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Oljemåla"
" …</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Mask Size"
msgstr "Maskstorlek"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Mask Size selects the size of the brush mask used to paint the oily render. "
"Larger values here produce an oilier render."
msgstr ""
"Maskstorlek väljer storleken på penselmasken som används för att måla den "
"oljiga återgivningen. Större värden ger en mer oljig återgivning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Use Intensity Algorithm"
msgstr "Använd intensitetsalgoritm"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Use Intensity Algorithm changes the mode of operation to help preserve "
"detail and coloring."
msgstr ""
"Använd intensitetsalgoritm ändrar arbetssättet för att bevara detaljer och "
"färgläggning bättre."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Artistic filters create artistic effects like cubism, oil painting, "
