#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "GIMPressionist"
msgstr "GIMPressionist"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Filter <quote>GIMPressionist</quote> applied"
msgstr "Filtret <quote>GIMPressionist</quote> har tillämpats"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"It's the king of Artistic filters. It can do what Cubism and Apply Canvas do"
" and much more. It gives your image the look of a painting. All is going as "
"if your image was painted again on a paper and with a brush you'd have "
"chosen. It works on the active layer or selection."
msgstr ""
"Det är kungen bland konstnärliga filter. Det kan göra det som Kubism och "
"Tillämpa canvas gör, och mycket mer. Det ger bilden utseendet av en målning."
" Allt sker som om bilden målades på nytt på papper med en pensel du har "
"valt. Det arbetar på det aktiva lagret eller markeringen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can find this filter via the image menu through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Artistic</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>GIMPressionist</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
msgstr ""
"Du hittar filtret i bildmenyn via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Konstnärligt</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>GIMPressionist</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"All your setting changes will appear in the Preview without affecting the "
"image until you click on <guibutton>OK</guibutton>. The "
"<guibutton>Update</guibutton> button refreshes the preview window (it is not"
" automatic, Gimpressionist has so much work to do!), and the "
"<guibutton>Reset</guibutton> button reverts to the original image."
msgstr ""
"Alla ändringar av inställningar visas i förhandsgranskningen utan att "
"påverka bilden förrän du klickar på <guibutton>OK</guibutton>. Knappen "
"<guibutton>Uppdatera</guibutton> uppdaterar förhandsgranskningsfönstret (det"
" sker inte automatiskt eftersom GIMPressionist har mycket att göra), och "
"knappen <guibutton>Återställ</guibutton> återgår till den ursprungliga "
"bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<placeholder-1/> tab options"
msgstr "Alternativ på fliken <placeholder-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"GIMPressionist has a lot of parameters. When combined, they give an "
"astronomical number of possibilities. So, it is important, when an "
"interesting preset has been found, to save it and also to send it to the "
"plugin author if exceptional. Per contra, the intricacy of all these "
"parameters makes difficult understanding and foreseeing how each one works."
msgstr ""
"GIMPressionist har många parametrar. I kombination ger de ett astronomiskt "
"antal möjligheter. När du hittar en intressant förinställning är det därför "
"viktigt att spara den och, om den är särskilt bra, skicka den till "
"insticksmodulens upphovsperson. Samtidigt gör alla parametrers komplexitet "
"det svårt att förstå och förutse hur var och en fungerar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Save Current</guilabel>: Save current parameters. You can give a "
"name in the input box on the left and a short description in the dialog that"
" appear."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Spara aktuella</guilabel>: Sparar de aktuella parametrarna. Du kan"
" ange ett namn i inmatningsrutan till vänster och en kort beskrivning i "
"dialogrutan som visas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Apply</guilabel>: Load the parameters of the selected preset in "
"the list."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Tillämpa</guilabel>: Läser in parametrarna för den valda "
"förinställningen i listan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Delete</guilabel>: Delete the selected preset. You can delete only"
" the presets you have created."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Ta bort</guilabel>: Tar bort den valda förinställningen. Du kan "
"endast ta bort förinställningar som du själv har skapat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<guilabel>Refresh</guilabel>: Update the preset list."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Uppdatera</guilabel>: Uppdaterar listan med förinställningar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Paper tab"
msgstr "Fliken Papper"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This tab concerns the texture of the canvas your image will be painted on. "
"You have a list of textures and a <guilabel>Preview</guilabel> for the "
"selected texture. A description is displayed on the right for every texture "
"when selected."
msgstr ""
"Fliken gäller texturen på den canvas som bilden ska målas på. Du har en "
"lista över texturer och en <guilabel>Förhandsgranskning</guilabel> av den "
"valda texturen. Till höger visas en beskrivning för varje textur när den "
"väljs."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Inverts the paper texture: what was a hollow turns to a bump and vice-versa."
msgstr ""
"Inverterar papperstexturen: det som var en fördjupning blir en upphöjning "
"och tvärtom."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Apply the paper as it, without embossing it. It looks like if a transparent "
"paper has been overlayed on the image."
msgstr ""
"Tillämpar papperet som det är, utan att prägla det. Det ser ut som om ett "
"genomskinligt papper har lagts över bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Specifies the scale of the texture (in % of the original file): controls the"
" graininess of the texture."
msgstr ""
"Anger texturens skala (i procent av originalfilen): styr texturens "
"kornighet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Relief"
msgstr "Relief"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Specifies the amount of embossing to apply (3-150)."
msgstr "Anger mängden prägling som ska tillämpas (3–150)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Brush tab"
msgstr "Pensel-fliken"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"\"Brush\" is a general term for any material used to paint. A list of "
"brushes is available with a <guilabel>Preview</guilabel> for the selected "
"one."
msgstr ""
"”Pensel” är ett allmänt begrepp för material som används för att måla. En "
"lista över penslar finns tillgänglig med en "
"<guilabel>Förhandsgranskning</guilabel> av den valda."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Changes the gamma (luminosity) of the selected brush. The gamma correction "
"brightens or darkens midtones."
msgstr ""
"Ändrar gamma (ljusstyrkan) för den valda penseln. Gammakorrigeringen gör "
"mellantoner ljusare eller mörkare."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can also use a brush pattern you have created by selecting its image "
"(arrow button on the Select line). This image must be on your screen before "
"you launch the filter to be taken in account. Of course, don't use big "
"images."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också använda ett penselmönster som du har skapat genom att välja "
"dess bild (pilknappen på raden Välj). Bilden måste visas på skärmen innan du"
" startar filtret för att tas med. Använd förstås inte stora bilder."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If your image has several layers, they also will be displayed in the Select "
"list and can be used as a brush. When selected, the layer appears in the "
"brush preview and the normal brush is deselected."
msgstr ""
"Om bilden har flera lager visas de också i listan Välj och kan användas som "
"pensel. När ett lager väljs visas det i penselförhandsgranskningen och den "
"vanliga penseln avmarkeras."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guibutton>Save as</guibutton> button allows you to save the selected "
"brush."
msgstr ""
"Knappen <guibutton>Spara som</guibutton> låter dig spara den valda penseln."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Specifies the brush proportions, height (0 -1) and width (0 +1)."
msgstr "Anger penselns proportioner, höjd (0–1) och bredd (0–1)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Specifies the amount of paint used for each stroke. This may evoke painting "
"with a palette knife."
msgstr ""
"Anger mängden färg som används för varje penseldrag. Det kan påminna om "
"målning med palettkniv."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This tab allows to set the orientation of the brush strokes. A painter is "
"not obliged to go over with the same paintbrush angle. To perform some "
"effects, he can vary their orientation."
msgstr ""
"På fliken kan du ange penseldragens orientering. En målare behöver inte "
"arbeta med samma penselvinkel överallt. För att uppnå vissa effekter kan "
"orienteringen varieras."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Directions"
msgstr "Riktningar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"With this option, you can set how many times the brush will pass through a "
"same place, with each time a different direction, resulting in a more and "
"more thick paint."
msgstr ""
"Med alternativet kan du ange hur många gånger penseln ska passera samma "
"plats, varje gång i en annan riktning, vilket ger allt tjockare färg."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Start Angle"
msgstr "Startvinkel"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Specifies the general direction of the strokes, the angle that the angle "
"range will start from. Directions are often chosen to give some movement to "
"the image."
msgstr ""
"Anger penseldragens allmänna riktning, den vinkel som vinkelintervallet "
"börjar vid. Riktningar väljs ofta för att ge bilden en känsla av rörelse."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Angle Span"
msgstr "Vinkelomfång"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Specifies the angle, the sector, of the stroke \"fan\"."
msgstr "Anger vinkeln, sektorn, för penseldragens ”solfjäder”."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Specifies the direction of the brush strokes."
msgstr "Anger riktningen för penseldragen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Value</guilabel> : Let the Value (luminosity) of the region "
"determine the direction of the stroke."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Värde</guilabel>: Låt områdets värde (ljusstyrka) bestämma "
"penseldragets riktning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Radius</guilabel> : The distance from the center of the image "
"determines the direction of the stroke."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Radie</guilabel>: Avståndet från bildens mitt bestämmer "
"penseldragets riktning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Random</guilabel> : Select a random direction for each stroke."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Slumpmässig</guilabel>: Välj en slumpmässig riktning för varje "
"penseldrag."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Radial</guilabel> : Let the direction from the center determine "
"the direction of the stroke."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Radiell</guilabel>: Låt riktningen från mitten bestämma "
"penseldragets riktning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Flowing</guilabel> : Not a direction question here: the strokes "
"follow a \"flowing\" pattern."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Flytande</guilabel>: Här handlar det inte om riktning; "
"penseldragen följer ett ”flytande” mönster."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Hue</guilabel> : Let the hue of the region determine the direction"
" of the stroke."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Nyans</guilabel>: Låt områdets nyans bestämma penseldragets "
"riktning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Adaptive</guilabel> : The brush direction that matches the "
"original image the closest is selected."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Adaptiv</guilabel>: Den penselriktning som bäst motsvarar den "
"ursprungliga bilden väljs."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Manual</guilabel> : The <guilabel>Edit</guilabel> button opens the"
" <link linkend=\"gimpressionist-orient-map-editor\"> Edit orientation Map "
"dialog </link> that allows you to set the directions manually."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Manuell</guilabel>: Knappen <guilabel>Redigera</guilabel> öppnar "
"dialogrutan <link linkend=\"gimpressionist-orient-map-editor\">Redigera "
"orienteringskarta</link>, där du kan ange riktningarna manuellt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Size tab"
msgstr "Storlek-fliken"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This tab allows you to set the number of brush sizes that will be used to "
"paint, the limits of variation of these sizes and the criterion used to "
"determine them."
msgstr ""
"På fliken kan du ange hur många penselstorlekar som ska användas vid "
"målning, gränserna för deras variation och vilket kriterium som bestämmer "
"dem."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Three Sliders"
msgstr "Tre reglage"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "You can specify how many brush sizes are to be used and their sizes."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ange hur många penselstorlekar som ska användas och vilka storlekar "
"de har."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<guilabel>Sizes</guilabel>: The number of brush sizes to use."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Storlekar</guilabel>: Antalet penselstorlekar som ska användas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Minimum Size</guilabel> and <guilabel>Maximum Size </guilabel>: "
"The brush sizes are between these two values. Greater the size, greater the "
"length and width of strokes."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Minsta storlek</guilabel> och <guilabel>Största "
"storlek</guilabel>: Penselstorlekarna ligger mellan dessa två värden. Ju "
"större storlek, desto längre och bredare penseldrag."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Sizes"
msgstr "Storlekar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You have there options to specify how the size of strokes will be "
"determined."
msgstr ""
"Här finns alternativ för att ange hur penseldragens storlek ska bestämmas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Value</guilabel>: Let the Value (luminosity) of the region "
"determine the size of the stroke."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Värde</guilabel>: Låt områdets värde (ljusstyrka) bestämma "
"penseldragets storlek."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Radius</guilabel> : The distance from the center of the image "
"determines the size of the stroke."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Radie</guilabel>: Avståndet från bildens mitt bestämmer "
"penseldragets storlek."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<guilabel>Random</guilabel> : Select a random size for each stroke."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Slumpmässig</guilabel>: Välj en slumpmässig storlek för varje "
"penseldrag."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Radial</guilabel> : Let the direction from the center determine "
"the size of the stroke."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Radiell</guilabel>: Låt riktningen från mitten bestämma "
"penseldragets storlek."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Flowing</guilabel> : Not a length question here: the strokes "
"follow a \"flowing\" pattern."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Flytande</guilabel>: Här handlar det inte om längd; penseldragen "
"följer ett ”flytande” mönster."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Hue</guilabel> : Let the hue of the region determine the size of "
"the stroke."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Nyans</guilabel>: Låt områdets nyans bestämma penseldragets "
"storlek."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Adaptive</guilabel> : The brush size that matches the original "
"image the closest is selected."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Adaptiv</guilabel>: Den penselstorlek som bäst motsvarar den "
"ursprungliga bilden väljs."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Manual</guilabel> : The <guilabel>Edit</guilabel> button opens the"
" <link linkend=\"gimpressionist-size-map-editor\">Size Map Editor</link>. "
"That allows you to specify the size of strokes by yourself."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Manuell</guilabel>: Knappen <guilabel>Redigera</guilabel> öppnar "
"<link linkend=\"gimpressionist-size-map-editor\">Redigerare för "
"storlekskarta</link>. Där kan du själv ange storleken på penseldragen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Placement tab"
msgstr "Fliken Placering"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "In this tab you can set how strokes will be distributed."
msgstr "På fliken kan du ange hur penseldragen ska fördelas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"In the preview of the Orientation Map Editor, all small arrows look like a "
"flow around objects. Inside this flow, strokes may be placed in two "
"different ways:"
msgstr ""
"I förhandsgranskningen av redigeraren för orienteringskarta ser alla små "
"pilar ut som ett flöde runt objekt. Inom detta flöde kan penseldragen "
"placeras på två olika sätt:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Randomly</guilabel>: Places strokes randomly. This produces a more"
" realistic paint."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Slumpmässigt</guilabel>: Placerar penseldrag slumpmässigt. Det ger"
" en mer realistisk målning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Evenly</guilabel>: Strokes are evenly distributed across the "
"image."
msgstr "<guilabel>Jämnt</guilabel>: Penseldragen fördelas jämnt över bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Stroke Density"
msgstr "Penseldragstäthet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The greater the density the closer the strokes. With a low density, the "
"paper or background may be visible in unstroke areas."
msgstr ""
"Ju högre täthet, desto närmare ligger penseldragen. Vid låg täthet kan "
"papperet eller bakgrunden synas i områden utan penseldrag."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Centerize"
msgstr "Centrera"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Focus brush strokes around center."
msgstr "Koncentrera penseldragen kring mitten."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Color tab"
msgstr "Färg-fliken"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "In this tab, you can set what the stroke color will be."
msgstr "På fliken kan du ange vilken färg penseldragen ska ha."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "You can set the stroke color in two ways:"
msgstr "Du kan ange penseldragens färg på två sätt:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Average under brush</guilabel>: Stroke color is computed from the "
"average of all pixels under the brush."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Genomsnitt under pensel</guilabel>: Penseldragets färg beräknas "
"utifrån genomsnittet av alla bildpunkter under penseln."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Center of brush</guilabel>: Samples the color from the pixel in "
"the center of the brush."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Penselns mitt</guilabel>: Hämtar färgen från bildpunkten i "
"penselns mitt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Color Noise"
msgstr "Färgbrus"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This slider, and its input box, allow you to introduce noise in the stroke "
"color, that will look less homogeneous."
msgstr ""
"Med reglaget och dess inmatningsruta kan du lägga till brus i penseldragets "
"färg så att den ser mindre enhetlig ut."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "General tab"
msgstr "Allmänt-fliken"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"In this tab you can set what will be the background and the relief of brush "
"strokes."
msgstr "På fliken kan du ange bakgrund och relief för penseldragen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Keep Original</guilabel>: The original image will be used as a "
"background."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Behåll ursprunglig</guilabel>: Den ursprungliga bilden används som"
" bakgrund."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>From Paper</guilabel>: Copy the texture of the selected paper as a"
" background."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Från papper</guilabel>: Kopierar det valda papperets textur som "
"bakgrund."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Solid</guilabel>: By clicking on the color dwell you can select a "
"solid colored background."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Enfärgad</guilabel>: Genom att klicka på färgrutan kan du välja en"
" helfärgad bakgrund."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Transparent</guilabel>: Use a transparent background. Only the "
"painted strokes will be visible. This option is available only if your image"
" has an Alpha channel."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Genomskinlig</guilabel>: Använder en genomskinlig bakgrund. Endast"
" de målade penseldragen syns. Alternativet är endast tillgängligt om bilden "
"har en alfakanal."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Paint Edges"
msgstr "Måla kanter"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If it is disabled, a thin border will not be painted around the outside "
"border of the image."
msgstr ""
"Om alternativet är inaktiverat målas ingen tunn kant runt bildens ytterkant."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If checked, the resulting image will be seamlessly tileable. The right side "
"will match the left side and the top will match the bottom. This is "
"interesting if your image will be repeatedly used in a Web background."
msgstr ""
"Om alternativet är markerat kan den resulterande bilden plattas sömlöst. "
"Höger sida passar ihop med vänster sida och ovansidan med undersidan. Det är"
" användbart om bilden ska användas upprepade gånger som webbakgrund."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Add a shadow effect to each brush stroke."
msgstr "Lägg till en skuggeffekt för varje penseldrag."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Edge Darken"
msgstr "Mörka kanter"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"How much to darken the edges of each brush stroke. This increases paint "
"relief or thickness."
msgstr ""
"Anger hur mycket kanterna på varje penseldrag ska mörkas. Det ökar färgens "
"relief eller tjocklek."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Shadow Darken"
msgstr "Mörka skugga"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "How much to darken the brush shadow."
msgstr "Anger hur mycket penselskuggan ska mörkas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Shadow Depth"
msgstr "Skuggdjup"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "How far apart from the object the drop shadow should be."
msgstr "Anger hur långt från objektet slagskuggan ska ligga."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Shadow Blur"
msgstr "Oskärpa för skugga"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "How much to blur the drop shadow."
msgstr "Anger hur mycket slagskuggan ska göras oskarp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Deviation Threshold"
msgstr "Avvikelsegräns"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "A bail-out value for adaptive selections of brush size."
msgstr "Ett avbrottsvärde för adaptiva val av penselstorlek."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/options-artistic-gimpressionist-sizemap.png'; "
"md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/options-artistic-gimpressionist-sizemap.png'; "
"md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "GIMPressionist - Size Map Editor"
msgstr "GIMPressionist – redigerare för storlekskarta"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The Size-map editor is an annexe of the <link linkend=\"plug-in-"
"gimpressionist\">GIMPressionist</link> filter. You can get to it by clicking"
" on the <guibutton>Edit</guibutton> button in the \"Size\" tab. With this "
"editor, you can set the size that brush strokes given by filter will have."
msgstr ""
"Redigeraren för storlekskarta är ett tillägg till filtret <link "
"linkend=\"plug-in-gimpressionist\">GIMPressionist</link>. Du öppnar den "
"genom att klicka på knappen <guibutton>Redigera</guibutton> på fliken "
"”Storlek”. Med redigeraren kan du ange storleken på filtrets penseldrag."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Size-map editor options"
msgstr "Alternativ för redigeraren för storlekskarta"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can place one or several vectors. You can set their strength. They will "
"act on the corresponding area of the image."
msgstr ""
"Du kan placera ut en eller flera vektorer. Du kan ange deras styrka. De "
"verkar på motsvarande område i bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Smvectors"
msgstr "Smvektorer"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"In this window you can place your vectors. By clicking on the "
"<guibutton>Add</guibutton> button, you add a vector at the center of the "
"window, whereas clicking with the mouse <emphasis>Middle Button</emphasis> "
"puts it where you click. Vectors are red when selected, and gray when they "
"are not, with a white point at tip."
msgstr ""
"I fönstret kan du placera ut vektorer. När du klickar på knappen "
"<guibutton>Lägg till</guibutton> lägger du till en vektor i fönstrets mitt, "
"medan ett klick med musens <emphasis>mittenknapp</emphasis> placerar den där"
" du klickar. Vektorer är röda när de är valda och grå när de inte är det, "
"med en vit punkt i spetsen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Clicking with the mouse <emphasis>Left Button</emphasis> displaces the "
"selected vector to the clicked point."
msgstr ""
"Ett klick med musens <emphasis>vänsterknapp</emphasis> flyttar den valda "
"vektorn till den punkt du klickade på."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Clicking on the mouse <emphasis>Right Button</emphasis>, has no evident "
"action."
msgstr ""
"Ett klick med musens <emphasis>högerknapp</emphasis> har ingen uppenbar "
"verkan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Clicking on <guibutton>&lt;&lt;</guibutton> et "
"<guibutton>&gt;&gt;</guibutton> buttons displaces focus from a vector to "
"another."
msgstr ""
"När du klickar på knapparna <guibutton>&lt;&lt;</guibutton> och "
"<guibutton>&gt;&gt;</guibutton> flyttas fokus från en vektor till en annan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guibutton>Kill</guibutton> button allows you to delete the selected "
"vector."
msgstr ""
"Knappen <guibutton>Döda</guibutton> låter dig ta bort den valda vektorn."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"With the scroll bar on the right of the Vectors panel, you can set the image"
" brightness. This can be very useful if the image is very dark/bright and "
"you can't see vectors well."
msgstr ""
"Med rullningslisten till höger om panelen Vektorer kan du ställa in bildens "
"ljusstyrka. Detta kan vara mycket användbart om bilden är mycket mörk eller "
"ljus och du inte ser vektorerna tydligt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This Preview gives you an idea of the action of the different vectors. The "
"size of squares represent the size of the brushes and their strength."
msgstr ""
"Förhandsgranskningen ger dig en uppfattning om hur de olika vektorerna "
"verkar. Kvadraternas storlek representerar penslarnas storlek och styrka."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Change the size of the brush strokes in the selected vector domain."
msgstr "Ändra storleken på penseldragen i den valda vektorns område."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This slider acts on the influence domain of the selected vector. This "
"influence lowers with distance."
msgstr ""
"Reglaget påverkar inflytelseområdet för den valda vektorn. Inflytandet "
"minskar med avståndet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Strength Exp."
msgstr "Styrkeexponent."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Change the exponent of the stroke."
msgstr "Ändra exponenten för penseldraget."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Voronoi"
msgstr "Voronoi"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"See <link linkend=\"gimpressionist-orient-map-editor\"> Orientation Map "
"Editor</link> for an explanation."
msgstr ""
"Se <link linkend=\"gimpressionist-orient-map-editor\">Redigerare för "
"orienteringskarta</link> för en förklaring."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/options-artistic-gimpressionist-orientmap.png'; "
"md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/options-artistic-gimpressionist-orientmap.png'; "
"md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/voronoi.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/voronoi.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "GIMPressionist - Orientation Map Editor"
msgstr "GIMPressionist – redigerare för orienteringskarta"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The Orientation-map editor is an annexe of the <link linkend=\"plug-in-"
"gimpressionist\">GIMPressionist</link> filter. You can get to it by clicking"
" on the <guibutton>Edit</guibutton> button in the <quote>Orientation</quote>"
" tab. With this editor, you can set the direction that brush strokes given "
"by filter will have."
msgstr ""
"Redigeraren för orienteringskarta är ett tillägg till filtret <link "
"linkend=\"plug-in-gimpressionist\">GIMPressionist</link>. Du öppnar den "
"genom att klicka på knappen <guibutton>Redigera</guibutton> på fliken "
"<quote>Orientering</quote>. Med redigeraren kan du ange riktningen på "
"filtrets penseldrag."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Options of the <quote>Orientation-map Editor</quote> dialog"
msgstr ""
"Alternativ i dialogrutan <quote>Redigerare för orienteringskarta</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can place one or several vectors. You can set their direction and their "
"strength. They will act on the corresponding area of the image."
msgstr ""
"Du kan placera ut en eller flera vektorer. Du kan ange deras riktning och "
"styrka. De verkar på motsvarande område i bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Vectors"
msgstr "Vektorer"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"In the left windows (Vectors) you can manage your vectors. By default, a "
"vector is at center. Vectors are red when they are active, and grey when "
"they are not with a white point at tip."
msgstr ""
"I det vänstra fönstret (Vektorer) kan du hantera vektorerna. Som standard "
"finns en vektor i mitten. Vektorer är röda när de är aktiva och grå när de "
"inte är det, med en vit punkt i spetsen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"By clicking on the <guibutton>Add</guibutton> button, you add a vector at "
"center of the window, whereas clicking with the mouse <emphasis>Middle "
"Button</emphasis> puts it where you click."
msgstr ""
"När du klickar på knappen <guibutton>Lägg till</guibutton> lägger du till en"
" vektor i fönstrets mitt, medan ett klick med musens "
"<emphasis>mittenknapp</emphasis> placerar den där du klickar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"When clicking with the mouse <emphasis>Right Button</emphasis>, the selected"
" vector points to where you have clicked."
msgstr ""
"När du klickar med musens <emphasis>högerknapp</emphasis> pekar den valda "
"vektorn mot den plats där du klickade."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Clicking on <guibutton>&lt;&lt;</guibutton> and "
"<guibutton>&gt;&gt;</guibutton> buttons displaces focus from a vector to "
"another."
msgstr ""
"När du klickar på knapparna <guibutton>&lt;&lt;</guibutton> och "
"<guibutton>&gt;&gt;</guibutton> flyttas fokus från en vektor till en annan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Delete</guilabel> button allows you to delete the selected "
"vector."
msgstr ""
"Knappen <guilabel>Ta bort</guilabel> låter dig ta bort den valda vektorn."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This Preview gives you an idea of the action of the various vectors. The "
"slider on the right border lets you change the luminosity of this preview."
msgstr ""
"Förhandsgranskningen ger dig en uppfattning om hur de olika vektorerna "
"verkar. Med reglaget i högerkanten kan du ändra ljusstyrkan i "
"förhandsgranskningen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You have there some types to arrange the brush strokes within the selected "
"vector domain. Describing them is difficult, but you can see the result in "
"the Preview."
msgstr ""
"Här finns några typer för att ordna penseldragen inom den valda vektorns "
"område. De är svåra att beskriva, men resultatet syns i "
"förhandsgranskningen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"A Voronoi's diagram consists in partitioning a plane with n master points "
"into n polygons where each polygon has only one of these n master points and"
" where any given other point of the polygon is closer to the master point "
"than to any other. So each polygon limit is midway between two master point."
" Here is an example of a Voronoi's diagram: <placeholder-1/> Here, when this"
" option is checked, only the vector closest to a given point of the image "
"influences this point."
msgstr ""
"Ett Voronoi-diagram delar upp ett plan med n huvudpunkter i n polygoner, där"
" varje polygon endast har en av huvudpunkterna och varje annan punkt i "
"polygonen ligger närmare huvudpunkten än någon annan. Varje polygonkant "
"ligger alltså mitt emellan två huvudpunkter. Här är ett exempel på ett "
"Voronoi-diagram: <placeholder-1/> När alternativet är markerat påverkar "
"endast den vektor som ligger närmast en given punkt i bilden den punkten."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Angle</guilabel>: Direction of the selected vector. This slider "
"has the same action as right-clicking (see above)."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Vinkel</guilabel>: Den valda vektorns riktning. Reglaget har samma"
" funktion som ett högerklick (se ovan)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Angle Offset"
msgstr "Vinkelförskjutning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "This slider allows you to change the angle of ALL vectors."
msgstr "Reglaget låter dig ändra vinkeln för ALLA vektorer."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This slider acts on the influence domain of the selected vector. This "
"influence lowers with distance. Strength is showed with the vector length."
msgstr ""
"Reglaget påverkar inflytelseområdet för den valda vektorn. Inflytandet "
"minskar med avståndet. Styrkan visas av vektorns längd."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This slider acts on the length of ALL vectors, and so changes the strength "
"of all brush strokes."
msgstr ""
"Reglaget påverkar längden på ALLA vektorer och ändrar därmed styrkan hos "
"alla penseldrag."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/artistic-taj-cubism.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/filters/examples/artistic-taj-cubism.jpg'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"

