"@@image: 'images/toolbox/tool-options-rotate.png'; "
"md5=5fe6ef5249980691608d0bf916c96220"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/toolbox/tool-options-rotate.png'; "
"md5=5fe6ef5249980691608d0bf916c96220"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/toolbox/tool-dialog-rotate.png'; "
"md5=aa4959e639f07e0709d8d97f7481c176"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/toolbox/tool-dialog-rotate.png'; "
"md5=aa4959e639f07e0709d8d97f7481c176"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The Rotate tool in Toolbox"
msgstr "Rotationsverktyget i verktygslådan"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This tool is used to rotate the active layer, a selection or a path. When "
"you click on the image or the selection with this tool a <emphasis>Rotation "
"Information</emphasis> dialog is opened. There, you can set the rotation "
"axis, marked with a point, and the rotation angle. You can do the same by "
"dragging the mouse pointer on the image or the rotation point."
msgstr ""
"Verktyget används för att rotera det aktiva lagret, en markering eller en "
"bana. När du klickar på bilden eller markeringen med verktyget öppnas "
"dialogrutan <emphasis>Rotationsinformation</emphasis>. Där kan du ange "
"rotationsaxeln, som markeras med en punkt, och rotationsvinkeln. Du kan göra"
" samma sak genom att dra muspekaren över bilden eller rotationspunkten."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help/master
msgid "You can access the Selection Tool in different ways:"
msgstr "Du kan komma åt markeringsverktyget på olika sätt:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"from the image menu bar "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transform "
"Tools</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Rotate</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"från bildmenyraden via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Verktyg</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transformeringsverktyg</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Rotera</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"by clicking the tool icon: <guiicon><inlinegraphic "
"fileref=\"images/toolbox/stock-tool-rotate-22.png\"/></guiicon> in the "
"Toolbox,"
msgstr ""
"genom att klicka på verktygsikonen: <guiicon><inlinegraphic "
"fileref=\"images/toolbox/stock-tool-rotate-22.png\"/></guiicon> i "
"verktygslådan,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"by using the <keycombo><keycap>Shift</keycap><keycap>R</keycap></keycombo> "
"key combination."
msgstr ""
"med tangentkombinationen "
"<keycombo><keycap>Skift</keycap><keycap>R</keycap></keycombo>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Holding <keycap>Ctrl</keycap> will constrain the rotation angle to 15 "
"degrees increments."
msgstr ""
"Om du håller ned <keycap>Ctrl</keycap> begränsas rotationsvinkeln till steg "
"om 15 grader."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Rotation tool options"
msgstr "Alternativ för rotationsverktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Transform; Direction, Interpolation; Clipping; Preview"
msgstr ""
"Transformering; riktning; interpolering; klippning; förhandsgranskning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Transform Direction"
msgstr "Transformeringsriktning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The Transform Direction sets which way or direction a layer is rotated. The "
"Normal mode will rotate the layer as one might expect. If a layer is rotated"
" 10 degrees to the right, then the layer will be rendered as such. This "
"behaviour is contrary to Corrective rotation."
msgstr ""
"Transformeringsriktning anger åt vilket håll ett lager roteras. Normalt läge"
" roterar lagret som förväntat. Om ett lager roteras 10 grader åt höger "
"återges lagret på det sättet. Detta beteende är motsatsen till korrigerande "
"rotation."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Corrective Rotation is primarily used to repair digital images that are not "
"straight. If the image is 13 degrees askew then you need not try to rotate "
"by that angle. By using Corrective Rotation you can rotate visually and line"
" up the layer with the image. Because the transformation is reversed, or "
"performed backwards, the image will be rotated with sufficient angle to "
"correct the error."
msgstr ""
"Korrigerande rotation används främst för att räta upp digitala bilder. Om "
"bilden lutar 13 grader behöver du inte försöka rotera med just den vinkeln. "
"Med korrigerande rotation kan du rotera visuellt och rikta in lagret mot "
"bilden. Eftersom transformeringen är omvänd, eller utförs baklänges, roteras"
" bilden med tillräcklig vinkel för att rätta felet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>15 Degrees (Ctrl)</guilabel> will constrain the rotation to angles"
" divisible by 15 degrees."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>15 grader (Ctrl)</guilabel> begränsar rotationen till vinklar som "
"är delbara med 15 grader."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The Rotation Information window"
msgstr "Fönstret Rotationsinformation"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The Rotation Information dialog window"
msgstr "Dialogfönstret Rotationsinformation"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Here you can set the rotation angle, from -180° to +180°, i.e. 360°."
msgstr "Här kan du ange rotationsvinkeln från −180° till +180°, alltså 360°."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Center X/Y"
msgstr "Centrum X/Y"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This option allows you to set the position of the rotation center, "
"represented by a large point in the image. A click-and-drag on this point "
"also allows you to move this center. Default unit of measurement is pixel, "
"but you can change it by using the drop-down list."
msgstr ""
"Alternativet låter dig ange rotationscentrumets position, som representeras "
"av en stor punkt i bilden. Du kan också flytta centrumet genom att klicka "
"och dra i punkten. Standardmåttenheten är bildpunkt, men du kan ändra den "
"med listrutan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can also rotate layers with "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transform</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Arbitrary"
" Rotation...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
msgstr ""
"Du kan också rotera lager via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transformera</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Godtycklig"
" rotation …</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/toolbox/toolbox-perspective.png'; "
"md5=75cb3d8c889e5b20ccd392491e992546"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/toolbox/toolbox-perspective.png'; "
"md5=75cb3d8c889e5b20ccd392491e992546"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/toolbox/tool-options-perspective.png'; "
"md5=6be91d209195a14e5ce4b598a196c680"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/toolbox/tool-options-perspective.png'; "
"md5=6be91d209195a14e5ce4b598a196c680"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/toolbox/tool-dialog-perspective.png'; "
"md5=4ab905f70a270153227aac296d2a40ab"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/toolbox/tool-dialog-perspective.png'; "
"md5=4ab905f70a270153227aac296d2a40ab"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Perspective tool"
msgstr "Perspektivverktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The Perspective Tool is used to change the <quote>perspective</quote> of the"
" active layer content, of a selection content or of a path. When you click "
"on the image, according to the Preview type you have selected, a rectangular"
" frame or a grid pops up around the selection (or around the whole layer if "
"there is no selection), with a handle on each of the four corners. By moving"
" these handles by click-and-drag, you can modify the perspective. At the "
"same time, a <quote>Transformation information</quote> pops up, which lets "
"you valid the transformation. At the center of the element, a circle lets "
"you move the element by click-and-drag."
msgstr ""
"Perspektivverktyget används för att ändra <quote>perspektivet</quote> för "
"innehållet i det aktiva lagret, innehållet i en markering eller en bana. När"
" du klickar på bilden visas, beroende på vald förhandsgranskningstyp, en "
"rektangulär ram eller ett rutnät runt markeringen (eller runt hela lagret om"
" ingen markering finns), med ett handtag i vart och ett av de fyra hörnen. "
"Genom att dra i handtagen kan du ändra perspektivet. Samtidigt visas "
"<quote>Transformeringsinformation</quote>, där du kan bekräfta "
"transformeringen. En cirkel i objektets mitt låter dig flytta objektet genom"
" att dra."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This tool is not actually a perspective tool, as it doesn't impose "
"perspective rules. It is better described as a distort tool."
msgstr ""
"Detta är egentligen inte ett perspektivverktyg, eftersom det inte tillämpar "
"perspektivregler. Det beskrivs bättre som ett förvrängningsverktyg."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "You can access the Perspective tool in different ways:"
msgstr "Du kan komma åt perspektivverktyget på olika sätt:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"From the image menu bar <guimenuitem>Tools</guimenuitem>/ "
"<guimenuitem>Transform "
"Tools</guimenuitem><guimenuitem>Perspective</guimenuitem>,"
msgstr ""
"Från bildmenyraden <guimenuitem>Verktyg</guimenuitem>/ "
"<guimenuitem>Transformeringsverktyg</guimenuitem><guimenuitem>Perspektiv</guimenuitem>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
