#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Transform Tools"
msgstr "Transformeringsverktyg"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "An overview of the transform tools"
msgstr "Översikt över transformeringsverktygen"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Inside the Transformation tool dialog, you will find eight tools to modify "
"the presentation of the image or the presentation of an element of the "
"image, selection, layer or path. Each transform tool has an Option dialog "
"and an Information dialog to set parameters."
msgstr ""
"I dialogrutan för transformeringsverktyg finns åtta verktyg för att ändra "
"bildens utseende eller utseendet för ett bildelement, en markering, ett "
"lager eller en bana. Varje transformeringsverktyg har en "
"alternativdialogruta och en informationsdialogruta där parametrar kan "
"ställas in."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Common options of transform tools"
msgstr "Gemensamma alternativ för transformeringsverktyg"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Some options are shared by several transform tools. We will describe them "
"here. More specific options will be described with their tool."
msgstr ""
"Vissa alternativ delas av flera transformeringsverktyg. De beskrivs här. Mer"
" specifika alternativ beskrivs tillsammans med respektive verktyg."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> offers you three buttons which let you select which "
"image element the transform tool will work on."
msgstr ""
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> har tre knappar som låter dig välja vilket "
"bildelement transformeringsverktyget ska arbeta på."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Remember that the Transform option persists when you quit the tool."
msgstr ""
"Kom ihåg att alternativet Transformera behålls när du avslutar verktyget."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"When you activate the first button <guiicon><inlinegraphic "
"fileref=\"images/tool-options/rotate-affect-layer.png\"/></guiicon> the tool"
" works on the active layer. If no selection exists in this layer, the whole "
"layer will be transformed."
msgstr ""
"När du aktiverar den första knappen <guiicon><inlinegraphic "
"fileref=\"images/tool-options/rotate-affect-layer.png\"/></guiicon> arbetar "
"verktyget på det aktiva lagret. Om det inte finns någon markering i lagret "
"transformeras hela lagret."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"When you activate the second button <guiicon><inlinegraphic "
"fileref=\"images/tool-options/rotate-affect-selection.png\"/></guiicon> the "
"tool works on the selection contour only (the whole layer contour if no "
"selection)."
msgstr ""
"När du aktiverar den andra knappen <guiicon><inlinegraphic "
"fileref=\"images/tool-options/rotate-affect-selection.png\"/></guiicon> "
"arbetar verktyget endast på markeringskonturen (hela lagerkonturen om ingen "
"markering finns)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"When you activate the third button, <guiicon><inlinegraphic "
"fileref=\"images/tool-options/rotate-affect-path.png\"/></guiicon> the tool "
"works on the path only."
msgstr ""
"När du aktiverar den tredje knappen, <guiicon><inlinegraphic "
"fileref=\"images/tool-options/rotate-affect-path.png\"/></guiicon>, arbetar "
"verktyget endast på banan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Direction</guilabel> sets which way or direction a layer is "
"transformed:"
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Riktning</guilabel> anger åt vilket håll ett lager transformeras:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The <quote>Normal (Forward)</quote> mode will transform the image or layer "
"as one might expect. You just use the handles to perform the transformation "
"you want. If you use a grid (see below), the image or layer is transformed "
"according to the shape and position you put the grid into."
msgstr ""
"Läget <quote>Normal (framåt)</quote> transformerar bilden eller lagret som "
"förväntat. Du använder handtagen för att utföra önskad transformering. Om du"
" använder ett rutnät (se nedan) transformeras bilden eller lagret efter den "
"form och position som du ger rutnätet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<quote>Corrective (Backward)</quote> inverts the direction. Primarily used "
"with the Rotation tool to repair digital images that have some geometric "
"errors (a horizon not horizontal, a wall not vertical...). See <xref "
"linkend=\"gimp-tool-rotate\"/>."
msgstr ""
"<quote>Korrigerande (bakåt)</quote> vänder riktningen. Det används främst "
"med rotationsverktyget för att rätta digitala bilder med geometriska fel (en"
" horisont som inte är vågrät, en vägg som inte är lodrät …). Se <xref "
"linkend=\"gimp-tool-rotate\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This drop-down list lets you choose the method and thus the quality of the "
"transformation:"
msgstr ""
"Med listrutan kan du välja metod och därmed transformeringens kvalitet:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The color of each pixel is copied from its closest neighboring pixel in the "
"original image. This often results in aliasing (the <quote>stair-"
"step</quote> effect) and a coarse image, but it is the fastest method. "
"Sometimes this method is called <quote>Nearest Neighbor</quote>."
msgstr ""
"Färgen för varje bildpunkt kopieras från den närmaste bildpunkten i "
"ursprungsbilden. Detta ger ofta aliasing (en <quote>trappeffekt</quote>) och"
" en grov bild, men är den snabbaste metoden. Metoden kallas ibland "
"<quote>Närmaste granne</quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The color of each pixel is computed as the average color of the four closest"
" pixels in the original image. This gives a satisfactory result for most "
"images and is a good compromise between speed and quality. Sometimes this "
"method is called <quote>Bilinear</quote>."
msgstr ""
"Färgen för varje bildpunkt beräknas som medelfärgen för de fyra närmaste "
"bildpunkterna i ursprungsbilden. Det ger ett tillfredsställande resultat för"
" de flesta bilder och är en bra kompromiss mellan hastighet och kvalitet. "
"Metoden kallas ibland <quote>Bilinjär</quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The color of each pixel is computed as the average color of the eight "
"closest pixels in the original image. This usually gives the best result, "
"but it naturally takes more time. Sometimes this method is called "
"<quote>Bicubic</quote>."
msgstr ""
"Färgen för varje bildpunkt beräknas som medelfärgen för de åtta närmaste "
"bildpunkterna i ursprungsbilden. Detta ger vanligen bäst resultat, men tar "
"naturligtvis längre tid. Metoden kallas ibland <quote>Bikubisk</quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Sinc (Lanczos3)"
msgstr "Sinc (Lanczos3)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The Lanczos3 method uses the Sinc mathematical function and performs a high "
"quality interpolation."
msgstr ""
"Metoden Lanczos3 använder den matematiska funktionen Sinc och utför "
"högkvalitativ interpolering."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can set the default interpolation method in the <link linkend=\"gimp-"
"prefs-tool-options\">Tools Options Preferences</link> dialog."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ange standardmetod för interpolering i dialogrutan <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-prefs-tool-options\">Inställningar för "
"verktygsalternativ</link>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"After transformation, the image can be bigger. This option will clip the "
"transformed image to the original image size."
msgstr ""
"Efter transformeringen kan bilden vara större. Alternativet klipper den "
"transformerade bilden till den ursprungliga bildstorleken."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "You can choose between several ways to clip:"
msgstr "Du kan välja mellan flera sätt att klippa:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Original image for examples"
msgstr "Ursprunglig bild för exempel"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Rotation applied with <quote>Adjust</quote>"
msgstr "Rotation med <quote>Anpassa</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Rotation applied with <quote>Adjust</quote> and canvas enlarged to layer "
"size"
msgstr ""
"Rotation med <quote>Anpassa</quote> och arbetsytan utökad till lagerstorlek"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"With Adjust: the layer is enlarged to contain all the rotated layer. The new"
" layer border is visible; the whole layer becomes visible by using the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Image</guimenu><guimenuitem>Fit Canvas to "
"Layers</guimenuitem></menuchoice> command."
msgstr ""
"Med Anpassa: lagret utökas så att hela det roterade lagret ryms. Den nya "
"lagerkanten syns; hela lagret blir synligt med kommandot "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Bild</guimenu><guimenuitem>Anpassa arbetsyta till "
"lager</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Example for Clip"
msgstr "Exempel på Klipp"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "With Clip: all what exceeds image limits is deleted."
msgstr "Med Klipp: allt som överskrider bildens gränser tas bort."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Crop to result"
msgstr "Beskär till resultat"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Example for Crop to result"
msgstr "Exempel på Beskär till resultat"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Rotation 45° with Crop to result"
msgstr "Rotation 45° med Beskär till resultat"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "The crop limit is marked with red. No transparent area is included."
msgstr ""
"Beskärningsgränsen är rödmarkerad. Inget genomskinligt område inkluderas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, the image is cropped so that the transparent "
"area, created by the transform operation in corners, will not be included in"
" the resulting image."
msgstr ""
"Om alternativet väljs beskärs bilden så att det genomskinliga område som "
"transformeringen skapar i hörnen inte inkluderas i den resulterande bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Crop with aspect"
msgstr "Beskär med bildförhållande"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This option works like the one described before, but makes sure, that the "
"aspect ratio is maintained."
msgstr ""
"Alternativet fungerar som det föregående, men ser till att bildförhållandet "
"bevaras."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Transformation tools"
msgstr "Transformeringsverktyg"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> lets you select among four Preview possibilities:"
msgstr ""
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> låter dig välja mellan fyra "
"förhandsgranskningsalternativ:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Puts a frame to mark the image outline, with a handle on each corner. "
"Movements will affect this frame only on the Preview, but the result of the "
"transformation will concern either the content or the boundaries of the "
"selection according to the selected Affect mode."
msgstr ""
"Lägger en ram som markerar bildens kontur, med ett handtag i varje hörn. "
"Rörelser påverkar endast ramen i förhandsgranskningen, men resultatet av "
"transformeringen gäller antingen innehållet eller markeringens gränser "
"enligt valt Påverka-läge."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Puts a grid on the image, with four handles. Movements will affect this grid"
" only on the Preview, but the result of the transformation will concern "
"either the content or the boundaries of the selection according to the "
"selected Transform mode."
msgstr ""
"Lägger ett rutnät över bilden med fyra handtag. Rörelser påverkar endast "
"rutnätet i förhandsgranskningen, men resultatet av transformeringen gäller "
"antingen innehållet eller markeringens gränser enligt valt "
"Transformeringsläge."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Here, the preview is a copy of the image superimposed on the image, with an "
"outline. Movements affect this copy and the underlying image appears."
msgstr ""
"Här är förhandsgranskningen en kopia av bilden som lagts över bilden med en "
"kontur. Rörelser påverkar kopian och den underliggande bilden visas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Grid+Image"
msgstr "Rutnät + bild"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Both turn at the same time."
msgstr "Båda vrids samtidigt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Options with grid activate a drop-list with two options: <guilabel>Number of"
" Grid Lines</guilabel> will allow control over the total number of displayed"
" grid lines. Use the slider to set the number of grid lines. <guilabel>Grid "
"Line Spacing</guilabel> allows control over the distance between the grid "
"lines. Use the slider to set the distance."
msgstr ""
"Alternativ med rutnät aktiverar en listruta med två val: <guilabel>Antal "
"rutnätslinjer</guilabel> styr det totala antalet visade rutnätslinjer. "
"Använd reglaget för att ange antalet rutnätslinjer. <guilabel>Avstånd mellan"
" rutnätslinjer</guilabel> styr avståndet mellan rutnätslinjerna. Använd "
"reglaget för att ange avståndet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "This slider lets you set the preview opacity."
msgstr "Med reglaget kan du ange förhandsgranskningens opacitet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"When rotating a path, Preview options are not valid: only Outline is active."
msgstr ""
"När en bana roteras är förhandsgranskningsalternativen inte tillgängliga: "
"endast Kontur är aktivt."

