#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Rotate An Image"
msgstr "Rotera en bild"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Images that are taken with digital cameras sometimes need to be rotated. To "
"do this, select <menuchoice moreinfo=\"none\"><guimenu "
"moreinfo=\"none\">Image</guimenu><guisubmenu "
"moreinfo=\"none\">Transform</guisubmenu><guimenuitem "
"moreinfo=\"none\">Rotate 90° clockwise</guimenuitem></menuchoice> (or "
"counter-clockwise) from the main menu. The images below demonstrate a 90 "
"degrees CCW rotation."
msgstr ""
"Bilder som tas med digitalkameror behöver ibland roteras. För att göra "
"detta, välj <menuchoice moreinfo=\"none\"><guimenu "
"moreinfo=\"none\">Bild</guimenu><guisubmenu "
"moreinfo=\"none\">Transform</guisubmenu><guimenuitem "
"moreinfo=\"none\">Rotera 90° medurs</guimenuitem></menuchoice> (eller "
"moturs) från huvudmenyn. Bilderna nedan demonstrerar en 90 graders rotation "
"moturs."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
