"innehåller dokumentet eller en del av det, antingen ordagranna kopior, eller"
" med ändringar och/eller översatt till ett annat språk."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"A <quote>Secondary Section</quote> is a named appendix or a front-matter "
"section of the Document that deals exclusively with the relationship of the "
"publishers or authors of the Document to the Document's overall subject (or "
"to related matters) and contains nothing that could fall directly within "
