#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This tool is designed to intelligently weigh the pixel colors of the "
"selection or active layer and reduce the number of colors while maintaining "
"a semblance of the original image characteristics."
msgstr ""
"Detta verktyg analyserar färgerna i markeringen eller det aktiva lagret och "
"minskar antalet färger, samtidigt som bildens ursprungliga egenskaper i "
"stora drag bevaras."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can find this tool from the image-menu through: "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</guimenu><guisubmenu>Color "
"Tools</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Posterize</guimenuitem></menuchoice> or "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Colors</guimenu><guimenuitem>Posterize</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du hittar verktyget i bildmenyn via: "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Verktyg</guimenu><guisubmenu>Färgverktyg</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Posterisera</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
" eller "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Färger</guimenu><guimenuitem>Posterisera</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"or by clicking the <guiicon><inlinegraphic fileref=\"images/toolbox/stock-"
"tool-posterize-22.png\"/></guiicon> icon in ToolBox, if Color Tools have "
"been added to it."
msgstr ""
"eller genom att klicka på ikonen <guiicon><inlinegraphic "
"fileref=\"images/toolbox/stock-tool-posterize-22.png\"/></guiicon> i "
"verktygslådan, om Färgverktyg har lagts till där."

