#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Measure a distance"
msgstr "Mät ett avstånd"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Measure an angle"
msgstr "Mät en vinkel"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Measure a surface"
msgstr "Mät en yta"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Measure tool"
msgstr "Mätverktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The Measure Tool is used to gain knowledge about pixel distances in your "
"working image. By clicking and holding the mouse button, you can determine "
"the angle and number of pixels between the point of click and where the "
"mouse pointer is located. The information is displayed on the status bar or "
"can also be displayed in the Info Window."
msgstr ""
"Mätverktyget används för att ta reda på pixelavstånd i bilden du arbetar "
"med. Genom att klicka och hålla ned musknappen kan du bestämma vinkeln och "
"antalet bildpunkter mellan klickpunkten och muspekarens aktuella position. "
"Informationen visas i statusraden eller kan också visas i "
"informationsfönstret."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"When you pass the mouse pointer over the end point it turns to a move "
"pointer. Then if you click you can resume the measure."
msgstr ""
"När du för muspekaren över slutpunkten ändras den till en flyttpil. Om du "
"sedan klickar kan du återuppta mätningen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Distance between the original point and the mouse pointer, in pixels."
msgstr "Avståndet mellan ursprungspunkten och muspekaren, i bildpunkter."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Angle, in every quadrant, from 0° to 90°."
msgstr "Vinkel, i varje kvadrant, från 0° till 90°."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Pointer coordinates relative to the original point."
msgstr "Pekarens koordinater i förhållande till ursprungspunkten."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Information is displayed in the <link linkend=\"gimp-image-window-status-"
"bar\">status bar</link>, at the bottom of the Image window: <placeholder-1/>"
msgstr ""
"Information visas i <link linkend=\"gimp-image-window-status-"
"bar\">statusraden</link>, längst ned i bildfönstret: <placeholder-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can get to the Measure Tool from the image-menu through: "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</guimenu><guimenuitem>Measure</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgstr ""
"Du kan komma åt Mätverktyget från bildmenyn via: "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Verktyg</guimenu><guimenuitem>Mät</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"or by clicking the tool icon: <guiicon><inlinegraphic "
"fileref=\"images/toolbox/stock-tool-measure-22.png\"/></guiicon> in Toolbox."
msgstr ""
"eller genom att klicka på verktygsikonen: <guiicon><inlinegraphic "
"fileref=\"images/toolbox/stock-tool-measure-22.png\"/></guiicon> i "
"verktygslådan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Holding down the <keycap>Shift</keycap> allows to start a new measure from "
"the pointed point without deleting the previous measure. Angle is measured "
"from the previous line and not from the default horizontal. The mouse "
"pointer goes with a <quote>+</quote> sign. So, you can <emphasis>measure any"
" angle</emphasis> on the image."
msgstr ""
"Om du håller ned <keycap>Skift</keycap> kan du starta en ny mätning från den"
" utpekade punkten utan att ta bort föregående mätning. Vinkeln mäts från "
"föregående linje och inte från standardhorisontalen. Muspekaren får ett "
"<quote>+</quote>-tecken. Du kan alltså <emphasis>mäta vilken vinkel som "
"helst</emphasis> i bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Holding down the <keycap>Ctrl</keycap> key puts the tool into constrained "
"straight line mode. The orientation of the line is constrained to the "
"nearest multiple of 15 degrees."
msgstr ""
"Om du håller ned <keycap>Ctrl</keycap> placeras verktyget i begränsat rakt "
"linjeläge. Linjens orientering begränsas till närmaste multipel av 15 "
"grader."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<keycap>Ctrl</keycap> key pressed and click on an end point creates a "
"horizontal guide. The mouse pointer goes with the <guiicon><inlinegraphic "
"fileref=\"images/toolbox/measure-horiz.png\"/></guiicon> icon."
msgstr ""
"När <keycap>Ctrl</keycap> hålls ned och du klickar på en slutpunkt skapas en"
" vågrät hjälplinje. Muspekaren får ikonen <guiicon><inlinegraphic "
"fileref=\"images/toolbox/measure-horiz.png\"/></guiicon>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<keycap>Alt</keycap> key and click on an end point creates a vertical guide."
" The mouse pointer goes with the <guiicon><inlinegraphic "
"fileref=\"images/toolbox/measure-vert.png\"/></guiicon> icon."
msgstr ""
"När <keycap>Alt</keycap> hålls ned och du klickar på en slutpunkt skapas en "
"lodrät hjälplinje. Muspekaren får ikonen <guiicon><inlinegraphic "
"fileref=\"images/toolbox/measure-vert.png\"/></guiicon>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This key combination and click on a measure line allows to move the measure."
msgstr ""
"Med denna tangentkombination och ett klick på en mätlinje kan du flytta "
"mätningen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>Alt</keycap></keycombo> key "
"combination and click on an end point creates a vertical and a horizontal "
"guides."
msgstr ""
"Tangentkombinationen "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>Alt</keycap></keycombo> och ett klick"
" på en slutpunkt skapar en lodrät och en vågrät hjälplinje."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "<quote>Measure</quote> tool options"
msgstr "Verktygsalternativ för <quote>Mät</quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Use Info Window"
msgstr "Använd informationsfönster"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"This option will display an Info Window dialog that details the measure tool"
" results. The results are more complete on the status bar."
msgstr ""
"Detta alternativ visar dialogrutan Informationsfönster med detaljerade "
"resultat från mätverktyget. Resultaten är mer fullständiga i statusraden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Measuring surfaces"
msgstr "Mäta ytor"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can't measure surfaces directly, but you can use the <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-histogram-dialog\">Histogram</link> that gives you the number"
" of pixels in a selection."
msgstr ""
"Du kan inte mäta ytor direkt, men du kan använda <link linkend=\"gimp-"
"histogram-dialog\">Histogram</link>, som visar antalet bildpunkter i en "
"markering."

