"fileref=\"images/toolbox/stock-convert-grayscale-16.png\"/></guiicon> in "
"Toolbox, if this tool has been installed there (see <link linkend=\"gimp-"
"tools-dialog\">Tools dialog</link>."
msgstr ""
"genom att klicka på verktygsikonen <guiicon><inlinegraphic "
"fileref=\"images/toolbox/stock-convert-grayscale-16.png\"/></guiicon> i "
"verktygslådan, om verktyget har installerats där (se <link linkend=\"gimp-"
