msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/toolbox/auto-shrink2.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Width / Height</guilabel>: only Width or Height will remain fixed."
" The value of this dimension can be set in the text box below; it defaults "
"to 100 pixels."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Bredd/höjd</guilabel>: endast bredden eller höjden förblir fast. "
"Värdet för dimensionen kan anges i textrutan nedan; standardvärdet är 100 "
"bildpunkter."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Size</guilabel>: both Width and Height will be fixed. Their values"
" can be set in the text box below, in the form <quote>150x100</quote> for "
"example. The crop rectangle will adopt this values as soon as you click the "
"image. On the right, two buttons let you choose a "
"<guibutton>Landscape</guibutton> (widthwise) or "
"<guibutton>Portrait</guibutton> (upright) format for the crop rectangle."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Storlek</guilabel>: både bredd och höjd är fasta. Deras värden kan"
" anges i textrutan nedan, till exempel som <quote>150x100</quote>. "
"Beskärningsrektangeln får dessa värden så snart du klickar på bilden. Till "
"höger finns två knappar där du kan välja <guibutton>Landskap</guibutton> "
"(liggande) eller <guibutton>Porträtt</guibutton> (stående) format för "
"beskärningsrektangeln."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/toolbox/toolbox-blur.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/toolbox/toolbox-blur.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/toolbox/tool-options-blur-sharpen.png'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/toolbox/tool-options-blur-sharpen.png'; md5=THIS FILE "
"DOESN'T EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Blur/Sharpen tool icon in the Toolbox"
msgstr "Ikon för Smeta ut/skärpa i verktygslådan"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"In <quote>Sharpen</quote> mode, the tool works by increasing the contrast "
"where the brush is applied. A little bit of this may be useful, but over-"
"application will produce noise. Some of the <link linkend=\"filters-"
"enhance\">Enhancement Filters</link>, particularly the <link linkend=\"plug-"
"in-unsharp-mask\">Unsharp Mask</link>, do a much cleaner job of sharpening "
"areas of a layer."
msgstr ""
"I läget <quote>Skärpa</quote> fungerar verktyget genom att öka kontrasten "
"där penseln används. En liten mängd kan vara användbar, men för mycket "
"skapar brus. Vissa <link linkend=\"filters-"
"enhance\">Förbättringsfilter</link>, särskilt <link linkend=\"plug-in-"
"unsharp-mask\">Oskarp mask</link>, ger en mycket renare skärpning av områden"
" i ett lager."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"You can create a more sophisticated sharpening brush using the Clone tool. "
"To do this, start by duplicating the layer you want to work on, and run a "
"sharpening filter, such as Unsharp Mask, on the copy. Then activate the "
"Clone tool, and in its Tool Options set Source to <quote>Image "
"source</quote> and Alignment to <quote>Registered</quote>. Set the Opacity "
"to a modest value, such as 10. Then Ctrl-click on the copy to make it the "
"source image. If you now paint on the original layer, you will mix together,"
" where the brush is applied, the sharpened version with the unsharpened "
"version."
msgstr ""
"Du kan skapa en mer avancerad skärpepensel med verktyget Klona. Börja med "
"att duplicera lagret som du vill arbeta med och kör ett skärpefilter, "
"exempelvis Oskarp mask, på kopian. Aktivera sedan Klona-verktyget och ange i"
" dess verktygsalternativ <quote>Bildkälla</quote> som Källa och "
"<quote>Registrerad</quote> som Justering. Ange ett måttligt värde för "
"Opacitet, till exempel 10. Ctrl-klicka sedan på kopian för att göra den till"
" källbild. När du målar på originallagret blandas den skärpta och oskärpta "
"versionen där penseln används."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"From the image-menu: <menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</guimenu><guisubmenu>Paint "
"tools</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Blur/Sharpen</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Från bildmenyn: "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Verktyg</guimenu><guisubmenu>Målarverktyg</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Smeta"
" ut/skärpa</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"The Tool can also be called by clicking the tool icon: "
"<guiicon><inlinegraphic fileref=\"images/toolbox/stock-tool-"
"blur-22.png\"/></guiicon> in the Toolbox."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också öppna verktyget genom att klicka på verktygsikonen: "
"<guiicon><inlinegraphic fileref=\"images/toolbox/stock-tool-"
"blur-22.png\"/></guiicon> i verktygslådan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"By using the keyboard shortcut <keycap>Shift</keycap><keycap>U</keycap>."
msgstr ""
"Genom att använda tangentbordsgenvägen "
"<keycap>Skift</keycap><keycap>U</keycap>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"See the <link linkend=\"gimp-tool-brush\">Brush Tools Overview</link> for a "
"description of key modifiers that have the same effect on all brush tools."
msgstr ""
"Se <link linkend=\"gimp-tool-brush\">Översikt över penselverktyg</link> för "
"en beskrivning av väljartangenter som har samma effekt i alla penselverktyg."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<keycap>Ctrl</keycap>: Holding down the Ctrl key toggles between Blur and "
"Sharpen modes; it reverses the setting shown in the Tool Options."
msgstr ""
"<keycap>Ctrl</keycap>: Om du håller ned Ctrl växlar du mellan lägena Smeta "
"ut och Skärpa; inställningen som visas i verktygsalternativen omvänds."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid "Tool Options for the Blur/Sharpen tool"
msgstr "Alternativ för verktyget Smeta ut/skärpa"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"Opacity; Brush; Scale; Brush Dynamics; Fade Out; Apply Jitter; Hard Edges"
msgstr ""
"Opacitet; pensel; skala; penseldynamik; tona ut; tillämpa spridning; hårda "
"kanter"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Blur</emphasis> mode causes each pixel affected by the brush to be"
" blended with neighboring pixels, thereby increasing the similarity of "
"pixels inside the brushstroke area. <emphasis>Sharpen</emphasis> mode causes"
" each pixel to become more different from its neighbors than it previously "
"was: it increases contrast inside the brushstroke area. Too much Sharpen "
"ends in an ugly flocculation aspect. Whatever setting you choose here, you "
"can reverse it on-the-fly by holding down the Ctrl key."
msgstr ""
"Läget <emphasis>Smeta ut</emphasis> gör att varje pixel som påverkas av "
"penseln blandas med närliggande pixlar, vilket ökar likheten mellan pixlarna"
" inom penseldragets område. Läget <emphasis>Skärpa</emphasis> gör i stället "
"varje pixel mer olik sina grannar än tidigare: kontrasten ökar inom "
"penseldragets område. För mycket skärpa ger ett fult fläckigt utseende. "
"Oavsett vilken inställning du väljer här kan du växla den tillfälligt genom "
"att hålla ned Ctrl."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/toolbox/toolbox-eyedropper.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/toolbox/toolbox-eyedropper.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T "
"EXIST"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gimp-help — GIMP User Manual/master
msgid ""
