#. from gnome:reviewed/graphs/main
msgid ""
"<b>X Value Calculation</b>\n"
"\n"
"Enter an equation to calculate X values.\n"
"Use 'n' for the row index (starting from 0).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Examples:</b>\n"
"• <b>n</b> → 0, 1, 2, 3, 4…\n"
"• <b>n*0.5</b> → 0, 0.5, 1.0, 1.5, 2.0…\n"
"• <b>n^2</b> → 0, 1, 4, 9, 16…\n"
"• <b>2^n</b> → 1, 2, 4, 8, 16…\n"
"• <b>n*10+100</b> → 100, 110, 120, 130…"
msgstr ""
"<b>X-värdesberäkning</b>\n"
"\n"
"Ange en ekvation för att beräkna X-värden.\n"
"Använd ”n” för radindexet (med början på 0).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Exempel:</b>\n"
"• <b>n</b> → 0, 1, 2, 3, 4…\n"
"• <b>n*0.5</b> → 0, 0.5, 1.0, 1.5, 2.0…\n"
"• <b>n^2</b> → 0, 1, 4, 9, 16…\n"
"• <b>2^n</b> → 1, 2, 4, 8, 16…\n"
"• <b>n*10+100</b> → 100, 110, 120, 130…"

#. from gnome:reviewed/graphs/main
msgid ""
"<b>Uses regex pattern matching</b>\n"
"\n"
"These characters have special meanings in regex syntax:\n"
"<b>. * + ? [ ] ^ $ | \\ ( ) { }</b>\n"
"\n"
"To match these characters literally, escape them with <b>\\</b>\n"
"\n"
"<b>Examples:</b>\n"
"• <b>\\.</b> matches a period\n"
"• <b>\\*</b> matches an asterisk\n"
"• <b>\\|</b> matches a pipe character\n"
"\n"
"<a href='https://docs.python.org/3/library/re.html#regular-expression-syntax'>Learn more about regex syntax…</a>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Använder matchning med reguljära uttryck</b>\n"
"\n"
"Dessa tecken har särskilda betydelser i syntaxen för reguljära uttryck:\n"
"<b>. * + ? [ ] ^ $ | \\ ( ) { }</b>\n"
"\n"
"För att matcha tecknen ordagrant ska du föregå dem med <b>\\</b>\n"
"\n"
"<b>Exempel:</b>\n"
"• <b>\\.</b> matchar en punkt\n"
"• <b>\\*</b> matchar en asterisk\n"
"• <b>\\|</b> matchar ett lodrätt streck\n"
"\n"
"<a href='https://docs.python.org/3/library/re.html#regular-expression-syntax'>Läs mer om syntaxen för reguljära uttryck…</a>"

