"You may be able to ignore this error and carry on working, but you may get unexpected results.\n"
"\n"
"Please tell the developers about this using the issue tracker if no-one else has reported it yet."
msgstr ""
"Du kan möjligen ignorera detta fel och jobba på, men du kan få oväntade resultat.\n"
