#. from gnome:reviewed/constrict/main
msgid ""
"Constrict compresses your videos to your chosen file size — useful for "
"uploading to services with specific file size limits. No more relying on "
"online services for video compression, or the manual trial-and-error of re-"
"encoding at various bitrates yourself."
msgstr ""
"Constrict komprimerar dina videoklipp till din valda filstorlek — användbart"
" för att skicka till tjänster med specifika filstorleksgränser. Inget mer "
"behov av nättjänster för videokomprimering, eller att själv prova sig fram "
"med manuell omkodning i olika bithastigheter."

#. from gnome:reviewed/constrict/main
msgid "Features include:"
msgstr "Funktioner omfattar:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/constrict/main
msgid "An intuitive, easy to use interface."
msgstr "Ett intuitivt, lättanvänt gränssnitt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/constrict/main
msgid ""
"Automatic calculation of average bitrate (ABR), resolution, framerate, and "
"audio quality each video is re-encoded with to meet the target file size."
msgstr ""
"Automatisk uträkning av medelbithastighet (ABR), upplösning, bildfrekvens "
"och ljudkvalitet som varje videoklipp omkodas med för att uppnå "
"målfilstorleken."

#. from gnome:reviewed/constrict/main
msgid "Bulk compression of multiple videos to one output directory."
msgstr "Masskomprimering av flera videoklipp till en utdatakatalog."

#. from gnome:reviewed/constrict/main
msgid ""
"Customization of framerate limits, to ensure a clearer or smoother image."
msgstr ""
"Anpassning av bildfrekvensgränser för att säkerställa en klarare eller "
"mjukare bild."

#. from gnome:reviewed/constrict/main
msgid ""
"A choice of codecs to encode output files with, including H.264, HEVC, AV1, "
"and VP9."
msgstr ""
"Ett val av kodekar att koda utdatafiler med, innefattande H.264, HEVC, AV1 "
"och VP9."

#. from gnome:reviewed/constrict/main
msgid ""
"The app attempts to retain as much audiovisual quality as possible for the "
"file size given. However, extremely steep reductions in file size can cause "
"significant loss of quality in the output file, and sometimes compression "
"may not be possible at all. All processing is done locally — and as such, "
"compression speeds are only as fast as your hardware allows."
msgstr ""
"Programmet försöker bibehålla så mycket audiovisuell kvalitet som möjligt "
"för den angivna filstorleken. Extremt stora reduceringar i filstorlek kan "
"dock orsaka betydande förlust av kvalitet i utdatafilen, och ibland kan "
"komprimering kanske inte ens vara möjlig. All bearbetning görs lokalt — och "
"på så vis är komprimeringshastigheter endast så snabba som din hårdvara "
"tillåter."

#. from gnome:reviewed/constrict/main
msgid "Source videos queued for compression"
msgstr "Källvideor köade för komprimering"

