#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"When editing a formula, if the cursor is at a point where a cell reference "
"or range would be appropriate, the reference or range can be selected using "
"the mouse. If the mouse is used to click on a cell, the reference of that "
"cell will be entered into a formula. Alternatively, if the mouse is used to "
"drag a selection over a range of cells, that cell range will become part of "
"the formula. The selected range will be highlighted by a border of moving "
"black dashes, commonly called the \"marching ants\" border."
msgstr ""
"När du redigerar en formel och markören står där en cellreferens eller ett "
"cellområde kan anges, kan du välja referensen eller området med musen. "
"Klicka på en cell för att lägga in dess referens i formeln. Du kan också dra"
" över ett cellområde så att området läggs till i formeln. Det markerade "
"området ramas in av svarta streck som rör sig, ofta kallade ”vandrande "
"myror”."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Begin entering a formula as you would normally. Stop at the point where a "
"cell reference is appropriate. For example, example, type "
"<userinput>=exp(</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"Börja skriva en formel som vanligt. Stanna där en cellreferens ska stå. "
"Skriv till exempel <userinput>=exp(</userinput>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Click on the cell you want to reference. Its reference will be entered into "
"the formula."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på cellen du vill referera till. Cellreferensen läggs till i formeln."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"To finish the formula, just type in the closing parenthesis. This will also "
"\"unselect\" the region."
msgstr ""
"Avsluta formeln genom att skriva den avslutande parentesen. Då avmarkeras "
"även området."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The mouse can be used to select a single cell, a continuous range of cells "
"or several disjoint ranges of cells just like regular selections."
msgstr ""
"Du kan använda musen för att markera en enskild cell, ett sammanhängande "
"cellområde eller flera åtskilda cellområden, precis som vid vanliga "
"markeringar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If entering lots of formulas or even just entering a few formulas, it is "
"often quickest to use the keyboard to select cells and ranges of cells for "
"use in formulas. Just as reaching a input point allows the user to select "
"cells with the mouse, it is possible to use the keyboard to select cells. "
"Just use the cursor keys and selection modifiers to create a selection."
msgstr ""
"När du skriver många formler, eller bara några få, går det ofta snabbast att"
" använda tangentbordet för att markera celler och cellområden som ska ingå i"
" formlerna. Precis som när du når en position i formeln där du kan välja "
"celler med musen, kan du välja dem med tangentbordet. Använd piltangenterna "
"och tangenter som utökar markeringen för att göra en markering."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Enter a formula, but stop the cursor at a point where a cell reference is "
"appropriate. For this example, =SUM("
msgstr ""
"Skriv en formel, men stanna där cellreferensen ska stå. I det här exemplet "
"skriver du =SUM("

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Move the selection around with the cursor keys. Move the selection cursor to"
" cell B1 to start the selection."
msgstr ""
"Flytta markeringen med piltangenterna. Placera markeringsmarkören på cell B1"
" för att börja markera området."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Hold down <keycap>Shift</keycap> and move the selection one cell over and "
"one cell down. Cells B1,B2,C1,C2 should now be selected and the formula "
"should show =sum(B1:C2"
msgstr ""
"Håll ned <keycap>Shift</keycap> och flytta markeringen en cell åt höger och "
"en cell nedåt. Nu ska cellerna B1, B2, C1 och C2 vara markerade och formeln "
"ska visa =sum(B1:C2"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"To finish the function, close the parenthesis. The cell should now show "
"=sum(B1:C2). Press enter and the formula is entered."
msgstr ""
"Avsluta funktionen med en högerparentes. Cellen ska nu visa =sum(B1:C2). "
"Tryck på Enter för att mata in formeln."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"To select a range of cell, hold <keycap>Shift</keycap> and move over the "
"desired area."
msgstr ""
"Håll ned <keycap>Shift</keycap> och flytta markeringen över det önskade "
"området för att markera ett cellområde."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"To stop entering a selection or to start over, press "
"<keycombo><keycap>Shift</keycap> <keycap>Backspace</keycap></keycombo>"
msgstr ""
"Om du vill avbryta en markering eller börja om trycker du på "
"<keycombo><keycap>Shift</keycap> <keycap>Backspace</keycap></keycombo>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Errors are almost never entered directly into a spreadsheet but usually "
"arise from problems which <application>Gnumeric</application> encounters "
"during calculations. A list of errors with their meanings is presented in "
"<xref linkend=\"sect-data-errors\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Fel matas nästan aldrig in direkt i ett kalkylblad, utan uppstår vanligtvis "
"när <application>Gnumeric</application> stöter på problem under beräkningar."
" En lista över fel och vad de betyder finns i <xref linkend=\"sect-data-"
"errors\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"In an unusual case where it is needed, an error can be entered by hand like "
"the entry of other elements. First the cell must be selected, then the error"
" must be entered (e.g. #DIV/0!) and finally the <keysym>Enter</keysym> key "
"must be pressed."
msgstr ""
"I ovanliga fall kan du behöva mata in ett fel manuellt, på samma sätt som "
"andra värden. Markera cellen, skriv felet (till exempel #DIV/0!) och tryck "
"på <keysym>Enter</keysym>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"This section describes advanced methods for data entry in "
"<application>Gnumeric</application>. This includes techniques useful when "
"adding large amounts of data, methods to automatically catch mistakes during"
" data entry, using pre-defined templates to format data input, obtaining "
"data from external sources and generating sequences of random numbers with "
"defined distributions."
msgstr ""
"I det här avsnittet beskrivs avancerade metoder för att mata in data i "
"<application>Gnumeric</application>. Här ingår tekniker för att lägga till "
"stora datamängder, automatiskt upptäcka inmatningsfel, formatera data med "
"fördefinierade mallar, hämta data från externa källor och skapa slumpmässiga"
" talserier med angivna fördelningar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"It is sometimes necessary to enter large amounts of data by hand into a "
"spreadsheet. To facilitate this work, <application>Gnumeric</application> "
"provides several techniques to facilitate the entry of large amounts of "
"data."
msgstr ""
"Ibland behöver stora datamängder matas in manuellt i ett kalkylblad. "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> har flera tekniker som underlättar sådan"
" inmatning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If data are to be entered into a series of rows or columns, this region can "
"be selected ahead of time thereby modifying the behaviour of the data entry "
"keys (the <keysym>Enter</keysym>, <keysym>Tab</keysym> and arrow keys)."
msgstr ""
"Om du ska mata in data i en serie rader eller kolumner kan du markera "
"området i förväg. Då ändras beteendet hos tangenterna för datainmatning "
"(<keysym>Enter</keysym>, <keysym>Tab</keysym> och piltangenterna)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Select the region with the mouse. For example, the region from cell C4 to "
"cell E8 can be selected by clicking with the left mouse button on cell C4 "
"and dragging the mouse cursor to cell E8. (More information on complex "
"selections is presented below.)"
msgstr ""
"Markera området med musen. Till exempel kan området från cell C4 till cell "
"E8 markeras genom att klicka med vänster musknapp på cell C4 och dra "
"muspekaren till cell E8. (Mer information om komplicerade markeringar finns "
"nedan.)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Enter data by typing the data and the <keysym>Enter</keysym> key. If this is"
" done repeatedly, the fifth time the <keysym>Enter</keysym> key is pressed, "
"the selection will not move to cell C9 but will jump up to cell D4."
msgstr ""
"Skriv in data och tryck på <keysym>Enter</keysym>. Om du upprepar detta "
"flyttas markeringen, när du trycker på <keysym>Enter</keysym> femte gången, "
"inte till cell C9 utan tillbaka till cell D4."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The <keysym>Tab</keysym> key can also be used instead of the "
"<keysym>Enter</keysym> key to move sequentially through the selection."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också använda <keysym>Tab</keysym> i stället för "
"<keysym>Enter</keysym> för att flytta stegvis genom markeringen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"It is often necessary to enter a regular sequence of numbers or a repeated "
"sequence of text. <application>Gnumeric</application> provides several ways "
"to input series and sequences of this kind."
msgstr ""
"Du kan behöva mata in en regelbunden talföljd eller upprepa samma text flera"
" gånger. <application>Gnumeric</application> erbjuder flera sätt att mata in"
" sådana serier och följder."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The simplest way to fill a series with the same element repeated involves "
"entering the element once and dragging the selection box to fill that "
"element repeatedly. For example, the text \"employee:\" could be input into "
"cell C2. That cell could then be selected. The selection box is a thick "
"white rectangle which surrounds the cell. This selection box has a small "
"white square at the bottom right hand corner. If the mouse cursor is placed "
"above this square box, it changes to a thin cross. If the left hand mouse "
"button is clicked and held, and the mouse dragged to cell C10, "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> will automatically fill all of the cells"
" with the identical string."
msgstr ""
"Det enklaste sättet att fylla en serie med samma värde är att mata in värdet"
" en gång och dra markeringsrutan för att upprepa det. Skriv till exempel "
"texten ”employee:” i cell C2 och markera sedan cellen. Markeringsrutan är en"
" tjock vit rektangel runt cellen med en liten vit ruta i det nedre högra "
"hörnet. När du för muspekaren över den lilla rutan ändras pekaren till ett "
"tunt kors. Håll ned vänster musknapp och dra till cell C10. Då fyller "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> automatiskt cellerna med samma text."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"An alternative way to enter data into a region involves first selecting the "
"region, then typing the value and finally typing the "
"<keycombo><keysym>Ctrl</keysym><keysym>Enter</keysym></keycombo> key "
"combination. This will fill the whole region with the identical value which "
"was originally entered."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också markera området först, skriva värdet och sedan trycka på "
"<keycombo><keysym>Ctrl</keysym><keysym>Enter</keysym></keycombo>. Då fylls "
"hela området med det angivna värdet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"A similar method is available to fill sequences of integers. If the example "
"just given was altered so that cell C2 had the number 14 and the "
"<keysym>Ctrl</keysym> key was held during the dragging of the selection, "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> will automatically fill the cells C2 to "
"C10 with the series 14,15,16,...,22."
msgstr ""
"Du kan på liknande sätt fylla en talserie med heltal. Om du i exemplet ovan "
"skriver 14 i C2 och håller ned <keysym>Ctrl</keysym> medan du drar "
"markeringen, fyller <application>Gnumeric</application> automatiskt cellerna"
" C2 till C10 med serien 14, 15, 16, …, 22."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"More complex series and sequences of data can be entered with a similar "
"mechanism."
msgstr ""
"Du kan även mata in mer komplicerade serier och följder på liknande sätt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Enter a value into the first cell you wish to autofill. For example, the "
"cell C2 could have the number \"24\" entered."
msgstr ""
"Ange ett värde i den första cellen som ska fyllas automatiskt. Skriv till "
"exempel talet 24 i C2."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Enter a second value into the second cell you wish to autofill. This must be"
" adjacent to the first cell. This sets the increment to use when autofilling"
" the rest of your cells. For example, the cell D2 could have the number "
"\"28\" entered."
msgstr ""
"Ange ett andra värde i cellen intill den första. Det anger steglängden som "
"används när de återstående cellerna fylls automatiskt. Skriv till exempel "
"talet 28 i D2."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Select both the cells just entered. At the bottom-right of the selection "
"should be a small box. Your mouse cursor will change to a cross-hair when "
"placed over the box. Press and hold on the box. Drag in the direction, "
"either vertical or horizontal, you wish to increment and release when all "
"the cells are filled. For example, selecting cells C2 and D2, then dragging "
"the bottom right of the selection to cell I2 will fill the cells with the "
"sequence from 24 to 48 with each increment being 4."
msgstr ""
"Markera båda cellerna. Längst ned till höger på markeringen finns en liten "
"ruta. När du för muspekaren över rutan ändras den till ett hårkors. Håll "
"musknappen nedtryckt på rutan, dra lodrätt eller vågrätt för att utöka "
"serien och släpp när alla celler har fyllts. Om du markerar C2 och D2 och "
"drar markeringens nedre högra hörn till I2 fylls cellerna med värdena 24 "
"till 48 i steg om 4."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"An alternative to the last step involves using the menus. Once the first two"
" values have been input, the whole range to be filled can be selected using "
"the mouse and then the <guimenuitem>Autofill</guimenuitem> selection can be "
"made from the <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> and <guisubmenu>Fill</guisubmenu>. "
"This will automatically complete the series in the selected region."
msgstr ""
"I stället för det sista steget kan du använda menyerna. När de två första "
"värdena har matats in markerar du hela området som ska fyllas och väljer "
"<guimenuitem>Autofyll</guimenuitem> under <guimenu>Redigera</guimenu> → "
"<guisubmenu>Fyll</guisubmenu>. Då kompletteras serien automatiskt i det "
"markerade området."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> supports incrementing the date by month,"
" date, or year."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan öka datumet med en månad, en dag "
"eller ett år."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Note that, While <application>Gnumeric</application> will increment days of "
"the month, if you do 11/14/2001 and 12/14/2001, it will recognize it as the "
"same day of the month and increment the month so the next value would be to "
"1/14/2002 instead of the day difference."
msgstr ""
"Observera att <application>Gnumeric</application> tolkar datumen 2001-11-14 "
"och 2001-12-14 som samma dag i olika månader. Därför blir nästa värde "
"2002-01-14, alltså samma dag i månaden, i stället för ett datum med lika "
"stort dagintervall."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> is able to increment several types of "
"data beyond simple integers. The procedure is the same as described above "
"but involves different starting values. <application>Gnumeric</application> "
"can increment: <_:variablelist-1/>"
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan öka flera typer av värden, inte bara"
" heltal. Tillvägagångssättet är detsamma som ovan, men startvärdena skiljer "
"sig. <application>Gnumeric</application> kan öka: <_:variablelist-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> can be explicitly told the cells to "
"autofill as in the examples above, but it can also guess the number of cells"
" to fill based on the length of an adjacent column or row. For example, if "
"the cells B2 to B10 have information and cell C2 has the integer value "
"\"1\", then selecting cell C2 and double clicking on the bottom rightmost "
"box of the selection rectangle will fill the value \"1\" from cell C3 to "
"cell C10."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ange vilka celler <application>Gnumeric</application> ska fylla "
"automatiskt, som i exemplen ovan. Programmet kan också avgöra hur många "
"celler som ska fyllas utifrån längden på en intilliggande kolumn eller rad. "
"Om cellerna B2 till B10 innehåller data och C2 har heltalsvärdet 1 fylls "
"värdet 1 i cellerna C3 till C10 när du markerar C2 och dubbelklickar på "
"rutan längst ned till höger på markeringen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The entry of large amounts of data into a spreadsheet is tedious work which "
"is prone to repeated mistakes. <application>Gnumeric</application> provides "
"a tool to automatically correct commonly made simple mistakes. The "
"corrections are configured and activated using the `AutoCorrect' dialog, "
"available via <guimenuitem>Auto Correct</guimenuitem> in the "
"<guimenu>Tools</guimenu> menu."
msgstr ""
"Det är tidskrävande att mata in stora datamängder och lätt att göra samma "
"misstag flera gånger. <application>Gnumeric</application> har ett verktyg "
"som automatiskt rättar vanliga, enkla misstag. Du konfigurerar och aktiverar"
" rättningarna i dialogrutan ”Autokorrigera”, som öppnas via "
"<guimenuitem>Autokorrigera</guimenuitem> i menyn <guimenu>Verktyg</guimenu>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/dialog-auto-correct.png\"/> "
"</imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the auto-correct "
"dialog.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/dialog-auto-correct.png\"/> "
"</imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av dialogrutan för "
"autokorrigering.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If this correction rule is activated, the first letter of a name of a day is"
" capitalized automatically. For example, if you type `monday', it is "
"automatically replaced by `Monday'."
msgstr ""
"Om den här regeln är aktiverad blir veckodagarnas första bokstav automatiskt"
" en versal. Om du till exempel skriver ”måndag” ersätts det automatiskt med "
"”Måndag”."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"A common mistake is to hold down the shift key a little bit too long while "
"typing initial letters. When it happens, you will get two initial capitals "
"instead of one. If this correction rule is activated, the second letter of "
"words beginning with two capital letters is automatically lowercased. For "
"example, if you type `TOtal' into a cell it is replaced by `Total'. Note "
"that if the word contains two capital letters only, it is not replaced."
msgstr ""
"Ett vanligt misstag är att hålla ned Shift-tangenten för länge när du "
"skriver ett ords första bokstäver. Då blir de två första bokstäverna "
"versaler. Om regeln är aktiverad ändras den andra bokstaven i ord som börjar"
" med två versaler automatiskt till en gemen. Skriver du till exempel ”TOtal”"
" i en cell ersätts det med ”Total”. Ord som bara består av två versaler "
"ändras inte."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"It is possible to specify exceptions to this tool. For example, you do not "
"want the tool to replace the word `PVbonds' when it is typed. To specify "
"exceptions, type `PVbonds' into the ``Do not correct'' entry, and press "
"``Add'' button. Now the word should be included in the list of exceptions. "
"To remove a word from the list, select the word and press the ``Remove'' "
"button."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ange undantag för verktyget. Om du till exempel inte vill att "
"”PVbonds” ska ändras skriver du in ”PVbonds” i fältet ”Korrigera inte” och "
"klickar på ”Lägg till”. Ordet visas då i undantagslistan. Markera ordet och "
"klicka på ”Ta bort” om du vill ta bort det."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If this correction rule is activated, the first letter of a sentence typed "
"into a cell is capitalized, if it is a lowercase letter in the first place. "
"Only text that ends to a dot is considered a sentence."
msgstr ""
"Om den här regeln är aktiverad blir den första bokstaven i en mening "
"automatiskt en versal, om den är en gemen från början. Bara text som "
"avslutas med punkt räknas som en mening."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"It is possible to specify exceptions to this tool. For example, you do not "
"want the tool to capitalize letters after acronym `i.g.'. To specify "
"exceptions, type `i.g.' into the ``Do not capitalize after'' entry, and "
"press ``Add'' button. Now the word should be included in the list of "
"exceptions. To remove a word from the list, select the word and press the "
"``Remove'' button."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ange undantag för verktyget. Om du till exempel inte vill att text "
"efter förkortningen ”i.g.” ska ändras skriver du ”i.g.” i fältet ”Inför inte"
" stor bokstav efter” och klickar på ”Lägg till”. Förkortningen visas då i "
"undantagslistan. Markera ordet och klicka på ”Ta bort” om du vill ta bort "
"det."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-random.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the random "
"number generation tool.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-random.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av verktyget "
"för slumptalsgenerering.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Use the random number generation tool to generate random numbers. This tool "
"can generate random numbers from various probability distributions."
msgstr ""
"Använd slumptalsgeneratorn för att skapa tal från olika "
"sannolikhetsfördelningar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Specify the random distribution by selecting one of the items from the "
"random distribution list. The following random distributions are supported: "
"Discrete, Normal, Poisson, Exponential, Binomial, Negative Binomial, "
"Bernoulli, and Uniform."
msgstr ""
"Välj en sannolikhetsfördelning i listan. Följande fördelningar stöds: "
"diskret, normal, Poisson, exponentiell, binomial, negativ binomial, "
"Bernoulli och likformig."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Specify the value and probability input range in the <quote><guilabel>Value "
"and Probability Input Range:</guilabel></quote> entry box. The value and "
"probability input range is a table consisting of two columns and any number "
"of rows. The first column specifies the discrete random values and the "
"second column the probabilities for them. The discrete random values do not "
"have to be numbers, for example, strings will do as well. The sum of the "
"probabilities in the second column should be one. For example, if you have "
"the values A, B, C, and D in A1:A4 and values 0.1, 0.4, 0.2, and 0.3 in "
"B1:B4, you would specify the value and probability input range to be A1:B4."
msgstr ""
"Ange värdena och sannolikheterna i fältet <quote><guilabel>Indataområde för "
"värde och sannolikhet:</guilabel></quote>. Området är en tabell med två "
"kolumner och valfritt antal rader. Den första kolumnen innehåller de "
"diskreta slumpvärdena och den andra deras sannolikheter. Slumpvärdena "
"behöver inte vara tal; de kan till exempel vara textsträngar. "
"Sannolikheterna i den andra kolumnen ska tillsammans bli ett. Om A1:A4 "
"innehåller värdena A, B, C och D och B1:B4 innehåller sannolikheterna 0,1; "
"0,4; 0,2 och 0,3 anger du A1:B4 som indataområde för värden och "
"sannolikheter."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If the probabilities do not add to 1, they will be automatically scaled."
msgstr "Om sannolikheterna inte blir 1 tillsammans skalas de automatiskt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Specify the mean and the standard deviation. The default values are 0 for "
"the mean and 1 for the standard deviation."
msgstr ""
"Ange medelvärdet och standardavvikelsen. Standardvärdena är 0 för "
"medelvärdet och 1 för standardavvikelsen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Specify the lambda in the <quote><guilabel>Lambda</guilabel></quote> entry. "
"Lambda is the average number of events in a unit time interval."
msgstr ""
"Ange lambda i fältet <quote><guilabel>Lambda</guilabel></quote>. Lambda är "
"det genomsnittliga antalet händelser per tidsenhet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Specify <parameter>b</parameter> in the <quote><guilabel>b "
"Value</guilabel></quote> entry."
msgstr ""
"Ange <parameter>b</parameter> i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>b-värde</guilabel></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Specify the probability of success (<parameter>p</parameter>) in the "
"<quote><guilabel>p Value</guilabel></quote> entry and the number of trials "
"(<parameter>n</parameter>) in the <quote><guilabel>Number of "
"Trials</guilabel></quote> entry. The Binomial distribution is a discrete "
"distribution in which the experiment consists of <parameter>n</parameter> "
"identical trials. Each trial is independent of other the trials and has two "
"possible outcomes, a success or a failure. The probability of success "
"<parameter>p</parameter> is constant from one trial to another. The mean of "
"a random variable that has a Binomial distribution is <parameter>E(X) = "
"np</parameter>, and the variance is <parameter>var(X) = np(1-p)</parameter>."
msgstr ""
"Ange sannolikheten för framgång (<parameter>p</parameter>) i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>p-värde</guilabel></quote> och antalet försök "
"(<parameter>n</parameter>) i fältet <quote><guilabel>Antal "
"försök</guilabel></quote>. Binomialfördelningen är diskret och består av "
"<parameter>n</parameter> identiska försök. Försöken är oberoende av varandra"
" och vart och ett har två möjliga utfall: framgång eller misslyckande. "
"Sannolikheten <parameter>p</parameter> för framgång är densamma i varje "
"försök. Medelvärdet för en slumpvariabel med binomialfördelning är "
"<parameter>E(X) = np</parameter> och variansen är <parameter>var(X) = "
"np(1-p)</parameter>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Specify the probability of success <parameter>p</parameter> in the "
"<quote><guilabel>p Value</guilabel></quote> entry and the number of failures"
" <parameter>r</parameter> in the <quote><guilabel>Number of "
"Failures</guilabel></quote> entry. Negative Binomial distribution is a "
"discrete distribution in which the experiment consists of a sequence of "
"independent trials. Each trial has two possible outcomes, a success or a "
"failure. The probability of success <parameter>p</parameter> is constant "
"from one trial to another. The experiment continues until "
"<parameter>r</parameter> failures are observed, where "
"<parameter>r</parameter> is fixed in advance. The mean of a random variable "
"that has a Negative Binomial distribution is <parameter>E(X) = "
"r(1-p)/p</parameter>, and the variance is <parameter>var(X) = "
"r(1-p)/p^2</parameter>."
msgstr ""
"Ange sannolikheten för framgång <parameter>p</parameter> i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>p-värde</guilabel></quote> och antalet misslyckanden "
"<parameter>r</parameter> i fältet <quote><guilabel>Antal "
"misslyckanden</guilabel></quote>. Den negativa binomialfördelningen är "
"diskret och bygger på en följd av oberoende försök. Varje försök har två "
"möjliga utfall: framgång eller misslyckande. Sannolikheten "
"<parameter>p</parameter> för framgång är densamma i varje försök. Försöken "
"fortsätter tills <parameter>r</parameter> misslyckanden har inträffat; "
"värdet på <parameter>r</parameter> bestäms i förväg. Medelvärdet för en "
"slumpvariabel med negativ binomialfördelning är <parameter>E(X) = "
"r(1-p)/p</parameter> och variansen är <parameter>var(X) = "
"r(1-p)/p^2</parameter>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Specify the probability of success (<parameter>p</parameter>) in the "
"<quote><guilabel>p Value</guilabel></quote> entry. <parameter>p</parameter> "
"is a probability value between 0 and 1. The Bernoulli distribution has two "
"random values 0 and 1, and <parameter>p</parameter> is the probability to "
"observe value 1. The mean of a random variable that has a Bernoulli "
"distribution is <parameter>E(X) = 1(p) + 0(1-p) = p</parameter>, and the "
"variance is <parameter>var(X) = p(1-p)</parameter>."
msgstr ""
"Ange sannolikheten för framgång (<parameter>p</parameter>) i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>p-värde</guilabel></quote>. <parameter>p</parameter> är ett"
" sannolikhetsvärde mellan 0 och 1. Bernoullifördelningen har två möjliga "
"värden, 0 och 1, och <parameter>p</parameter> är sannolikheten för att "
"värdet 1 ska inträffa. Medelvärdet för en slumpvariabel med "
"Bernoullifördelning är <parameter>E(X) = 1(p) + 0(1-p) = p</parameter> och "
"variansen är <parameter>var(X) = p(1-p)</parameter>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Specify the range of the continuous random variable with the "
"<quote><guilabel>Between:</guilabel></quote> and "
"<quote><guilabel>And:</guilabel></quote> entries. The default values for "
"these entries are 0 and 1."
msgstr ""
"Ange intervallet för den kontinuerliga slumpvariabeln i fälten "
"<quote><guilabel>Mellan:</guilabel></quote> och "
"<quote><guilabel>och:</guilabel></quote>. Standardvärdena är 0 och 1."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Specify the number of variables in the <quote><guilabel> Number of "
"Variables:</guilabel></quote> entry on the `Options' Page. This determines "
"the number of columns of random values to be produced."
msgstr ""
"Ange antalet variabler i fältet <quote><guilabel> Antal "
"variabler:</guilabel></quote> på sidan Alternativ. Detta avgör hur många "
"kolumner med slumptal som skapas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Specify the number of random numbers for each variable in the "
"<quote><guilabel>Size of Sample:</guilabel> </quote> entry on the same page."
" This determines the number of rows of random values to be produced."
msgstr ""
"Ange antalet slumptal per variabel i fältet <quote><guilabel>Storlek på "
"stickprov:</guilabel> </quote> på samma sida. Detta avgör hur många rader "
"med slumptal som skapas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-random-ex1.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of some "
"example data for use with the random number generation tool.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-random-ex1.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av exempeldata "
"för verktyget för slumptalsgenerering.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"random-example-1\"/> shows some example data and <xref "
"linkend=\"random-example-2\"/> the corresponding output."
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"random-example-1\"/> visar exempeldata och <xref "
"linkend=\"random-example-2\"/> motsvarande utdata."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-random-ex2.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the output "
"from the random number generation tool.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-random-ex2.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av utdata från "
"slumptalsgeneratorn.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Data are commonly obtained from external sources such as from other files, "
"either in a spreadsheet format or in delimited text format, from other "
"applications using the mouse to copy and paste data or from external "
"applications such as databases or internet data streams."
msgstr ""
"Data hämtas ofta från externa källor: andra filer i kalkylblads- eller "
"avgränsat textformat, andra program via kopiera och klistra in eller externa"
" tjänster som databaser och dataströmmar från internet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Data which already exist in an external file can be imported into a workbook"
" first by opening the file into a separate instance of "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> and then by copying the relevant data "
"into the desired worksheet."
msgstr ""
"Data i en extern fil kan importeras till en arbetsbok genom att du först "
"öppnar filen i en separat instans av <application>Gnumeric</application> och"
" därefter kopierar relevanta data till önskat kalkylblad."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Data contained in external files in the formats of several other spreadsheet"
" applications can be opened by <application>Gnumeric</application>. "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> can open files in "
"<application>Applix</application> (TM) format, GNU "
"<application>Oleo</application> format, Lotus <application>123</application>"
" (TM) format, Microsoft <application>Excel</application> (TM) format, "
"<application>Multiplan</application> (TM) format, OpenOffice "
"<application>Calc</application> or StarOffice "
"<application>Calc</application> (TM) format, <application>Plan "
"Perfect</application> (TM) format, <application>Quattro Pro</application> "
"(TM) format, <application>sc</application> and "
"<application>XSpread</application> format or in the "
"<application>Xbase</application> format."
msgstr ""
"Filer i format från flera andra program för kalkylblad kan öppnas med "
"<application>Gnumeric</application>. <application>Gnumeric</application> kan"
" läsa filer i formaten <application>Applix</application> (TM), GNU "
"<application>Oleo</application>, Lotus <application>123</application> (TM), "
"Microsoft <application>Excel</application> (TM), "
"<application>Multiplan</application> (TM), OpenOffice "
"<application>Calc</application> och StarOffice "
"<application>Calc</application> (TM), <application>Plan "
"Perfect</application> (TM), <application>Quattro Pro</application> (TM), "
"<application>sc</application> och <application>XSpread</application> samt "
"<application>Xbase</application>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Data contained in external text files which are formatted in well defined "
"ways can also be opened by <application>Gnumeric</application>. "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> can open files formatted in Data "
"Interchange Format, formatted as HTML tables, or formatted in text formats "
"such as comma separated values or tab delimited records. The opening of text"
" format files is configurable by the user so that text files which contain "
"data formatted in a wide variety of schemes can be imported correctly into "
"<application>Gnumeric</application>. Obtaining data from these files is "
"explained in detail in the section titled <xref linkend=\"sect-file-"
"open\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Textfiler med en väldefinierad struktur kan också öppnas i "
"<application>Gnumeric</application>. <application>Gnumeric</application> kan"
" öppna filer i Data Interchange Format, HTML-tabeller och textformat som "
"kommaseparerade värden eller tabbseparerade poster. Du kan anpassa hur "
"textfiler öppnas så att filer med olika upplägg importeras korrekt i "
"<application>Gnumeric</application>. Läs mer om hur du hämtar data från "
"sådana filer i avsnittet <xref linkend=\"sect-file-open\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Data which are opened into a separate instance of "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> can be copied and pasted into the "
"current worksheet with the copy and paste commands as explained in <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-movecopy-cutandpaste\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Data som öppnats i en separat instans av <application>Gnumeric</application>"
" kan kopieras och klistras in i det aktuella kalkylbladet med kommandona "
"Kopiera och Klistra in, som beskrivs i <xref linkend=\"sect-movecopy-"
"cutandpaste\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Data can be obtained from other <application>Gnumeric</application> "
"workbooks or other applications using the mouse to copy data and paste them "
"into a worksheet. This is explained below in the section titled <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-movecopy-xclipboard\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan hämta data från andra arbetsböcker i "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> eller från andra program genom att "
"kopiera dem med musen och klistra in dem i ett kalkylblad. Detta beskrivs i "
"avsnittet <xref linkend=\"sect-movecopy-xclipboard\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> has been connected to external data "
"sources such as stock quotation service data streams using an experimental "
"plugin. This requires the ability to write programming code. Information on "
"extending <application>Gnumeric</application> by developing plugins can be "
"found in the section called <xref linkend=\"sect-extending-plugins\"/> and "
"the actual computer source code can be found in the directory "
"<literal>gnumeric/plugins/sample_datasource/</literal> of either a "
"distribution of <application>Gnumeric</application> or in a code checkout "
"from the revision control repository."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> har med hjälp av en experimentell "
"insticksmodul kopplats till externa datakällor, till exempel dataflöden från"
" aktiekurser. Detta kräver att du kan skriva programkod. Läs om hur du "
"utökar <application>Gnumeric</application> med insticksmoduler i <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-extending-plugins\"/>. Källkoden finns i katalogen "
"<literal>gnumeric/plugins/sample_datasource/</literal>, antingen i en "
"distribution av <application>Gnumeric</application> eller i en lokal kopia "
"som hämtats från versionshanteringsarkivet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"By selecting multiple cells at once, common operations can be performed on "
"all the cells which have been selected. These operations include data entry,"
" copying the cells, and multiple other operations ."
msgstr ""
"När du markerar flera celler samtidigt kan du utföra vanliga åtgärder på dem"
" alla, till exempel mata in data, kopiera celler och göra flera andra saker."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Some operations cannot be done on selections of arbitrary shape. For "
"instance, <application>Gnumeric</application> could not correctly reshape a "
"worksheet following the deletion of a discontinuous group of cells therefore"
" such an operation is not allowed. If users attempt an operation which "
"cannot be performed, a warning dialog will appear."
msgstr ""
"Vissa åtgärder kan inte utföras på markeringar med godtycklig form. "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan till exempel inte omforma ett "
"kalkylblad korrekt om en icke-sammanhängande grupp celler tas bort. Därför "
"tillåts inte en sådan åtgärd. Om du försöker utföra en åtgärd som inte stöds"
" visas en varningsdialogruta."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The simplest selection involves a single cell. In most cases, simply "
"clicking with the left hand mouse button while the mouse cursor is over a "
"cell will cause that cell to become selected."
msgstr ""
"Den enklaste markeringen består av en enda cell. Vanligtvis markerar du en "
"cell genom att klicka på den med vänster musknapp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The selected cell is indicated by a dark double line with a small square in "
"the bottom right corner. The selected cell is the one that is currently in "
"focus and will take any input for the keyboard."
msgstr ""
"Den markerade cellen ramas in av en mörk dubbel linje med en liten ruta "
"längst ned till höger. Cellen som har fokus tar emot tangentbordsinmatning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/selection-2.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of a single "
"selected cell.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/selection-2.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av en enskild "
"markerad cell.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"To make a cell become the selected cell, simply move the white-cross cursor "
"over the cell and press the left mouse button. There is one exception: When "
"on a cell that contains a hyperlink, the mouse cursor changes from the white"
" cross to a hand and clicking the left mouse button activates the link. In "
"that case the cell can be selected by clicking the middle mouse button."
msgstr ""
"Flytta pekaren med det vita korset över cellen och klicka med vänster "
"musknapp för att markera den. Ett undantag finns: om cellen innehåller en "
"hyperlänk ändras pekaren i stället till en hand, och ett vänsterklick öppnar"
" länken. Då kan du markera cellen genom att klicka med mittenknappen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/selection-1.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the cursor "
"selecting a cell.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/selection-1.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av pekaren när "
"den markerar en cell.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Several cells can be selected at once. When multiple cells are selected, the"
" selected cells are indicated with a light, \"baby\" blue colour. When a "
"single block of cells is selected, a double black line will surround the "
"selection, and all cells except the first one to be selected will be shown "
"in light blue."
msgstr ""
"Du kan markera flera celler samtidigt. De markerade cellerna visas då i "
"ljusblått. Ett sammanhängande cellområde omges av en dubbel svart linje, och"
" alla celler utom den först markerade visas i ljusblått."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/selection-3.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of a "
"contiguous selection of cells.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/selection-3.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av ett "
"sammanhängande markerat cellområde.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"To make a continuous selection of cells, move the white cross mouse cursor "
"pointer to the cell at one corner of the block of continuous cells, click "
"and hold the primary mouse pointer on that cell, drag the pointer to the "
"opposite corner of the block of cells and then release the mouse button. The"
" block of cells will now be selected."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill markera ett sammanhängande cellområde flyttar du pekaren med det "
"vita korset till ett av områdets hörn. Håll ned musknappen, dra pekaren till"
" det motsatta hörnet och släpp knappen. Cellerna i området markeras då."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The arrow keys can also be used to select a continuous block of cells. To "
"add cells in this manner, first select the cell in one corner of the cell "
"block with the primary mouse button, then hold the <keycap>Shift</keycap> "
"key and use the arrow keys to expand the selection block."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också markera ett sammanhängande cellområde med piltangenterna. "
"Markera först en cell i ett av områdets hörn med musknappen. Håll sedan ned "
"<keycap>Shift</keycap> och använd piltangenterna för att utöka markeringen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/selection-4.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of a block "
"selection and the mouse cursor.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/selection-4.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av ett markerat"
" cellområde och muspekaren.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"A discontinuous group of cells can also be selected, by selecting cells or "
"block of cells while holding down the <keycap>Ctrl</keycap> key. To select a"
" discontinuous group of cells, first select a cell or a continuous group of "
"cells as explained above, then click and hold down the <keycap>Ctrl</keycap>"
" while selecting more cells. All of the cells which are selected while the "
"<keycap>Ctrl</keycap> key is held down will be added to the selection. All "
"selected cells will be displayed with a light blue colour. Cells can be "
"added individually or as continuous blocks. This selection process is "
"additive with each selected cell added only once so selecting cells twice or"
" more simply adds those cells once to the selection."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också markera en icke-sammanhängande grupp celler genom att hålla ned"
" <keycap>Ctrl</keycap> medan du markerar enskilda celler eller cellområden. "
"Markera först en cell eller ett sammanhängande område enligt beskrivningen "
"ovan. Håll sedan ned <keycap>Ctrl</keycap> medan du markerar fler celler. "
"Alla celler du markerar medan <keycap>Ctrl</keycap> hålls ned läggs till i "
"den befintliga markeringen och visas i ljusblått. Du kan lägga till celler "
"en och en eller som sammanhängande områden. Varje cell läggs bara till en "
"gång, även om du markerar den flera gånger."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/selection-5.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of a multiple "
"selection.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/selection-5.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av flera "
"markerade cellområden.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"There are several ways to make selections using the keyboard keys directly. "
"These may be quicker than using the mouse pointer. As explained above, the "
"simplest of these uses the <keycap>Shift</keycap> and <keycap>arrow</keycap>"
" keys to make a new selection."
msgstr ""
"Du kan markera celler på flera sätt direkt med tangentbordet, vilket ibland "
"går snabbare än att använda musen. Det enklaste sättet är att använda "
"<keycap>Shift</keycap> och <keycap>piltangent</keycap> för att skapa en ny "
"markering, enligt beskrivningen ovan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"To select an entire row of cells, press the combination of "
"<keycombo><keycap>Shift</keycap><keycap>space</keycap></keycombo> keys. This"
" is equivalent to pressing the row label button on the left side of the "
"sheet."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill markera en hel rad trycker du på "
"<keycombo><keycap>Shift</keycap><keycap>blanksteg</keycap></keycombo>. Det "
"motsvarar att klicka på radrubriken till vänster i kalkylbladet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/selection-8.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of a selected "
"row.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/selection-8.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av en markerad "
"rad.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"To select an entire column of cells, press the combination of "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>Space</keycap></keycombo> keys. This "
"is equivalent to pressing the column label button on the top of the sheet."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill markera en hel kolumn trycker du på "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>Blanksteg</keycap></keycombo>. Det "
"motsvarar att klicka på kolumnrubriken längst upp i kalkylbladet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "An entire column being selected."
msgstr "En hel kolumn markeras."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/selection-9.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of a selected "
"column.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/selection-9.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av en markerad "
"kolumn.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"To select the entire sheet, press the combination of "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>A</keycap></keycombo> keys. This is "
"equivalent to pressing the button in the top left corner of the sheet."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill markera hela kalkylbladet trycker du på "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>A</keycap></keycombo>. Det motsvarar "
"att klicka på knappen längst upp till vänster i kalkylbladet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The entire worksheet being selected."
msgstr "Hela kalkylbladet markeras."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/selection-10.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of an entire "
"worksheet selected.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/selection-10.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av ett helt "
"markerat kalkylblad.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The following list summaries keyboard shortcuts which can be used to select "
"large cell blocks."
msgstr ""
"Följande lista sammanfattar kortkommandon som du kan använda för att markera"
" större cellområden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<keycombo><keycap>Shift</keycap><keycap>Arrow</keycap></keycombo> : Define "
"selection with cursor keys."
msgstr ""
"<keycombo><keycap>Shift</keycap><keycap>piltangent</keycap></keycombo> : "
"Skapa en markering med piltangenterna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>Arrow</keycap></keycombo> : Jump to "
"the end of the current region."
msgstr ""
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>piltangent</keycap></keycombo> : "
"Hoppa till slutet av det aktuella området."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<keycombo><keycap>Alt</keycap><keycap>Space</keycap></keycombo> : Select "
"current row."
msgstr ""
"<keycombo><keycap>Alt</keycap><keycap>Blanksteg</keycap></keycombo> : "
"Markera den aktuella raden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>Space</keycap></keycombo> : Select "
"current column."
msgstr ""
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>Blanksteg</keycap></keycombo> : "
"Markera den aktuella kolumnen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>A</keycap></keycombo> : Select the "
"entire sheet."
msgstr ""
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>A</keycap></keycombo> : Markera hela "
"kalkylbladet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>/</keycap></keycombo> : Select the "
"array formula around the current edit position."
msgstr ""
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>/</keycap></keycombo> : Markera "
"matrisformeln runt den aktuella redigeringspositionen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Moving and Copying Data"
msgstr "Flytta och kopiera data"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Data which have been entered once into a spreadsheet can be moved to new "
"locations and possibly duplicated. The simplest way to do this involves "
"dragging the selection box. A more advanced way involves a formal cut or "
"copy operation and then a paste operation in the new location. The latter "
"approach allows the data to be modified as they are pasted which can be "
"extremely important."
msgstr ""
"Data som redan har matats in i ett kalkylblad kan flyttas till nya platser "
"eller kopieras. Enklast gör du det genom att dra markeringen. En mer "
"avancerad metod är att klippa ut eller kopiera data och sedan klistra in dem"
" på den nya platsen. Då kan du även ändra data medan du klistrar in dem, "
"vilket ibland är viktigt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "NOTE"
msgstr "OBS!"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Currently <application>Gnumeric</application> only supports copying, cutting"
" and pasting of simple selections or continuous selections as described in "
"<xref linkend=\"sect-data-selections\"/>. You cannot copy, cut or paste "
"discontinuous selections."
msgstr ""
"För närvarande går det bara att kopiera, klippa ut och klistra in enskilda "
"eller sammanhängande markeringar i <application>Gnumeric</application>, "
"enligt beskrivningen i <xref linkend=\"sect-data-selections\"/>. Det går "
"inte att kopiera, klippa ut eller klistra in icke-sammanhängande "
"markeringar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"It is frequently necessary to copy the results of complex calculations into "
"a new location. This is done by selecting the data and using the "
"<guimenuitem>As Value</guimenuitem> command from the <guimenuitem>Paste "
"Special...</guimenuitem> dialog. This is explained in <xref linkend=\"sect-"
"movecopy-pastespecial\"/> below."
msgstr ""
"Ofta behöver du kopiera resultatet av komplicerade beräkningar till en annan"
" plats. Markera data och välj <guimenuitem>Som värde</guimenuitem> i "
"dialogrutan <guimenuitem>Klistra in special…</guimenuitem>. Detta beskrivs "
"nedan i <xref linkend=\"sect-movecopy-pastespecial\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Simple Copy and Move"
msgstr "Enkel kopiering och flytt"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The easiest way to move or copy a cell or a group of cells is by selecting "
"the cell or cells to be moved or copied, then using the mouse to drag the "
"selection box to a new location."
msgstr ""
"Enklast flyttar eller kopierar du en cell eller ett cellområde genom att "
"markera det och dra markeringen till den nya platsen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Select a cell to move by clicking in it. You can also select a range of "
"cells as described in <xref linkend=\"sect-data-selections\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på cellen som ska flyttas. Du kan också markera ett cellområde enligt"
" beskrivningen i <xref linkend=\"sect-data-selections\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Click <mousebutton>left</mousebutton> mouse button on the border of the "
"selection (anywhere except the autofill square in the bottom right corner). "
"Use <mousebutton>left</mousebutton> mouse button to move cells or "
"<keycap>Ctrl</keycap>+<mousebutton>left</mousebutton> mouse button to copy "
"cells."
msgstr ""
"Klicka med <mousebutton>vänster</mousebutton> musknapp på markeringens kant,"
" men inte på den lilla rutan för automatisk ifyllning längst ned till höger."
" Dra med <mousebutton>vänster</mousebutton> musknapp för att flytta "
"cellerna. Håll ned <keycap>Ctrl</keycap> och klicka med "
"<mousebutton>vänster</mousebutton> musknapp för att kopiera dem."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Drag the selection to the new location."
msgstr "Dra markeringen till den nya platsen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Release the mouse button."
msgstr "Släpp musknappen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The selected cells will be copied or moved to the new location. This will "
"move both cells' content and formatting. When copying, relative cell "
"references in all formulas will change as described in <xref linkend=\"sect-"
"data-formulas-references\"/>; when moving, relative cell references will "
"remain unchanged."
msgstr ""
"De markerade cellerna kopieras eller flyttas till den nya platsen, "
"tillsammans med innehåll och formatering. När du kopierar ändras relativa "
"cellreferenser i formler, enligt beskrivningen i <xref linkend=\"sect-data-"
"formulas-references\"/>. När du flyttar celler förblir de relativa "
"cellreferenserna oförändrade."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Cut, Copy and Paste"
msgstr "Klipp ut, kopiera och klistra in"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Another, more flexible, way to copy or move a selection is to use cut, copy,"
" and paste operations. These operations allow the user to copy or move "
"selected cells to the clipboard buffer and then paste the contents of the "
"clipboard buffer to a different location or a different workbook."
msgstr ""
"Ett mer flexibelt sätt att kopiera eller flytta en markering är att använda "
"kommandona Klipp ut, Kopiera och Klistra in. Med dem kan du kopiera eller "
"flytta markerade celler till urklippet och sedan klistra in innehållet på en"
" annan plats eller i en annan arbetsbok."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Cutting a Selection to the Clipboard"
msgstr "Klippa ut en markering till urklippet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Use keyboard shortcut "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>X</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"Använd kortkommandot "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>X</keycap></keycombo>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Choose <guimenuitem>Cut</guimenuitem> from the <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> menu."
msgstr ""
"Välj <guimenuitem>Klipp ut</guimenuitem> i menyn "
"<guimenu>Redigera</guimenu>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Click on <guiicon><inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"figures/button-cut.png\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An "
"image of the cut toolbar button.</phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject>"
" Cut </guiicon> button in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på knappen <guiicon><inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"figures/button-cut.png\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En "
"bild av knappen Klipp ut i verktygsraden.</phrase> </textobject> "
"</inlinemediaobject> Klipp ut </guiicon> i verktygsraden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Right-click on the selection and choose <guimenuitem>Cut</guimenuitem> from "
"the context menu."
msgstr ""
"Högerklicka på markeringen och välj <guimenuitem>Klipp ut</guimenuitem> i "
"snabbmenyn."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"To cut a cell or a selection to the clipboard, you should select a cell or "
"range of cells as described in <xref linkend=\"sect-data-selections\"/> and "
"then use one of the following methods: <_:itemizedlist-1/> The selection "
"will be copied to the clipboard buffer. To remind you of this, the border of"
" the selection will be shown as \"marching ants\". The selection will be "
"moved to a new location as soon as you choose "
"<guimenuitem>Paste</guimenuitem> command as described below."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill klippa ut en cell eller en markering till urklippet markerar du "
"först en cell eller ett cellområde enligt <xref linkend=\"sect-data-"
"selections\"/> och använder sedan någon av metoderna: <_:itemizedlist-1/> "
"Markeringen kopieras till urklippet. Den rörliga streckade kanten, de så "
"kallade ”vandrande myrorna”, visar att den ligger kvar. Så snart du väljer "
"<guimenuitem>Klistra in</guimenuitem> flyttas markeringen till den nya "
"platsen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Please note that the selection will remain in its current location until you"
" paste it. If you want to delete a selection without pasting it to a new "
"location, use <guimenuitem>Delete</guimenuitem> command instead."
msgstr ""
"Markeringen ligger kvar på sin plats tills du klistrar in den. Om du vill ta"
" bort den utan att klistra in den någon annanstans väljer du i stället "
"<guimenuitem>Ta bort</guimenuitem>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Copying a Selection to the Clipboard"
msgstr "Kopiera en markering till urklippet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Use keyboard shortcut "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>C</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"Använd kortkommandot "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>C</keycap></keycombo>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Choose <guimenuitem>Copy</guimenuitem> from the <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> "
"menu."
msgstr ""
"Välj <guimenuitem>Kopiera</guimenuitem> i menyn <guimenu>Redigera</guimenu>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Click on <guiicon><inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"figures/button-copy.png\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An"
" image of the copy toolbar button.</phrase> </textobject> "
"</inlinemediaobject> Copy </guiicon> button in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på knappen <guiicon><inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"figures/button-copy.png\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En"
" bild av knappen Kopiera i verktygsraden.</phrase> </textobject> "
"</inlinemediaobject> Kopiera </guiicon> i verktygsraden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Right-click on the selection and choose <guimenuitem>Copy</guimenuitem> from"
" the context menu."
msgstr ""
"Högerklicka på markeringen och välj <guimenuitem>Kopiera</guimenuitem> i "
"snabbmenyn."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"To copy a cell or a selection to the clipboard, you should select a cell or "
"range of cells as described in <xref linkend=\"sect-data-selections\"/> and "
"then use one of the following methods: <_:itemizedlist-1/> The selection "
"will be copied to the clipboard buffer. To remind you of this, the selection"
" will outlined by \"marching ants\" border. The selection will be copied to "
"a new location as soon as you choose <guimenuitem>Paste</guimenuitem> "
"command as described below."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill kopiera en cell eller en markering till urklippet markerar du "
"först en cell eller ett cellområde enligt <xref linkend=\"sect-data-"
"selections\"/> och använder sedan någon av metoderna: <_:itemizedlist-1/> "
"Markeringen kopieras till urklippet och omges av den rörliga streckade "
"kanten, de så kallade ”vandrande myrorna”. Därefter kan du klistra in en "
"kopia på en ny plats genom att välja <guimenuitem>Klistra in</guimenuitem>, "
"enligt beskrivningen nedan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Pasting the Clipboard"
msgstr "Klistra in från urklippet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Use keyboard shortcut "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>V</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"Använd kortkommandot "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>V</keycap></keycombo>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Choose <guimenuitem>Paste</guimenuitem> from the <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> "
"menu."
msgstr ""
"Välj <guimenuitem>Klistra in</guimenuitem> i menyn "
"<guimenu>Redigera</guimenu>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Click on <guiicon><inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"figures/button-paste.png\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>An image of the paste toolbar button.</phrase> </textobject> "
"</inlinemediaobject> Paste </guiicon> button in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på knappen <guiicon><inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"figures/button-paste.png\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>En bild av knappen Klistra in i verktygsraden.</phrase> "
"</textobject> </inlinemediaobject> Klistra in </guiicon> i verktygsraden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Right-click on the cell and choose <guimenuitem>Paste</guimenuitem> from the"
" context menu."
msgstr ""
"Högerklicka på cellen och välj <guimenuitem>Klistra in</guimenuitem> i "
"snabbmenyn."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"To paste the contents of the clipboard (i.e., previously cut or copied "
"selection) to a new location, just click on a cell and use one of the "
"following methods: <_:itemizedlist-1/> The contents of the clipboard will be"
" pasted in the spreadsheet so that the selected cell becomes the top left "
"corner of the selection. This will also copy the formatting of the original "
"selection."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill klistra in innehållet i urklippet (det vill säga en tidigare "
"utklippt eller kopierad markering) på en ny plats klickar du på en cell och "
"använder någon av följande metoder: <_:itemizedlist-1/> Innehållet i "
"urklippet klistras in i kalkylbladet så att den markerade cellen blir "
"markeringens övre vänstra hörn. Då kopieras även den ursprungliga "
"markeringens formatering."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If you are pasting a selection which was <emphasis>copied</emphasis> to the "
"clipboard buffer, all relative cell references in all formulas will change "
"as described in <xref linkend=\"sect-data-formulas-references\"/>. The "
"selection remains in the clipboard buffer so that it can be pasted again. "
"The original selection will remain outlined with \"marching ants\" border."
msgstr ""
"Om du klistrar in en markering som har <emphasis>kopierats</emphasis> till "
"urklippet ändras alla relativa cellreferenser i formlerna, enligt "
"beskrivningen i <xref linkend=\"sect-data-formulas-references\"/>. "
"Markeringen ligger kvar i urklippet och kan klistras in igen. Den "
"ursprungliga markeringen omges fortfarande av den rörliga streckade kanten, "
"de så kallade ”vandrande myrorna”."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If you are pasting a selection which was <emphasis>cut</emphasis> to the "
"clipboard buffer, all cell references in all formulas will remain unchanged."
" The original selection will be removed from the workbook and the clipboard "
"buffer will be cleared."
msgstr ""
"Om du klistrar in en markering som har <emphasis>klippts ut</emphasis> till "
"urklippet förblir alla cellreferenser i formlerna oförändrade. Den "
"ursprungliga markeringen tas bort från arbetsboken och urklippet töms."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"As shown in <xref linkend=\"dmedian-example-1\"/>, instead of using (the "
"non-existing) function <code>DMEDIAN</code> one can use the alternative "
"expression <code>median(if(A1:A20=\"AA\",B1:B20))</code> entered as an array"
" function as described in <xref linkend=\"sect-data-formulas-array\"/>. "
"Multiple conditions can be combined using multiplication to obtain "
"<code>AND</code> and addition to obtain <code>OR</code> as in "
"<code>median(if((A1:A20=\"AA\")+(C1:C20=\"BB\"),B1:B20))</code>. Using "
"defined names as introduced in <xref linkend=\"sect-data-formulas-names\"/> "
"for <code>A1:A20</code> and <code>B1:B20</code> can make this code very "
"flexible and readable."
msgstr ""
"Som visas i <xref linkend=\"dmedian-example-1\"/> kan man använda uttrycket "
"<code>median(if(A1:A20=\"AA\",B1:B20))</code> i stället för den (icke-"
"existerande) funktionen <code>DMEDIAN</code> och ange det som en "
"matrisformel, enligt beskrivningen i <xref linkend=\"sect-data-formulas-"
"array\"/>. Flera villkor kan kombineras med multiplikation för att få "
"<code>AND</code> och med addition för att få <code>OR</code>, som i "
"<code>median(if((A1:A20=\"AA\")+(C1:C20=\"BB\"),B1:B20))</code>. Om man "
"använder definierade namn, enligt <xref linkend=\"sect-data-formulas-"
"names\"/>, för <code>A1:A20</code> och <code>B1:B20</code> blir formeln "
"flexibel och lätt att läsa."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"In this case we cannot use "
"<code>if(OR(A1:A20=\"AA\",C1:C20=\"BB\"),...)</code> since the OR function "
"would be applied to all 40 equality tests rather than each of the 20 pairs "
"of equality tests."
msgstr ""
"I det här fallet kan vi inte använda "
"<code>if(OR(A1:A20=\"AA\",C1:C20=\"BB\"),...)</code>, eftersom funktionen OR"
" då tillämpas på alla 40 likhetstester i stället för på vart och ett av de "
"20 paren."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/formula-dmedian.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Calculating the MEDIAN "
"of some data values.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/formula-dmedian.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Beräkning av medianen "
"för några datavärden.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Deleting Data"
msgstr "Ta bort data"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "This section needs to be written."
msgstr "Det här avsnittet har ännu inte skrivits."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"With data shuffling tool you can shuffle data in a given cell range. The "
"tool can be started by selecting ``Shuffle'' menu item in ``Data'' menu. In "
"order to use the tool give the input range in which the data to be shuffled "
"is stored. The tool is able to shuffle the contents of the whole cell range,"
" or, also shuffle data according to rows or columns. The shuffling method is"
" selected under the ``Input Range'' entry. For example, if your data is "
"grouped by rows then select ``Shuffle Method'' ``Rows''."
msgstr ""
"Med verktyget Blanda data kan du blanda om data i ett cellområde. Starta "
"verktyget genom att välja menyalternativet Blanda på menyn Data. Ange det "
"cellområde som innehåller data som ska blandas om. Du kan blanda om hela "
"cellområdet eller data efter rader eller kolumner. Välj blandningsmetod "
"under Indataområde. Om data är grupperade efter rader väljer du Rader som "
"blandningsmetod."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The default output method is to shuffle in-place. The shuffled data can also"
" be written into a new sheet, new workbook, or into an existing sheet by "
"giving the output range. If you select the ``Autofit Columns'' option, the "
"width of each output column is automatically fixed according to the size of "
"data in it."
msgstr ""
"Som standard blandas data om på plats. Du kan också skriva de blandade data "
"till ett nytt blad, en ny arbetsbok eller ett befintligt blad genom att ange"
" utdataintervallet. Om du väljer alternativet Anpassa kolumner automatiskt "
"justeras bredden på varje kolumn efter mängden data i den."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If the link location text box is empty when you click on "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton>, no hyperlink is created. Instead, if any cells in"
" the selection have existing hyperlinks, those hyperlinks are removed. The "
"distinctive format applied to links is not removed. For that reason it might"
" be preferable to choose <xref linkend=\"edit-menu-clear-links\"/> from the "
"<xref linkend=\"Edit-Menu\"/> to remove existing hyperlinks."
msgstr ""
"Om textrutan för länkmål är tom när du klickar på <guibutton>OK</guibutton> "
"skapas ingen hyperlänk. Om det i stället finns befintliga hyperlänkar i "
"markeringen tas de bort. Länkarnas särskilda formatering tas inte bort. "
"Därför kan det vara bättre att välja <xref linkend=\"edit-menu-clear-"
"links\"/> på menyn <xref linkend=\"Edit-Menu\"/> om du vill ta bort "
"befintliga länkar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Internal Link: The second element of the dialog is a text box labeled "
"\"Target Range\". You can enter a single range, with or without a worksheet "
"name. To select the range from the worksheet, click on the button at the end"
" of the \"Target Range\" line. This collapses the dialog to a single line "
"and makes it possible to interact with the cell grid. Select the desired "
"sheet tab, if necessary, then select the desired cells. When the selection "
"is complete, click on the button at the end of the Target Range input box to"
" open the full <guimenu>HyperLink</guimenu> dialog again."
msgstr ""
"Intern länk: Den andra delen av dialogrutan är en textruta med etiketten "
"”Målområde”. Här kan du ange ett område, med eller utan bladnamn. Om du vill"
" välja området direkt i kalkylbladet klickar du på knappen i slutet av raden"
" Målområde. Dialogrutan fälls då ihop till en rad så att du kan arbeta i "
"cellrutnätet. Välj vid behov rätt bladflik och markera sedan cellerna. När "
"du är klar klickar du på knappen i slutet av inmatningsrutan Målområde för "
"att öppna hela dialogrutan <guimenu>Hyperlänk</guimenu> igen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"When you move the mouse pointer to a hyperlink in the cell grid, a tool tip "
"appears. The default tip shows the link address and instructions for "
"activating the link or selecting the cell. To define a tip specific to the "
"link, select the radio button next to \"Tip\", then enter the tip text in "
"the text box. If the link-specific tip is selected and left blank, no tip is"
" displayed when the mouse pointer is on the link."
msgstr ""
"När du för muspekaren över en hyperlänk i cellrutnätet visas ett "
"verktygstips. Standardtipset visar länkadressen och instruktioner för att "
"öppna länken eller markera cellen. Om du vill ange ett eget tips för länken "
"väljer du alternativknappen bredvid ”Tips” och skriver tipstexten i "
"textrutan. Om det länkspecifika tipset är valt men lämnas tomt visas inget "
"tips när muspekaren är över länken."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"A name is a sequence of letters, digits, and underscore characters, "
"beginning with a letter or underscore. A name cannot look like a cell "
"identifier. For example, \"D7\" is not a permitted name, while \"D_7\" and "
"\"_D7\" are permitted."
msgstr ""
"Ett namn består av bokstäver, siffror och understreck och måste börja med en"
" bokstav eller ett understreck. Det får inte se ut som en cellreferens. Till"
" exempel är ”D7” inte ett tillåtet namn, men ”D_7” och ”_D7” går bra."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The second column of the <guimenu>Define Names</guimenu> dialog can show one"
" of three icons. To define a new name, click on the plus sign in the row for"
" the workbook or the active worksheet. Names defined under a worksheet name "
"are visible only on that worksheet. Names defined for the workbook are "
"visible to any worksheet that does not have its own definition of the name. "
"Names are created as \"&lt;new-name&gt;\", which must be changed before the "
"definition can be used. Click on the new line to select it, then click on "
"the name field and type the new name, followed by the <keycap>Enter</keycap>"
" key. When you press <keycap>Enter</keycap>, the name is fixed. Only its "
"value can then be changed."
msgstr ""
"Den andra kolumnen i dialogrutan <guimenu>Definiera namn</guimenu> kan visa "
"en av tre ikoner. Klicka på plustecknet på raden för arbetsboken eller det "
"aktiva bladet om du vill skapa ett nytt namn. Namn som definieras för ett "
"blad är bara synliga där. Namn som definieras för arbetsboken är synliga i "
"alla blad som inte har en egen definition av namnet. Namn skapas med värdet "
"”&lt;nytt namn&gt;”, som måste ändras innan definitionen kan användas. "
"Klicka på den nya raden för att markera den. Klicka sedan i namnfältet och "
"skriv det nya namnet. Bekräfta med <keycap>Enter</keycap>. När du trycker på"
" <keycap>Enter</keycap> låses namnet. Därefter kan bara dess värde ändras."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The last column of the dialog shows the value defined for the name. When a "
"new name is created, this field is initialized with an absolute reference to"
" the currently selected cells. To modify a definition, click on the value "
"field and edit it as desired, then press the <keycap>Enter</keycap> key. To "
"define a string value, enclose it in quotation marks, for example, 'string "
"one' or \"string two\". To specify a range of cells, use absolute "
"references. Relative references change in meaning depending on the cell "
"where they are used, which is unlikely to produce your intended result. You "
"can define a name as a cell or range of cells by clearing its existing "
"definition, if any, and then selecting the desired cell or cells on the cell"
" grid. You can switch worksheets prior to selecting cells. The dialog "
"continues to modify names defined for the workbook or the worksheet that was"
" displayed when the dialog was opened. A reference created by selection in "
"the <guimenu>Define Names</guimenu> dialog includes the worksheet name and "
"uses absolute cell coordinates. That is, a selection would look like "
"\"Sheet1!$A$1:$B$24\"."
msgstr ""
"Den sista kolumnen i dialogrutan visar värdet som har definierats för "
"namnet. När ett nytt namn skapas fylls fältet i med en absolut referens till"
" de markerade cellerna. Om du vill ändra definitionen klickar du i "
"värdefältet, redigerar det och trycker på <keycap>Enter</keycap>. Om du vill"
" definiera ett textvärde omger du det med citattecken, till exempel 'text "
"ett' eller \"text två\". Använd absoluta referenser när du anger ett "
"cellområde. Relativa referenser ändras beroende på var de används och ger "
"troligen inte det resultat du tänkt dig. Du kan definiera ett namn för en "
"cell eller ett cellområde genom att först ta bort den befintliga "
"definitionen och sedan markera önskade celler i cellrutnätet. Du kan byta "
"blad innan du markerar celler. Dialogrutan fortsätter att ändra namn för den"
" arbetsbok eller det blad som visades när den öppnades. En referens som "
"skapas genom markering i dialogrutan <guimenu>Definiera namn</guimenu> "
"innehåller bladnamnet och använder absoluta cellkoordinater. En markering "
"skulle alltså se ut så här: \"Blad1!$A$1:$B$24\"."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Below the display of defined names is a filter box. If the workbook or sheet"
" contains many defined names, you can see a subset of the names by typing a "
"partial name in the filter box and pressing <keycap>Enter</keycap>. All "
"names that do not contain the entered string are omitted from the display. "
"Differences of case are ignored. For example, if “real” were entered in the "
"filter box, names such as \"Real_Value\" and \"Surreal\" would be displayed."
" When you press <keycap>Enter</keycap> in the filter box, contexts that "
"contain no matching names are automatically collapsed. You may later need to"
" manually expand the workbook line, for example, if the filter string is "
"changed. If the line for the workbook or a worksheet begins with a right-"
"pointing arrow, it contains names that pass the filter. Clicking on the "
"arrow will change it to a downward-pointing arrow and make the names "
"visible. To see all the defined names, clear the filter by clicking on the "
"button at the right end of the filter box."
msgstr ""
"Under listan med definierade namn finns ett filterfält. Om arbetsboken eller"
" bladet innehåller många namn kan du visa ett urval genom att skriva en del "
"av ett namn i filterfältet och trycka på <keycap>Enter</keycap>. Namn som "
"inte innehåller den angivna texten visas inte. Filter använder inte skillnad"
" mellan versaler och gemener. Om du till exempel skriver ”pris” visas namn "
"som ”Pris_värde” och ”Överpris”. När du trycker på <keycap>Enter</keycap> i "
"filterfältet fälls grupper utan matchande namn automatiskt ihop. Om du "
"senare ändrar filtret kan du behöva fälla ut arbetsboksraden manuellt. En "
"pil åt höger vid arbetsboken eller ett blad betyder att det finns namn som "
"matchar filtret. Klicka på pilen så pekar den nedåt och namnen visas. Om du "
"vill visa alla definierade namn rensar du filtret med knappen till höger om "
"filterfältet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Print_Area: The range of cells set as the sheet's print area; undefined if "
"print area is not set."
msgstr ""
"Print_Area: Cellområdet som har angetts som bladets utskriftsområde. "
"Odefinierat om inget utskriftsområde har angetts."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Screenshot of Demand tab for the newsvendor example with probability "
"distribution for type of newsday in cells A21 through G29."
msgstr ""
"Skärmbild av fliken Efterfrågan i exemplet med tidningsförsäljning, med "
"sannolikhetsfördelningen för olika typer av dagar i cellerna A21–G29."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Finally, back in the Profit tab, the demand data will be filled in through "
"the use of references to the Demand Tables tab as shown in <xref "
"linkend=\"fig-simulation-example-profit-sheet\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Till sist fyller du i efterfrågedata på fliken Vinst med referenser till "
"fliken Efterfrågetabeller, enligt <xref linkend=\"fig-simulation-example-"
"profit-sheet\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"This screenshot depicts the profit sheet for the newsvendor example after "
"references to demands are included in cells B17 through B21 and cells B24 "
"through D24."
msgstr ""
"Skärmbilden visar kalkylbladet Vinst i exemplet med tidningsförsäljning, "
"efter att referenser till efterfrågan har lagts till i cellerna B17–B21 och "
"B24–D24."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"When done, the Profit spreadsheet will be setup with a profit equation, "
"decision variables, and random events as shown in <xref linkend=\"fig-"
"simulation-example-profit-sheet\"/>. The <function>rand()</function> "
"functions in cells C17 and C18 return a random value between 0 and 1, which "
"are used by the <function>lookup()</function> functions in cells B20, B24, "
"C24 and D24 to calculate a randomly determined daily demand. Next, this "
"sheet will be used for analysis through the use of simulation."
msgstr ""
"När kalkylbladet Vinst är klart innehåller det en vinstformel, "
"beslutsvariabler och slumpmässiga händelser, som i <xref linkend=\"fig-"
"simulation-example-profit-sheet\"/>. Funktionerna "
"<function>rand()</function> i cellerna C17 och C18 returnerar ett "
"slumpmässigt värde mellan 0 och 1. Värdena används av funktionerna "
"<function>lookup()</function> i cellerna B20, B24, C24 och D24 för att "
"beräkna dagens slumpmässiga efterfrågan. Därefter analyseras modellen genom "
"simulering."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"To run the simulation, from the Gnumeric toolbar, select Tools → Simulation."
" In the Risk Simulation dialog box that appears, the first tab is the "
"Variables tab. There are two entries in the Variables tab: Input variables "
"and Output variables (<xref linkend=\"analysis-simulation-variables-"
"dialog\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"Starta simuleringen genom att välja Verktyg → Simulering i Gnumeric. I "
"dialogrutan Risksimulering som öppnas är den första fliken Variabler. Där "
"finns två fält: variabler för indata och variabler för utdata (<xref "
"linkend=\"analysis-simulation-variables-dialog\"/>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Input variables are the cells which hold the functions based on random "
"numbers of the type described in Section A.14. In this case, they are the "
"cells B17 and B18 in the Profit worksheet, which hold the rand() function. "
"Later, when the quantity purchased is a parameter set by the "
"<function>SIMTABLE</function> function, cell B16 which holds the purchase "
"quantity will be added to the range of input variables."
msgstr ""
"Variabler för indata är cellerna som innehåller funktioner baserade på "
"slumptal av den typ som beskrivs i avsnitt A.14. Här är det cellerna B17 och"
" B18 i bladet Vinst, som innehåller funktionen rand(). Senare, när "
"inköpsmängden anges som en parameter med funktionen "
"<function>SIMTABLE</function>, läggs cell B16, som innehåller inköpsmängden,"
" till indataområdet för variabler."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Output variables are the results of interest, or the dependent variable. In "
"this case, the dependent variables are the demand and the profit, which are "
"in cells B20 and B21."
msgstr ""
"Variabler för utdata är de resultat man är intresserad av, det vill säga de "
"beroende variablerna. Här är efterfrågan och vinsten beroende variabler, i "
"cellerna B20 och B21."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The next tab is the Options tab . There are four settings in the options as "
"shown in <xref linkend=\"fig-analysis-simulation-options-dialog\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Nästa flik är Alternativ. Där finns fyra inställningar, som visas i <xref "
"linkend=\"fig-analysis-simulation-options-dialog\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The second pair of options are the number of iterations and the Max time. In"
" a simulation, each iteration is the equivalent of a sample. A sample from a"
" random distribution is taken for each of the input values (as specified in "
"the Variables tab) and the resulting output value(s). The more iterations, "
"the better the estimate of the output value. However, this also takes more "
"time to run. A Max time value is specified in seconds where the simulation "
"will end without output if an individual simulation takes longer than the "
"Max time allotted. If this occurs (see <xref linkend=\"fig-analysis-"
"simulation-maximumtime-dialog\"/>), the options are to either increase the "
"Max time value, or decrease the number of iterations. A more drastic option "
"is to change the model so that fewer calculations or samples of random "
"numbers need to be made."
msgstr ""
"Det andra paret inställningar gäller antalet iterationer och maxtiden. Varje"
" iteration i en simulering motsvarar ett stickprov. För varje indatavärde "
"(enligt fliken Variabler) hämtas ett stickprov från en slumpfördelning och "
"motsvarande utdatavärden beräknas. Ju fler iterationer, desto bättre "
"uppskattning av utdatavärdet, men simuleringen tar också längre tid. "
"Maxtiden anges i sekunder. Om en enskild simulering tar längre tid än den "
"angivna maxtiden avbryts den utan att något resultat visas. Om det inträffar"
" (se <xref linkend=\"fig-analysis-simulation-maximumtime-dialog\"/>), kan du"
" antingen öka maxtiden eller minska antalet iterationer. Ett mer "
"genomgripande alternativ är att ändra modellen så att färre beräkningar "
"eller färre slumptal behöver tas fram."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The next tab is the Summary. There are two boxes in this tab, the Simulation"
" Summary and the Summary of results (see <xref linkend=\"fig-analysis-"
"simulation-summary-dialog\"/>). In simulation summary, there is a "
"description of the simulation parameters."
msgstr ""
"Nästa flik är Sammanfattning. Där finns två rutor: Simuleringssammanfattning"
" och Sammanfattning av resultat (se <xref linkend=\"fig-analysis-simulation-"
"summary-dialog\"/>). Simuleringssammanfattningen beskriver parametrarna för "
"simuleringen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"In the summary of results window, there are summary statistics for each "
"round of the simulation. If multiple rounds were done, the results of each "
"round can be browsed by using the 'Prev. Sim.' and 'Next Sim.' buttons below"
" the Summary of results box. For each output and input variable, the summary"
" shows the Min, Average and the Max value across the iterations for that "
"round of the simulation. Note that for the input variables, this shows the "
"random number that is the average, max and min. If the statistics on "
"intermediate values, such as a cost distribution, was desired, these "
"intermediate values should be added to the list of output variables."
msgstr ""
"I fönstret Sammanfattning av resultat visas sammanfattande statistik för "
"varje simuleringsomgång. Om simuleringen körts i flera omgångar kan du "
"bläddra bland resultaten med knapparna Föreg. sim. och Nästa sim. under "
"rutan Sammanfattning av resultat. För varje variabel för utdata och indata "
"visas det minsta, genomsnittliga och största värdet under omgångens "
"iterationer. För variablerna för indata är detta de slumpmässiga värdenas "
"minsta, genomsnittliga och största värde. Om du även vill se statistik för "
"mellanvärden, till exempel en kostnadsfördelning, lägger du till dessa "
"värden i listan över variabler för utdata."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The last tab is labeled 'Output'. This tab identifies the location where the"
" output table will be generated. There are two sets of options, first the "
"Output Placement then Output Formatting as shown in <xref linkend=\"fig-"
"analysis-simulation-output-dialog\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Den sista fliken heter Utdata. Här väljer du var utdatatabellen ska skapas. "
"Det finns två grupper med inställningar: Utdataplacering och "
"Utdataformatering, som visas i <xref linkend=\"fig-analysis-simulation-"
"output-dialog\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The default output placement is 'New sheet'. This will create a new sheet in"
" the Gnumeric workbook labeled 'Simulation Report (1)', where '1' can be "
"replaced with another number if a tab labeled 'Simulation Report (1)' "
"already exists. The option 'New workbook' creates a Gnumeric workbook named "
"'Book2.gnumeric' with a tab labeled 'Simulation Report.'"
msgstr ""
"Standardvalet för utdataplacering är Nytt blad. Då skapas ett nytt blad i "
"arbetsboken i Gnumeric med namnet Simulationsrapport (1). Siffran kan ändras"
" om det redan finns en flik med samma namn. Alternativet Ny arbetsbok skapar"
" en ny arbetsbok i Gnumeric med filnamnet Book2.gnumeric och en flik med "
"namnet Simulationsrapport."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"'Autofit columns' automatically makes each column long enough to include the"
" largest entry in that column. Note that column 'A' in the resulting "
"spreadsheet used to save run information such as date and time and is kept "
"narrow."
msgstr ""
"Alternativet Anpassa kolumner automatiskt gör varje kolumn tillräckligt bred"
" för den längsta posten. Observera att kolumn A i kalkylbladet används för "
"att spara information om körningen, till exempel datum och tid, och därför "
"hålls smal."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The output will include a heading, then a table for each round of the "
"simulation. Judicious choice of output variables will also include any "
"intermediate values of interest in the simulation in this table. Each row of"
" the output table has statistics of the values of a variable over the "
"iterations of the simulation as shown in <xref linkend=\"fig-analysis-"
"simulation-report-screen\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Utdata innehåller först en rubrik och därefter en tabell för varje "
"simuleringsomgång. Om du väljer lämpliga variabler för utdata kan tabellen "
"även innehålla mellanvärden som är intressanta för simuleringen. Varje rad i"
" utdatatabellen visar statistik för en variabel under simuleringens "
"iterationer, som i <xref linkend=\"fig-analysis-simulation-report-"
"screen\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The third option is to embed the output table into an existing worksheet. "
"This is done by specifying the 'Output range'. Note that the output range "
"must be large enough to include the entire table, including heading "
"information. For a single round this requires 11 rows and 16 columns. For "
"example, the range Profit!A24:P35 would contain the statistics for one round"
" with the three input variables and two output variables. As input and "
"output variables change, or the number of rounds of the simulation change, "
"the number of rows required will change."
msgstr ""
"Det tredje alternativet placerar utdatatabellen i ett befintligt blad. Ange "
"då Utdataintervall. Området måste rymma hela tabellen, inklusive rubriker. "
"En simuleringsomgång kräver 11 rader och 16 kolumner. Området Profit!A24:P35"
" skulle till exempel rymma statistiken för en omgång med tre variabler för "
"indata och två variabler för utdata. Antalet rader som behövs ändras när "
"variablerna för indata eller utdata ändras, eller när antalet "
"simuleringsomgångar ändras."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"'Clear output range' is in effect if the Output Placement option chosen is "
"Output range. It clears the selected cells in the spreadsheet before putting"
" the output table in its place."
msgstr ""
"Alternativet Töm utdataområde gäller när Utdataplacering är inställt på "
"Utdataintervall. Det tömmer de markerade cellerna i kalkylbladet innan "
"utdatatabellen placeras där."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"'Retain output range formatting' retains formatting for cells such as number"
" formatting."
msgstr ""
"Alternativet Behåll formatering av utdataområde bevarar cellernas "
"formatering, till exempel format för tal."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"'Retain output range comments' retains comments that have been placed in "
"output cells. This is most useful when the input and output variables "
"remained the same."
msgstr ""
"Alternativet Behåll kommentarer i utdataområde bevarar kommentarer i "
"cellerna i utdataområdet. Det är mest användbart när variablerna för indata "
"och utdata är oförändrade."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The output will be of the input variables and the output variables that were"
" variables tab of the Simulation window . For the input variables, the "
"output will be the statistics of the random variable used in modeling the "
"input variables. For the output variables, the statistics will be of the "
"output variable. These statistics, in particular the standard deviation and "
"confidence interval, should be examined to ensure the simulation was at a "
"precision adequate for the purpose. Some notes on how to use these "
"statistics for refining the simulation design can be found in <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-advanced-analysis-simulation-iterations\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Rapporten innehåller variablerna för indata och utdata som har angetts på "
"fliken Variabler i simuleringsfönstret. För variablerna för indata visas "
"statistiken för de slumpvariabler som användes för att modellera indata. För"
" variablerna för utdata visas statistik för själva utdata. Granska särskilt "
"standardavvikelsen och konfidensintervallet för att bedöma om simuleringen "
"har tillräcklig precision. Råd om hur statistiken kan användas för att "
"förfina simuleringen finns i <xref linkend=\"sect-advanced-analysis-"
"simulation-iterations\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Take the sample variance <inlineequation> <_:alt-1/> <_:mathphrase-2/> "
"</inlineequation> from the simulation output spreadsheet and determine the "
"sample standard deviation <inlineequation> <_:alt-3/> <_:mathphrase-4/> "
"</inlineequation> (see <xref linkend=\"fig-analysis-simulation-report-"
"screen\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"Hämta stickprovsvariansen <inlineequation> <_:alt-1/> <_:mathphrase-2/> "
"</inlineequation> från simuleringsrapportens kalkylblad och beräkna "
"stickprovsstandardavvikelsen <inlineequation> <_:alt-3/> <_:mathphrase-4/> "
"</inlineequation> (se <xref linkend=\"fig-analysis-simulation-report-"
"screen\"/>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"R is greater than equal to z of alpha divided by 2, times standard "
"deviation, divided by epsilon. Quantity squared."
msgstr ""
"R är större än eller lika med z för alfa delat med två, multiplicerat med "
"standardavvikelsen och dividerat med epsilon, allt i kvadrat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Taking the variance of the table, and setting <inlineequation> <_:alt-1/> "
"<_:mathphrase-2/> </inlineequation> and <inlineequation> <_:alt-3/> "
"<_:mathphrase-4/> </inlineequation>, lookup <inlineequation> <_:alt-5/> "
"<_:mathphrase-6/> </inlineequation> from a standard normal table. "
"<inlineequation> <_:alt-7/> <_:mathphrase-8/> </inlineequation> so we have"
msgstr ""
"Utifrån tabellens varians, och med <inlineequation> <_:alt-1/> "
"<_:mathphrase-2/> </inlineequation> samt <inlineequation> <_:alt-3/> "
"<_:mathphrase-4/> </inlineequation>, slår vi upp <inlineequation> <_:alt-5/>"
" <_:mathphrase-6/> </inlineequation> i en tabell över "
"standardnormalfördelningen. <inlineequation> <_:alt-7/> <_:mathphrase-8/> "
"</inlineequation> Därmed får vi"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Therefore, the minimum number of iterations is 3857. The simulation can then"
" be re-run with 3857 iterations to create a 95% c.i for profit where "
"<inlineequation> <_:alt-1/> <_:mathphrase-2/> </inlineequation> In this "
"example with 3857 iterations, we get the following Simulation Report table:"
msgstr ""
"Därför behövs minst 3 857 iterationer. Kör simuleringen igen med 3 857 "
"iterationer för att få ett 95 % konfidensintervall för vinsten, där "
"<inlineequation> <_:alt-1/> <_:mathphrase-2/> </inlineequation> gäller. Med "
"3 857 iterationer får vi följande tabell i Simulationsrapporten:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"As expected, the 95% Confidence interval for Profit is less than 0.05. For "
"the newsvendor example, the next step would be to look at the confidence "
"intervals of the profit for all values of purchase quantity, and verify that"
" this confidence interval is adequate for the decision to be made."
msgstr ""
"Som väntat är det 95 % konfidensintervallet för vinsten mindre än 0,05. "
"Nästa steg i exemplet med tidningsförsäljning är att granska "
"konfidensintervallen för vinsten vid alla inköpsmängder och kontrollera att "
"intervallet ger tillräcklig precision för beslutet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"To solve optimization problems with Gnumeric you have to type in the problem"
" into a sheet. A recommended way to start with is to allocate a separate "
"column in the spreadsheet for each decision variable (in the previous "
"example the x, y, and z) and a separate row for each constraint (the "
"constraints #1-#4). The coefficients of these variables should be placed "
"into the cells corresponding to the allocated row and the column. It is also"
" recommended that you label the rows and the columns to make the sheet much "
"more readable. The sheet for our maximization problem would look like this:"
msgstr ""
"Om du vill lösa ett optimeringsproblem med Gnumeric skriver du in problemet "
"i ett blad. Ett bra sätt att börja är att avsätta en kolumn i kalkylbladet "
"för varje beslutsvariabel (x, y och z i föregående exempel) och en rad för "
"varje bivillkor (#1–#4). Placera variablernas koefficienter i cellerna där "
"respektive rad och kolumn möts. Märk gärna rader och kolumner så blir bladet"
" tydligare. Bladet för maximeringsproblemet skulle se ut så här:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The constraints are defined in rows seven to ten. Since the coefficients of "
"these functions are in columns B, C and D we will get the total sum of each "
"of the constraint using the formula `SUMPRODUCT(B$3:D$3,Bn:Dn)' where n is "
"the row number of the constraint. For example, in E7 we have "
"`=SUMPRODUCT(B$3:D$3,B7:D7)', in E8 `=SUMPRODUCT(B$3:D$3,B8:D8)' and so on. "
"The right hand side (RHS) values of the constraints are typed into cells "
"G7:G10."
msgstr ""
"Bivillkoren anges på raderna 7–10. Eftersom koefficienterna finns i "
"kolumnerna B, C och D får vi summan för varje bivillkor med formeln "
"`SUMPRODUCT(B$3:D$3,Bn:Dn)', där n är bivillkorets radnummer. I E7 blir "
"formeln till exempel `=SUMPRODUCT(B$3:D$3,B7:D7)', i E8 "
"`=SUMPRODUCT(B$3:D$3,B8:D8)' och så vidare. Bivillkorens högerled (RHS) "
"anges i cellerna G7:G10."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Now it is time to select `Solver...' from the `Tools' menu. After you have "
"done it, the following dialog will appear:"
msgstr ""
"Välj nu `Problemlösare…` på menyn `Verktyg`. Då öppnas följande dialogruta:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"In this page, you can see all constraints that have been defined in the "
"`Subject to the Constraints:' window. Since none has been defined, this "
"window should be empty. Now type in the constraints (#1-#4) one by one."
msgstr ""
"På den här fliken visas alla bivillkor som har lagts till under ”Föremål för"
" bivillkoren:”. Eftersom inga har lagts till än är listan tom. Skriv in "
"bivillkoren (#1–#4) ett i taget."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-outputoptions.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the output"
" options dialog used by the statistical analysis tools.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-outputoptions.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Bild av dialogrutan "
"med utdataalternativ som används av de statistiska analysverktygen.</phrase>"
" </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"To enter a range into an entry field, you can either type the range "
"specification into the text field, or click in the text field and then "
"select the range on the sheet (see <xref linkend=\"specifyingranges\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ange ett cellområde i ett inmatningsfält genom att skriva det i "
"textrutan eller klicka i rutan och markera området i bladet (se <xref "
"linkend=\"specifyingranges\"/>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Specifying Ranges"
msgstr "Ange cellområden"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ranges.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the input "
"range text box used by the statistical analysis tools.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ranges.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Bild av textrutan "
"Indataområde som används av de statistiska analysverktygen.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Some entry fields accept lists of ranges. To enter these lists, select one "
"range, type a comma, and then select the next range. At any time, you may "
"switch to another sheet of the workbook."
msgstr ""
"Vissa inmatningsfält kan innehålla listor med cellområden. Välj ett område, "
"skriv ett kommatecken och välj sedan nästa. Du kan när som helst byta till "
"ett annat blad i arbetsboken."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The correlation tool calculates the pairwise Pearson correlation "
"coefficients of the given variables. Use this tool to calculate any number "
"of correlation coefficients at the same time. The variables for which the "
"correlations are calculated are specified by the <quote><guilabel>Input "
"Range:</guilabel></quote> entry. The input range can consist of either a "
"single range or a comma separated list of ranges. The given range or ranges "
"can be grouped by columns, by rows, or by areas."
msgstr ""
"Korrelationsverktyget beräknar Pearsons korrelationskoefficienter parvis för"
" de angivna variablerna. Med verktyget kan du beräkna flera koefficienter "
"samtidigt. Ange variablerna vars korrelationer ska beräknas i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>Indataområde:</guilabel></quote>. Indataområdet kan bestå "
"av ett cellområde eller en kommaseparerad lista med cellområden. Områdena "
"kan grupperas efter kolumner, rader eller cellområden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If the first row or column of the given ranges, or the first field of each "
"area contains labels, the <quote><guibutton>Labels</guibutton></quote> "
"option should be selected."
msgstr ""
"Om den första raden eller kolumnen i ett område, eller det första fältet i "
"varje område, innehåller rubriker väljer du alternativet "
"<quote><guibutton>Rubriker</guibutton></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"For example, you want to calculate the correlation between three variables, "
"one each in columns A, B, and C. Both variables have 10 values in rows 2 to "
"11 with labels in row 1 (see <xref linkend=\"correlation-example-1\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"Säg att du vill beräkna korrelationen mellan tre variabler, en i vardera "
"kolumn A, B och C. Varje variabel har tio värden i raderna 2–11 och en "
"rubrik i rad 1 (se <xref linkend=\"correlation-example-1\"/>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Enter A1:B11 in the <quote><guilabel>Input Range:</guilabel></quote> entry "
"by typing this directly into the entry or clicking in the entry field and "
"then selecting that range on the sheet. In the latter case the entry will "
"also contain the sheet name."
msgstr ""
"Ange A1:B11 i fältet <quote><guilabel>Indataområde:</guilabel></quote> genom"
" att skriva det direkt eller klicka i fältet och markera området i bladet. I"
" det senare fallet läggs även bladnamnet till i fältet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Select the <quote><guibutton>Columns</guibutton></quote> radio button next "
"to <quote><guilabel>Grouped By:</guilabel></quote>, since each variable is "
"in its own column."
msgstr ""
"Eftersom varje variabel finns i en egen kolumn väljer du alternativknappen "
"<quote><guibutton>Kolumner</guibutton></quote> bredvid "
"<quote><guilabel>Grupperad efter:</guilabel></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Select the <quote><guibutton>Labels</guibutton></quote> option since the "
"first row contains labels. (see <xref linkend=\"correlation-example-2\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"Välj alternativet <quote><guibutton>Rubriker</guibutton></quote> eftersom "
"den första raden innehåller rubriker (se <xref linkend=\"correlation-"
"example-2\"/>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The calculated correlations are given in a table with each column and row "
"labeled with the names of the variables. If the names are not given in the "
"input range, <application>Gnumeric</application> generates them. In our "
"example, the correlation between the variables in column A and B, can be "
"found in the second column and third row of the results table (see <xref "
"linkend=\"correlation-example-3\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"De beräknade korrelationerna visas i en tabell med variabelnamnen som "
"rubriker för rader och kolumner. Om variabelnamnen saknas i indataområdet "
"skapar <application>Gnumeric</application> dem. I exemplet finns "
"korrelationen mellan variablerna i kolumn A och B i resultatets andra kolumn"
" och tredje rad (se <xref linkend=\"correlation-example-3\"/>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Covariance Tool"
msgstr "Kovariansverktyg"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Covariance Tool Dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutan för kovariansverktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-covariance.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the "
"covariance analysis dialog.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-covariance.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Bild av dialogrutan för"
" kovariansanalys.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The covariance tool calculates the pairwise covariance coefficients of the "
"given variables. Use this tool to calculate any number of covariance "
"coefficients at the same time. The variables for which the covariances are "
"calculated are specified by the <quote><guilabel>Input "
"Range:</guilabel></quote> entry. The input range can consist of either a "
"single range or a comma separated list of ranges. The given range or ranges "
"can be grouped by columns, by rows, or by areas."
msgstr ""
"Kovariansverktyget beräknar kovarianskoefficienterna för alla par av angivna"
" variabler. Med verktyget kan du beräkna flera koefficienter samtidigt. Ange"
" variablerna i fältet <quote><guilabel>Indataområde:</guilabel></quote>. "
"Indataområdet kan bestå av ett cellområde eller en kommaseparerad lista med "
"cellområden. Områdena kan grupperas efter kolumner, rader eller cellområden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-covariance-"
"ex1.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image "
"example data for a covariance analysis.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-covariance-"
"ex1.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Exempeldata "
"för kovariansanalys.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Using The Covariance Tool"
msgstr "Använda kovariansverktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"For example, you want to calculate the covariance between three variables, "
"one each in columns A, B, and C. Both variables have 10 values in rows 2 to "
"11 with labels in row 1 (see <xref linkend=\"covariance-example-1\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"Säg att du vill beräkna kovariansen mellan tre variabler, en i vardera "
"kolumn A, B och C. Varje variabel har tio värden i raderna 2–11 och en "
"rubrik i rad 1 (se <xref linkend=\"covariance-example-1\"/>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Select the <quote><guibutton>Labels</guibutton></quote> option since the "
"first row contains labels."
msgstr ""
"Välj alternativet <quote><guibutton>Rubriker</guibutton></quote> eftersom "
"den första raden innehåller rubriker."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The calculated covariances are given in a table with each column and row "
"labeled with the names of the variables. If the names are not given in the "
"input range, <application>Gnumeric</application> generates them. In our "
"example, the covariance between the variables in column A and B, can be "
"found in the second column and third row of the results table (see <xref "
"linkend=\"covariance-example-2\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"De beräknade kovarianserna visas i en tabell med variabelnamnen som rubriker"
" för rader och kolumner. Om variabelnamnen saknas i indataområdet skapar "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> dem. I exemplet finns kovariansen mellan"
" variablerna i kolumn A och B i resultatets andra kolumn och tredje rad (se "
"<xref linkend=\"covariance-example-2\"/>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Covariance Tool Output"
msgstr "Kovariansverktygets utdata"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-covariance-"
"ex2.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of "
"the output of a covariance analysis.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-covariance-"
"ex2.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Bild av "
"utdata från kovariansanalys.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Descriptive Statistics Tool"
msgstr "Verktyg för deskriptiv statistik"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Descriptive Statistics Tool Dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutan för deskriptiv statistik"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-descstats.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the "
"descriptive statistics dialog.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-descstats.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Bild av dialogrutan för"
" deskriptiv statistik.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The descriptive statistics tool calculates various statistics for the given "
"variables and a confidence interval for the population mean. The variables "
"are specified via the <quote><guilabel>Input Range:</guilabel></quote> "
"entry. The given range or list of ranges can be grouped into variables by "
"columns, rows, or areas."
msgstr ""
"Verktyget för deskriptiv statistik beräknar olika statistiska mått för de "
"angivna variablerna och ett konfidensintervall för populationens medelvärde."
" Ange variablerna i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>Indataområde:</guilabel></quote>. Cellområdet eller listan "
"med cellområden kan grupperas i variabler efter kolumner, rader eller "
"områden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "This tool can produce four different kinds of statistical data."
msgstr "Verktyget kan beräkna fyra olika typer av statistik."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If the <quote><guibutton>Summary Statistics</guibutton></quote> option is "
"selected, this tool calculates the mean, standard error, median, mode, "
"standard deviation, sample variance, kurtosis, skewness, range, minimum, "
"maximum, sum, and count for each variable."
msgstr ""
"Om du väljer <quote><guibutton>Sammanfattande statistik</guibutton></quote> "
"beräknar verktyget medelvärde, standardfel, median, typvärde, "
"standardavvikelse, provvarians, kurtosis, skevhet, intervall, minimum, "
"maximum, summa och antal för varje variabel."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If the <quote><guibutton>Confidence Interval for the "
"Mean</guibutton></quote> option is selected, the tool calculates confidence "
"intervals for the population mean of each variable. Specify the confidence "
"level in the entry box. The default confidence level is 95%."
msgstr ""
"Om du väljer <quote><guibutton>Konfidensintervall för "
"medelvärdet</guibutton></quote> beräknar verktyget ett konfidensintervall "
"för populationens medelvärde för varje variabel. Ange konfidensnivån i "
"fältet. Standardnivån är 95 %."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The interval given will usually be wider than the interval obtained using "
"the CONFIDENCE function. The CONFIDENCE function assumes that the population"
" standard deviation is known. This tool estimates the population standard "
"deviation using the sample standard deviation."
msgstr ""
"Intervallet från det här verktyget är vanligtvis bredare än det som beräknas"
" med funktionen CONFIDENCE. Funktionen CONFIDENCE förutsätter att "
"populationens standardavvikelse är känd. Verktyget uppskattar den med hjälp "
"av stickprovets standardavvikelse."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If the <quote><guibutton>Kth Largest:</guibutton></quote> option is "
"selected, the tool finds the <parameter>k</parameter>th largest value of "
"each of the variables. Specify <parameter>k</parameter> in the entry box "
"next to the option. The default is 1."
msgstr ""
"Om du väljer <quote><guibutton>k:te största:</guibutton></quote> hittar "
"verktyget det <parameter>k</parameter>:te största värdet för varje variabel."
" Ange <parameter>k</parameter> i fältet bredvid alternativet. Standardvärdet"
" är 1."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If the <quote><guibutton>Kth Smallest:</guibutton></quote> option is "
"selected, the tool finds the <parameter>k</parameter>th smallest value of "
"each of the variables. Specify <parameter>k</parameter> in the entry box "
"next to the option. The default is 1."
msgstr ""
"Om du väljer <quote><guibutton>k:te minsta:</guibutton></quote> hittar "
"verktyget det <parameter>k</parameter>:te minsta värdet för varje variabel. "
"Ange <parameter>k</parameter> i fältet bredvid alternativet. Standardvärdet "
"är 1."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If the first entry for each variable contains the label, select the "
"<quote><guibutton>Labels</guibutton></quote> option."
msgstr ""
"Om den första posten för varje variabel innehåller en rubrik väljer du "
"alternativet <quote><guibutton>Rubriker</guibutton></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-descstats-ex1.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of some "
"example data for descriptive statistics.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-descstats-ex1.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Bild av exempeldata "
"för deskriptiv statistik.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Using the Descriptive Statistics Tool"
msgstr "Använda verktyget för deskriptiv statistik"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"descstats-example-1\"/> shows some example data, <xref "
"linkend=\"descstats-example-1-options\"/> the selected options, and <xref "
"linkend=\"descstats-example-2\"/> the corresponding output."
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"descstats-example-1\"/> visar exempeldata, <xref "
"linkend=\"descstats-example-1-options\"/> de valda alternativen och <xref "
"linkend=\"descstats-example-2\"/> motsvarande utdata."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The Options Page For Descriptive Statistics"
msgstr "Alternativsidan för deskriptiv statistik"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-descstats-"
"ex1-options.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An "
"image of some example data for descriptive statistics.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-descstats-"
"ex1-options.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Bild "
"av alternativen för deskriptiv statistik.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Descriptive Statistics Tool Output"
msgstr "Utdata från verktyget för deskriptiv statistik"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-descstats-ex2.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the output"
" of a descriptive statistics analysis.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-descstats-ex2.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Bild av resultatet "
"från en analys med deskriptiv statistik.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> provides two types of frequencies "
"tables:"
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> har två typer av frekvenstabeller:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The frequency table tools is primarily useful for non-numeric data (data of "
"nominal and ordinal level of measurement). It allows to determine "
"frequencies for given values."
msgstr ""
"Verktygen för frekvenstabeller passar främst för icke-numeriska data, där "
"värdena anger kategorier eller en ordning. De används för att beräkna hur "
"ofta angivna värden förekommer."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The histogram tool is useful for numeric data that is supposed to be "
"classified into a certain number of intervals. These intervals can be either"
" specified or calculated."
msgstr ""
"Verktyget Histogram passar för numeriska data som ska delas in i ett visst "
"antal intervall. Intervallen kan anges i förväg eller beräknas av verktyget."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Frequency Tables Tool"
msgstr "Verktyg för frekvenstabeller"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The frequency tool can be used to create frequency tables for non-numerical "
"data. It presents this table numerically as well as graphically."
msgstr ""
"Frekvensverktyget kan skapa frekvenstabeller för icke-numeriska data. "
"Tabellen visas både numeriskt och grafiskt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If your data are numeric and you want to accumulate whole intervals of "
"values into frequency counts then this tool is not appropriate. In that case"
" you may want to use the histogram table tool described in section <xref "
"linkend=\"histogram-tool\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Om dina data är numeriska och du vill samla värden i intervall och räkna "
"förekomster passar det här verktyget inte. Använd i så fall verktyget "
"Histogram som beskrivs i avsnittet <xref linkend=\"histogram-tool\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Frequency Tool Dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutan för frekvensverktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-frequency.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the dialog "
"to generate various frequency tables open to the \"Input\" tab.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-frequency.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Bild av dialogrutan för"
" att skapa frekvenstabeller, med fliken Indata öppen.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"As shown in <xref linkend=\"frequency-tool-dialog\"/>, the frequency table "
"dialog has four tabs. We will introduce them in sequence."
msgstr ""
"Som visas i <xref linkend=\"frequency-tool-dialog\"/> har dialogrutan "
"Frekvensverktyg fyra flikar. De presenteras i tur och ordning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The <quote><guilabel>Input</guilabel></quote> Tab"
msgstr "Fliken <quote><guilabel>Indata</guilabel></quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The <quote><guilabel>Input</guilabel></quote> tab shown in <xref "
"linkend=\"frequency-tool-dialog\"/> contains the field specifying the data "
"to be used for the histogram."
msgstr ""
"Fliken <quote><guilabel>Indata</guilabel></quote> i <xref "
"linkend=\"frequency-tool-dialog\"/> innehåller fältet där du anger vilka "
"data som ska användas i histogrammet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The <quote><guilabel>Input Range</guilabel></quote> entry contains a single "
"range or a list of ranges, that can be grouped into variables by rows, "
"columns, or areas."
msgstr ""
"Fältet <quote><guilabel>Indataområde</guilabel></quote> innehåller ett "
"cellområde eller en lista med cellområden. Områdena kan delas in i variabler"
" efter rader, kolumner eller delområden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If the first row or column of the given input ranges, or the first field of "
"each area contains labels, the <quote><guibutton>Labels</guibutton></quote> "
"option should be selected. If the input is grouped by areas and the top left"
" cell contains a label, the other cells in the first row are being ignored."
msgstr ""
"Om den första raden eller kolumnen i de angivna cellområdena, eller det "
"första fältet i varje delområde, innehåller rubriker väljer du alternativet "
"<quote><guibutton>Rubriker</guibutton></quote>. Om indata grupperas i "
"områden och cellen längst upp till vänster innehåller en rubrik ignoreras de"
" övriga cellerna på den första raden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The <quote><guilabel>Categories</guilabel></quote> Tab"
msgstr "Fliken <quote><guilabel>Kategorier</guilabel></quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The <quote><guilabel>Categories</guilabel></quote> tab permits the "
"specification of a range that contains the possible values that are supposed"
" to be counted in the input range."
msgstr ""
"På fliken <quote><guilabel>Kategorier</guilabel></quote> kan du ange ett "
"cellområde med de värden som ska räknas i indataområdet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The <quote><guilabel>Automatic categories</guilabel></quote> option is "
"disabled since it is not yet implemented."
msgstr ""
"Alternativet <quote><guilabel>Automatiska kategorier</guilabel></quote> är "
"inaktiverat eftersom funktionen ännu inte har implementerats."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Frequency Tool Dialog Categories Tab"
msgstr "Fliken Kategorier i dialogrutan för frekvensverktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-frequency-"
"cats.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of "
"the dialog to generate various frequency tables open to the \"Categories\" "
"tab.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-frequency-"
"cats.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Bild av "
"dialogrutan för att skapa frekvenstabeller, med fliken Kategorier "
"öppen.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The <quote><guilabel>Graphs &amp; Options</guilabel></quote> Tab"
msgstr "Fliken <quote><guilabel>Diagram och alternativ</guilabel></quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The <quote><guilabel>Graphs &amp; Options</guilabel></quote> tab allows "
"various options to be set. In the top half of the tab you can choose whether"
" you would like a graph to be created. If you choose to have a graph created"
" you can specify whether you would like to see a bar chart or a column "
"chart."
msgstr ""
"På fliken <quote><guilabel>Diagram och alternativ</guilabel></quote> kan du "
"ställa in olika alternativ. I den övre delen väljer du om ett diagram ska "
"skapas. Om du väljer det kan du ange om diagrammet ska visa staplar eller "
"kolumner."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"In the bottom part of the tab you can select the "
"<quote><guilabel>percentages</guilabel></quote> option. This option replaces"
" the frequency counts with percentages."
msgstr ""
"I den nedre delen av fliken kan du välja "
"<quote><guilabel>procent</guilabel></quote>. Då visas frekvenserna i procent"
" i stället för som antal."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If the categories range contains repeated values, then the percentages may "
"add up to more than 100%. If the categories range does not contain all "
"values that occur in the input range, the percentages may sum to less than "
"100%."
msgstr ""
"Om kategorierna innehåller upprepade värden kan summan bli större än 100 %. "
"Om kategorierna inte omfattar alla värden i indataområdet kan summan bli "
"mindre än 100 %."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The <quote><guilabel>Use exact comparisons</guilabel></quote> checkbox "
"determines how category values and input range values are compared. If it is"
" checked then the function <function>EXACT</function> is used for the "
"comparison. If it isn't checked then simple equality is used. In this latter"
" case, empty cells and cells containing the numerical value 0 are considered"
" equal. As a consequence you usually want that checkbox to be selected."
msgstr ""
"Kryssrutan <quote><guilabel>Använd exakta jämförelser</guilabel></quote> "
"avgör hur kategorivärden jämförs med värdena i indataområdet. Om rutan är "
"markerad används funktionen <function>EXACT</function>. Annars används en "
"vanlig likhetsjämförelse, där tomma celler räknas som lika med celler som "
"innehåller talet 0. Därför bör rutan vanligtvis vara markerad."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Frequency Tool Dialog Graphs &amp; Options Tab"
msgstr "Fliken Diagram och alternativ i dialogrutan Frekvensverktyg"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-frequency-"
"graphs.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image "
"of the dialog to generate various frequency tables open to the \"Graphs "
"&amp; Options\" tab.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-frequency-"
"graphs.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Bild av "
"dialogrutan för att skapa frekvenstabeller, med fliken Diagram och "
"alternativ öppen.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Frequency Tool Results"
msgstr "Resultat från frekvensverktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-frequency-"
"results.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Sample "
"results of the frequencies tool.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-frequency-"
"results.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Exempel "
"på resultat från frekvensverktyget.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Histogram Tool"
msgstr "Histogramverktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The histogram tool can be used to create histograms or frequency tables for "
"numerical data. Using this tool you can define intervals, or "
"<quote>bins</quote>. The tool determines how many data points belong to each"
" bin and presents this number numerically as well as graphically."
msgstr ""
"Histogramverktyget kan skapa histogram eller frekvenstabeller för numeriska "
"data. Med verktyget kan du definiera intervall, så kallade "
"<quote>klasser</quote>. Verktyget räknar hur många datapunkter som tillhör "
"varje klass och visar antalet både numeriskt och grafiskt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If your data are non-numeric this tool is not appropriate. In that case you "
"may want to use the frequency table tool described in section <xref "
"linkend=\"frequency-tool\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Verktyget passar inte för icke-numeriska data. Använd i så fall "
"frekvensverktyget som beskrivs i avsnittet <xref linkend=\"frequency-"
"tool\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Histogram Tool Dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutan för histogramverktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-histogram.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the dialog "
"to generate various histograms open to the \"Input\" tab.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-histogram.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Bild av dialogrutan för"
" att skapa histogram, med fliken Indata öppen.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"As shown in <xref linkend=\"histogram-tool-dialog\"/>, the histogram dialog "
"has five tabs. We will introduce them in sequence."
msgstr ""
"Som visas i <xref linkend=\"histogram-tool-dialog\"/> har "
"histogramdialogrutan fem flikar. De presenteras i tur och ordning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The <quote><guilabel>Input</guilabel></quote> tab shown in <xref "
"linkend=\"histogram-tool-dialog\"/> contains the field specifying the data "
"to be used for the histogram."
msgstr ""
"Fliken <quote><guilabel>Indata</guilabel></quote> i <xref "
"linkend=\"histogram-tool-dialog\"/> innehåller fältet där du anger vilka "
"data som ska användas i histogrammet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The <quote><guilabel>Cutoffs</guilabel></quote> Tab"
msgstr "Fliken <quote><guilabel>Gränsvärden</guilabel></quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Histogram Tool Dialog <quote><guilabel>Cutoffs</guilabel></quote> Tab"
msgstr ""
"Histogramverktygets dialogruta – fliken "
"<quote><guilabel>Gränsvärden</guilabel></quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-histogram-"
"cutoffs.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image "
"of the dialog to generate various histograms open to the \"Cutoffs\" "
"tab.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-histogram-"
"cutoffs.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Bild av "
"histogramdialogrutan med fliken Gränsvärden öppen.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The cutoffs for the histogram can either be predetermined by data contained "
"in your workbook or calculated by the histogram tool. These cutoffs "
"determine bins as defined by the selection on the "
"<quote><guilabel>Bins</guilabel></quote> tab."
msgstr ""
"Histogrammets gränsvärden kan hämtas från data i arbetsboken eller beräknas "
"av histogramverktyget. Gränsvärdena avgör klassindelningen enligt "
"inställningarna på fliken <quote><guilabel>Grupper</guilabel></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Select the <quote><guilabel>Predetermined Cutoffs</guilabel></quote> option "
"to specify data on your worksheet in the <quote><guilabel>Cutoff "
"Range:</guilabel></quote> entry. The values in this range will be used as "
"cutoffs <parameter>c<subscript>1</subscript></parameter>, "
"<parameter>c<subscript>2</subscript></parameter>, and so on to "
"<parameter>c<subscript>n</subscript></parameter>."
msgstr ""
"Välj <quote><guilabel>Förutbestämda gränsvärden</guilabel></quote> om du "
"vill ange värden från kalkylbladet i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>Gränsvärdesområde:</guilabel></quote>. Värdena i området "
"används som gränsvärden <parameter>c<subscript>1</subscript></parameter>, "
"<parameter>c<subscript>2</subscript></parameter> och så vidare upp till "
"<parameter>c<subscript>n</subscript></parameter>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Select the <quote><guilabel>Calculated Cutoffs</guilabel></quote> option to "
"have the cutoffs determined by the tool. Enter the desired number of cutoffs"
" in the <quote><guilabel>Number of Cutoffs</guilabel></quote> entry. It is "
"strongly recommended (but optional) that you specify the minimum and maximum"
" cutoffs in the <quote><guilabel>Minimum cutoff</guilabel></quote> and "
"<quote><guilabel>Maximum cutoff</guilabel></quote> entries. If the minimum "
"or maximum cutoff is not specified, the tool will use the minimum and/or "
"maximum of the current data."
msgstr ""
"Välj <quote><guilabel>Beräknade gränsvärden</guilabel></quote> om verktyget "
"ska beräkna gränsvärdena. Ange önskat antal i fältet <quote><guilabel>Antal "
"gränsvärden</guilabel></quote>. Vi rekommenderar starkt, men det är "
"valfritt, att du anger lägsta och högsta gränsvärde i fälten "
"<quote><guilabel>Minsta gränsvärde</guilabel></quote> och "
"<quote><guilabel>Största gränsvärde</guilabel></quote>. Om du inte anger ett"
" lägsta eller högsta gränsvärde använder verktyget det minsta respektive "
"största värdet i de aktuella data."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The <quote><guilabel>Bins</guilabel></quote> Tab"
msgstr "Fliken <quote><guilabel>Grupper</guilabel></quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Histogram Tool Dialog <quote><guilabel>Bins Tab</guilabel></quote>"
msgstr ""
"Histogramverktygets dialogruta – fliken "
"<quote><guilabel>Grupper</guilabel></quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-histogram-"
"bins.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of "
"the dialog to generate various histograms open to the \"Bins\" tab.</phrase>"
" </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-histogram-"
"bins.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Bild av "
"histogramdialogrutan med fliken Grupper öppen.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The bins tab is used to determine how the cutoffs "
"<parameter>c<subscript>1</subscript></parameter>, "
"<parameter>c<subscript>2</subscript></parameter>, and so on to "
"<parameter>c<subscript>n</subscript></parameter> are translated into bins. "
"Specifically, it has to be determined whether first and/or last bins "
"reaching from −∞ to <parameter>c<subscript>1</subscript></parameter> and "
"from <parameter>c<subscript>n</subscript></parameter> to ∞ are added and "
"whether data points that much cutoffs exactly are included in the bin to the"
" right or the left."
msgstr ""
"På fliken Grupper anger du hur gränsvärdena "
"<parameter>c<subscript>1</subscript></parameter>, "
"<parameter>c<subscript>2</subscript></parameter> och så vidare upp till "
"<parameter>c<subscript>n</subscript></parameter> ska delas in i klasser. Du "
"väljer bland annat om en första klass från −∞ till "
"<parameter>c<subscript>1</subscript></parameter> och/eller en sista klass "
"från <parameter>c<subscript>n</subscript></parameter> till ∞ ska läggas "
"till, samt om datapunkter som exakt motsvarar ett gränsvärde ska räknas till"
" klassen till höger eller vänster."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"For example the option <quote><guilabel>[∙,∙),[∙,∙),⋯, [∙,∙),[∙,∞) "
"</guilabel></quote> indicates that the first bin starts at the first cutoff "
"while the last bin ends at ∞. Moreover, each cutoff value belongs to the bin"
" on its right."
msgstr ""
"Alternativet <quote><guilabel>[∙,∙),[∙,∙),⋯, [∙,∙),[∙,∞) </guilabel></quote>"
" innebär till exempel att den första klassen börjar vid det första "
"gränsvärdet och att den sista slutar vid ∞. Varje gränsvärde räknas dessutom"
" till klassen till höger."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Histogram Tool Dialog <quote><guilabel>Graphs &amp; Options "
"Tab</guilabel></quote>"
msgstr ""
"Histogramverktygets dialogruta – fliken <quote><guilabel>Diagram och "
"alternativ</guilabel></quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-histogram-"
"graphs.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image "
"of the dialog to generate various histograms open to the \"Graphs &amp; "
"Options\" tab.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-histogram-"
"graphs.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Bild av "
"histogramdialogrutan med fliken Diagram och alternativ öppen.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The options in the graphs and options tab specify any graph to be created "
"and modify the appearance of the histogram:"
msgstr ""
"På fliken Diagram och alternativ väljer du om ett diagram ska skapas och hur"
" histogrammet ska se ut:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The <quote><guibutton>No chart</guibutton></quote> option causes the chart "
"to be omitted."
msgstr ""
"Med alternativet <quote><guibutton>Inget diagram</guibutton></quote> skapas "
"inget diagram."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The <quote><guibutton>Bar chart</guibutton></quote> option causes a bar "
"chart to be added to the histogram. For each bin, the bar chart shows a "
"horizontal bar indicating the frequency."
msgstr ""
"Alternativet <quote><guibutton>Stapeldiagram</guibutton></quote> lägger till"
" ett stapeldiagram i histogrammet. För varje klass visar en vågrät stapel "
"frekvensen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The <quote><guibutton>Column chart</guibutton></quote> option causes a "
"column chart to be added to the histogram. For each bin, the column chart "
"shows a vertical bar indicating the frequency."
msgstr ""
"Alternativet <quote><guibutton>Kolumndiagram</guibutton></quote> lägger till"
" ett kolumndiagram i histogrammet. För varje klass visar en lodrät stapel "
"frekvensen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The <quote><guibutton>Histogram chart</guibutton></quote> option causes a "
"histogram chart to be added to the histogram. For each bin, the histogram "
"chart shows a vertical bar indicating the density (that is the frequency "
"divided by the width of the bin)."
msgstr ""
"Alternativet <quote><guibutton>Histogramdiagram</guibutton></quote> lägger "
"till ett histogramdiagram. För varje klass visar en lodrät stapel tätheten, "
"det vill säga frekvensen dividerad med klassens bredd."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The <quote><guibutton>Percentages</guibutton></quote> option causes the "
"frequencies to be expressed as percentages."
msgstr ""
"Med alternativet <quote><guibutton>Procent</guibutton></quote> visas "
"frekvenserna i procent."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The <quote><guibutton>Cumulative answers</guibutton></quote> option causes a"
" cumulative frequency table (either with counts or with pecentages) to be "
"created."
msgstr ""
"Alternativet <quote><guibutton>Kumulativa frekvenser</guibutton></quote> "
"skapar en tabell med kumulativa frekvenser, antingen som antal eller "
"procent."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The <quote><guibutton>Count numbers only</guibutton></quote> option "
"determines whether only numbers are counted. If also non-numbers are counted"
" they are first converted into numbers, usually into 0."
msgstr ""
"Alternativet <quote><guibutton>Räkna endast tal</guibutton></quote> avgör om"
" bara tal ska räknas. Om även andra värden räknas omvandlas de först till "
"tal, vanligtvis till 0."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The <quote><guilabel>Output</guilabel></quote> Tab"
msgstr "Fliken <quote><guilabel>Utdata</guilabel></quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The Output tab contains the standard output options and fields described in "
"<xref linkend=\"sect-stat-analysis-overview\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Fliken Utdata innehåller de vanliga alternativen och fälten för utdata som "
"beskrivs i <xref linkend=\"sect-stat-analysis-overview\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "A Histogram Example"
msgstr "Exempel på histogram"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-histogram-ex1.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of some "
"example data for use with the histogram tool.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-histogram-ex1.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Exempeldata för "
"histogramverktyget.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Using the Histogram Tool"
msgstr "Använda histogramverktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"For example, you want to calculate a histogram for the number of successes "
"in several sequences of trials. The numbers of successes are recorded in "
"column A and the cutoffs of interest in column C (see <xref "
"linkend=\"histogram-example-1\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"Anta att du vill beräkna ett histogram över antalet lyckade utfall i flera "
"försöksserier. Antalet lyckade utfall finns i kolumn A och de önskade "
"gränsvärdena i kolumn C (se <xref linkend=\"histogram-example-1\"/>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Enter A1:A31 in the <quote><guilabel>Input Range:</guilabel></quote> entry "
"of the <quote><guilabel>Input</guilabel></quote> tab by typing this directly"
" into the entry or clicking in the entry field and then selecting that range"
" on the sheet. In the latter case the entry may also contain the sheet name."
msgstr ""
"Ange A1:A31 i fältet <quote><guilabel>Indataområde:</guilabel></quote> på "
"fliken <quote><guilabel>Indata</guilabel></quote>. Skriv in området direkt "
"eller klicka i fältet och markera området i bladet. I det senare fallet kan "
"fältet även innehålla bladets namn."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Since you only have one variable select the "
"<quote><guibutton>Areas</guibutton></quote> or "
"<quote><guibutton>Columns</guibutton></quote> radio button next to "
"<quote><guilabel>Grouped By:</guilabel></quote>."
msgstr ""
"Eftersom du bara har en variabel väljer du alternativknappen "
"<quote><guibutton>Områden</guibutton></quote> eller "
"<quote><guibutton>Kolumner</guibutton></quote> bredvid "
"<quote><guilabel>Grupperad efter:</guilabel></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Select the <quote><guibutton>Labels</guibutton></quote> option since the "
"first cell of the Input Range contains a label."
msgstr ""
"Markera <quote><guibutton>Rubriker</guibutton></quote>, eftersom den första "
"cellen i indataområdet innehåller en rubrik."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Enter C2:C5 in the <quote><guilabel>Cutoff Range:</guilabel></quote> entry "
"of the <quote><guilabel>Cutoffs</guilabel></quote> tab. The "
"<quote><guilabel>Predetermined Cutoffs</guilabel></quote> option will now "
"also be selected (see <xref linkend=\"histogram-example-2\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"Ange C2:C5 i fältet <quote><guilabel>Slutintervall:</guilabel></quote> på "
"fliken <quote><guilabel>Slut</guilabel></quote>. Då markeras även "
"<quote><guilabel>Förutbestämda slut</guilabel></quote> (se <xref "
"linkend=\"histogram-example-2\"/>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"In the <quote><guilabel>Bins</guilabel></quote> tab select the second option"
" since we want to add two bins reaching to ∓∞ and we want to count each "
"cutoff value in the bin to its right (see <xref linkend=\"histogram-"
"example-3\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"På fliken <quote><guilabel>Grupper</guilabel></quote> väljer du det andra "
"alternativet. Då läggs två grupper som sträcker sig till ∓∞ till, och varje "
"gränsvärde räknas till gruppen till höger (se <xref linkend=\"histogram-"
"example-3\"/>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Select the <quote><guibutton>Percentage</guibutton></quote> option of the "
"<quote><guilabel>Graphs &amp;Options</guilabel></quote> tab to have the "
"frequencies expressed as percentages."
msgstr ""
"Välj <quote><guibutton>Procent</guibutton></quote> på fliken "
"<quote><guilabel>Diagram och alternativ</guilabel></quote> om frekvenserna "
"ska visas i procent."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Select the <quote><guibutton>Column Chart</guibutton></quote> option of the "
"<quote><guilabel>Graphs &amp;Options</guilabel></quote> tab to have a column"
" chart added to the histogram (see <xref linkend=\"histogram-example-4\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"Välj <quote><guibutton>Kolumndiagram</guibutton></quote> på fliken "
"<quote><guilabel>Diagram och alternativ</guilabel></quote> om ett "
"kolumndiagram ska läggas till i histogrammet (se <xref linkend=\"histogram-"
"example-4\"/>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"In the <quote><guilabel>Output</guilabel></quote> tab, specify the output "
"options as described in <xref linkend=\"sect-stat-analysis-overview\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Ange utdatainställningarna på fliken "
"<quote><guilabel>Utdata</guilabel></quote> enligt beskrivningen i <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-stat-analysis-overview\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The results are shown in <xref linkend=\"histogram-example-5\"/>. Note that "
"the graph will by default appear on top of the histogram table. It usually "
"needs to be moved in to proper position. That has already been done here."
msgstr ""
"Resultatet visas i <xref linkend=\"histogram-example-5\"/>. Som standard "
"placeras diagrammet ovanpå histogramtabellen. Vanligtvis behöver det flyttas"
" till rätt plats, vilket redan har gjorts i det här exemplet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Histogram Tool: Specifying Cutoffs"
msgstr "Histogramverktyget: ange gränsvärden"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-histogram-ex2.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of selecting "
"the cutoffs for the example data used with the histogram tool.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-histogram-ex2.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Val av gränsvärden för"
" exempeldata i histogramverktyget.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Histogram Tool: Specifying Bins"
msgstr "Histogramverktyget: ange grupper"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-histogram-ex3.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of selecting "
"a certain bins type.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-histogram-ex3.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Val av "
"grupptyp.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Histogram Tool: Specifying Options"
msgstr "Histogramverktyget: ange alternativ"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-histogram-ex4.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of specifying"
" the required options.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-histogram-ex4.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Val av de önskade "
"alternativen.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Histogram Tool Output"
msgstr "Resultat från histogramverktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-histogram-ex5.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the output"
" from the histogram analysis tool.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-histogram-ex5.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Utdata från "
"histogramanalysverktyget.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Rank and Percentile Tool"
msgstr "Verktyget Rang och percentil"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Rank and Percentile Tool Dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutan Rang och percentil"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-rank.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the rank "
"and percentile analysis tool.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-rank.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Analysverktyget Rang "
"och percentil.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Use this tool to rank given data and to calculate the percentiles of each "
"data point."
msgstr ""
"Använd verktyget för att rangordna data och beräkna percentilen för varje "
"datapunkt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Specify the datasets to use in the <quote><guilabel>Input "
"Range:</guilabel></quote> entry. The given range can be grouped into "
"datasets by columns, by rows, or by areas."
msgstr ""
"Ange vilka data som ska användas i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>Indataområde:</guilabel></quote>. Området kan delas in i "
"datamängder efter kolumner, rader eller områden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "For each dataset, the tool creates three columns in the output table:"
msgstr "För varje datamängd skapar verktyget tre kolumner i utdatatabellen:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The first column gives the indices of the ordered data from largest to "
"smallest data value."
msgstr ""
"Den första kolumnen visar positionerna för värdena, sorterade från störst "
"till minst."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The second column gives data values corresponding to the indices in the "
"first column."
msgstr ""
"Den andra kolumnen visar de värden som motsvarar positionerna i den första "
"kolumnen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The third column indicates the percentile of the data value in the second "
"column."
msgstr ""
"Den tredje kolumnen visar percentilen för värdet i den andra kolumnen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If you have labels in the first cell of each data set, select the "
"<quote><guilabel>Labels</guilabel></quote> option."
msgstr ""
"Om den första cellen i varje datamängd innehåller en rubrik markerar du "
"<quote><guilabel>Rubriker</guilabel></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Some Example Data for the Rank and Percentile Tool"
msgstr "Exempeldata för verktyget Rang och percentil"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-rank-ex1.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of example "
"data for use with the rank and percentile analysis tool.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-rank-ex1.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Exempeldata för "
"analysverktyget Rang och percentil.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Using the Rank and Percentile Tool"
msgstr "Använda verktyget Rang och percentil"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"rank-example-1\"/> shows some example data and <xref "
"linkend=\"rank-example-2\"/> the corresponding output."
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"rank-example-1\"/> visar exempeldata och <xref "
"linkend=\"rank-example-2\"/> motsvarande utdata."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Rank and Percentile Tool Output"
msgstr "Utdata från verktyget Rang och percentil"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-rank-ex2.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the output "
"from a rank and percentile analysis.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-rank-ex2.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Utdata från en rang- "
"och percentilanalys.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"In the case of ties, the rank calculated by this tool differs from the value"
" of the RANK function for the same data. This tool calculates the rank as it"
" is normally used in Statistics: If two values are tied, the assigned rank "
"is the average rank for those entries. For example in <xref linkend=\"rank-"
"example-1\"/> the two values 10 are the second and third largest values. "
"Since they are equal each receives the rank of 2.5, the average of 2 and 3. "
"The rank function on the other hand assigns the rank as it is normally used "
"to determine placements. The two values 10 would therefore each receive a "
"rank of 2."
msgstr ""
"Om flera värden är lika skiljer sig rangordningen från verktyget från "
"resultatet av funktionen RANK för samma data. Verktyget använder den "
"statistiska rangordningen: lika värden får medelvärdet av sina rangtal. I "
"<xref linkend=\"rank-example-1\"/> är till exempel de två värdena 10 näst "
"störst respektive tredje störst. Eftersom värdena är lika får båda rangtalet"
" 2,5, medelvärdet av 2 och 3. Funktionen RANK använder i stället den "
"rangordning som brukar användas för placeringar. Därför får båda värdena 10 "
"rangtalet 2."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Sampling Tool"
msgstr "Stickprovsverktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Sampling Tool Dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutan för stickprovsverktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-sampling.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the "
"sampling tool.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-sampling.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>Stickprovsverktyget.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Use the sampling tool to take a sample of a data set. This tool can take "
"both a random sample of a given size or a periodic sample:"
msgstr ""
"Använd stickprovsverktyget för att ta ett stickprov ur en datamängd. "
"Verktyget kan ta ett slumpmässigt stickprov av en viss storlek eller ett "
"periodiskt stickprov:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "random sample"
msgstr "slumpmässigt stickprov"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"A random sample is a subset of the population such that every subset of that"
" size has the same chance of being picked."
msgstr ""
"Ett slumpmässigt stickprov är en delmängd av populationen där varje delmängd"
" av samma storlek har lika stor sannolikhet att väljas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "periodic sample"
msgstr "periodiskt stickprov"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"In a periodic sample every <parameter>k</parameter>th element in the "
"population is selected."
msgstr ""
"I ett periodiskt stickprov väljs vart <parameter>k</parameter>:e element i "
"populationen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"To use this tool, first specify the data set or data sets by setting the "
"<quote><guilabel>Input Range:</guilabel></quote> entry. The range or ranges "
"given can be grouped into datasets by rows, by columns, or by areas."
msgstr ""
"Ange först vilken eller vilka datamängder som ska användas i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>Indataområde:</guilabel></quote>. Området eller områdena "
"kan delas in i datamängder efter rader, kolumner eller områden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If the first entry in each data set contains a variable, select the "
"<quote><guilabel>Labels</guilabel></quote> option."
msgstr ""
"Om den första posten i varje datamängd innehåller ett variabelnamn markerar "
"du <quote><guilabel>Rubriker</guilabel></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Select the sampling method which can be either periodic or random."
msgstr "Välj urvalsmetod: periodisk eller slumpmässig."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Specify the size of the random sample in the <quote><guilabel>Size of "
"Sample:</guilabel></quote> entry."
msgstr ""
"Ange storleken på det slumpmässiga stickprovet i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>Storlek på stickprov:</guilabel></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Specify the period in the <quote><guilabel>Period:</guilabel></quote> entry."
msgstr "Ange perioden i fältet <quote><guilabel>Period:</guilabel></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Specify the number of samples you would like to obtain in the "
"<quote><guilabel> Number of Samples:</guilabel></quote> entry."
msgstr ""
"Ange hur många stickprov du vill ta i fältet <quote><guilabel> Antal "
"stickprov:</guilabel></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Since the period uniquely determines a periodic sample, if you specify that "
"you would like 2 samples you will be given the identical sample twice."
msgstr ""
"Eftersom perioden entydigt bestämmer ett periodiskt stickprov får du samma "
"stickprov två gånger om du anger att du vill ta 2 stickprov."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If the dataset for a periodic sample is a two dimensional range, "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> will enumerate the data points by row "
"first."
msgstr ""
"Om datamängden för ett periodiskt stickprov består av ett tvådimensionellt "
"område räknar <application>Gnumeric</application> datapunkterna radvis "
"först."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Some Example Data for the Sampling Tool"
msgstr "Exempeldata för stickprovsverktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-sampling-ex1.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of example "
"data for use with the sampling tool.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-sampling-ex1.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Exempeldata för "
"stickprovsverktyget.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Using the Sampling Tool"
msgstr "Använda stickprovsverktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"sampling-example-1\"/> shows some example data and <xref "
"linkend=\"sampling-example-2\"/> the corresponding output."
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"sampling-example-1\"/> visar exempeldata och <xref "
"linkend=\"sampling-example-2\"/> motsvarande utdata."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
