msgid "Dependent Observations"
msgstr "Beroende observationer"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Forecast Tools"
msgstr "Prognosverktyg"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Exponential Smoothing Tool"
msgstr "Verktyg för exponentiell utjämning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Exponential Smoothing Tool Dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutan för exponentiell utjämning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-smoothing.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the "
"exponential smoothing dialog.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-smoothing.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Dialogrutan för "
"exponentiell utjämning.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The Exponential Smoothing tool performs the exponential smoothing for the "
"given set or sets of values. It provides the choice of 5 different "
"exponential smoothing methods:"
msgstr ""
"Verktyget för exponentiell utjämning jämnar ut en eller flera värdeserier "
"exponentiellt. Du kan välja mellan fem olika metoder:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Simple exponential smoothing according to (Hunter, 1968)."
msgstr "Enkel exponentiell utjämning enligt Hunter (1968)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Simple exponential smoothing according to (Roberts, 1959)."
msgstr "Enkel exponentiell utjämning enligt Roberts (1959)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Holt's trend corrected exponential smoothing (occasionally also referred to "
"as double exponential smoothing)"
msgstr ""
"Holts trendkorrigerade exponentiella utjämning (ibland även kallad dubbel "
"exponentiell utjämning)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Multiplicative Holt-Winters exponential smoothing (occasionally also "
"referred to as triple exponential smoothing)"
msgstr ""
"Multiplikativ exponentiell utjämning enligt Holt–Winters (ibland även kallad"
" trippel exponentiell utjämning)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Since the kind of options available depend on the type of exponential "
"smoothing desired, you can choose the type on the <quote><guilabel>Input "
"</guilabel></quote> page."
msgstr ""
"Vilka alternativ som är tillgängliga beror på vilken typ av exponentiell "
"utjämning du väljer. Välj typ på sidan <quote><guilabel>Indata "
"</guilabel></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Common Options of the Exponential Smoothing Tool"
msgstr "Gemensamma alternativ för verktyget för exponentiell utjämning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Specify the cells containing the datasets in the <quote><guilabel>Input "
"Range</guilabel></quote> entry. The entered range or ranges are grouped into"
" datasets either by rows or by columns."
msgstr ""
"Ange cellerna med datamängderna i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>Indataområde</guilabel></quote>. Området eller områdena "
"delas in i datamängder efter rader eller kolumner."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If you select the <quote><guilabel>Include chart</guilabel></quote> option, "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> will also create a chart showing both "
"the data and corresponding smoothed values."
msgstr ""
"Om du väljer <quote><guilabel>Inkludera diagram</guilabel></quote> skapar "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> även ett diagram som visar både data och"
" motsvarande utjämnade värden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Exponential Smoothing According to Hunter"
msgstr "Exponentiell utjämning enligt Hunter"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Each value in the smoothed set is predicted based on the forecast for the "
"prior period. The formula is given in <xref linkend=\"exp-smoothing-tool-"
"formula-hunter\"/>. α is the value given as <quote><guilabel>Damping "
"factor</guilabel></quote>. <parameter>y<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> "
"is the <parameter>t</parameter>th value in the original data set and "
"<parameter>l<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> the corresponding smoothed "
"value."
msgstr ""
"Varje värde i den utjämnade serien beräknas utifrån prognosen för föregående"
" period. Formeln finns i <xref linkend=\"exp-smoothing-tool-formula-"
"hunter\"/>. α är värdet i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>Dämpningsfaktor</guilabel></quote>. "
"<parameter>y<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> är värdet på plats "
"<parameter>t</parameter> i den ursprungliga serien, och "
"<parameter>l<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> är motsvarande utjämnade "
"värde."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Exponential Smoothing Formula According To Hunter"
msgstr "Formel för exponentiell utjämning enligt Hunter"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-exp-smoothing-"
"hunter-formula.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>The formula used in exponential smoothing according to "
"Hunter.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-exp-smoothing-"
"hunter-formula.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>Formeln för exponentiell utjämning enligt Hunter.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"For example, a value for α between 0.2 and 0.3 represents 20 to 30 percent "
"error adjustment in the prior forecast."
msgstr ""
"Ett värde på α mellan 0,2 och 0,3 innebär till exempel att föregående "
"prognosfel korrigeras med 20–30 procent."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If you choose to have the tool enter formulæ rather than values into the "
"output region, then you can modify the damping factor α even after you "
"executed the tool."
msgstr ""
"Om du väljer att verktyget ska skriva in formler i stället för värden i "
"utdataområdet kan du ändra dämpningsfaktorn α även efter att verktyget har "
"körts."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"To have the standard errors output as well, check the "
"<quote><guilabel>Standard error</guilabel></quote> check box. The formula "
"used is given in <xref linkend=\"exp-smoothing-tool-formula-hunter-"
"stderr\"/>. The denominator can be adjusted by selecting the appropriate "
"radio button. Since there are <parameter>t−1</parameter> terms in the sum of"
" the denominator, selecting <quote><guilabel>n−1</guilabel></quote> means "
"that the denominator will be <parameter>t−2</parameter>."
msgstr ""
"Markera kryssrutan <quote><guilabel>Standardfel</guilabel></quote> om "
"standardfelen också ska visas. Formeln finns i <xref linkend=\"exp-"
"smoothing-tool-formula-hunter-stderr\"/>. Du kan ändra nämnaren med "
"motsvarande alternativknapp. Eftersom summan i nämnaren innehåller "
"<parameter>t−1</parameter> termer innebär valet "
"<quote><guilabel>n−1</guilabel></quote> att nämnaren blir "
"<parameter>t−2</parameter>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The Standard Error Formula For Exponential Smoothing According To Hunter"
msgstr "Formel för standardfel vid exponentiell utjämning enligt Hunter"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-exp-smoothing-"
"hunter-stderr.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>The"
" formula used to calculate the standard error of exponential smoothing "
"according to Hunter </phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-exp-smoothing-"
"hunter-stderr.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>Formeln för att beräkna standardfelet vid exponentiell utjämning "
"enligt Hunter</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If you check the <quote><guilabel>Include chart</guilabel></quote> check "
"box, a line graph showing the observations "
"<parameter>y<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> and the predicted values "
"<parameter>l<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> will also be created."
msgstr ""
"Om du markerar kryssrutan <quote><guilabel>Inkludera "
"diagram</guilabel></quote> skapas även ett linjediagram som visar "
"observationerna <parameter>y<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> och de "
"prognostiserade värdena <parameter>l<subscript>t</subscript></parameter>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Using the Exponential Smoothing Tool"
msgstr "Använda verktyget för exponentiell utjämning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"smoothing-example-1\"/> shows some example data, <xref "
"linkend=\"smoothing-example-2\"/> the selected options and <xref "
"linkend=\"smoothing-example-3\"/> the corresponding output."
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"smoothing-example-1\"/> visar exempeldata, <xref "
"linkend=\"smoothing-example-2\"/> de valda alternativen och <xref "
"linkend=\"smoothing-example-3\"/> motsvarande utdata."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Some Example Data for the Exponential Smoothing Tool"
msgstr "Exempeldata för verktyget för exponentiell utjämning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-smoothing-ex1.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of example "
"data for exponential smoothing.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-smoothing-ex1.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Exempeldata för "
"exponentiell utjämning.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The Options for the Exponential Smoothing Tool"
msgstr "Alternativ för verktyget för exponentiell utjämning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-smoothing-ex3.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the "
"options tab of the exponential smoothing tool.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-smoothing-ex3.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Fliken med alternativ "
"för verktyget för exponentiell utjämning.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Exponential Smoothing Tool Output (Hunter)"
msgstr "Utdata från verktyget för exponentiell utjämning (Hunter)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-smoothing-ex2.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the output"
" of an exponential smoothing analysis according to Hunter.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-smoothing-ex2.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Utdata från en analys "
"med exponentiell utjämning enligt Hunter.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Exponential Smoothing According to Roberts"
msgstr "Exponentiell utjämning enligt Roberts"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The simple exponential smoothing method according to Roberts is used for "
"forecasting a time series without a trend or seasonal pattern, but for which"
" the level is nevertheless slowly changing over time. The predicted values "
"are calculated according to the formula given in <xref linkend=\"exp-"
"smoothing-tool-formula-roberts\"/>. α is the value given as "
"<quote><guilabel>Damping factor</guilabel></quote>. "
"<parameter>y<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> is the "
"<parameter>t</parameter>th value in the original data set and "
"<parameter>l<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> the predicted value. "
"<parameter>l<subscript>0</subscript></parameter> is the predicted value at "
"time 0 and must be estimated. This tool uses the average value of the first "
"5 observations as estimate."
msgstr ""
"Roberts metod för enkel exponentiell utjämning används för att prognostisera"
" tidsserier utan trend eller säsongsmönster, men där nivån ändå förändras "
"långsamt över tid. De prognostiserade värdena beräknas enligt formeln i "
"<xref linkend=\"exp-smoothing-tool-formula-roberts\"/>. α är värdet i fältet"
" <quote><guilabel>Dämpningsfaktor</guilabel></quote>. "
"<parameter>y<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> är värdet på plats "
"<parameter>t</parameter> i den ursprungliga serien, och "
"<parameter>l<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> är det prognostiserade "
"värdet. <parameter>l<subscript>0</subscript></parameter> är det "
"prognostiserade värdet vid tidpunkt 0 och måste uppskattas. Verktyget "
"använder medelvärdet av de första 5 observationerna som uppskattning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If you choose to have the tool enter formulæ rather than values into the "
"output region, then you can modify the damping factor α and the estimated "
"value at time 0 after executing the tool."
msgstr ""
"Om du väljer att verktyget ska skriva in formler i stället för värden i "
"utdataområdet kan du ändra dämpningsfaktorn α och det uppskattade värdet vid"
" tidpunkt 0 även efter att verktyget har körts."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Exponential Smoothing Formula According To Roberts"
msgstr "Formel för exponentiell utjämning enligt Roberts"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-exp-smoothing-"
"roberts-formula.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>The formula used in exponential smoothing according to "
"Roberts.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-exp-smoothing-"
"roberts-formula.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>Formeln för exponentiell utjämning enligt Roberts.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"To have the standard errors output as well, check the "
"<quote><guilabel>Standard error</guilabel></quote> check box. The formula "
"used is given in <xref linkend=\"exp-smoothing-tool-formula-roberts-"
"stderr\"/>. The denominator can be adjusted by selecting the appropriate "
"radio button."
msgstr ""
"Markera kryssrutan <quote><guilabel>Standardfel</guilabel></quote> om "
"standardfelen också ska visas. Formeln finns i <xref linkend=\"exp-"
"smoothing-tool-formula-roberts-stderr\"/>. Du kan ändra nämnaren med "
"motsvarande alternativknapp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The Standard Error Formula For Exponential Smoothing According To Roberts"
msgstr "Formel för standardfel vid exponentiell utjämning enligt Roberts"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-exp-smoothing-"
"roberts-stderr.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>The formula used to calculate the standard error of exponential "
"smoothing according to Roberts </phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-exp-smoothing-"
"roberts-stderr.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>Formeln för att beräkna standardfelet vid exponentiell utjämning "
"enligt Roberts</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"smoothing-example-4\"/> shows example output for the "
"exponential smoothing tool using the formula according to Roberts. Cell A4 "
"contains the estimated level at time 0. If you requested to have formulæ "
"rather than values entered into the sheet, then changing the estimate in A4 "
"and/or the value for α in A2 will result in an immediate change to the "
"predicted values."
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"smoothing-example-4\"/> visar exempel på utdata från "
"verktyget för exponentiell utjämning med Roberts formel. Cell A4 innehåller "
"den uppskattade nivån vid tidpunkt 0. Om du valde att verktyget skulle "
"skriva in formler i stället för värden i bladet ändras prognosvärdena direkt"
" när du ändrar uppskattningen i A4 och/eller värdet på α i A2."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Exponential Smoothing Tool Output (Roberts)"
msgstr "Utdata från verktyget för exponentiell utjämning (Roberts)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-smoothing-ex4.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the output"
" of an exponential smoothing analysis according to Roberts.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-smoothing-ex4.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Utdata från en analys "
"med exponentiell utjämning enligt Roberts.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Holt's Trend Corrected Exponential Smoothing"
msgstr "Holts trendkorrigerade exponentiella utjämning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Holt's trend corrected exponential smoothing is appropriate when both the "
"level and the growth rate of a time series are changing. (If the time series"
" has a fixed growth rate and therefore exhibits a linear trend, a linear "
"regression model is more appropriate.)"
msgstr ""
"Holts trendkorrigerade exponentiella utjämning passar när både nivån och "
"tillväxttakten i en tidsserie förändras. (Om tidsserien har en fast "
"tillväxttakt och därmed en linjär trend passar en linjär regressionsmodell "
"bättre.)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<parameter>y<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> is the true value at time "
"<parameter>t</parameter>, <parameter>l<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> "
"is the estimated level at time <parameter>t</parameter> and "
"<parameter>b<subscript>t </subscript></parameter> is the estimated growth "
"rate at time <parameter>t</parameter>. We use the two smoothing equations "
"given in <xref linkend=\"exp-smoothing-tool-formula-holt\"/> to update our "
"estimates. α is the value given as <quote><guilabel>Damping "
"factor</guilabel></quote> and γ is the value given as "
"<quote><guilabel>Growth damping factor</guilabel></quote>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>y<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> är det verkliga värdet vid "
"tidpunkt <parameter>t</parameter>, "
"<parameter>l<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> är den uppskattade nivån "
"vid tidpunkt <parameter>t</parameter> och <parameter>b<subscript>t "
"</subscript></parameter> är den uppskattade tillväxttakten vid tidpunkt "
"<parameter>t</parameter>. Uppskattningarna uppdateras med de två "
"utjämningsekvationerna i <xref linkend=\"exp-smoothing-tool-formula-"
"holt\"/>. α är värdet i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>Dämpningsfaktor</guilabel></quote> och γ värdet i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>Tillväxtdämpningsfaktor</guilabel></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"This tool obtains initial (time 0) estimates for the level and growth rate "
"by performing a linear regression using the first 5 data values."
msgstr ""
"Verktyget uppskattar den ursprungliga nivån och tillväxttakten (vid tidpunkt"
" 0) genom linjär regression på de första 5 datavärdena."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Formulae Of Holt's Trend Corrected Exponential Smoothing"
msgstr "Formler för Holts trendkorrigerade exponentiella utjämning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-exp-smoothing-holt-"
"formula.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>The "
"formulae used in Holt's trend corrected exponential smoothing.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-exp-smoothing-holt-"
"formula.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Formlerna"
" för Holts trendkorrigerade exponentiella utjämning.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If you choose to have the tool enter formulæ rather than values into the "
"output region, then you can modify the damping factors α and γ as well as "
"the estimated level and growth rate at time 0 after executing the tool."
msgstr ""
"Om du väljer att verktyget ska skriva in formler i stället för värden i "
"utdataområdet kan du ändra dämpningsfaktorerna α och γ samt den uppskattade "
"nivån och tillväxttakten vid tidpunkt 0 även efter att verktyget har körts."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"To have the standard errors output as well, check the "
"<quote><guilabel>Standard error</guilabel></quote> check box. The formula "
"used is given in <xref linkend=\"exp-smoothing-tool-formula-holt-stderr\"/>."
" The denominator can be adjusted by selecting the appropriate radio button."
msgstr ""
"Markera kryssrutan <quote><guilabel>Standardfel</guilabel></quote> om "
"standardfelen också ska visas. Formeln finns i <xref linkend=\"exp-"
"smoothing-tool-formula-holt-stderr\"/>. Du kan ändra nämnaren med "
"motsvarande alternativknapp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The Standard Error Formula For Holt's Trend Corrected Exponential Smoothing"
msgstr ""
"Formel för standardfel vid Holts trendkorrigerade exponentiella utjämning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-exp-smoothing-holt-"
"stderr.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>The "
"formula used to calculate the standard error for Holt's trend corrected "
"exponential smoothing. </phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-exp-smoothing-holt-"
"stderr.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Formeln "
"för att beräkna standardfelet vid Holts trendkorrigerade exponentiella "
"utjämning.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If you check the <quote><guilabel>Include chart</guilabel></quote> check "
"box, a line graph showing the observations "
"<parameter>y<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> and the estimated level "
"values <parameter>l<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> will also be "
"created."
msgstr ""
"Om du markerar kryssrutan <quote><guilabel>Inkludera "
"diagram</guilabel></quote> skapas även ett linjediagram som visar "
"observationerna <parameter>y<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> och de "
"uppskattade nivåerna <parameter>l<subscript>t</subscript></parameter>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"smoothing-example-5\"/> shows example output for Holt's "
"trend corrected exponential smoothing. Cell A4 contains the estimated level "
"at time 0 and B4 the estimated growth rate at time 0. If you requested to "
"have formulæ rather than values entered into the sheet, then changing the "
"estimates in A4, B4, the values for α in A2 and/or for γ in B2 will result "
"in an immediate change to the predicted values."
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"smoothing-example-5\"/> visar exempelresultat för Holts "
"trendkorrigerade exponentiella utjämning. Cell A4 innehåller den uppskattade"
" nivån vid tidpunkt 0 och B4 den uppskattade tillväxttakten vid tidpunkt 0. "
"Om du valde att formler skulle skrivas in i stället för värden ändras "
"prognosvärdena direkt när du ändrar uppskattningarna i A4 eller B4, värdet "
"på α i A2 eller värdet på γ i B2."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Exponential Smoothing Tool Output (Holt's)"
msgstr "Utdata från verktyget för exponentiell utjämning (Holt)"

