#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Moving Average Tool"
msgstr "Verktyg för glidande medelvärde"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Moving Average Tool Dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutan för glidande medelvärde"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-moving-"
"average.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image "
"of the dialog for the moving average analysis tool.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-moving-"
"average.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>Dialogrutan för analysverktyget Glidande medelvärde.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Use the moving average tool to calculate moving averages of one or more data"
" sets. A moving average provides useful trend information of the data that "
"is lost in a simple average. In addition, moving averages can be used to "
"eliminate random variance. For example, use this tool to create a smoother "
"curve of a stock prize."
msgstr ""
"Använd verktyget för glidande medelvärde för att beräkna glidande "
"medelvärden för en eller flera datamängder. Ett glidande medelvärde visar "
"trendinformation som ett vanligt medelvärde döljer. Det kan också användas "
"för att jämna ut slumpmässig variation, till exempel för att få en jämnare "
"kurva över en aktiekurs."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Choose the type of moving average you would like to calculate. The tool can "
"determine 4 types of moving averages:"
msgstr ""
"Välj vilken typ av glidande medelvärde du vill beräkna. Verktyget kan "
"beräkna fyra typer:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Spencer's 15 point moving average"
msgstr "Spencers 15-punkters glidande medelvärde"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Moving Average Tool Dialog: The <quote><guilabel>Options</guilabel></quote> "
"Tab"
msgstr ""
"Dialogrutan för glidande medelvärde: fliken "
"<quote><guilabel>Alternativ</guilabel></quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-moving-average-"
"options.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image "
"of the <quote><guilabel>Options</guilabel></quote> tab of the moving average"
" analysis tool.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-moving-average-"
"options.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Fliken "
"<quote><guilabel>Alternativ</guilabel></quote> i analysverktyget Glidande "
"medelvärde.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Specify the <quote><guilabel>Interval</guilabel></quote> for the moving "
"average. The interval <parameter>i</parameter> is the number of consecutive "
"values to be included in each moving average. This options is only available"
" for the simple and weighted moving averages."
msgstr ""
"Ange <quote><guilabel>Intervall</guilabel></quote> för det glidande "
"medelvärdet. Intervallet <parameter>i</parameter> anger hur många värden i "
"följd som ska ingå i varje medelvärde. Alternativet är bara tillgängligt för"
" enkla och viktade glidande medelvärden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Check the <quote><guilabel>Standard errors</guilabel></quote> checkbox if "
"you would also like the standard error to be calculated. Since there is no "
"general agreement on the denominator for the standard error you can choose "
"the appropriate radio button."
msgstr ""
"Markera <quote><guilabel>Standardfel</guilabel></quote> om standardfelet "
"också ska beräknas. Eftersom det inte finns någon allmänt vedertagen nämnare"
" för standardfelet kan du välja en med motsvarande alternativknapp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"In the case of the simple moving average, you can also choose between a "
"prior moving average and a central moving average, or you may even specify "
"any other desired offset."
msgstr ""
"För ett enkelt glidande medelvärde kan du även välja mellan ett tidigare och"
" ett centralt glidande medelvärde, eller ange en annan förskjutning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<quote><guilabel>Prior moving average</guilabel></quote>: Each average takes"
" into account the current observation and the most recent prior observations"
" for a total of <parameter>i</parameter> observations."
msgstr ""
"<quote><guilabel>Tidigare glidande medelvärde</guilabel></quote>: Varje "
"medelvärde omfattar den aktuella observationen och de närmast föregående "
"observationerna, sammanlagt <parameter>i</parameter> observationer."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<quote><guilabel>Central moving average</guilabel></quote> with "
"<parameter>i</parameter> being odd: Each average takes into account the "
"current observation and the same number of most recent prior observations "
"and closest future observations for a total of <parameter>i</parameter> "
"observations."
msgstr ""
"<quote><guilabel>Centralt glidande medelvärde</guilabel></quote> när "
"<parameter>i</parameter> är udda: Varje medelvärde omfattar den aktuella "
"observationen, lika många av de närmast föregående observationerna och de "
"närmast följande observationerna, sammanlagt <parameter>i</parameter> "
"observationer."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<quote><guilabel>Central moving average</guilabel></quote> with "
"<parameter>i</parameter> being even: This is calculated according to the "
"formula given in <xref linkend=\"moving-formula-central\"/>. "
"<parameter>a<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> is the moving average at "
"time <parameter>t</parameter> and "
"<parameter>y<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> is the observation at time "
"<parameter>t</parameter>."
msgstr ""
"<quote><guilabel>Centralt glidande medelvärde</guilabel></quote> när "
"<parameter>i</parameter> är jämnt: Beräkningen följer formeln i <xref "
"linkend=\"moving-formula-central\"/>. "
"<parameter>a<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> är det glidande medelvärdet"
" vid tidpunkt <parameter>t</parameter> och "
"<parameter>y<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> observationen vid tidpunkt "
"<parameter>t</parameter>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<quote><guilabel>Other offset</guilabel></quote>: If the offset is 0, this "
"is just the prior moving average. Otherwise the offset indicates the number "
"of closest future observations to include in the average. Correspondingly, "
"the number of most recent past observations is decreased."
msgstr ""
"<quote><guilabel>Annan förskjutning</guilabel></quote>: Vid förskjutningen 0"
" blir resultatet samma som för ett tidigare glidande medelvärde. Annars "
"anger förskjutningen hur många av de närmast följande observationerna som "
"ska ingå. Antalet närmast föregående observationer minskas i motsvarande "
"grad."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Formula For The Central Moving Average With Even Interval"
msgstr "Formel för centralt glidande medelvärde med jämnt intervall"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-moving-average-"
"formula-central.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>The formula for the central moving average if the interval length is"
" even.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-moving-average-"
"formula-central.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>Formeln för centralt glidande medelvärde när intervallängden är "
"jämn.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The results are given in one column for each dataset (with a second column "
"added if you have chosen standard errors to be calculated). Each row "
"represents the moving average of the corresponding row or column in the "
"input range. Depending on the type of average and the offset, the moving "
"average cannot be calculated for the first rows in the input range."
msgstr ""
"Resultatet visas i en kolumn per datamängd. Om du har valt att beräkna "
"standardfel läggs en andra kolumn till. Varje rad visar det glidande "
"medelvärdet för motsvarande rad eller kolumn i indataområdet. Beroende på "
"medelvärdestyp och förskjutning kan det glidande medelvärdet inte beräknas "
"för de första raderna i indataområdet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Simple Moving Average"
msgstr "Enkelt glidande medelvärde"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"A simple moving average is the unweighted average of a collection of "
"observations. Exactly which observations are included depends on whether a "
"prior or central moving average is calculated."
msgstr ""
"Ett enkelt glidande medelvärde är ett oviktat medelvärde av flera "
"observationer. Vilka observationer som ingår beror på om ett tidigare eller "
"centralt glidande medelvärde beräknas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Cumulative Moving Average"
msgstr "Kumulativt glidande medelvärde"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"A cumulative moving average is a prior moving average in which the current "
"and all prior observations are included."
msgstr ""
"Ett kumulativt glidande medelvärde är ett tidigare glidande medelvärde där "
"den aktuella observationen och alla föregående observationer ingår."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Weighted Moving Average"
msgstr "Viktat glidande medelvärde"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"A weighted moving average with an interval <parameter>i</parameter> is a "
"prior moving average calculated according to formula <xref linkend=\"moving-"
"formula-central\"/>. <parameter>a<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> is the"
" moving average at time <parameter>t</parameter> and "
"<parameter>y<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> is the observation at time "
"<parameter>t</parameter>."
msgstr ""
"Ett viktat glidande medelvärde med intervallet <parameter>i</parameter> är "
"ett tidigare glidande medelvärde som beräknas enligt formeln <xref "
"linkend=\"moving-formula-central\"/>. "
"<parameter>a<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> är det glidande medelvärdet"
" vid tidpunkt <parameter>t</parameter> och "
"<parameter>y<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> observationen vid tidpunkt "
"<parameter>t</parameter>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Formula For The Weighted Moving Average With Interval "
"<parameter>i</parameter>"
msgstr ""
"Formel för viktat glidande medelvärde med intervallet "
"<parameter>i</parameter>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-moving-average-"
"formula-weighted.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>The formula for the weighted moving average if the interval length "
"is <parameter>i</parameter>.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-moving-average-"
"formula-weighted.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>Formeln för viktat glidande medelvärde med intervallängden "
"<parameter>i</parameter>.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Spencer's 15 Point Moving Average"
msgstr "Spencers 15-punkts glidande medelvärde"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Spencer's 15 point moving average is a central moving average calculated "
"according to formula <xref linkend=\"moving-formula-spencer\"/>. "
"<parameter>a<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> is the moving average at "
"time <parameter>t</parameter> and "
"<parameter>y<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> is the observation at time "
"<parameter>t</parameter>."
msgstr ""
"Spencers 15-punkters glidande medelvärde är ett centralt glidande medelvärde"
" som beräknas enligt formeln <xref linkend=\"moving-formula-spencer\"/>. "
"<parameter>a<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> är det glidande medelvärdet"
" vid tidpunkt <parameter>t</parameter> och "
"<parameter>y<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> är observationen vid "
"tidpunkt <parameter>t</parameter>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Formula For Spencer's 15 Point Moving Average"
msgstr "Formel för Spencers 15-punkters glidande medelvärde"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-moving-average-"
"formula-spencer.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>The formula for the Spencer's 15 point moving average.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-moving-average-"
"formula-spencer.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>Formeln för Spencers 15-punkters glidande medelvärde.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "A Moving Average Example"
msgstr "Exempel på glidande medelvärde"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Some Example Data for the Moving Average Tool"
msgstr "Exempeldata för verktyget Glidande medelvärde"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-moving-average-"
"ex1.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of "
"some example data for use with the moving average analysis tool.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-moving-average-"
"ex1.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Exempeldata "
"för analysverktyget Glidande medelvärde.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Using the Moving Average Tool"
msgstr "Använda verktyget för glidande medelvärde"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"moving-example-1\"/> shows some example data, <xref "
"linkend=\"moving-example-2\"/> shows the option settings, and <xref "
"linkend=\"moving-example-3\"/> the corresponding output."
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"moving-example-1\"/> visar exempeldata, <xref "
"linkend=\"moving-example-2\"/> visar de valda alternativen och <xref "
"linkend=\"moving-example-3\"/> motsvarande utdata."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Moving Averages Tool Options"
msgstr "Alternativ för verktyget Glidande medelvärde"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-moving-average-"
"ex2.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of "
"the option settings of the moving averages example.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-moving-average-"
"ex2.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Valda "
"alternativ i exemplet med glidande medelvärde.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Moving Averages Tool Output"
msgstr "Utdata från verktyget Glidande medelvärde"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-moving-average-"
"ex3.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of "
"the output from the moving average analysis tool.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-moving-average-"
"ex3.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Utdata från "
"analysverktyget Glidande medelvärde.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Fourier Analysis Tool"
msgstr "Verktyg för Fourieranalys"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Fourier Analysis Tool Dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutan för Fourieranalys"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-fourier.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the fourier"
" analysis dialog.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-fourier.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Dialogrutan för "
"Fourieranalys.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The Fourier Analysis tool normally performs a Fast Fourier Transform to "
"obtain the discrete fourier transform F<subscript>s</subscript> of the given"
" sequence f<subscript>t</subscript> of real numbers according to the formula"
" given in <xref linkend=\"fourier-tool-formula\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Verktyget Fourieranalys utför normalt en snabb Fouriertransform för att "
"beräkna den diskreta Fouriertransformen F<subscript>s</subscript> av den "
"givna följden f<subscript>t</subscript> av reella tal enligt formeln i <xref"
" linkend=\"fourier-tool-formula\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Select the <quote><guilabel>Inverse</guilabel></quote> option to calculate "
"the inverse discrete fourier transform f<subscript>t</subscript> of the "
"given sequence F<subscript>s</subscript> of real numbers"
msgstr ""
"Välj <quote><guilabel>Invers</guilabel></quote> om du vill beräkna den "
"inversa diskreta Fouriertransformen f<subscript>t</subscript> av den givna "
"följden F<subscript>s</subscript> av reella tal"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If the number of terms in the given sequence is not a power of 2 (i.e. 2, 4,"
" 8, 16, 32, 64, 128, etc.), this tool will append zeros to reach such a "
"power of 2!"
msgstr ""
"Om antalet termer i följden inte är en tvåpotens (det vill säga 2, 4, 8, 16,"
" 32, 64, 128 och så vidare) lägger verktyget till nollor tills antalet blir "
"en sådan tvåpotens!"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Specify the cells containing the datasets in the <quote><guilabel>Input "
"Range</guilabel></quote> entry. The entered range or ranges are grouped into"
" sequences either by rows or by columns."
msgstr ""
"Ange cellerna med datamängderna i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>Indataområde</guilabel></quote>. Området eller områdena "
"delas in i följder efter rader eller kolumner."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Fourier Analysis Formulae"
msgstr "Formler för Fourieranalys"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-fourier-"
"formula.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>The "
"formulae used in a fourier analysis.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-fourier-"
"formula.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Formlerna"
" för Fourieranalys.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Before using the numbers obtained by this tool, ensure that these are in "
"fact the correct formulae for your discipline. In the physical sciences this"
" fourier transform tends to be called the inverse fourier transform and vice"
" versa. Moreover, frequently the scaling factor varies."
msgstr ""
"Kontrollera att formlerna passar ditt ämnesområde innan du använder "
"resultaten från verktyget. Inom fysik kallas den här Fouriertransformen ofta"
" för invers Fouriertransform, och tvärtom. Även skalningsfaktorn varierar "
"ofta."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"For example <application>Mathematica</application> uses the terms fourier "
"transform and inverse fourier transform with the reversed meaning than "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> and it uses a scaling factor of "
"<parameter>1/SQRT(N)</parameter> rather than <parameter>1/N</parameter>."
msgstr ""
"<application>Mathematica</application> använder till exempel termerna "
"Fouriertransform och invers Fouriertransform med omvänd betydelse jämfört "
"med <application>Gnumeric</application>. Programmet använder också "
"skalningsfaktorn <parameter>1/SQRT(N)</parameter> i stället för "
"<parameter>1/N</parameter>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Kaplan Meier Estimates Tool"
msgstr "Verktyget Kaplan-Meier-estimat"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The <quote><guilabel>Input</guilabel></quote> tab shown in <xref "
"linkend=\"kaplan-meier-tool-dialog\"/> contains the fields specifying the "
"data to be used for the Kaplan Meier Estimates. The time column contains the"
" times or dates at which the subjects died or were censored. If any of the "
"subjects were censored, the <guilabel>Permit censorship</guilabel> checkbox "
"is checked and the Censor column contained the censorship marks. Censorship "
"marks are typically 0s or 1s. The range of censor marks or labels can be set"
" using the remaining two spinboxes."
msgstr ""
"Fliken <quote><guilabel>Indata</guilabel></quote> i <xref linkend=\"kaplan-"
"meier-tool-dialog\"/> innehåller fälten där du anger data för Kaplan-Meier-"
"estimaten. Tidskolumnen innehåller tidpunkterna eller datumen då individerna"
" avled eller censurerades. Om någon individ censurerades är kryssrutan "
"<guilabel>Tillåt censur</guilabel> markerad och censurmarkeringarna finns i "
"censurkolumnen. Censurmarkeringar är vanligtvis 0 eller 1. Intervallet för "
"censurmarkeringar eller etiketter ställs in med de två återstående "
"snurrknapparna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Kaplan-Meier Tool Dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutan för Kaplan-Meier-verktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-kaplan.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the "
".Kaplan-Meier tool dialog.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-kaplan.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Dialogrutan för Kaplan-"
"Meier-verktyget.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The <quote><guilabel>Groups</guilabel></quote> Tab"
msgstr "Fliken <quote><guilabel>Grupper</guilabel></quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If the subjects belong to several groups and the groups are supposed to be "
"analyzed separately, the groups tab can be used."
msgstr ""
"Om individerna tillhör flera grupper som ska analyseras var för sig kan du "
"använda fliken Grupper."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Kaplan-Meier Tool Dialog Groups Tab"
msgstr "Fliken Grupper i dialogrutan för Kaplan-Meier-verktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-kaplan-groups.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the "
"Kaplan-Meier tool dialog groups tab.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-kaplan-groups.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Fliken Grupper i "
"dialogrutan för Kaplan-Meier-verktyget.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The groups tab can be enabled via the <guilabel>Define multiple groups "
"</guilabel> checkbox. The groups column entry contains the address of the "
"column specifying the group membership. Groups can then be defined or "
"deleted via the <guilabel>Add</guilabel> and <guilabel>Remove </guilabel> "
"buttons."
msgstr ""
"Du aktiverar fliken Grupper genom att markera <guilabel>Definiera multipla "
"grupper </guilabel>. Fältet för gruppkolumn innehåller adressen till "
"kolumnen som anger grupptillhörighet. Sedan kan du definiera eller ta bort "
"grupper med knapparna <guilabel>Lägg till</guilabel> och <guilabel>Ta bort "
"</guilabel>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The <quote><guilabel>Options</guilabel></quote> Tab"
msgstr "Fliken <quote><guilabel>Alternativ</guilabel></quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The options tab of the Kaplan-Meier tools dialog is used to set various "
"options of the Kaplan-Meier tool."
msgstr ""
"På fliken Alternativ i Kaplan-Meier-verktygets dialogruta ställer du in "
"olika alternativ för verktyget."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Kaplan-Meier Tool Dialog Options Tab"
msgstr "Fliken Alternativ i dialogrutan för Kaplan-Meier-verktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-kaplan-"
"options.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image "
"of the Kaplan-Meier tool dialog options tab.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-kaplan-"
"options.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Fliken "
"Alternativ i dialogrutan för Kaplan-Meier-verktyget.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "A Kaplan-Meier Example"
msgstr "Exempel på Kaplan-Meier-estimat"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Kaplan-Meier Tool Example Input"
msgstr "Indata i Kaplan-Meier-exemplet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-kaplan-ex1.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the input "
"to the Kaplan-Meier estimate example and of the input tab of the Kaplan-"
"Meier analysis tool.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-kaplan-ex1.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Indata till exemplet "
"med Kaplan-Meier-estimat och fliken Indata i Kaplan-Meier-"
"verktyget.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Using the Kaplan-Meier Tool"
msgstr "Använda Kaplan-Meier-verktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Suppose you want to calculate Kaplan-Meier Estimates for the as given in "
"<xref linkend=\"kaplan-meier-tool-example-1\"/>. Each row contains the data "
"for one subject. Column A contains the survival time, i.e. the time until "
"death or censure. Column B contains the group number, we are considering two"
" groups of subjects. Column C indicates whether the subject died (0) or was "
"censured (1)."
msgstr ""
"Anta att du vill beräkna Kaplan-Meier-estimat för data i <xref "
"linkend=\"kaplan-meier-tool-example-1\"/>. Varje rad innehåller data för en "
"individ. Kolumn A innehåller överlevnadstiden, det vill säga tiden fram till"
" dödsfall eller censurering. Kolumn B innehåller gruppnumret; här behandlas "
"två grupper. Kolumn C anger om individen avled (0) eller censurerades (1)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"We complete the fields of the <guilabel>Input</guilabel> tab as shown in "
"<xref linkend=\"kaplan-meier-tool-example-1\"/>. The time column is A2:A21 "
"and the censure column is C2:C21."
msgstr ""
"Fyll i fälten på fliken <guilabel>Indata</guilabel> enligt <xref "
"linkend=\"kaplan-meier-tool-example-1\"/>. Tidskolumnen är A2:A21 och "
"censurkolumnen C2:C21."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Kaplan-Meier Tool Example Group Tab"
msgstr "Fliken Grupper i Kaplan-Meier-exemplet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-kaplan-ex3.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the group "
"tab of the Kaplan-Meier analysis tool.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-kaplan-ex3.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Fliken Grupper i "
"Kaplan-Meier-analysverktyget.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Since we have two groups of subjects, on the <guilabel>Groups</guilabel> tab"
" we check the <guilabel>Define multiple groups</guilabel> check box and set "
"up two groups with identifiers 1 and 2 in column B2:B21: <_:figure-1/>"
msgstr ""
"Eftersom individerna tillhör två grupper markerar vi <guilabel>Definiera "
"multipla grupper</guilabel> på fliken <guilabel>Grupper</guilabel> och "
"skapar två grupper med identifierarna 1 och 2 i kolumn B2:B21: <_:figure-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"On the <guilabel>Options</guilabel> tab all checkboxes are pre-checked and "
"we leave them that way to obtain a maximum amount of information."
msgstr ""
"Alla kryssrutor på fliken <guilabel>Alternativ</guilabel> är redan "
"markerade. Vi låter dem vara markerade för att få så mycket information som "
"möjligt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"On the output tab we choose where we would like the output to be placed. For"
" the purposes of this example we retain the <guilabel>New Sheet</guilabel> "
"target. After clicking <guilabel>OK</guilabel> we get the output shown in "
"<xref linkend=\"kaplan-meier-tool-example-2\"/>. Note that the graph "
"initially always appears on top of the numerical result and was moved for "
"the screen shot."
msgstr ""
"På fliken Utdata väljer vi var resultatet ska placeras. I det här exemplet "
"behåller vi målet <guilabel>Nytt blad</guilabel>. När vi klickar på "
"<guilabel>OK</guilabel> visas resultatet i <xref linkend=\"kaplan-meier-"
"tool-example-2\"/>. Diagrammet placeras först ovanpå sifferresultatet; i "
"skärmbilden har det flyttats."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"B1:F17 shows the results of the first group, G1 to K17 the results of the "
"second group. The graph shows the Kaplan-Meier survival curves for both "
"groups."
msgstr ""
"B1:F17 visar resultaten för den första gruppen och G1:K17 resultaten för den"
" andra. Diagrammet visar Kaplan-Meier-kurvorna för överlevnad i båda "
"grupperna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"M4:N7 shows the result of the Mantel-Haenszel Log-Rank Test. In this case "
"the p-value is larger than 0.3 and we would fail to reject the Null "
"hypothesis. There is no evidence that the survival times differ."
msgstr ""
