#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>ODDLYIELD</function>(<parameter>settlement</parameter>,<parameter>maturity</parameter>,<parameter>last_interest</parameter>,<parameter>rate</parameter>,<parameter>price</parameter>,<parameter>redemption</parameter>,<parameter>frequency</parameter>,<parameter>basis</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"<function>ODDLYIELD</function>(<parameter>avräkning</parameter>;<parameter>förfallodatum</parameter>;<parameter>sista_ränta</parameter>;<parameter>ränta</parameter>;<parameter>pris</parameter>;<parameter>inlösen</parameter>;<parameter>frekvens</parameter>;<parameter>bas</parameter>)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<parameter>spot1</parameter>: spot price of the underlying asset of the "
"first option"
msgstr ""
"<parameter>spotpris1</parameter>: spotpris för den underliggande tillgången "
"för den första optionen"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<parameter>spot2</parameter>: spot price of the underlying asset of the "
"second option"
msgstr ""
"<parameter>spotpris2</parameter>: spotpriset för den underliggande "
"tillgången för den andra optionen"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "<parameter>strike1</parameter>: strike prices of the first option"
msgstr ""
"<parameter>lösenpris1</parameter>: lösenpriserna för den första optionen"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "<parameter>strike2</parameter>: strike prices of the second option"
msgstr ""
"<parameter>lösenpris2</parameter>: lösenpriserna för den andra optionen"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<parameter>cost_of_carry1</parameter>: net cost of holding the underlying "
"asset of the first option (for common stocks, the risk free rate less the "
"dividend yield)"
msgstr ""
"<parameter>innehavskostnad1</parameter>: nettokostnaden för att hålla den "
"underliggande tillgången för den första optionen (för vanliga aktier, den "
"riskfria räntan minus direktavkastningen)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<parameter>cost_of_carry2</parameter>: net cost of holding the underlying "
"asset of the second option (for common stocks, the risk free rate less the "
"dividend yield)"
msgstr ""
"<parameter>innehavskostnad2</parameter>: nettokostnaden för att hålla den "
"underliggande tillgången för den andra optionen (för vanliga aktier, den "
"riskfria räntan minus direktavkastningen)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>OPT_2_ASSET_CORRELATION</function> models the theoretical price of"
" options on 2 assets with correlation <parameter>rho</parameter>. The payoff"
" for a call is max(<parameter>spot2</parameter> - "
"<parameter>strike2</parameter>,0) if <parameter>spot1</parameter> &gt; "
"<parameter>strike1</parameter> or 0 otherwise. The payoff for a put is max "
"(<parameter>strike2</parameter> - <parameter>spot2</parameter>, 0) if "
"<parameter>spot1</parameter> &lt; <parameter>strike1</parameter> or 0 "
"otherwise."
msgstr ""
"<function>OPT_2_ASSET_CORRELATION</function> modellerar det teoretiska "
"priset på optioner med två tillgångar med korrelation "
"<parameter>rho</parameter>. Utbetalningen för ett köp är "
"max(<parameter>spotpris2</parameter> - <parameter>lösenpris2</parameter>,0) "
"om <parameter>spotpris1</parameter> &gt; <parameter>lösenpris1</parameter>, "
"annars 0. Utbetalningen för sälj är max(<parameter>lösenpris2</parameter> - "
"<parameter>spotpris2</parameter>, 0) om <parameter>spotpris1</parameter> "
"&lt; <parameter>lösenpris1</parameter>, annars 0."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>OPT_AMER_EXCHANGE</function>(<parameter>spot1</parameter>,<parameter>spot2</parameter>,<parameter>qty1</parameter>,<parameter>qty2</parameter>,<parameter>time</parameter>,<parameter>rate</parameter>,<parameter>cost_of_carry1</parameter>,<parameter>cost_of_carry2</parameter>,<parameter>volatility1</parameter>,<parameter>volatility2</parameter>,<parameter>rho</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"<function>OPT_AMER_EXCHANGE</function>(<parameter>spotpris1</parameter>;<parameter>spotpris2</parameter>;<parameter>kvnt1</parameter>;<parameter>kvnt2</parameter>;<parameter>tid</parameter>;<parameter>ränta</parameter>;<parameter>innehavskostnad1</parameter>;<parameter>innehavskostnad2</parameter>;<parameter>volatilitet1</parameter>;<parameter>volatilitet2</parameter>;<parameter>rho</parameter>)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "<parameter>spot1</parameter>: spot price of asset 1"
msgstr "<parameter>spotpris1</parameter>: spotpris för tillgång 1"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "<parameter>spot2</parameter>: spot price of asset 2"
msgstr "<parameter>spotpris2</parameter>: spotpris för tillgång 2"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<parameter>cost_of_carry1</parameter>: net cost of holding asset 1 (for "
"common stocks, the risk free rate less the dividend yield)"
msgstr ""
"<parameter>innehavskostnad1</parameter>: nettokostnaden för att hålla "
"tillgång 1 (för vanliga aktier, den riskfria räntan minus "
"direktavkastningen)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<parameter>cost_of_carry2</parameter>: net cost of holding asset 2 (for "
"common stocks, the risk free rate less the dividend yield)"
msgstr ""
"<parameter>innehavskostnad2</parameter>: nettokostnaden för att hålla "
"tillgång 2 (för vanliga aktier, den riskfria räntan minus "
"direktavkastningen)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>OPT_AMER_EXCHANGE</function> models the theoretical price of an "
"American option to exchange one asset with quantity "
"<parameter>qty2</parameter> and spot price <parameter>spot2</parameter> for "
"another with quantity <parameter>qty1</parameter> and spot price "
"<parameter>spot1</parameter>."
msgstr ""
"<function>OPT_AMER_EXCHANGE</function> modellerar det teoretiska priset på "
"en amerikansk option för att växla en tillgång med kvantitet "
"<parameter>kvnt2</parameter> och spotpris <parameter>spotpris2</parameter> "
"för en annan med kvantitet <parameter>kvnt1</parameter> och spotpris "
"<parameter>spotpris1</parameter>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "<parameter>spot</parameter>: spot price"
msgstr "<parameter>spotpris</parameter>: spotpris"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "<parameter>strike</parameter>: strike price"
msgstr "<parameter>lösenpris</parameter>: lösenpris"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<parameter>cost_of_carry</parameter>: net cost of holding the underlying "
"asset"
msgstr ""
"<parameter>innehavskostnad</parameter>: nettokostnaden för att inneha den "
"underliggande tillgången"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<parameter>amer_euro_flag</parameter>: 'a' for an American style option or "
"'e' for a European style option"
msgstr ""
"<parameter>amerikansk_europeisk_flagga</parameter>: är antingen \"a\" eller "
"\"e\" för att indikera om optionen är amerikansk eller europeisk"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<parameter>cost_of_carry</parameter>: net cost of holding the underlying "
"asset (for common stocks, the risk free rate less the dividend yield), "
"defaults to 0"
msgstr ""
"<parameter>innehavskostnad</parameter>: nettokostnaden för att inneha den "
"underliggande tillgången (för vanliga aktier, den riskfria räntan minus "
"direktavkastningen), standard är 0"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>OPT_BS</function> uses the Black-Scholes model to calculate the "
"price of a European option struck at <parameter>strike</parameter> on an "
"asset with spot price <parameter>spot</parameter>."
msgstr ""
"<function>OPT_BS</function> använder Black-Scholes-modellen för att beräkna "
"priset på en europeisk option med lösenpris satt till "
"<parameter>lösenpris</parameter> på en tillgång med spotpris "
"<parameter>spotpris</parameter>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The returned value will be expressed in the same units as "
"<parameter>strike</parameter> and <parameter>spot</parameter>."
msgstr ""
"Det returnerade värdet kommer att uttryckas i samma enhet som "
"<parameter>lösenpris</parameter> och <parameter>spotpris</parameter>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>OPT_BS_CARRYCOST</function> uses the Black-Scholes model to "
"calculate the 'elasticity' of a European option struck at "
"<parameter>strike</parameter> on an asset with spot price "
"<parameter>spot</parameter>. The elasticity of an option is the rate of "
"change of its price with respect to its "
"<parameter>cost_of_carry</parameter>."
msgstr ""
"<function>OPT_BS_CARRYCOST</function> använder Black-Scholes-modellen för "
"att beräkna ”elasticitet” för en europeisk option med lösenpris satt till "
"<parameter>lösenpris</parameter> på en tillgång med spotpris "
"<parameter>spotpris</parameter>. Elasticitet för en option är "
"förändringstakten av dess pris med avseende på dess "
"<parameter>innehavskostnad</parameter>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>OPT_BS_DELTA</function> uses the Black-Scholes model to calculate "
"the 'delta' of a European option struck at <parameter>strike</parameter> on "
"an asset with spot price <parameter>spot</parameter>."
msgstr ""
"<function>OPT_BS_DELTA</function> använder Black-Scholes-modellen för att "
"beräkna ”delta” på en europeisk option med lösenpris satt till "
"<parameter>lösenpris</parameter> på en tillgång med spotpris "
"<parameter>spotpris</parameter>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>OPT_BS_GAMMA</function>(<parameter>spot</parameter>,<parameter>strike</parameter>,<parameter>time</parameter>,<parameter>rate</parameter>,<parameter>volatility</parameter>,<parameter>cost_of_carry</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"<function>OPT_BS_GAMMA</function>(<parameter>spotpris</parameter>;<parameter>lösenpris</parameter>;<parameter>tid</parameter>;<parameter>ränta</parameter>;<parameter>volatilitet</parameter>;<parameter>innehavskostnad</parameter>)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>OPT_BS_GAMMA</function> uses the Black-Scholes model to calculate "
"the 'gamma' of a European option struck at <parameter>strike</parameter> on "
"an asset with spot price <parameter>spot</parameter>. The gamma of an option"
" is the second derivative of its price with respect to the price of the "
"underlying asset."
msgstr ""
"<function>OPT_BS_GAMMA</function> använder Black-Scholes-modellen för att "
"beräkna ”gamma” på en europeisk option med lösenpris satt till "
"<parameter>lösenpris</parameter> på en tillgång med spotpris "
"<parameter>spotpris</parameter>. Gamma för en option är andraderivatan av "
"dess pris med avseende på priset på underliggande tillgång."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Gamma is expressed as the rate of change of delta per unit change in "
"<parameter>spot</parameter>. Gamma is the same for calls and puts."
msgstr ""
"Gamma uttrycks som hastigheten för förändring för delta per enhetsändring i "
"<parameter>spotpris</parameter>. Gamma är densamma för köp och sälj."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>OPT_BS_RHO</function> uses the Black-Scholes model to calculate "
"the 'rho' of a European option struck at <parameter>strike</parameter> on an"
" asset with spot price <parameter>spot</parameter>. The rho of an option is "
"the rate of change of its price with respect to the risk free interest rate."
msgstr ""
"<function>OPT_BS_RHO</function> använder Black-Scholes-modellen för att "
"beräkna ”rho” för en europeisk option med lösenpris satt till "
"<parameter>lösenpris</parameter> på en tillgång med spotpris "
"<parameter>spotpris</parameter>. rho för en option är förändringstakten av "
"dess pris med avseende på dess riskfria ränta."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>OPT_BS_THETA</function> uses the Black-Scholes model to calculate "
"the 'theta' of a European option struck at <parameter>strike</parameter> on "
"an asset with spot price <parameter>spot</parameter>. The theta of an option"
" is the rate of change of its price with respect to time to expiry."
msgstr ""
"<function>OPT_BS_THETA</function> använder Black-Scholes-modellen för att "
"beräkna ”theta” för en europeisk option med lösenpris satt till "
"<parameter>lösenpris</parameter> på en tillgång med spotpris "
"<parameter>spotpris</parameter>. Theta för en option är förändringstakten av"
" dess pris med avseende på dess utgångsdatum."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>OPT_BS_VEGA</function>(<parameter>spot</parameter>,<parameter>strike</parameter>,<parameter>time</parameter>,<parameter>rate</parameter>,<parameter>volatility</parameter>,<parameter>cost_of_carry</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"<function>OPT_BS_VEGA</function>(<parameter>spotpris</parameter>;<parameter>lösenpris</parameter>;<parameter>tid</parameter>;<parameter>ränta</parameter>;<parameter>volatilitet</parameter>;<parameter>innehavskostnad</parameter>)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>OPT_BS_VEGA</function> uses the Black-Scholes model to calculate "
"the 'vega' of a European option struck at <parameter>strike</parameter> on "
"an asset with spot price <parameter>spot</parameter>. The vega of an option "
"is the rate of change of its price with respect to volatility."
msgstr ""
"<function>OPT_BS_VEGA</function> använder Black-Scholes-modellen för att "
"beräkna ”vega” för en europeisk option med lösenpris satt till "
"<parameter>lösenpris</parameter> på en tillgång med spotpris "
"<parameter>spotpris</parameter>. Vega för en option är förändringstakten av "
"dess pris med avseende på dess volatilitet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>OPT_COMPLEX_CHOOSER</function>(<parameter>spot</parameter>,<parameter>strike_call</parameter>,<parameter>strike_put</parameter>,<parameter>time</parameter>,<parameter>time_call</parameter>,<parameter>time_put</parameter>,<parameter>rate</parameter>,<parameter>cost_of_carry</parameter>,<parameter>volatility</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"<function>OPT_COMPLEX_CHOOSER</function>(<parameter>spotpris</parameter>;<parameter>lösenpris_köp</parameter>;<parameter>lösenpris_sälj</parameter>;<parameter>tid</parameter>;<parameter>time_call</parameter>;<parameter>time_put</parameter>;<parameter>ränta</parameter>;<parameter>innehavskostnad</parameter>;<parameter>volatilitet</parameter>)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<parameter>strike_call</parameter>: strike price, if exercised as a call "
"option"
msgstr ""
"<parameter>lösenpris_köp</parameter>: lösenpris om inlöst som en köpoption"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<parameter>strike_put</parameter>: strike price, if exercised as a put "
"option"
msgstr ""
"<parameter>lösenpris_sälj</parameter>: lösenpris om inlöst som en säljoption"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>OPT_EURO_EXCHANGE</function>(<parameter>spot1</parameter>,<parameter>spot2</parameter>,<parameter>qty1</parameter>,<parameter>qty2</parameter>,<parameter>time</parameter>,<parameter>rate</parameter>,<parameter>cost_of_carry1</parameter>,<parameter>cost_of_carry2</parameter>,<parameter>volatility1</parameter>,<parameter>volatility2</parameter>,<parameter>rho</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"<function>OPT_EURO_EXCHANGE</function>(<parameter>spotpris1</parameter>;<parameter>spotpris2</parameter>;<parameter>kvnt1</parameter>;<parameter>kvnt2</parameter>;<parameter>tid</parameter>;<parameter>ränta</parameter>;<parameter>innehavskostnad1</parameter>;<parameter>innehavskostnad2</parameter>;<parameter>volatilitet1</parameter>;<parameter>volatilitet2</parameter>;<parameter>rho</parameter>)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>OPT_EURO_EXCHANGE</function> models the theoretical price of a "
"European option to exchange one asset with quantity "
"<parameter>qty2</parameter> and spot price <parameter>spot2</parameter> for "
"another with quantity <parameter>qty1</parameter> and spot price "
"<parameter>spot1</parameter>."
msgstr ""
"<function>OPT_EURO_EXCHANGE</function> modellerar det teoretiska priset på "
"en europeisk option för att växla en tillgång med kvantitet "
"<parameter>kvnt2</parameter> och <parameter>spotpris2</parameter> för en "
"annan, med kvantitet <parameter>kvnt1</parameter> och spotpris "
"<parameter>spotpris1</parameter>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<parameter>strike1</parameter>: strike price at which the option is struck"
msgstr "<parameter>lösenpris1</parameter>: lösenpriset som satts för optionen"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<parameter>strike2</parameter>: strike price at which the option is re-"
"struck if out of the money at <parameter>time1</parameter>"
msgstr ""
"<parameter>lösenpris2</parameter>: lösenpris som sätts på nytt om optionen "
"saknar realvärde vid <parameter>tid1</parameter>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<parameter>spot_min</parameter>: minimum spot price of the underlying asset "
"so far observed"
msgstr ""
"<parameter>minsta_spotpris</parameter>: är minsta spotpris så här långt för "
"den underliggande tillgången"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<parameter>spot_max</parameter>: maximum spot price of the underlying asset "
"so far observed"
msgstr ""
"<parameter>högsta_spotpris</parameter>: är högsta spotpris så här långt för "
"den underliggande tillgången"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>OPT_FRENCH</function> values the theoretical price of a European "
"option adjusted for trading day volatility, struck at "
"<parameter>strike</parameter> on an asset with spot price "
"<parameter>spot</parameter>."
msgstr ""
"<function>OPT_FRENCH</function> beräknar det teoretiska priset på en "
"europeisk option, korrigerat för volatiliteten under handelsdagar, med "
"lösenpris <parameter>lösenpris</parameter> och spotpris "
"<parameter>spotpris</parameter>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>OPT_GARMAN_KOHLHAGEN</function> values the theoretical price of a "
"European currency option struck at <parameter>strike</parameter> on an asset"
" with spot price <parameter>spot</parameter>."
msgstr ""
"<function>OPT_GARMAN_KOHLHAGEN</function> beräknar det teoretiska priset på "
"en europeisk valutaoption med lösenpris <parameter>lösenpris</parameter> och"
" spotpris <parameter>spotpris</parameter>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>OPT_ON_OPTIONS</function>(<parameter>type_flag</parameter>,<parameter>spot</parameter>,<parameter>strike1</parameter>,<parameter>strike2</parameter>,<parameter>time1</parameter>,<parameter>time2</parameter>,<parameter>rate</parameter>,<parameter>cost_of_carry</parameter>,<parameter>volatility</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"<function>OPT_ON_OPTIONS</function>(<parameter>typflagga</parameter>;<parameter>spotpris</parameter>;<parameter>lösenpris1</parameter>;<parameter>lösenpris2</parameter>;<parameter>tid1</parameter>;<parameter>tid2</parameter>;<parameter>ränta</parameter>;<parameter>innehavskostnad</parameter>;<parameter>volatilitet</parameter>)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<parameter>strike1</parameter>: strike price at which the option being "
"valued is struck"
msgstr ""
"<parameter>lösenpris1</parameter>: lösenpriset som satts för optionen som "
"värderas"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<parameter>strike2</parameter>: strike price at which the underlying option "
"is struck"
msgstr ""
"<parameter>lösenpris2</parameter>: lösenpriset som satts för den "
"underliggande optionen"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<parameter>cost_of_carry</parameter>: net cost of holding the underlying "
"asset of the underlying option"
msgstr ""
"<parameter>innehavskostnad</parameter>: nettokostnaden för att inneha den "
"underliggande tillgången för den underliggande optionen"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"For common stocks, <parameter>cost_of_carry</parameter> is the risk free "
"rate less the dividend yield. <parameter>time2</parameter> ≥ "
"<parameter>time1</parameter>"
msgstr ""
"För vanliga aktier är <parameter>innehavskostnad</parameter> den riskfria "
"räntan minus direktavkastningen. <parameter>tid2</parameter> ≥ "
"<parameter>tid1</parameter>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>OPT_RGW</function>(<parameter>spot</parameter>,<parameter>strike</parameter>,<parameter>time_payout</parameter>,<parameter>time_exp</parameter>,<parameter>rate</parameter>,<parameter>d</parameter>,<parameter>volatility</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"<function>OPT_RGW</function>(<parameter>spotpris</parameter>;<parameter>lösenpris</parameter>;<parameter>tid_utdelning</parameter>;<parameter>tid_utg</parameter>;<parameter>räntesats</parameter>;<parameter>d</parameter>;<parameter>volatilitet</parameter>)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>OPT_TIME_SWITCH</function> models the theoretical price of time "
"switch options. (Pechtl 1995). The holder receives <parameter>a</parameter> "
"* <parameter>dt</parameter> for each period that the asset price was greater"
" than <parameter>strike</parameter> (for a call) or below it (for a put)."
msgstr ""
"<function>OPT_TIME_SWITCH</function> modellerar det teoretiska priset på "
"optioner med tidsvillkor (Pechtl 1995). Ägaren får <parameter>a</parameter> "
"* <parameter>dt</parameter> för varje period som tillgångens pris var högre "
"än <parameter>lösenpris</parameter> (för köp) eller lägre än det (för sälj)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>PMT</function>(<parameter>rate</parameter>,<parameter>nper</parameter>,<parameter>pv</parameter>,<parameter>fv</parameter>,<parameter>type</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"<function>PMT</function>(<parameter>ränta</parameter>;<parameter>antal_perioder</parameter>;<parameter>nv</parameter>;<parameter>fv</parameter>;<parameter>typ</parameter>)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>PPMT</function>(<parameter>rate</parameter>,<parameter>per</parameter>,<parameter>nper</parameter>,<parameter>pv</parameter>,<parameter>fv</parameter>,<parameter>type</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"<function>PPMT</function>(<parameter>ränta</parameter>;<parameter>periodnummer</parameter>;<parameter>antal_perioder</parameter>;<parameter>nv</parameter>;<parameter>fv</parameter>;<parameter>typ</parameter>)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>PPMT</function> calculates the principal part of an annuity's "
"payment for period number <parameter>per</parameter>."
msgstr ""
"<function>PPMT</function> beräknar den del av annuitetsbetalningen som avser"
" amortering under period <parameter>periodnummer</parameter>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>PRICE</function>(<parameter>settlement</parameter>,<parameter>maturity</parameter>,<parameter>rate</parameter>,<parameter>yield</parameter>,<parameter>redemption</parameter>,<parameter>frequency</parameter>,<parameter>basis</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"<function>PRICE</function>(<parameter>avräkning</parameter>;<parameter>förfallodatum</parameter>;<parameter>ränta</parameter>;<parameter>avkastning</parameter>;<parameter>inlösen</parameter>;<parameter>frekvens</parameter>;<parameter>bas</parameter>)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>PRICEDISC</function>(<parameter>settlement</parameter>,<parameter>maturity</parameter>,<parameter>discount</parameter>,<parameter>redemption</parameter>,<parameter>basis</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"<function>PRICEDISC</function>(<parameter>avräkning</parameter>;<parameter>förfallodatum</parameter>;<parameter>diskontering</parameter>;<parameter>inlösen</parameter>;<parameter>bas</parameter>)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>PRICEMAT</function>(<parameter>settlement</parameter>,<parameter>maturity</parameter>,<parameter>issue</parameter>,<parameter>discount</parameter>,<parameter>yield</parameter>,<parameter>basis</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"<function>PRICEMAT</function>(<parameter>avräkning</parameter>;<parameter>förfallodatum</parameter>;<parameter>start</parameter>;<parameter>diskontering</parameter>;<parameter>avkastning</parameter>;<parameter>bas</parameter>)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>PV</function>(<parameter>rate</parameter>,<parameter>nper</parameter>,<parameter>pmt</parameter>,<parameter>fv</parameter>,<parameter>type</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"<function>PV</function>(<parameter>ränta</parameter>;<parameter>antal_perioder</parameter>;<parameter>bet</parameter>;<parameter>fv</parameter>;<parameter>typ</parameter>)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>PV</function> calculates the present value of "
"<parameter>fv</parameter> which is <parameter>nper</parameter> periods into "
"the future, assuming a periodic payment of <parameter>pmt</parameter> and an"
" interest rate of <parameter>rate</parameter> per period."
msgstr ""
"<function>PV</function> beräknar aktuellt värde för "
"<parameter>fv</parameter> vilka är <parameter>antal_perioder</parameter> "
"perioder in i framtiden antagande periodisk betalning för "
"<parameter>bet</parameter> och en räntesats på <parameter>ränta</parameter> "
"per period."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>RATE</function>(<parameter>nper</parameter>,<parameter>pmt</parameter>,<parameter>pv</parameter>,<parameter>fv</parameter>,<parameter>type</parameter>,<parameter>guess</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"<function>RATE</function>(<parameter>antal_perioder</parameter>;<parameter>bet</parameter>;<parameter>nv</parameter>;<parameter>fv</parameter>;<parameter>typ</parameter>;<parameter>gissning</parameter>)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>RECEIVED</function>(<parameter>settlement</parameter>,<parameter>maturity</parameter>,<parameter>investment</parameter>,<parameter>rate</parameter>,<parameter>basis</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"<function>RECEIVED</function>(<parameter>avräkning</parameter>;<parameter>förfallodatum</parameter>;<parameter>investering</parameter>;<parameter>ränta</parameter>;<parameter>bas</parameter>)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>SLN</function>(<parameter>cost</parameter>,<parameter>salvage</parameter>,<parameter>life</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"<function>SLN</function>(<parameter>kostnad</parameter>;<parameter>restvärde</parameter>;<parameter>livstid</parameter>)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>SYD</function>(<parameter>cost</parameter>,<parameter>salvage</parameter>,<parameter>life</parameter>,<parameter>period</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"<function>SYD</function>(<parameter>kostnad</parameter>;<parameter>restvärde</parameter>;<parameter>livstid</parameter>;<parameter>period</parameter>)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>TBILLEQ</function>(<parameter>settlement</parameter>,<parameter>maturity</parameter>,<parameter>discount</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"<function>TBILLEQ</function>(<parameter>avräkning</parameter>;<parameter>förfallodatum</parameter>;<parameter>diskontering</parameter>)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>TBILLPRICE</function>(<parameter>settlement</parameter>,<parameter>maturity</parameter>,<parameter>discount</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"<function>TBILLPRICE</function>(<parameter>avräkning</parameter>;<parameter>förfallodatum</parameter>;<parameter>diskontering</parameter>)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>TBILLYIELD</function>(<parameter>settlement</parameter>,<parameter>maturity</parameter>,<parameter>price</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"<function>TBILLYIELD</function>(<parameter>avräkning</parameter>;<parameter>förfallodatum</parameter>;<parameter>pris</parameter>)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>VDB</function>(<parameter>cost</parameter>,<parameter>salvage</parameter>,<parameter>life</parameter>,<parameter>start_period</parameter>,<parameter>end_period</parameter>,<parameter>factor</parameter>,<parameter>no_switch</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"<function>VDB</function>(<parameter>kostnad</parameter>;<parameter>restvärde</parameter>;<parameter>livstid</parameter>;<parameter>startperiod</parameter>;<parameter>slutperiod</parameter>;<parameter>faktor</parameter>;<parameter>växla_ej</parameter>)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>YIELD</function>(<parameter>settlement</parameter>,<parameter>maturity</parameter>,<parameter>rate</parameter>,<parameter>price</parameter>,<parameter>redemption</parameter>,<parameter>frequency</parameter>,<parameter>basis</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"<function>YIELD</function>(<parameter>avräkning</parameter>;<parameter>förfallodatum</parameter>;<parameter>ränta</parameter>;<parameter>pris</parameter>;<parameter>inlösen</parameter>;<parameter>frekvens</parameter>;<parameter>bas</parameter>)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>YIELDDISC</function>(<parameter>settlement</parameter>,<parameter>maturity</parameter>,<parameter>price</parameter>,<parameter>redemption</parameter>,<parameter>basis</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"<function>YIELDDISC</function>(<parameter>avräkning</parameter>;<parameter>förfallodatum</parameter>;<parameter>pris</parameter>;<parameter>inlösen</parameter>;<parameter>bas</parameter>)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<function>YIELDMAT</function>(<parameter>settlement</parameter>,<parameter>maturity</parameter>,<parameter>issue</parameter>,<parameter>rate</parameter>,<parameter>price</parameter>,<parameter>basis</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"<function>YIELDMAT</function>(<parameter>avräkning</parameter>;<parameter>förfallodatum</parameter>;<parameter>start</parameter>;<parameter>ränta</parameter>;<parameter>pris</parameter>;<parameter>bas</parameter>)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "<parameter>link_location</parameter>: string"
msgstr "<parameter>länkadress</parameter>: sträng"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Suppose you want to perform a principal component analysis on the data given"
" in <xref linkend=\"pcanalysis-example-1\"/> having the two dimensions "
"(factors) <inlineequation><_:mathphrase-1/></inlineequation> and "
"<inlineequation><_:mathphrase-2/></inlineequation>."
msgstr ""
"Anta att du vill utföra en principalkomponentanalys av data i <xref "
"linkend=\"pcanalysis-example-1\"/> med två dimensioner (faktorer), "
"<inlineequation><_:mathphrase-1/></inlineequation> och "
"<inlineequation><_:mathphrase-2/></inlineequation>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Enter Sheet1!$A$1:$B$11 (or just A1:B11) in the <quote><guilabel>Input "
"Range:</guilabel></quote> entry by typing this directly into the entry or "
"clicking in the entry field and then selecting the range on the sheet."
msgstr ""
"Ange Sheet1!$A$1:$B$11 (eller bara A1:B11) i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>Indataområde:</guilabel></quote>. Skriv in området direkt "
"eller klicka i fältet och markera området i kalkylbladet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Select the <quote><guibutton>Labels</guibutton></quote> option since the "
"first row contains labels. (see <xref linkend=\"pcanalysis-tool-dialog\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"Markera alternativet <quote><guibutton>Rubriker</guibutton></quote> eftersom"
" den första raden innehåller rubriker (se <xref linkend=\"pcanalysis-tool-"
"dialog\"/>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The output of this principal component analysis is shown in <xref "
"linkend=\"regression-example-3\"/>. The output shows the covariance matrix, "
"the eigenvalues and corresponding eigenvectors. The principal component is "
"the constructed factor with the highest percent of trace, "
"<inlineequation><_:mathphrase-1/></inlineequation>."
msgstr ""
"Resultatet av principalkomponentanalysen visas i <xref linkend=\"regression-"
"example-3\"/>. Det visar kovariansmatrisen, egenvärdena och motsvarande "
"egenvektorer. Huvudkomponenten är den konstruerade faktor som står för "
"störst andel av den totala variansen, "
"<inlineequation><_:mathphrase-1/></inlineequation>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Principal Component Analysis Tool Output"
msgstr "Resultat från verktyget Principalkomponentanalys"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-pcanalysis-"
"ex2.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of "
"the output from a principal component analysis.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-pcanalysis-"
"ex2.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Resultat från"
" en principalkomponentanalys.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Regression Tool"
msgstr "Regressionsverktyg"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Regression Tool Dialog"
msgstr "Dialogruta för regressionsverktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-regression.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the "
"regression tool dialog.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-regression.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Dialogruta för "
"regressionsverktyget.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The regression tool performs a multiple regression analysis."
msgstr "Regressionsverktyget utför en multipel regressionsanalys."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Enter a range or list of ranges containing the independent variables into "
"the <quote><guilabel>X Variables:</guilabel></quote> entry."
msgstr ""
"Ange ett område eller en lista med områden som innehåller de oberoende "
"variablerna i fältet <quote><guilabel>X-variabler:</guilabel></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Enter a single range containing the dependent variable into the "
"<quote><guilabel>Y Variable:</guilabel></quote> entry."
msgstr ""
"Ange ett område som innehåller den beroende variabeln i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>Y-variabel:</guilabel></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If the ranges for the independent and dependent variables also contains "
"labels in the first field of each row, column or area, select the <quote> "
"<guilabel>Labels</guilabel></quote> option."
msgstr ""
"Om områdena med oberoende och beroende variabler även har rubriker i den "
"första cellen i varje rad, kolumn eller område markerar du alternativet "
"<quote><guilabel>Rubriker</guilabel></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Specify the confidence level in the <quote><guilabel>Confidence "
"Level:</guilabel></quote> entry. The default is 95%."
msgstr ""
"Ange konfidensnivån i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>Konfidensnivå:</guilabel></quote>. Standardvärdet är 95 %."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
