#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Comparing Medians of Two Populations"
msgstr "Jämförelse av medianer i två populationer"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> provides three non-parametric tests to "
"test the null hypothesis that the two samples come from populations with the"
" same median. Two tests, performed through the same tool, apply in the case "
"of paired samples:"
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> innehåller tre icke-parametriska test av"
" nollhypotesen att två urval kommer från populationer med samma median. Två "
"test för parade urval utförs med samma verktyg:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "One test applies in the case of unpaired samples:"
msgstr "Ett test används för oparade urval:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"This section describes the two sample (paired) sign test to test the null "
"hypothesis that the two samples come from populations with the same median. "
"The tool to perform a sign test to test the null hypothesis that the single "
"sample comes from a population with a given median is in section <xref "
"linkend=\"sign-test-tool\"/>."
msgstr ""
"I det här avsnittet beskrivs teckentestet för två parade urval, som prövar "
"nollhypotesen att urvalen kommer från populationer med samma median. "
"Verktyget för teckentest av nollhypotesen att ett enskilt urval kommer från "
"en population med en viss median beskrivs i avsnittet <xref linkend=\"sign-"
"test-tool\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"This section describes the two sample (paired) Wilcoxon signed rank test to "
"test the null hypothesis that the two samples come from populations with the"
" same median. The tool to perform a Wilcoxon signed rank test to test the "
"null hypothesis that the single sample comes from a population with a given "
"median is in section <xref linkend=\"wilcoxon-sign-test-tool\"/>."
msgstr ""
"I det här avsnittet beskrivs Wilcoxons teckenrangtest för två parade urval, "
"som prövar nollhypotesen att urvalen kommer från populationer med samma "
"median. Verktyget för Wilcoxons teckenrangtest av nollhypotesen att ett "
"enskilt urval kommer från en population med en viss median beskrivs i "
"avsnittet <xref linkend=\"wilcoxon-sign-test-tool\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "F-Test: Two-Sample for Variances Tool"
msgstr "F-test: verktyg för varians i två urval"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "F-Test Tool Dialog"
msgstr "Dialogruta för F-testverktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ftest.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the dialog "
"for an F-test analysis of the equality of two variances.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ftest.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av dialogrutan "
"för F-test av om två varianser är lika.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Use the F-Test tool to test whether two population variances are different "
"against the null hypothesis that they are not."
msgstr ""
"Använd F-testverktyget för att pröva om två populationsvarianser skiljer sig"
" åt, med nollhypotesen att de är lika."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Specify the variables in the <quote><guilabel>Variable 1 "
"Range:</guilabel></quote> and <quote><guilabel>Variable 2 "
"Range:</guilabel></quote> entries. The "
"<quote><guilabel>Alpha:</guilabel></quote> entry contains the significance "
"level which is by default 5%."
msgstr ""
"Ange variablernas områden i fälten <quote><guilabel>Område för variabel "
"1:</guilabel></quote> och <quote><guilabel>Område för variabel "
"2:</guilabel></quote>. Signifikansnivån anges i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>Alfa:</guilabel></quote> och är som standard 5 %."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If the first field of each range contains labels, select the "
"<quote><guibutton>Labels</guibutton></quote> option. The names of the "
"variables will be included in the output table."
msgstr ""
"Om det första fältet i varje område innehåller etiketter väljer du "
"alternativet <quote><guibutton>Etiketter</guibutton></quote>. Variabelnamnen"
" tas då med i resultattabellen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The results are given in a table. This table contains the mean, variance, "
"count of observations and the degree of freedom for both variables. The "
"output table also includes the F-value, the one-tailed probability for the "
"F-value, and the F Critical value for one-tailed test and the corresponding "
"values for a two tailed test. The one-tailed probability for the F-value "
"(<quote><inlineequation><_:mathphrase-1/></inlineequation> one-tail</quote> "
"row) is the probability of making a Type I error in the one-tailed test. "
"Similarly, the two-tailed probability for the F-value (<quote><guilabel>P "
"two-tail</guilabel></quote> row) is the probability of making a Type I error"
" in the two-tailed test. Since in the two-tailed F-Test both critical values"
" are positive, the <quote><guilabel>F Critical two-tail</guilabel></quote> "
"row contains two numbers."
msgstr ""
"Resultaten visas i en tabell med medelvärde, varians, antal observationer "
"och frihetsgrader för båda variablerna. Resultattabellen innehåller även "
"F-värdet, dess ensvansade sannolikhet och det kritiska F-värdet för ett "
"ensvansat test, samt motsvarande värden för ett tvåsvansat test. Den "
"ensvansade sannolikheten för F-värdet (raden "
"<quote><inlineequation><_:mathphrase-1/></inlineequation> ensvansad</quote>)"
" är sannolikheten att begå ett typ I-fel i det ensvansade testet. På samma "
"sätt är den tvåsvansade sannolikheten för F-värdet (raden <quote><guilabel>P"
" tvåsvansad</guilabel></quote>) sannolikheten att begå ett typ I-fel i det "
"tvåsvansade testet. Eftersom båda kritiska värdena är positiva i det "
"tvåsvansade F-testet innehåller raden <quote><guilabel>F kritiskt "
"tvåsvansat</guilabel></quote> två tal."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If the output is directed into a specific output range, that range should "
"contain at least three columns and eight rows."
msgstr ""
"Om resultatet placeras i ett särskilt cellområde bör området omfatta minst "
"tre kolumner och åtta rader."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ftest-ex1.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of some "
"example data for an F-test of the equality of two variances.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ftest-ex1.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av exempeldata "
"för ett F-test av om två varianser är lika.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Using the F-Test Tool"
msgstr "Använda F-testverktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"ftest-example-1\"/> shows some example data and <xref "
"linkend=\"ftest-example-2\"/> the corresponding output."
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"ftest-example-1\"/> visar exempeldata och <xref "
"linkend=\"ftest-example-2\"/> motsvarande resultat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "F-Test Tool Output"
msgstr "Resultat från F-testverktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ftest-ex2.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the output "
"of an F-test analysis of the equality of two variances.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ftest-ex2.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av resultatet "
"från ett F-test av om två varianser är lika.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Multiple Sample Tests"
msgstr "Test med flera urval"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Analysis of Variance"
msgstr "Variansanalys"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "ANOVA: Single Factor Tool"
msgstr "ANOVA: verktyg med en faktor"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Use this tool to perform a single factor analysis of the variances of given "
"variables. The variables are specified by the <quote><guilabel>Input "
"Range:</guilabel></quote> entry. The given range can be grouped into the "
"variables either by columns, by rows or by areas. The "
"<quote><guilabel>Alpha:</guilabel></quote> entry specifies the significance "
"level which is by default 5%."
msgstr ""
"Använd verktyget för att utföra en enkelfaktors-ANOVA på de angivna "
"variablerna. Ange dem i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>Indataområde:</guilabel></quote>. Dela in området i "
"variabler efter kolumner, rader eller områden. Fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>Alfa:</guilabel></quote> anger signifikansnivån, som "
"standard är 5 %."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If the first row or first column of the given range, or the first field of "
"each area contains labels, select the <quote><guibutton>Labels "
"</guibutton></quote> option. The names of the variables will be included in "
"the output table."
msgstr ""
"Om den första raden eller kolumnen i området, eller det första fältet i "
"varje delområde, innehåller etiketter väljer du alternativet "
"<quote><guibutton>Etiketter </guibutton></quote>. Variabelnamnen tas då med "
"i resultattabellen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The results of this analysis of variance are presented in a standard ANOVA "
"table. The <quote><guilabel>F critical</guilabel></quote> value is the "
"largest value of F that is statistically significant using the given "
"significance level (<quote><guilabel>Alpha</guilabel></quote>)."
msgstr ""
"Resultaten från variansanalysen visas i en standardiserad ANOVA-tabell. "
"Värdet <quote><guilabel>F kritiskt</guilabel></quote> är det största F-värde"
" som är statistiskt signifikant vid den angivna signifikansnivån "
"(<quote><guilabel>Alfa</guilabel></quote>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"This tool also calculates the count, sum, average, and the variance of each "
"variable."
msgstr ""
"Verktyget beräknar även antal, summa, medelvärde och varians för varje "
"variabel."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "1-factor ANOVA Dialog and Example Data"
msgstr "Dialogruta och exempeldata för 1-faktors-ANOVA"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ANOVA1-ex1.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of a "
"multilevel single factor ANOVA analysis.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ANOVA1-ex1.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av en "
"enkelfaktors-ANOVA med flera nivåer.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Using the single factor ANOVA"
msgstr "Använda enkelfaktors-ANOVA"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"See <xref linkend=\"anova-one-factor-tool-ex1\"/> for an example of a "
"completed dialog and <xref linkend=\"anova-one-factor-tool-ex2\"/> for the "
"corresponding output."
msgstr ""
"Se <xref linkend=\"anova-one-factor-tool-ex1\"/> för ett exempel på en "
"ifylld dialogruta och <xref linkend=\"anova-one-factor-tool-ex2\"/> för "
"motsvarande resultat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Output From a 1-factor ANOVA"
msgstr "Resultat från 1-faktors-ANOVA"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ANOVA1-ex2.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the output "
"from a multilevel single factor ANOVA analysis.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ANOVA1-ex2.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av resultatet "
"från en enkelfaktors-ANOVA med flera nivåer.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "ANOVA: Two-Factor Tool"
msgstr "ANOVA: verktyg med två faktorer"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> can perform two factor fixed effects "
"ANOVAs with and without replication. The same dialog is used and the "
"appropriate tool is selected depending on whether the number of rows per "
"sample is 1 or larger than 1."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan utföra tvåfaktors-ANOVA med fasta "
"effekter, både med och utan upprepning. Samma dialogruta används; rätt "
"verktyg väljs beroende på om antalet rader per urval är 1 eller fler."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "ANOVA: Two-Factor Without Replication Tool"
msgstr "ANOVA: verktyg med två faktorer utan upprepning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If the number of rows per sample is given as 1, "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> performs a two factor fixed effects "
"ANOVA without replication. Each column of the input range is interpreted as "
"a level of the first factor while each row is interpreted as a level of the "
"second factor."
msgstr ""
"Om antalet rader per urval är 1 utför <application>Gnumeric</application> en"
" tvåfaktors-ANOVA med fasta effekter utan upprepning. Varje kolumn i "
"indataområdet motsvarar en nivå av den första faktorn och varje rad en nivå "
"av den andra faktorn."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The first row and column of the range may contain labels for these levels. "
"In this case the <quote><guibutton>Labels</guibutton></quote> option should "
"be selected."
msgstr ""
"Den första raden och kolumnen i området kan innehålla etiketter för "
"nivåerna. Välj i så fall alternativet "
"<quote><guibutton>Etiketter</guibutton></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The <quote><guilabel>Alpha:</guilabel></quote> entry specifies the "
"significance level which is by default 5%."
msgstr ""
"Fältet <quote><guilabel>Alfa:</guilabel></quote> anger signifikansnivån, som"
" standard 5 %."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Using the 2-factor ANOVA Without Replication Tool"
msgstr "Använda verktyget för 2-faktors-ANOVA utan upprepning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"See <xref linkend=\"anova-two-factor-without-tool-ex1\"/> for an example of "
"a completed dialog and <xref linkend=\"anova-two-factor-without-tool-ex2\"/>"
" for the corresponding output."
msgstr ""
"Se <xref linkend=\"anova-two-factor-without-tool-ex1\"/> för ett exempel på "
"en ifylld dialogruta och <xref linkend=\"anova-two-factor-without-tool-"
"ex2\"/> för motsvarande resultat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "2-factor ANOVA Without Replication Dialog"
msgstr "Dialogruta för 2-faktors-ANOVA utan upprepning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ANOVA2wo-ex1.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of a two "
"factor ANOVA without replication analysis.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ANOVA2wo-ex1.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av en "
"tvåfaktors-ANOVA utan upprepning.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Output From a 2-factor ANOVA Without Replication"
msgstr "Resultat från 2-faktors-ANOVA utan upprepning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ANOVA2wo-ex2.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the output "
"from a two factor ANOVA without replication analysis.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ANOVA2wo-ex2.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av resultatet "
"från en tvåfaktors-ANOVA utan upprepning.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "ANOVA: Two-Factor With Replication Tool"
msgstr "ANOVA: verktyg med två faktorer och upprepning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If the number of rows per sample is larger than 1, "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> performs a two factor fixed effects "
"ANOVA with replication. Each column of the input range is interpreted as a "
"level of the first factor while groups of rows (the number of rows in each "
"group given by the <quote><guilabel>number of rows per "
"sample</guilabel></quote> value) are interpreted as levels of the second "
"factor."
msgstr ""
"Om antalet rader per urval är större än 1 utför "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> en tvåfaktors-ANOVA med fasta effekter "
"och upprepning. Varje kolumn i indataområdet motsvarar en nivå av den första"
" faktorn. Grupper av rader motsvarar nivåer av den andra faktorn; antalet "
"rader i varje grupp anges i fältet <quote><guilabel>Antal rader per "
"urval</guilabel></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"See <xref linkend=\"anova-two-factor-with-tool-ex1\"/> for an example of a "
"completed dialog and <xref linkend=\"anova-two-factor-with-tool-ex2\"/> for "
"the corresponding output."
msgstr ""
"Se <xref linkend=\"anova-two-factor-with-tool-ex1\"/> för ett exempel på en "
"ifylld dialogruta och <xref linkend=\"anova-two-factor-with-tool-ex2\"/> för"
" motsvarande resultat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "2-factor ANOVA With Replication Dialog"
msgstr "Dialogruta för 2-faktors-ANOVA med upprepning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ANOVA2w-ex1.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of a two "
"factor ANOVA with replication analysis.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ANOVA2w-ex1.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av en "
"tvåfaktors-ANOVA med upprepning.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Output From a 2-factor ANOVA With Replication"
msgstr "Resultat från 2-faktors-ANOVA med upprepning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ANOVA2w-ex2.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the output "
"from a two factor ANOVA with replication analysis.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ANOVA2w-ex2.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av resultatet "
"från en tvåfaktors-ANOVA med upprepning.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> will estimate missing values for each "
"level combination as the mean of the existing values in that combination. "
"The degrees of freedom are adjusted appropriately."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> skattar saknade värden för varje "
"nivåkombination som medelvärdet av de befintliga värdena i kombinationen. "
"Frihetsgraderna justeras därefter."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Tests for a Contingency Table"
msgstr "Test för en kontingenstabell"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Graphics: Images, Widgets, and Drawings"
msgstr "Grafik: bilder, gränssnittskomponenter och teckningar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> provides several types of graphical "
"elements which can be added to a worksheet. The creation, manipulation and "
"deletion of these elements all occur in similar ways. When these elements "
"are part of a worksheet, they all \"float\" above the cell grid, possibly "
"hiding data in the cells underneath."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> har flera typer av grafiska element som "
"kan läggas till i ett kalkylblad. De skapas, hanteras och tas bort på "
"liknande sätt. När de finns i kalkylbladet ”svävar” de ovanför cellrutnätet "
"och kan dölja data i cellerna under dem."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> currently displays four different types "
"of graphical elements: data graphs, images, widgets, and drawings. Data "
"graphs allow users to present worksheet data visually in charts containing "
"several kinds of plots including pie plots, bar and column plots, and "
"scatterplots. Images in many standard computer formats can be added to a "
"worksheet. Graphical user interface widgets can also be added to a worksheet"
" and connected to the values contained in worksheet cells. Drawings allow "
"users to add simple graphical elements on top of a worksheet including "
"lines, arrows and simple polygons."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> visar för närvarande fyra typer av "
"grafiska element: diagram, bilder, gränssnittskomponenter och teckningar. "
"Diagram visar kalkylbladsdata visuellt med olika diagramtyper, till exempel "
"cirkel-, stapel-, kolumn- och punktdiagram. Bilder i många vanliga filformat"
" kan läggas till i ett kalkylblad. Gränssnittskomponenter kan också läggas "
"till och kopplas till värden i kalkylbladets celler. Med teckningar kan du "
"lägga till enkla grafiska element ovanpå kalkylbladet, till exempel linjer, "
"pilar och enkla polygoner."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The four types of graphical elements."
msgstr "De fyra typerna av grafiska element."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The four types of graphical elements which can be added to a worksheet: a "
"data graph with a column plot, an image showing a map of France, a scrollbar"
" which can be used to alter the value in cell \"I6\", and a red arrow "
"drawing element."
msgstr ""
"De fyra typerna av grafiska element som kan läggas till i ett kalkylblad: "
"ett diagram med ett kolumndiagram, en bild med en karta över Frankrike, en "
"rullningslist som ändrar värdet i cellen ”I6” och en teckning i form av en "
"röd pil."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/graphical-elements.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image of "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> showing the four types of graphical "
"elements which can be added to a worksheet: a data graph with a column plot,"
" an image showing a map of France, a scrollbar which can be used to alter "
"the value in cell \"I6\", and a drawing element: a red arrow. </phrase> "
"</textobject> <_:caption-1/>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/graphical-elements.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> som visar de fyra typerna av grafiska "
"element som kan läggas till i ett kalkylblad: ett diagram med ett "
"kolumndiagram, en bild med en karta över Frankrike, en rullningslist som "
"ändrar värdet i cellen ”I6” och en teckning i form av en röd pil.</phrase> "
"</textobject> <_:caption-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Adding Graphical Elements"
msgstr "Lägga till grafiska element"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"All graphical elements are added in similar ways which differ only in the "
"original selection and configuration of the element. Data graphs are added "
"using the <interface>Graph Guru</interface>, which is invoked either through"
" the <guimenu>Insert</guimenu> menu or with the toolbar button, to define "
"the properties of the graph. Images are added using the "
"<guimenu>Insert</guimenu> menu <guimenuitem>Image...</guimenuitem> menu "
"entry, selecting the name of the file with the appropriate image and "
"clicking on the <guibutton>Open</guibutton> button. Widgets and drawing "
"elements are added by selecting the appropriate button on the object "
"toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Grafiska element läggs till på liknande sätt; det som skiljer är hur "
"elementet väljs och konfigureras. Diagram skapas med "
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface>, som öppnas via menyn "
"<guimenu>Infoga</guimenu> eller med en knapp i verktygsfältet. Där anger du "
"diagrammets egenskaper. Bilder läggs till via menyn "
"<guimenu>Infoga</guimenu> och menyalternativet "
"<guimenuitem>Bild...</guimenuitem>: välj bildfilen och klicka på "
"<guibutton>Öppna</guibutton>. Gränssnittskomponenter och teckningselement "
"läggs till med motsvarande knapp i objektverktygsfältet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"After any of these steps, the mouse cursor will change into a thin cross-"
"hair cursor, <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"figures/pointer_cross_hair.png\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>An image of the thin cross hair mouse pointer.</phrase> "
"</textobject> </inlinemediaobject>, when the mouse pointer is placed over "
"the cell grid area."
msgstr ""
"När du för muspekaren över cellrutnätet ändras den till ett tunt hårkors, "
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"figures/pointer_cross_hair.png\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>En bild av muspekaren med tunt hårkors.</phrase> </textobject> "
"</inlinemediaobject>. Detta sker efter något av stegen ovan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The graphical element can be placed in the workbook by moving the cursor "
"onto the worksheet and clicking once with the primary mouse button. The "
"graphical element will appear at its default size with the top right hand "
"corner defined by the position of the mouse cursor."
msgstr ""
"Du kan placera det grafiska elementet i arbetsboken genom att föra pekaren "
"till kalkylbladet och klicka en gång med den primära musknappen. Elementet "
"visas i sin standardstorlek med det övre högra hörnet vid pekarens position."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Alternatively, the graphical element can both be placed on the worksheet and"
" have its size determined which is done by click-dragging with the mouse. "
"When the cursor has changed to the thin cross-hair, the graphical element "
"can be inserted by moving the pointer over the worksheet to determine one of"
" the corners of the resulting element, clicking and holding the primary "
"mouse button, dragging the pointer to the opposite corner, and releasing the"
" mouse button. The graphical element will then appear between the place "
"where the primary mouse button was pressed and the place the button was "
"released."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också placera elementet och bestämma dess storlek samtidigt genom att"
" klicka och dra. När pekaren har ändrats till ett tunt hårkors för du den "
"till en av elementets hörnpunkter, håller ned den primära musknappen och "
"drar till den motsatta hörnpunkten. Släpp sedan musknappen. Elementet visas "
"då mellan punkten där du tryckte ned knappen och punkten där du släppte den."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Selecting Graphical Elements"
msgstr "Markera grafiska element"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Selecting the graphical element requires placing the mouse pointer over the "
"element and then clicking the primary mouse button. "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> indicates the element is selected by "
"drawing eight 'grab handles' around the element; these are small circles at "
"the four corners and in the middle of the four edges of a rectangle "
"surrounding the graphical element."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill markera ett grafiskt element för du muspekaren över det och "
"klickar med den primära musknappen. <application>Gnumeric</application> "
"visar att elementet är markerat genom att rita åtta handtag runt det. "
"Handtagen är små cirklar vid rektangelns fyra hörn och mitt på dess fyra "
"sidor."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "A graphical element which has been selected."
msgstr "Ett markerat grafiskt element."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The graphical column plot has been selected as evidenced by the eight small "
"circular 'grab handles' at the corners and in the middle of each edge."
msgstr ""
"Kolumndiagrammet är markerat. Det syns på de åtta små cirkelformade "
"handtagen vid hörnen och mitt på varje sida."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/graphical-elements-selected.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image of several "
"graphical elements of which one has been selected, and is therefore showing "
"its grab handles. </phrase> </textobject> <_:caption-1/>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/graphical-elements-selected.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av flera "
"grafiska element, varav ett är markerat och därför visar sina "
"handtag.</phrase> </textobject> <_:caption-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The mouse pointer will also change shape when placed over a selected element"
" or over the element's 'grab handles'. When the pointer is placed over a "
"selected element, the mouse pointer will change to the 'move' shape, "
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"figures/pointer_four_way_arrow.png\"/> </imageobject> <textobject>"
" <phrase>An image of the move mouse pointer.</phrase> </textobject> "
"</inlinemediaobject>; when the pointer is placed over the element's 'grab "
"handles' it will change to one of the resizing mouse pointer shapes, which "
"are presented in <xref linkend=\"sect-gui-mouse\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Muspekaren ändrar också utseende när den placeras över ett markerat element "
"eller dess handtag. Över själva elementet blir pekaren en flyttmarkör, "
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"figures/pointer_four_way_arrow.png\"/> </imageobject> <textobject>"
" <phrase>En bild av muspekaren för flyttning.</phrase> </textobject> "
"</inlinemediaobject>. Över handtagen blir den en av storleksändringspekaren "
"som visas i <xref linkend=\"sect-gui-mouse\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Moving and Resizing Graphical Elements"
msgstr "Flytta och ändra storlek på grafiska element"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Graphical elements can be moved from their original location on the "
"worksheet or can be changed in size or shape. All of these operations first "
"require selecting the graphical element with the primary mouse button and "
"then using this mouse button and the mouse pointer to manipulate the "
"element."
msgstr ""
"Grafiska element kan flyttas från sin ursprungliga plats i kalkylbladet och "
"ändras i storlek eller form. Först måste du markera elementet med den "
"primära musknappen. Använd sedan musknappen och pekaren för att ändra det."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Moving elements with the mouse"
msgstr "Flytta element med musen"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Moving the graphical element can be performed by first selecting the "
"graphical element, then placing the mouse pointer over the element which "
"will change it to the 'move' mouse shape, <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> "
"<imagedata fileref=\"figures/pointer_four_way_arrow.png\"/> </imageobject> "
"<textobject> <phrase>An image of the move mouse pointer.</phrase> "
"</textobject> </inlinemediaobject>, clicking and holding the primary mouse "
"button and moving the mouse pointer to a new location. As the mouse is moved"
" with the primary mouse button held down, the graphical element will move "
"along with the mouse cursor. When the mouse button is released, the object "
"will stay in its new location."
msgstr ""
"Markera först det grafiska elementet och för sedan muspekaren över det. "
"Pekaren ändras då till en flyttmarkör, <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> "
"<imagedata fileref=\"figures/pointer_four_way_arrow.png\"/> </imageobject> "
"<textobject> <phrase>En bild av muspekaren för flyttning.</phrase> "
"</textobject> </inlinemediaobject>. Håll ned den primära musknappen och för "
"pekaren till den nya platsen. Elementet följer med medan du håller knappen "
"nedtryckt. När du släpper knappen stannar elementet på den nya platsen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Moving elements with the arrow keys"
msgstr "Flytta element med piltangenterna"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Once they are selected, graphical elements can be moved with the arrow keys "
"on the keyboard. The movement can be made in smaller increments if the "
"<keycap>Ctrl</keycap> key is held simultaneously."
msgstr ""
"När grafiska element är markerade kan du flytta dem med piltangenterna. Håll"
" samtidigt ned <keycap>Ctrl</keycap> om du vill flytta dem i mindre steg."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Resizing and reshaping elements"
msgstr "Ändra storlek och form på element"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Changing the size or shape of the graphical element can be performed by "
"selecting the graphical element, placing the mouse pointer over one of the "
"'grab handles' at the corners or edges of the rectangular box around the "
"element, which will cause the mouse pointer to change shape to one of the "
"resize pointers, clicking and holding with the primary mouse button, "
"dragging the corner or edge to a new position, and releasing the mouse "
"button. If one of the corner 'grab handles' is used, the graphical element "
"can be altered into any new rectangular shape and size. If one of the edge "
"handles is used, the element can only be reshaped perpendicular to the "
"chosen edge."
msgstr ""
"Markera elementet och för muspekaren till ett av handtagen vid hörnen eller "
"kanterna på rutan runt elementet. Pekaren ändras då till en "
"storleksändringspekare. Håll ned den primära musknappen, dra hörnet eller "
"kanten till den nya platsen och släpp knappen. Om du använder ett "
"hörnhandtag kan elementet ändras till valfri rektangulär form och storlek. "
"Med ett handtag på kanten kan du bara ändra formen vinkelrätt mot den "
"kanten."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Invoking the Context Menu for Graphical Elements"
msgstr "Öppna snabbmenyn för grafiska element"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Many operations on graphical elements, including changing their internal "
"properties, saving elements as images, modifying the stacking order of the "
"elements, and deleting the elements, are performed through the context menu."
" The context menu appears when the mouse pointer is placed over the "
"graphical element and one of the secondary mouse buttons is clicked. When "
"the mouse pointer moves over a graphical element, it will change from the "
"usual wide cross cursor to a right pointing arrow cursor. Clicking with the "
"primary mouse button will select the graphical element but clicking with one"
" of the other mouse buttons will open the context menu. The specific button "
"that will trigger this menu depends on the specific hardware and "
"configuration of the computer. By default it is usually the rightmost mouse "
"button."
msgstr ""
"Många åtgärder för grafiska element utförs via snabbmenyn, till exempel att "
"ändra elementets egenskaper, spara det som en bild, ändra lagerordningen och"
" ta bort det. Snabbmenyn öppnas när du placerar muspekaren över elementet "
"och klickar med en sekundär musknapp. När pekaren förs över ett grafiskt "
"element ändras den vanliga stora hårkorspekaren till en högerpekande pil. "
"Klicka med den primära musknappen för att markera elementet. Med en annan "
"musknapp öppnar du snabbmenyn. Vilken knapp som öppnar menyn beror på "
"datorns maskinvara och inställningar. Som standard är det oftast den högra "
"musknappen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The context menu for graphical elements."
msgstr "Snabbmenyn för grafiska element."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The context menu for graph elements is the most complete. It includes an "
"entry to modify the internal properties of the graph, an entry to save the "
"graph as an image, four entries to reorder the stacking of the graph in "
"front or behind other graphs and one entry to delete the graph."
msgstr ""
"Snabbmenyn för diagram är mest omfattande. Den innehåller ett alternativ för"
" att ändra diagrammets egenskaper, ett för att spara det som en bild, fyra "
"för att ändra dess lagerordning i förhållande till andra diagram och ett för"
" att ta bort det."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/menu-context-graph.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image of "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> showing the context menu of a graph "
"element. </phrase> </textobject> <_:caption-1/>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/menu-context-graph.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> med snabbmenyn för ett "
"diagramelement.</phrase> </textobject> <_:caption-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The context menu for graphical elements contains a sub-menu labelled "
"<guimenuitem>Order</guimenuitem> which allows the user to change the "
"presentation order for overlapping graphical objects."
msgstr ""
"Snabbmenyn för grafiska element innehåller undermenyn "
"<guimenuitem>Ordning</guimenuitem>, där du kan ändra visningsordningen för "
"överlappande grafiska objekt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The order submenu of graphical element context menus."
msgstr "Undermenyn Ordning i snabbmenyerna för grafiska element."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The order submenu of the context menu for graph elements allows the user to "
"change the stacking order for the various graphs on the worksheet. This will"
" affect which objects are visible in front of other objects when several "
"objects overlap."
msgstr ""
"Undermenyn Ordning i snabbmenyn för diagramelement låter dig ändra "
"diagrammens lagerordning i kalkylbladet. Det avgör vilka objekt som visas "
"framför andra när flera överlappar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Modifying Graphical Elements"
msgstr "Ändra grafiska element"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Many of the graphical elements have internal properties which can be "
"changed. This includes the contents of a particular graph, the association "
"of a widget and the contents of a spreadsheet cell, or the characteristics "
"of a drawing element. These properties can be altered using the "
"<guimenuitem>Properties...</guimenuitem> menu item in the context menu which"
" appears when the mouse pointer is placed over the graphical element and one"
" of the secondary mouse buttons is clicked. After the context menu appears, "
"clicking on this menu item will open up a dialog allowing the user to alter "
"the properties of the element. Since these properties are specific to each "
"element, these dialogs will be discussed in each of the sections below."
msgstr ""
"Många grafiska element har egenskaper som kan ändras. Det kan till exempel "
"vara innehållet i ett diagram, kopplingen mellan en gränssnittskomponent och"
" en cell eller egenskaperna hos ett teckningselement. Ändra egenskaperna med"
" menyalternativet <guimenuitem>Egenskaper...</guimenuitem> i snabbmenyn. "
"Öppna snabbmenyn genom att placera muspekaren över elementet och klicka med "
"en sekundär musknapp. När du klickar på menyalternativet öppnas en "
"dialogruta där du kan ändra elementets egenskaper. Eftersom egenskaperna "
"skiljer sig åt mellan olika element beskrivs dialogrutorna i avsnitten "
"nedan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Saving Graphical Elements as Images"
msgstr "Spara grafiska element som bilder"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Some of the graphical elements, the data graphs and the image elements, "
"provide an item in the context menu which allows the element to be saved to "
"a file containing only an image of that element. Graphical plots can be "
"saved in Scalable Vector Graphics (SVG), Portable Network Graphics (PNG) or "
"JPEG formats. Images can be saved to their original format, or to PNG and "
"JPEG formats."
msgstr ""
"Vissa grafiska element, diagram och bildelement, har ett alternativ i "
"snabbmenyn för att spara elementet som en bildfil. Diagram kan sparas i "
"formaten SVG, PNG eller JPEG. Bilder kan sparas i sitt ursprungliga format "
"eller som PNG eller JPEG."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Elements which can be saved as images can be output to a file using an entry"
" in the element's context menu. First the context menu must be invoked by "
"placing the mouse pointer over the graphical element and clicking with one "
"of the secondary mouse buttons. Next the <guimenuitem>Save as "
"Image</guimenuitem> or the <guimenuitem>Save as</guimenuitem> menu items "
"must be selected by placing the mouse pointer over that item and clicking "
"with the primary mouse pointer. This will open up the <interface>Save "
"As</interface> dialog which will allow the user to name the file which will "
"be created, select where the file will be created, select the file type to "
"use for the image and then generate the file."
msgstr ""
"Du kan spara element som bilder i en fil med ett alternativ i elementets "
"snabbmeny. Öppna snabbmenyn genom att placera muspekaren över det grafiska "
"elementet och klicka med en sekundär musknapp. Välj sedan <guimenuitem>Spara"
" som bild</guimenuitem> eller <guimenuitem>Spara som</guimenuitem> genom att"
" föra pekaren till alternativet och klicka med den primära musknappen. Då "
"öppnas dialogrutan <interface>Spara som</interface>. Där kan du ange filnamn"
" och plats, välja bildformat och skapa filen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Restacking Graphical Elements"
msgstr "Ändra lagerordning för grafiska element"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Graphical elements can overlap when they are placed over the cell grid area."
" Conceptually, each graphical element occupies one layer in a stack of all "
"the elements. By default, elements which have been created more recently "
"will overlap in front of elements which were created earlier."
msgstr ""
"Grafiska element kan överlappa när de placeras ovanpå cellrutnätet. Man kan "
"se varje element som ett lager i en hög. Som standard hamnar element som "
"skapats senare framför dem som skapats tidigare."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Stacked graphical elements."
msgstr "Grafiska element i lager."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/graphical-elements-stacked.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image of "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> showing stacked graphical element. "
"</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/graphical-elements-stacked.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> som visar grafiska element i "
"lager.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The order of each element in the stack can be changed using the four menu "
"items in the context menu. The <guimenuitem>Top</guimenuitem> will bring the"
" selected element in front of all the other objects. The "
"<guimenuitem>Up</guimenuitem> menu item will bring the selected element "
"forward one layer. Conversely, the <guimenuitem>Down</guimenuitem> menu item"
" will move the selected element one layer towards the back, and the "
"<guimenuitem>Bottom</guimenuitem> menu item will palace the selected element"
" at the very back of the stack of elements. Jointly, these menu items allow "
"the user to specify exactly which order in which the graphical elements "
"should appear."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ändra elementens ordning i högen med de fyra alternativen i "
"snabbmenyn. <guimenuitem>Överkant</guimenuitem> placerar det markerade "
"elementet framför alla andra objekt. <guimenuitem>Upp</guimenuitem> flyttar "
"det ett lager framåt. <guimenuitem>Ner</guimenuitem> flyttar det ett lager "
"bakåt, och <guimenuitem>Underkant</guimenuitem> placerar det längst bak i "
"högen. Tillsammans låter alternativen dig bestämma exakt i vilken ordning de"
" grafiska elementen visas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The stacking of graphical elements in <application>Gnumeric</application> is"
" currently not working correctly. Widget elements are always placed above "
"the other elements and do not honor the same ordering scheme as the rest of "
"the elements. A large amount of work will be required to fix this and a "
"decision has been made to ignore this problem until the developers have the "
"time to fix this problem correctly."
msgstr ""
"Lagerordningen för grafiska element i <application>Gnumeric</application> "
"fungerar för närvarande inte korrekt. Gränssnittskomponenter placeras alltid"
" ovanpå övriga element och följer inte samma ordning som de andra elementen."
" Det krävs mycket arbete för att rätta till detta, så problemet lämnas tills"
" utvecklarna har tid att åtgärda det ordentligt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Deleting Graphical Elements"
msgstr "Ta bort grafiska element"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"All of the graphical elements in <application>Gnumeric</application> can be "
"deleted using the context menu. Deleting a graphical element will never "
"alter the data contents of the cells in the workbooks."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ta bort alla grafiska element i <application>Gnumeric</application> "
"via snabbmenyn. När du tar bort ett grafiskt element påverkas inte data i "
"arbetsbokens celler."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Deleting a graphical element requires using the context menu. First the "
"mouse pointer must be placed over the graphical element. Next, the context "
"menu must be invoked by clicking with one of the secondary mouse buttons. "
"Finally, the <guimenuitem>Delete</guimenuitem> menu item must be selected by"
" placing the mouse pointer over this menu item and clicking with the primary"
" mouse button. When this menu item is selected, the graphical element will "
"disappear from the worksheet and will not be saved as part of the "
"spreadsheet file the next time the file is saved."
msgstr ""
"Du tar bort ett grafiskt element via snabbmenyn. För först muspekaren över "
"elementet och öppna snabbmenyn genom att klicka med en sekundär musknapp. "
"För sedan pekaren till menyalternativet <guimenuitem>Ta bort</guimenuitem> "
"och klicka med den primära musknappen. Elementet försvinner från "
"kalkylbladet och sparas inte i kalkylbladsfilen nästa gång du sparar den."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Images can be added, as floating graphical elements, to "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> worksheets. These images will be saved "
"as part of the file and therefore can be sent to others embedded within the "
"spreadsheet file."
msgstr ""
"Du kan lägga till bilder som flytande grafiska element i "
"<application>Gnumeric</application>-kalkylblad. Bilderna sparas i "
"kalkylbladsfilen och kan därför skickas till andra inbäddade i filen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Images in several file formats can be added, but the specific list depends "
"on the particular installation of the underlying software library, "
"<filename>gdk-pixbuf</filename>. By default, the ANI, BMP, GIF, ICO, JPEG, "
"PCX, PNG, PNM/PBM/PGM/PPM family, Sun raster (RAS), Targa (TGA), TIFF, WBMP,"
" XBM, XPM image formats are supported, but extensions to the library can "
"also support other formats such as the WMF Windows Metafile and SVG Scalable"
" Vector Graphics formats."
msgstr ""
"Du kan lägga till bilder i flera olika filformat. Vilka format som är "
"tillgängliga beror på installationen av programbiblioteket <filename>gdk-"
"pixbuf</filename>. Som standard stöds ANI, BMP, GIF, ICO, JPEG, PCX, PNG, "
"PNM/PBM/PGM/PPM, Sun raster (RAS), Targa (TGA), TIFF, WBMP, XBM och XPM. "
"Tillägg till biblioteket kan även ge stöd för andra format, till exempel WMF"
" (Windows Metafile) och SVG (Scalable Vector Graphics)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"A complete listing of the file formats supported by the local version of "
"<filename>gdk-pixbuf</filename> can be generated with the <_:screen-1/> "
"command-line application, if this is installed on the system."
msgstr ""
"Om <filename>gdk-pixbuf</filename> är installerat kan du skapa en "
"fullständig lista över de filformat som stöds av den lokala versionen med "
"kommandoradsprogrammet <_:screen-1/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Inserting Images"
msgstr "Infoga bilder"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Inserting an image is performed like inserting any other graphical element "
"using the menu entry to start the process, then selecting the file, and "
"finally using the mouse to place the image above the worksheet."
msgstr ""
"Du infogar en bild på samma sätt som andra grafiska element: börja med att "
"välja ett menyalternativ, välj sedan filen och placera till sist bilden "
"ovanför kalkylbladet med musen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Procedure to insert an image into a worksheet."
msgstr "Så här infogar du en bild i ett kalkylblad."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Select the <guimenuitem>\"Image\"</guimenuitem> menu item in the "
"<guimenu>\"Insert\"</guimenu> menu"
msgstr ""
"Välj menyalternativet <guimenuitem>\"Bild\"</guimenuitem> i menyn "
"<guimenu>\"Infoga\"</guimenu>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Inserting an image starts by selecting, in the <guimenu>Insert</guimenu> "
"menu, the <guimenuitem>Image</guimenuitem> menu item using the mouse cursor "
"and the primary mouse button. This will open a dialog in which the user can "
"select the file which contains the desired image."
msgstr ""
"Börja med att öppna menyn <guimenu>Infoga</guimenu> och välja "
"menyalternativet <guimenuitem>Bild</guimenuitem> med muspekaren och den "
"primära musknappen. Då öppnas en dialogruta där du kan välja filen som "
"innehåller bilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Select the file containing the image"
msgstr "Välj bildfilen"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"In the dialog which appears the user must select the file which contains the"
" desired image. The dialog will be specific to the particular operating "
"system platform but should provide a way to navigate the filesystem to pick "
"the folder that contains the file and have a way to select the file or type "
"its name. When these choices have been made, the dialog can be dismissed by "
"double clicking on the file or by clicking on the "
"<guibutton>Open</guibutton> button. This will dismiss the dialog and expose "
"the worksheet, with the mouse pointer now converted to a thin cross-hair."
msgstr ""
"Välj filen med bilden i dialogrutan som öppnas. Dialogrutan beror på "
"operativsystemet, men du ska kunna bläddra i filsystemet till mappen där "
"filen finns och välja filen eller skriva dess namn. När du har gjort det kan"
" du stänga dialogrutan genom att dubbelklicka på filen eller klicka på "
"knappen <guibutton>Öppna</guibutton>. Kalkylbladet visas då igen och "
"muspekaren ändras till ett tunt hårkors."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Place the image on the worksheet with the mouse pointer"
msgstr "Placera bilden i kalkylbladet med muspekaren"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The image, which will float like other graphical elements above the "
"worksheet, must be placed on the worksheet. The image can be placed with its"
" default size by moving the thin cross-hair pointer above the worksheet and "
"clicking with the primary mouse button. Alternatively, the image can be "
"placed and sized by selecting two of the resulting corners. This is done by "
"moving the thin cross-hair pointer over the worksheet, determining one "
"corner by clicking and holding the primary mouse button, dragging the "
"pointer to the opposite corner, and releasing the mouse button. The image "
"will then appear between the place where the primary mouse button was "
"pressed and the place the button was released."
msgstr ""
"Bilden flyter ovanför kalkylbladet, precis som andra grafiska element, och "
"måste placeras där. Om du vill använda bildens standardstorlek för du det "
"tunna hårkorset över kalkylbladet och klickar med den primära musknappen. Du"
" kan också bestämma bildens storlek genom att välja två hörn. För hårkorset "
"över kalkylbladet, klicka och håll ned den primära musknappen för att ange "
"det ena hörnet, dra pekaren till det motsatta hörnet och släpp musknappen. "
"Bilden placeras då mellan punkten där du tryckte ned musknappen och punkten "
"där du släppte den."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Saving Images to New Files"
msgstr "Spara bilder i nya filer"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Images in a <application>Gnumeric</application> worksheet can be saved to a "
"new, separate file. The image can be saved either in its original format or "
"in PNG or JPEG formats. The ability to save images to a new file is "
"especially useful when a spreadsheet file has been transferred to a computer"
" that does not have a copy of the original image."
msgstr ""
"Bilder i ett <application>Gnumeric</application>-kalkylblad kan sparas i en "
"ny, separat fil. Bilden kan sparas i originalformatet eller som PNG eller "
"JPEG. Det är särskilt användbart att kunna spara bilder i en ny fil när ett "
"kalkylblad har överförts till en dator som saknar originalbilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Images above a worksheet can be saved by accessing the context menu, "
"selecting the many entry and navigating the file saving dialog which "
"appears."
msgstr ""
"Du kan spara bilder som ligger ovanför kalkylbladet genom att öppna "
"snabbmenyn, välja menyalternativet för att spara bilden och sedan navigera i"
" dialogrutan som visas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Procedure to save a worksheet image."
msgstr "Så här sparar du en bild från kalkylbladet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Open the context menu"
msgstr "Öppna snabbmenyn"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The context menu is opened by placing the mouse cursor over the image and "
"clicking one of the secondary mouse buttons."
msgstr ""
"Öppna snabbmenyn genom att föra muspekaren över bilden och klicka med en "
"sekundär musknapp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Select the <guimenuitem>\"Save As\"</guimenuitem> menu item"
msgstr "Välj menyalternativet <guimenuitem>\"Spara som\"</guimenuitem>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Once the context menu appears, the mouse cursor can be moved over the menu. "
"As the cursor passes over each menu item, that item will be highlighted. "
"When the <guimenuitem>Save As</guimenuitem> menu item is highlighted, "
"clicking with the primary mouse button will select that entry, causing the "
"context menu to disappear and the <interface>Save As</interface> dialog to "
"appear."
msgstr ""
"När snabbmenyn visas kan du föra muspekaren över alternativen. Varje "
"alternativ markeras när pekaren passerar över det. När <guimenuitem>Spara "
"som</guimenuitem> är markerat väljer du det genom att klicka med den primära"
" musknappen. Snabbmenyn stängs och dialogrutan <interface>Spara "
"som</interface> öppnas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Select the file name and location"
msgstr "Välj filnamn och plats"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The <interface>Save As</interface> dialog which opens will depend on the "
"platform that the user is using but should be standard for that platform. "
"The dialog should allow a user to define a name for the file, to select the "
"folder (directory) in which a file will be saved, and to select the format "
"for the saved file. When all these selections have been made, the "
"<guibutton>Save</guibutton> can be pressed which will dismiss the dialog and"
" save the file."
msgstr ""
"Den öppnade dialogrutan <interface>Spara som</interface> beror på "
"operativsystemet, men följer dess vanliga utformning. Där kan du ange "
"filnamn, välja mappen (katalogen) där filen ska sparas och välja filformat. "
"När du har gjort dina val klickar du på <guibutton>Spara</guibutton>. "
"Dialogrutan stängs och filen sparas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Deleting Images"
msgstr "Ta bort bilder"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"An image element, floating above a worksheet, can be deleted from the "
"worksheet and from the <application>Gnumeric</application> file using the "
"context menu. The procedure for deleting all graphical elements is the same;"
" this procedure is explained in <xref linkend=\"sect-graphical-overview-"
"deleting\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ta bort en bild som flyter ovanför kalkylbladet från både "
"kalkylbladet och <application>Gnumeric</application>-filen via snabbmenyn. "
"Samma metod används för att ta bort alla grafiska element; den beskrivs i "
"<xref linkend=\"sect-graphical-overview-deleting\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "GUI Widgets"
msgstr "Gränssnittskomponenter"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"A <application>Gnumeric</application> worksheet can graphical user interface"
" (GUI) elements, commonly called 'widgets', which can be tied to the data "
"contents of worksheet cells. For example, users can add a slider widget "
"which, when the position of the slider moves, alters the numeric value in a "
"worksheet cell."
msgstr ""
"Ett kalkylblad i <application>Gnumeric</application> kan innehålla grafiska "
"gränssnittskomponenter som är kopplade till cellernas data. Du kan till "
"exempel lägga till ett skjutreglage som ändrar talvärdet i en cell när du "
"flyttar reglaget."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Widgets are currently experimental!"
msgstr "Gränssnittskomponenterna är fortfarande experimentella!"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The current implementation of these widgets is incomplete. Some of the "
"obvious configuration settings for these widgets do not exist and much of "
"the functionality that these widgets should exhibit has not been "
"implemented. Future versions of <application>Gnumeric</application> will "
"complete these widgets and make them functional."
msgstr ""
"Den nuvarande implementationen av gränssnittskomponenterna är ofullständig. "
"Vissa självklara inställningar saknas och mycket av den avsedda "
"funktionaliteten har ännu inte implementerats. Framtida versioner av "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> ska färdigställa komponenterna och göra "
"dem fullt användbara."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Widgets do not currently stack properly on the worksheet"
msgstr ""
"Gränssnittskomponenterna staplas för närvarande inte korrekt i kalkylbladet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Widgets currently stay above all the other graphical elements because they "
"use a different system to calculate their positions than the other graphical"
" elements do. This will also be fixed in future updates."
msgstr ""
"Gränssnittskomponenterna ligger alltid ovanför de andra grafiska elementen "
"eftersom deras positioner beräknas med ett annat system. Även detta kommer "
"att rättas i framtida uppdateringar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Each of these elements can be added by selecting the appropriate icon on the"
" object toolbar and using the thin cross-hair mouse pointer to place the "
"element on the worksheet by clicking or by click-dragging with the primary "
"mouse button. This process is explained in greater detail in <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-graphical-overview-adding\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan lägga till varje sådan komponent genom att välja motsvarande ikon i "
"objektverktygsfältet och placera den i kalkylbladet med det tunna hårkorset."
" Klicka eller klicka och dra med den primära musknappen. Processen beskrivs "
"utförligare i <xref linkend=\"sect-graphical-overview-adding\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Each of these elements can be configured using the context menu and its "
"<guimenuitem>Properties</guimenuitem> menu item, as explained in <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-graphical-overview-modifing\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan konfigurera varje komponent via snabbmenyns menyalternativ "
"<guimenuitem>Egenskaper</guimenuitem>, enligt beskrivningen i <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-graphical-overview-modifing\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Each of these elements can be moved and resized on the worksheet, as "
"explained in <xref linkend=\"sect-graphical-overview-moveNresize\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan flytta och ändra storlek på varje komponent i kalkylbladet, enligt "
"beskrivningen i <xref linkend=\"sect-graphical-overview-moveNresize\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The stacking order, from the front to the back, which determines which "
"widgets obscure each other, can be changed using the entries in the context "
"menu, as explained in <xref linkend=\"sect-graphical-overview-"
"restacking\"/>. However, as explained in the note above, the widgets do not "
"currently stack under the other graphical elements."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ändra komponenternas lagerordning, från främst till längst bak, med "
"alternativen i snabbmenyn. Lagerordningen avgör vilka komponenter som "
"skymmer varandra. Se <xref linkend=\"sect-graphical-overview-restacking\"/>."
" Som nämnts ovan placeras komponenterna dock för närvarande inte bakom andra"
" grafiska element."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Each of these elements can be deleted using the context menu and its "
"<guimenuitem>Delete</guimenuitem> menu item, as explained in <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-graphical-overview-deleting\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ta bort varje komponent via snabbmenyns menyalternativ "
"<guimenuitem>Ta bort</guimenuitem>, enligt beskrivningen i <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-graphical-overview-deleting\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Labels."
msgstr "Etiketter."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Labels are intended to be small text elements which can be added to the "
"worksheet. Since it is currently not possible to edit the text field, these "
"widgets are not currently usable. The properties of the border and "
"background of the widget can be changed but, because the word \"Label\" is "
"always present, the rectangle drawing element, presented in <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-graphics-drawings-rectangle\"/> will be more useful."
msgstr ""
"Etiketter är små textelement som kan läggas till i kalkylbladet. Eftersom "
"texten för närvarande inte går att redigera är de här komponenterna inte "
"användbara. Du kan ändra komponentens kantlinje och bakgrund, men eftersom "
"texten ”Etikett” alltid visas är det mer användbart att använda "
"rektangelverktyget som beskrivs i <xref linkend=\"sect-graphics-drawings-"
"rectangle\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "A label widget."
msgstr "En etikettkomponent."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/widget-label.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image of a label "
"widget. </phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/widget-label.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av en "
"etikettkomponent.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Configuring the properties of the label"
msgstr "Konfigurera etikettens egenskaper"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The properties of the label can be altered with the "
"<guimenuitem>Properties</guimenuitem> menu item in the context menu which "
"appears when the mouse cursor is placed over the label and one of the "
"secondary mouse buttons is pressed."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ändra etikettens egenskaper med menyalternativet "
"<guimenuitem>Egenskaper</guimenuitem> i snabbmenyn. Öppna menyn genom att "
"föra muspekaren över etiketten och trycka på en sekundär musknapp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The label outline color and width, as well as the background, \"fill\", "
"color can be changed."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ändra färg och bredd på etikettens kontur samt bakgrundens "
"fyllningsfärg."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The configuration dialog for label properties."
msgstr "Dialogrutan för etikettens egenskaper."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/dialog-properties-label.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image of the dialog"
" used to configure checkbox widget elements. </phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/dialog-properties-label.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av dialogrutan "
"för att konfigurera etikettkomponenter.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Frames."
msgstr "Ramar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Frames are intended to be transparent boxes with a title that can be placed "
"around part of the worksheet to highlight that area. Because the format of "
"the border of these widgets cannot be altered, they are less visible than "
"they could be. A similar frame, without the title, can be made with the "
"rectangle drawing element, which is presented in <xref linkend=\"sect-"
"graphics-drawings-rectangle\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Ramar är genomskinliga rutor med en rubrik som kan placeras runt en del av "
"kalkylbladet för att framhäva området. Eftersom det inte går att ändra "
"utseendet på ramens kantlinje syns den sämre än den skulle kunna göra. Du "
"kan skapa en liknande ram utan rubrik med rektangelverktyget som beskrivs i "
"<xref linkend=\"sect-graphics-drawings-rectangle\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "A frame widget."
msgstr "En ramkomponent."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/widget-frame.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image of a frame "
"widget. </phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/widget-frame.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av en "
"ramkomponent.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Configuring the properties of the checkbox"
msgstr "Konfigurera komponentens egenskaper"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The properties of the frame can be altered with the "
"<guimenuitem>Properties</guimenuitem> menu item in the context menu which "
"appears when the mouse cursor is placed over the frame and one of the "
"secondary mouse buttons is pressed."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ändra ramens egenskaper med menyalternativet "
"<guimenuitem>Egenskaper</guimenuitem> i snabbmenyn. Öppna menyn genom att "
"föra muspekaren över ramen och trycka på en sekundär musknapp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Currently, only the word that appears in the frame can be altered."
msgstr "För närvarande går det bara att ändra texten som visas i ramen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The configuration dialog for frame properties."
msgstr "Dialogrutan för ramegenskaper."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/dialog-properties-frame.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image of the dialog"
" used to configure frame widget elements. </phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/dialog-properties-frame.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av dialogrutan "
"för att konfigurera ramkomponenter.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The word displayed in the frame can be altered by typing new text in the "
"textbox next to the word \"Label\"."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ändra texten som visas i ramen genom att skriva ny text i textrutan "
"bredvid ordet ”Etikett”."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Checkboxes."
msgstr "Kryssrutor."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Checkboxes are widgets which allow a user to visually see the state of an "
"entity, whether it is checked or not, and tie this state to the truth value "
"of a Boolean cell, \"TRUE\" if the checkbox is checked and \"FALSE\" the "
"checkbox is not. The check box can be used to alter the value of a cell, "
"which will alter any other cells whose values are computed based on the "
"dependent cell. This provides a simple way to alter a whole series of "
"computations."
msgstr ""
"Kryssrutor är gränssnittskomponenter som visar om ett objekt är markerat och"
" kopplar detta till det logiska värdet i en boolesk cell: ”TRUE” om rutan är"
" markerad och ”FALSE” om den inte är det. Du kan använda kryssrutan för att "
"ändra cellens värde, vilket i sin tur påverkar andra celler vars värden "
"beräknas utifrån den. På så sätt kan du enkelt ändra en hel serie "
"beräkningar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "A checkbox widget."
msgstr "En kryssruta."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/widget-checkbox.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image of a checkbox"
" widget. </phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/widget-checkbox.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av en "
"kryssruta.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The properties of the checkbox can be altered with the "
"<guimenuitem>Properties</guimenuitem> menu item in the context menu which "
"appears when the mouse cursor is placed over the checkbox and one of the "
"secondary mouse buttons is pressed."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ändra kryssrutans egenskaper med menyalternativet "
"<guimenuitem>Egenskaper</guimenuitem> i snabbmenyn. Öppna menyn genom att "
"föra muspekaren över kryssrutan och trycka på en sekundär musknapp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Checkboxes have two properties which can be configured: the worksheet cell "
"whose value will be altered by clicking in the checkbox and the text "
"displayed on the checkbox."
msgstr ""
"Kryssrutor har två inställningar: cellen i kalkylbladet vars värde ändras "
"när du klickar på rutan och texten som visas bredvid den."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The configuration dialog for checkbox properties."
msgstr "Dialogrutan för kryssrutans egenskaper."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/dialog-properties-checkbox.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image of the dialog"
" used to configure checkbox widget elements. </phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/dialog-properties-checkbox.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av dialogrutan "
"för att konfigurera kryssrutor.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The \"Link to:\" field allows the user to select a cell that will be changed"
" in response to changes in the state of the widget. A user can type the name"
" of a cell in the text box or may click in the text box to activate it and "
"then click on the worksheet to select the desired cell and "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> will automatically add a reference to "
"the cell."
msgstr ""
"I fältet ”Länka till:” väljer du en cell vars värde ska ändras när "
"komponentens tillstånd ändras. Skriv cellens namn i textrutan eller klicka i"
" den och välj sedan cellen i kalkylbladet. "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> lägger då automatiskt till en referens "
"till cellen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The \"Label\" field accepts a text value which will appear next to the "
"checkbox. This text can indicate what the checkbox field alters, for "
"instance in <xref linkend=\"fig-gnumeric-graphics-widgets-checkbox-"
"example\"/> the checkbox could be used to alter a series of calculations, "
"between including interest or excluding it, from the computation."
msgstr ""
"I fältet ”Etikett” skriver du texten som ska visas bredvid kryssrutan. "
"Texten kan ange vad rutan ändrar. I <xref linkend=\"fig-gnumeric-graphics-"
"widgets-checkbox-example\"/> kan kryssrutan till exempel styra om en serie "
"beräkningar ska inkludera ränta eller inte."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Scrollbars."
msgstr "Rullningslister."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Scrollbars are widgets that allow the changing of a numeric value by click-"
"dragging with the mouse."
msgstr ""
"Rullningslister är gränssnittskomponenter där du kan ändra ett talvärde "
"genom att klicka och dra med musen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "A scrollbar widget."
msgstr "En rullningslist."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/widget-scrollbar.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image of a "
"scrollbar widget. </phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/widget-scrollbar.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av en "
"rullningslist.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The scrollbar widget can be used in three ways: by dragging the 'thumb', by "
"clicking on the arrows, or by clicking in the 'channel'. The 'thumb' is the "
"small rectangular element between the two arrow buttons. The 'thumb' can be "
"dragged by placing the mouse pointer over the thumb, clicking and holding "
"with the primary mouse button and then dragging the mouse pointer up or "
"down. Clicking on the arrow buttons will scroll the thumb in the direction "
"of the arrow. The 'channel' is the area between the arrows that is not the "
"'thumb'. A mouse click with the primary mouse button when the mouse pointer "
"is over the 'channel' will cause the scrollbar to move a 'page'. The motion "
"of the 'thumb' will cause a numeric value to change based on the "
"configuration of the widget, as is explained below."
msgstr ""
"Du kan använda rullningslisten på tre sätt: dra handtaget, klicka på pilarna"
" eller klicka i spåret. Handtaget är den lilla rektangeln mellan de två "
"pilknapparna. Dra handtaget genom att placera muspekaren över det, hålla ned"
" den primära musknappen och dra pekaren uppåt eller nedåt. Om du klickar på "
"en pilknapp flyttas handtaget i pilens riktning. Spåret är området mellan "
"pilarna, utanför handtaget. Om du klickar i spåret med den primära "
"musknappen flyttas rullningslisten en sida. När handtaget flyttas ändras ett"
" talvärde enligt komponentens inställningar, som beskrivs nedan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Configuring the properties of the scrollbar"
msgstr "Konfigurera rullningslistens egenskaper"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The properties of the scrollbar can be altered with the "
"<guimenuitem>Properties</guimenuitem> menu item in the context menu which "
"appears when the mouse cursor is placed over the scrollbar and one of the "
"secondary mouse buttons is pressed."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ändra rullningslistens egenskaper med menyalternativet "
"<guimenuitem>Egenskaper</guimenuitem> i snabbmenyn. Öppna menyn genom att "
"föra muspekaren över rullningslisten och trycka på en sekundär musknapp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Scrollbars have five properties which can be configured: the worksheet cell "
"whose value will be altered by movement of the scrollbar 'thumb', the "
"minimum value when the thumb is at the top of its channel, the maximum value"
" reached when the thumb is at the bottom of its channel, the smallest "
"increment of change which is the change caused by clicking on the arrows, "
"and the page increment which is the change which occurs when the channel is "
"clicked."
msgstr ""
"Du kan konfigurera fem egenskaper för rullningslisten: cellen vars värde ska"
" ändras när handtaget flyttas, det lägsta värdet när handtaget är högst upp "
"i spåret, det högsta värdet när det är längst ned, det minsta ändringssteget"
" som används när du klickar på pilarna och hur mycket värdet ändras när du "
"klickar i spåret."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The configuration dialog for scrollbar properties."
msgstr "Dialogrutan för rullningslistens egenskaper."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/dialog-properties-scrollbar.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image of the "
"dialog used to configure scrollbar widget elements. </phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/dialog-properties-scrollbar.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av dialogrutan"
" för att konfigurera rullningslisten.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The other properties can be changed either by typing a new number into the "
"text box or by using the up and down arrows to increment or decrement the "
"width number."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ändra de övriga egenskaperna genom att skriva ett nytt tal i "
"textrutan eller använda uppåt- och nedåtpilarna för att öka eller minska "
"värdet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Spinbuttons."
msgstr "Stegningsrutor."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Spinbuttons, like sliders, are widgets that allow a user to change the "
"numeric value in the cell by interacting with a widget. The value of "
"spinbuttons can be changed either by typing a new number into the text box "
"or by clicking on the arrow buttons. If the buttons are clicked and held, "
"the numeric value will spin, incrementing or decrementing depending on the "
"arrow being held."
msgstr ""
"Stegningsrutor fungerar ungefär som skjutreglage: de låter dig ändra en "
"cells talvärde med en gränssnittskomponent. Du kan ändra värdet genom att "
"skriva ett nytt tal i textrutan eller klicka på pilknapparna. Om du håller "
"en knapp nedtryckt ökar eller minskar värdet kontinuerligt, beroende på "
"vilken pil du håller ned."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "A spinbutton widget."
msgstr "En stegningsruta."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/widget-spinbutton.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image of a "
"spinbutton widget. </phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/widget-spinbutton.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av en "
"stegningsruta.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Configuring the properties of the spinbutton"
msgstr "Konfigurera stegningsrutans egenskaper"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The properties of the spinbutton can be altered with the "
"<guimenuitem>Properties</guimenuitem> menu item in the context menu which "
"appears when the mouse cursor is placed over the spinbutton and one of the "
"secondary mouse buttons is pressed."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ändra stegningsrutans egenskaper med menyalternativet "
"<guimenuitem>Egenskaper</guimenuitem> i snabbmenyn. Öppna menyn genom att "
"föra muspekaren över stegningsrutan och trycka på en sekundär musknapp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Spinbuttons have five properties which can be configured: the worksheet cell"
" whose value will be altered by the spinbutton, the minimum value when the "
"thumb is at the top of its channel, the maximum value reached when the thumb"
" is at the bottom of its channel, the smallest increment of change which is "
"the change caused by clicking on the arrows, and the page increment which is"
" the change which occurs when the channel is clicked."
msgstr ""
"Du kan konfigurera fem egenskaper för stegningsrutan: cellen vars värde ska "
"ändras, minimivärdet när handtaget är högst upp i spåret, maximivärdet när "
"handtaget är längst ned, det minsta ändringssteget som används när du "
"klickar på pilarna och ändringssteget som används när du klickar i spåret."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The configuration dialog for spinbutton properties."
msgstr "Dialogrutan för stegningsrutans egenskaper."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/dialog-properties-scrollbar.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image of the "
"dialog used to configure spinbutton widget elements. </phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/dialog-properties-scrollbar.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av dialogrutan"
" för att konfigurera stegningsrutan.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Sliders."
msgstr "Skjutreglage."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Sliders, like scrollbars and spinbuttons, allow a cell value to be changed "
"based on user interaction with a widget on the screen."
msgstr ""
"Skjutreglage fungerar som rullningslister och stegningsrutor: de låter dig "
"ändra cellvärden genom att använda en gränssnittskomponent på skärmen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "A slider widget."
msgstr "Ett skjutreglage."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/widget-slider.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image of a slider "
"widget. </phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/widget-slider.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av ett "
"skjutreglage.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The slider widget can be used in two ways: by dragging the 'thumb' or by "
"clicking in the 'channel'. The 'thumb' is the small rectangular element "
"between the two arrow buttons. The 'thumb' can be dragged by placing the "
"mouse pointer over the thumb, clicking and holding with the primary mouse "
"button and then dragging the mouse pointer up or down. The 'channel' is the "
"area between the arrows that is not the 'thumb'. A mouse click with the "
"primary mouse button when the mouse pointer is over the 'channel' will cause"
" the scrollbar to move a 'page'. The motion of the 'thumb' will cause a "
"numeric value to change based on the configuration of the widget, as is "
"explained below."
msgstr ""
"Du kan använda skjutreglaget på två sätt: dra handtaget eller klicka i "
"spåret. Handtaget är den lilla rektangeln mellan de två pilknapparna. Dra "
"handtaget genom att placera muspekaren över det, hålla ned den primära "
"musknappen och dra pekaren uppåt eller nedåt. Spåret är området mellan "
"pilarna, utanför handtaget. Om du klickar i spåret med den primära "
"musknappen flyttas rullningslisten en sida. När handtaget flyttas ändras ett"
" talvärde enligt komponentens inställningar, som beskrivs nedan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Configuring the properties of the slider"
msgstr "Konfigurera skjutreglagets egenskaper"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The properties of the slider can be altered with the "
"<guimenuitem>Properties</guimenuitem> menu item in the context menu which "
"appears when the mouse cursor is placed over the slider and one of the "
"secondary mouse buttons is pressed."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ändra skjutreglagets egenskaper med menyalternativet "
"<guimenuitem>Egenskaper</guimenuitem> i snabbmenyn. Öppna menyn genom att "
"föra muspekaren över skjutreglaget och trycka på en sekundär musknapp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Sliders have five properties which can be configured: the worksheet cell "
"whose value will be altered by movement of the scrollbar 'thumb', the "
"minimum value when the thumb is at the top of its channel, the maximum value"
" reached when the thumb is at the bottom of its channel, the smallest "
"increment of change, and the page increment which is the change which occurs"
" when the channel is clicked."
msgstr ""
"Du kan konfigurera fem egenskaper för skjutreglaget: cellen vars värde ska "
"ändras när handtaget flyttas, minimivärdet när handtaget är högst upp i "
"spåret, maximivärdet när det är längst ned, det minsta ändringssteget och "
"ändringssteget som används när du klickar i spåret."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The configuration dialog for slider properties."
msgstr "Dialogrutan för skjutreglagets egenskaper."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/dialog-properties-scrollbar.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image of the "
"dialog used to configure slider widget elements. </phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/dialog-properties-scrollbar.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av dialogrutan"
" för att konfigurera skjutreglaget.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Lists."
msgstr "Listor."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"List widget elements are currently unusable because they cannot be "
"configured."
msgstr ""
"Listkomponenterna kan för närvarande inte användas eftersom de inte går att "
"konfigurera."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "A list widget."
msgstr "En listkomponent."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/widget-list.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image of a list "
"widget. </phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/widget-list.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av en "
"listkomponent.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Combination Boxes."
msgstr "Kombinationsrutor."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Combination box widgets are currently unusable because they cannot be "
"configured."
msgstr ""
"Kombinationsrutorna kan för närvarande inte användas eftersom de inte går "
"att konfigurera."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "A combination box widget."
msgstr "En kombinationsruta."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/widget-combobox.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image of a "
"combination box widget. </phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/widget-combobox.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av en "
"kombinationsruta.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Drawing Elements"
msgstr "Ritobjekt"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"A <application>Gnumeric</application> worksheet can contain graphical "
"elements which are simple drawing shapes."
msgstr ""
"Ett kalkylblad i <application>Gnumeric</application> kan innehålla grafiska "
"element i form av enkla ritobjekt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"This implementation of the drawing objects is temporary and will eventually "
"be replaced by a more complete implementation including more types of "
"drawing objects and based on scalable vector graphics (SVG) format graphical"
" elements."
msgstr ""
"Den nuvarande implementationen av ritobjekten är tillfällig. Den kommer så "
"småningom att ersättas av en mer komplett lösning med fler typer av "
"ritobjekt och grafik i formatet skalbar vektorgrafik (SVG)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Drawing Lines."
msgstr "Rita linjer."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Lines are simple drawing elements which can be added to a worksheet. <xref "
"linkend=\"fig-gnumeric-graphics-drawings-line-example\"/> shows a wide "
"orange line element placed above the worksheet grid."
msgstr ""
"Linjer är enkla ritobjekt som kan läggas till i ett kalkylblad. <xref "
"linkend=\"fig-gnumeric-graphics-drawings-line-example\"/> visar en bred "
"orange linje ovanpå kalkylbladets rutnät."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "A line drawing element."
msgstr "Ett linjeobjekt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/drawing-line.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image of a line "
"drawing element. </phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/drawing-line.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av ett "
"linjeobjekt.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Configuring the properties of the line"
msgstr "Konfigurera linjens egenskaper"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The properties of the line can be altered with the "
"<guimenuitem>Properties</guimenuitem> menu item in the context menu which "
"appears when the mouse cursor is placed over the line and one of the "
"secondary mouse buttons is pressed."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ändra linjens egenskaper med menyalternativet "
"<guimenuitem>Egenskaper</guimenuitem> i snabbmenyn. Öppna menyn genom att "
"föra muspekaren över linjen och trycka på en sekundär musknapp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Lines have two properties, the color used for the line and the width of the "
"line."
msgstr "Du kan ändra två egenskaper för linjen: färg och bredd."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The configuration dialog for line properties."
msgstr "Dialogrutan för linjens egenskaper."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/dialog-properties-line.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image of the dialog"
" used to configure line drawing elements. </phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/dialog-properties-line.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av dialogrutan "
"för att konfigurera linjeobjekt.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The color of the line can be altered by moving the mouse pointer over the "
"button with the icon of a small, black, downward pointing arrow and then "
"clicking with the primary mouse button. This will open up a panel with a "
"number of standard colors presented as small squares. Any of these colors "
"can be selected by moving the mouse pointer over the desired color and "
"pressing once with the primary mouse button. Alternatively, a custom color "
"can be chosen by clicking on the button at the bottom of the panel. This "
"will open up the color chooser dialog. In this dialog colors can be defined "
"using the numeric boxes or can be selected using the color triangle. The "
"color can be selected by Clicking on the outer circle while the darkness or "
"lightness can be selected by clicking inside the triangle. Once the desired "
"color has been configured, this color can be used for the label outline by "
"clicking on the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ändra linjens färg genom att föra muspekaren till knappen med en "
"liten svart nedåtpil och klicka med den primära musknappen. Då öppnas en "
"panel med standardfärger som små rutor. Välj en av färgerna genom att föra "
"pekaren till den och klicka en gång med den primära musknappen. Du kan också"
" välja en egen färg med knappen längst ned i panelen. Då öppnas "
"färgväljaren, där du kan ange färgen med sifferfälten eller välja den i "
"färgtriangeln. Välj nyans i den yttre cirkeln och ljushet eller mörkhet i "
"triangeln. När du har ställt in färgen klickar du på "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton> för att använda den på linjen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The line width can be changed either by typing a new number into the text "
"box or by using the up and down arrows to increment or decrement the width "
"number."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ändra linjens bredd genom att skriva ett nytt tal i textrutan eller "
"använda uppåt- och nedåtpilarna för att öka eller minska värdet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Drawing Arrows."
msgstr "Rita pilar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Arrows are elements that can be used to point to values in a worksheet. "
"<xref linkend=\"fig-gnumeric-graphics-drawings-arrow-example\"/> shows a "
"purple arrow floating over a worksheet"
msgstr ""
"Pilar kan användas för att peka ut värden i ett kalkylblad. <xref "
"linkend=\"fig-gnumeric-graphics-drawings-arrow-example\"/> visar en lila pil"
" ovanför ett kalkylblad"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "An arrow drawing element."
msgstr "Ett pilobjekt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/drawing-arrow.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image of an arrow "
"drawing element. </phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/drawing-arrow.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av ett "
"pilobjekt.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Configuring the properties of the arrow"
msgstr "Konfigurera pilens egenskaper"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The properties of the arrow can be altered with the "
"<guimenuitem>Properties</guimenuitem> menu item in the context menu which "
"appears when the mouse cursor is placed over the arrow and one of the "
"secondary mouse buttons is pressed."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ändra pilens egenskaper med menyalternativet "
"<guimenuitem>Egenskaper</guimenuitem> i snabbmenyn. Öppna menyn genom att "
"föra muspekaren över pilen och trycka på en sekundär musknapp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Arrows have five properties, the arrow color, the width of the line stem of "
"the arrow, and tree dimensions for the arrow point which will be explained "
"below."
msgstr ""
"Pilen har fem egenskaper: färg, skaftets bredd och tre mått för pilspetsen, "
"som beskrivs nedan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The configuration dialog for arrow properties."
msgstr "Dialogrutan för pilens egenskaper."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/dialog-properties-arrow.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image of the dialog"
" used to configure arrow drawing elements. </phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/dialog-properties-arrow.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av dialogrutan "
"för att konfigurera pilobjekt.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The dimensions of related to the arrow are presented in <xref linkend=\"fig-"
"gnumeric-graphics-drawing-arrow-dimensions\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Pilens mått visas i <xref linkend=\"fig-gnumeric-graphics-drawing-arrow-"
"dimensions\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The dimensions of the arrow point."
msgstr "Pilspetsens mått."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/arrowhead-dimensions.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image describing "
"the dimensions of the arrow head. </phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/arrowhead-dimensions.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild som visar "
"pilspetsens mått.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The 'Arrow Tip' is the distance from the point of the arrow to the base of "
"the arrowhead where the shaft begins. The 'Arrow Length' is the distance "
"from the arrow point to either of the outer side points of the arrow head, "
"projected along the shaft of the arrow. The 'Arrow Width' is the distance "
"between the two outer side points of the arrow head."
msgstr ""
"”Pilspets” är avståndet från pilens spets till pilhuvudets bas, där skaftet "
"börjar. ”Pillängd” är avståndet från pilspetsen till någon av pilhuvudets "
"yttre sidopunkter, mätt längs skaftet. ”Pilbredd” är avståndet mellan "
"pilhuvudets två yttre sidopunkter."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Drawing Rectangles."
msgstr "Rita rektanglar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Rectangles are areal drawing elements. <xref linkend=\"fig-gnumeric-"
"graphics-drawings-rectangle-example\"/> shows a yellow rectangle with a blue"
" border."
msgstr ""
"Rektanglar är ytfigurer. <xref linkend=\"fig-gnumeric-graphics-drawings-"
"rectangle-example\"/> visar en gul rektangel med blå kantlinje."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Rectangles have three properties which can be configured, the color and "
"width of the border and the color of the interior of the rectangle."
msgstr ""
"Du kan konfigurera tre egenskaper för rektangeln: kantlinjens färg och bredd"
" samt rektangelns fyllningsfärg."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "A rectangle drawing element."
msgstr "En rektangel."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/drawing-rectangle.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image of a "
"rectangle drawing element. </phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/drawing-rectangle.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av en "
"rektangel.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Configuring the properties of the rectangle"
msgstr "Konfigurera rektangelns egenskaper"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The properties of the rectangle can be altered with the "
"<guimenuitem>Properties</guimenuitem> menu item in the context menu which "
"appears when the mouse cursor is placed over the rectangle and one of the "
"secondary mouse buttons is pressed."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ändra rektangelns egenskaper med menyalternativet "
"<guimenuitem>Egenskaper</guimenuitem> i snabbmenyn. Öppna menyn genom att "
"föra muspekaren över rektangeln och trycka på en sekundär musknapp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The configuration dialog for rectangle properties."
msgstr "Dialogrutan för rektangelns egenskaper."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/dialog-properties-rectangle.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image of the "
"dialog used to configure rectangle drawing elements. </phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/dialog-properties-rectangle.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av dialogrutan"
" för att konfigurera rektanglar.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The color of the outline border can be configured by selecting a new color "
"from the color picker as was explained in <xref linkend=\"sect-graphics-"
"drawings-line\"/> for the line drawing element. The width of the border can "
"be configured by typing a new dimension in the text box or by clicking on "
"the increment arrows, up to increase the width and down to decrease the "
"width. The color of the interior of the rectangle, the 'fill' color, can be "
"configured in the same way as the color of the outline border."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ändra kantlinjens färg med färgväljaren, enligt beskrivningen för "
"linjeobjektet i <xref linkend=\"sect-graphics-drawings-line\"/>. Ändra "
"kantlinjens bredd genom att skriva ett nytt mått i textrutan eller klicka på"
" pilarna: uppåt ökar bredden och nedåt minskar den. Rektangelns "
"fyllningsfärg ändras på samma sätt som kantlinjens färg."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Drawing Ovals."
msgstr "Rita ovaler."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Ovals are areal drawing elements. <xref linkend=\"fig-gnumeric-graphics-"
"drawings-ovals-example\"/> shows a red oval with a transparent background, "
"which is a useful way to circle important ranges in a workbook."
msgstr ""
"Ovaler är ytfigurer. <xref linkend=\"fig-gnumeric-graphics-drawings-ovals-"
"example\"/> visar en röd oval med genomskinlig bakgrund. Sådana ovaler är "
"användbara för att ringa in viktiga cellområden i en arbetsbok."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Ovals, like rectangles, can be configured in the color and width of the "
"outline border, and the color of the fill."
msgstr ""
"Precis som för rektanglar kan du ändra ovalens kantlinjefärg och bredd samt "
"fyllningsfärg."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "An oval drawing element."
msgstr "En oval."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/drawing-oval.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image of an oval "
"drawing element. </phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/drawing-oval.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av en "
"oval.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Configuring the properties of the oval"
msgstr "Konfigurera ovalens egenskaper"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The properties of the oval can be altered with the "
"<guimenuitem>Properties</guimenuitem> menu item in the context menu which "
"appears when the mouse cursor is placed over the oval and one of the "
"secondary mouse buttons is pressed."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ändra ovalens egenskaper med menyalternativet "
"<guimenuitem>Egenskaper</guimenuitem> i snabbmenyn. Öppna menyn genom att "
"föra muspekaren över ovalen och trycka på en sekundär musknapp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The configuration dialog for oval properties."
msgstr "Dialogrutan för ovalens egenskaper."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/dialog-properties-oval.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image of the dialog"
" used to configure oval drawing elements. </phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/dialog-properties-oval.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av dialogrutan "
"för att konfigurera ovaler.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The configuration of these properties is the same as the configuration of "
"the rectangle properties explained above."
msgstr ""
"Dessa egenskaper konfigureras på samma sätt som rektangelns egenskaper ovan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> includes a powerful mechanism to create "
"graphical charts which present visually the data contained in a worksheet."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> har kraftfulla verktyg för att skapa "
"diagram som visar kalkylbladets data visuellt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The first section of this chapter starts with an overview of graph creation,"
" discusses terminology, and presents graph components and their "
"organization. The next section explains the <interface>\"Chart "
"Guru\"</interface> which is the tool used to configure graphs. The "
"subsequent section presents the different types of plots which can be "
"included in a graph and the final section explains how data can be pre-"
"selected to speed up the process of graph creation."
msgstr ""
"Det första avsnittet i kapitlet ger en översikt över hur du skapar grafer, "
"förklarar terminologin och beskriver grafens delar och hur de är "
"organiserade. Nästa avsnitt beskriver "
"<interface>”Diagramguiden”</interface>, verktyget för att konfigurera "
"grafer. Därefter presenteras de olika rittyper som kan ingå i en graf. Det "
"sista avsnittet förklarar hur du kan markera data i förväg för att snabba "
"upp arbetet med att skapa grafer."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Charts are exceedingly effective communication devices. Unfortunately, this "
"means that one cannot determine, simply based on the data to be plotted, "
"what type of plot will be the most effective. Instead users must familiarize"
" themselves with the various types of plots which are available and decide "
"for themselves which plot type is the most effective to communicate an idea."
" <xref linkend=\"sect-graphs-overview\"/> contains a detailed explanation of"
" the plot types available in <application>Gnumeric</application>."
msgstr ""
"Diagram är ett mycket effektivt sätt att förmedla information. Därför går "
"det inte att avgöra enbart utifrån data vilken rittyp som fungerar bäst. Du "
"behöver bekanta dig med de tillgängliga typerna och själv avgöra vilken som "
"tydligast förmedlar budskapet. <xref linkend=\"sect-graphs-overview\"/> "
"beskriver rittyperna i <application>Gnumeric</application> närmare."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "This chapter explains how to add graphs to plot worksheet data."
msgstr ""
"Det här kapitlet beskriver hur du skapar grafer av data i ett kalkylblad."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Overview of Graphs"
msgstr "Översikt över grafer"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"This overview will start with a brief summary of the process involved in "
"creating a graph, then will discuss the terminology used in this document, "
"will present the components of a graph, and present the hierarchy of the "
"components used in to configure the graphs."
msgstr ""
"Översikten börjar med en kort sammanfattning av hur du skapar en graf. "
"Därefter förklaras terminologin i dokumentet, grafens delar och hierarkin "
"som används när du konfigurerar den."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The Graph Creation Process"
msgstr "Skapa en graf"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The process of graph creation involves several steps each of which requires "
"the user to understand clearly what they intend to do. This outline is "
"presented to help users understand the subsequent discussion in this "
"document."
msgstr ""
"När du skapar en graf går du igenom flera steg. För varje steg behöver du "
"veta vad du vill åstadkomma. Följande översikt hjälper dig att förstå resten"
" av dokumentet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Outline of the procedure to create a graph."
msgstr "Översikt över hur du skapar en graf."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Data entry."
msgstr "Ange data."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Before a graph can be created, the data must be entered into a workbook."
msgstr "Innan du skapar ett diagram måste du ange data i en arbetsbok."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "(Optional) Data pre-selection."
msgstr "(Valfritt) Markera data i förväg."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"As explained in <xref linkend=\"sect-graphs-preselect\"/>, it is possible to"
" pre-select the data and have <application>Gnumeric</application> correctly "
"assign the cell contents into series names, category labels and data values."
" This process can only be understood once the rest of the graph creation "
"process has been mastered so the discussion of pre-selecting data is left "
"until the end of this section."
msgstr ""
"Som beskrivs i <xref linkend=\"sect-graphs-preselect\"/> kan du markera data"
" i förväg. Då tilldelar <application>Gnumeric</application> cellinnehållet "
"korrekt till serienamn, kategorietiketter och datavärden. Det är lättare att"
" förstå detta när du behärskar de övriga stegen i diagramarbetet, så "
"avsnittet om förhandsmarkering kommer sist."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Opening the graph guru"
msgstr "Öppna diagramguiden"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The <interface>Graph Guru</interface> can be opened in two ways. It can be "
"opened by clicking on the <guibutton>Graph Guru</guibutton> button, "
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/button-"
"graph.png\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the toolbar "
"graph guru button.</phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject>, which is on "
"the standard toolbar immediately to the left of the zoom box. Alternatively "
"the <interface>Graph Guru</interface> can be opened by using, in the "
"<guimenu>Insert</guimenu> menu, the <guimenuitem>Chart</guimenuitem> menu "
"item."
msgstr ""
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface> kan öppnas på två sätt. Klicka på "
"knappen <guibutton>Diagramguiden</guibutton> <inlinemediaobject> "
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/button-graph.png\"/> "
"</imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Bild av knappen för diagramguiden i "
"verktygsfältet.</phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject>, som finns i "
"standardverktygsfältet direkt till vänster om zoomrutan. Du kan också öppna "
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface> genom att öppna menyn "
"<guimenu>Infoga</guimenu> och välja menyalternativet "
"<guimenuitem>Diagram</guimenuitem>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Configuring the graph"
msgstr "Konfigurera diagrammet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The <interface>Graph Guru</interface> provides the user with a large number "
"of options to configure the graph, its charts and the plots. The first panel"
" provides a way to select the plot type, sub-type and, for some types, a "
"style. The second panel allows the user to configure each element of the "
"graph. When the configuration is complete, the guru is dismissed by clicking"
" the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button. This step will be explained in detail"
" in <xref linkend=\"sect-graphs-graphguru-navigating\"/>, below."
msgstr ""
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface> har många alternativ för att "
"konfigurera diagrammet, dess deldiagram och diagramtyper. I den första "
"panelen väljer du diagramtyp och undertyp samt, för vissa typer, en stil. I "
"den andra panelen konfigurerar du diagrammets olika delar. När du är klar "
"stänger du guiden genom att klicka på <guibutton>OK</guibutton>. Detta steg "
"beskrivs närmare i <xref linkend=\"sect-graphs-graphguru-navigating\"/> "
"nedan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Inserting the graph"
msgstr "Infoga grafen"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Finally, the graph is inserted into the worksheet like any other graphical "
"element, as was explained in <xref linkend=\"sect-graphical-overview-"
"adding\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Till sist infogar du grafen i kalkylbladet på samma sätt som andra grafiska "
"element, enligt beskrivningen i <xref linkend=\"sect-graphical-overview-"
"adding\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "On Terminology"
msgstr "Terminologi"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The terminology used for describing the components of data graphs is "
"confusing because graphs use many components and the words are applied "
"arbitrarily to each component. For example, the words \"graph\", \"chart\", "
"and \"plot\" could be used interchangeably but in "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> these words are used as explained below."
msgstr ""
"Terminologin för delarna i datagrafer kan vara förvirrande eftersom grafer "
"består av många delar och benämningarna används godtyckligt. Orden ”graf”, "
"”diagram” och ”rittyp” kan till exempel användas om vartannat, men i "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> har de betydelserna som förklaras nedan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The term 'graph' will be used, in this documentation, to refer to the entire"
" graphical element placed on the worksheet. A graph has an outline and a "
"background, may have one or more titles, and will have at least one 'chart'."
msgstr ""
"I den här dokumentationen syftar ”graf” på hela det grafiska objektet i "
"kalkylbladet. En graf har en kantlinje och en bakgrund, kan ha en eller "
"flera rubriker och innehåller minst ett ”diagram”."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The term 'chart' will be used to denote an intermediate level element which "
"has an outline and a background, may have one or more titles, may have a "
"legend and will have at least one 'plot'. To support the plot, the chart may"
" have a 'grid' area behind the plotted data, and have one or more axes."
msgstr ""
"”Diagram” betecknar en mellanliggande del med kantlinje och bakgrund. Den "
"kan ha en eller flera rubriker, en förklaring och minst en ”rittyp”. "
"Diagrammet kan också ha ett rutnätsområde bakom den utritade datan och en "
"eller flera axlar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Each 'plot' will be defined to be of a particular type when it is created. "
"Plots will have one or more 'series' of data values which will define the "
"magnitude of the values of to be plotted and may define a number of other "
"related values including errors in the x and y directions."
msgstr ""
"Varje ”rittyp” tilldelas en särskild typ när den skapas. Den innehåller en "
"eller flera dataserier vars värden anger storleken på det som ska ritas ut. "
"Serierna kan också innehålla andra relaterade värden, till exempel felvärden"
" i x- och y-led."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"This terminology can be used to describe in detail the components of a graph"
" in <application>Gnumeric</application>. <xref linkend=\"fig-graph-"
"components\"/> presents the components of a graph."
msgstr ""
"Med den här terminologin går det att beskriva delarna i en graf i "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> i detalj. <xref linkend=\"fig-graph-"
"components\"/> visar grafens delar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The Components of Graphs"
msgstr "Grafens delar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The components of <application>Gnumeric</application> graphs"
msgstr "Delarna i grafer i <application>Gnumeric</application>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"This screenshot depicts a graph in <application>Gnumeric</application> and "
"describes all of the components."
msgstr ""
"Den här skärmbilden visar en graf i <application>Gnumeric</application> och "
"beskriver alla dess delar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"This screenshot presents several of the major components of "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> graphs. These components will be "
"presented next in their containment hierarchy. The hierarchy is used in the "
"<interface>Graph Guru</interface> to organize the components so a user can "
"change all the preferences."
msgstr ""
"Den här skärmbilden visar några av huvuddelarna i grafer i "
"<application>Gnumeric</application>. Därefter presenteras delarna i den "
"hierarki de ingår i. <interface>Diagramguiden</interface> använder hierarkin"
" för att organisera delarna och låta dig ändra deras inställningar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The Graph Component Hierarchy"
msgstr "Hierarkin för grafens delar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The components that make up a graph in <application>Gnumeric</application> "
"are arranged in a hierarchy with all the configurable options of the graph "
"assigned as properties to one of the components in the hierarchy."
msgstr ""
"Delarna i en graf i <application>Gnumeric</application> är ordnade i en "
"hierarki. Alla inställningar som kan konfigureras för grafen tilldelas som "
"egenskaper till någon av delarna i hierarkin."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The hierarchy of components and their properties"
msgstr "Delarnas hierarki och egenskaper"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"This figure includes an image of the graph hierarchy presented by the graph "
"guru along with text descriptions of each component and of their properties."
msgstr ""
"Bilden visar hierarkin i diagramguiden samt textbeskrivningar av varje del "
"och dess egenskaper."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The hierarchy of graph component elements and the associated properties. In "
"this case, the element 'X-Axis2' is selected."
msgstr ""
"Hierarkin för grafens delar och deras egenskaper. Här är elementet ”X-Axis2”"
" markerat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"In <application>Gnumeric</application>, Graphs are the top level element "
"containing all the other components. Graphs have two properties related to "
"the style of the background rectangular panel, its fill and its outline. "
"Graphs can hold one or more titles and one or more charts."
msgstr ""
"I <application>Gnumeric</application> är grafen den översta nivån och "
"innehåller alla andra delar. Grafen har två egenskaper för bakgrundsrutans "
"utseende: fyllning och kantlinje. Den kan innehålla en eller flera rubriker "
"och diagram."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Titles have the same properties related to their background rectangular "
"panel, the fill and outline, have properties related to the text, the font "
"type, style, and size, and have the text data that will be the title itself."
msgstr ""
"Rubriker har egenskaper för bakgrundsrutans fyllning och kantlinje samt för "
"textens typsnitt, stil och storlek. De innehåller också själva rubriktexten."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Charts have the same properties related to the background rectangular panel "
"and can contain a number of other components including their own titles, a "
"legend, plot accessories and plots."
msgstr ""
"Diagram har motsvarande egenskaper för bakgrundsrutans utseende och kan "
"innehålla flera andra delar, till exempel egna rubriker, en förklaring, "
"tillbehör för rittyper och rittyper."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Legends have the same properties related to their background rectangular "
"panel and also have the properties related to the font in which the name of "
"each series will be added to the legend, the font type, style, and size."
msgstr ""
"Förklaringar har samma egenskaper för bakgrundsrutans utseende. De har också"
" inställningar för typsnitt, stil och storlek på texten med namnet på varje "
"dataserie."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Grids are the background of Cartesian plots and have the properties "
"determining the fill of this area and the line pattern displayed behind the "
"plotted series."
msgstr ""
"Rutnät utgör bakgrunden i kartesiska diagram och har inställningar för "
"områdets fyllning och linjemönstret som visas bakom dataserierna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The properties of each type of plot, and of the data series they contain, "
"vary depending on the actual type of the plot. For instance, the values of a"
" data series which are plotted as a pie plot will not have any associated "
"error values, whereas values plotted as columns could be associated to "
"Y-error values and values plotted as an XY scatterplot could be associated "
"with error values in both the X and the Y direction. Obviously, these "
"different plot types will require different options. The options associated "
"with each specific plot type will be discussed below, in <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-graphs-elementProperties\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Egenskaperna för varje diagramtyp och dess dataserier beror på diagramtypen."
" Värden i ett cirkeldiagram har till exempel inga tillhörande felvärden, "
"medan kolumner kan ha Y-felvärden och ett XY-spridningsdiagram kan ha "
"felvärden i både X- och Y-led. De olika diagramtyperna kräver därför olika "
"alternativ. Alternativen för varje typ beskrivs nedan i <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-graphs-elementProperties\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The Graph Guru"
msgstr "Diagramguiden"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"All graphs in <application>Gnumeric</application> are created using the "
"<interface>Graph Guru</interface> which is a complex dialog that allows for "
"detailed customization of each graph."
msgstr ""
"Alla grafer i <application>Gnumeric</application> skapas med "
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface>, en avancerad dialogruta där du kan "
"anpassa varje graf i detalj."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The components of the Graph Guru"
msgstr "Diagramguidens delar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The <interface>Graph Guru</interface> consists of two panels which appear "
"sequentially. The first panel allows the user to select the type of the "
"plot, and possibly a sub-type and a style. The second panel provides a way "
"to configure the style formats of each component of the final graph. <xref "
"linkend=\"fig-graphguru-panels\"/> shows the different areas of the two "
"panels of the <interface>Graph Guru</interface>."
msgstr ""
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface> består av två paneler som visas i tur "
"och ordning. I den första väljer du diagramtyp och eventuellt undertyp och "
"stil. I den andra kan du ställa in utseendet på varje del i den färdiga "
"grafen. <xref linkend=\"fig-graphguru-panels\"/> visar de olika områdena i "
"de två panelerna i <interface>Diagramguiden</interface>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The two panels of the Graph Guru"
msgstr "Diagramguidens två paneler"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "This screenshot depicts the two panels of the graph guru."
msgstr "Den här skärmbilden visar diagramguidens två paneler."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The components of the two panels"
msgstr "Delarna i de två panelerna"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "<guimenu>A</guimenu> - The Plot Type Selection Area"
msgstr "<guimenu>A</guimenu> – området för val av rittyp"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"This area lists the different types of plots which can be contained within "
"the graph. The desired plot type can be selected simply by placing the mouse"
" cursor over the desired type and clicking with the primary mouse button. "
"The blue highlight indicates the currently selected type."
msgstr ""
"Här visas de olika rittyper som kan ingå i grafen. Välj en rittyp genom att "
"föra muspekaren till den och klicka med den primära musknappen. Blå "
"markering visar vilken typ som är vald."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "<guimenu>B</guimenu> - The Preview Area."
msgstr "<guimenu>B</guimenu> – förhandsvisningsområdet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"This area shows a preview of the currently selected plot type/sub type "
"combination using the default settings for this type of plot."
msgstr ""
"Här visas en förhandsgranskning av den valda kombinationen av rittyp och "
"undertyp med standardinställningarna för rittypen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "<guimenu>C</guimenu> - The Plot Subtype Area."
msgstr "<guimenu>C</guimenu> – området för rittypens undertyper."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Hovering the mouse pointer over one of these icons causes a description of "
"the plot type to be shown next to the icon."
msgstr ""
"Om du håller muspekaren över någon av ikonerna visas en beskrivning av "
"rittypen bredvid ikonen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "<guimenu>D</guimenu> - The First Panel Navigation Buttons"
msgstr "<guimenu>D</guimenu> – navigeringsknapparna i den första panelen"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"These buttons enable the user to navigate through the <interface>Graph "
"Guru</interface>."
msgstr "Med knapparna kan du navigera i <interface>Diagramguiden</interface>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The <guibutton>Help</guibutton> Button"
msgstr "Knappen <guibutton>Hjälp</guibutton>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The <guibutton>Help</guibutton> button should cause this section of the "
"manual to open."
msgstr ""
"Knappen <guibutton>Hjälp</guibutton> öppnar det här avsnittet i handboken."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button will dismiss the <interface>Graph "
"Guru</interface> and return the user to the "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> worksheet."
msgstr ""
"Knappen <guibutton>Avbryt</guibutton> stänger "
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface> och återgår till kalkylbladet i "
"<application>Gnumeric</application>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The <guibutton>Forward</guibutton> Button"
msgstr "Knappen <guibutton>Framåt</guibutton>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The <guibutton>Forward</guibutton> button will dismiss the first panel of "
"the <interface>Graph Guru</interface> and open up the second panel."
msgstr ""
"Knappen <guibutton>Framåt</guibutton> stänger den första panelen i "
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface> och öppnar den andra."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The <guibutton>Insert</guibutton> Button"
msgstr "Knappen <guibutton>Infoga</guibutton>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The <guibutton>Insert</guibutton> button will dismiss the <interface>Graph "
"Guru</interface> and allow users to insert the graph, as it is currently "
"defined, into the worksheet. The resulting graph may not include any plots "
"or data but it can be modified subsequently using the context menu's "
"<guimenuitem>Properties</guimenuitem> menu entry."
msgstr ""
"Knappen <guibutton>Infoga</guibutton> stänger "
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface> och infogar den aktuella grafen i "
"kalkylbladet. Grafen kanske inte innehåller några rittyper eller data, men "
"du kan ändra den senare via snabbmenyns alternativ "
"<guimenuitem>Egenskaper</guimenuitem>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "<guimenu>E</guimenu> - The hierarchy tree of graph components"
msgstr "<guimenu>E</guimenu> – hierarkiträdet med grafens delar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"This area allows the user to navigate the hierarchy of graph components. The"
" components are arranged in a tree with nodes indicated by arrowheads. "
"Components can be selected by clicking on the component name with the mouse "
"pointer and nodes can be expanded or collapsed by clicking on the "
"arrowheads. The selection of different components in this area will cause "
"different property options to be displayed in area <guimenu>J</guimenu> "
"since each component in the hierarchy has its own specific properties."
msgstr ""
"Här kan du navigera i hierarkin över grafens delar. Delarna ordnas i ett "
"träd där noderna markeras med pilspetsar. Klicka på en dels namn för att "
"markera den och på en pilspets för att expandera eller fälla ihop en nod. "
"När du väljer olika delar här visas motsvarande egenskaper i området "
"<guimenu>J</guimenu>, eftersom varje del i hierarkin har egna egenskaper."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Immediately below the hierarchy are buttons that allow a user to modify the "
"hierarchy of components by adding components with the "
"<guibutton>Add</guibutton> button or by removing components with the "
"<guibutton>Delete</guibutton> button. The <guibutton>Order</guibutton> "
"allows the user to change the stacking order of charts, moving them up or "
"down, or of data series, moving them toward the front or back."
msgstr ""
"Direkt under hierarkin finns knappar för att ändra delarnas ordning och "
"innehåll. Lägg till delar med knappen <guibutton>Lägg till</guibutton> och "
"ta bort dem med <guibutton>Ta bort</guibutton>. Med "
"<guibutton>Ordning</guibutton> ändrar du diagrammens lagerordning genom att "
"flytta dem uppåt eller nedåt, eller dataseriernas ordning genom att flytta "
"dem framåt eller bakåt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "<guimenu>F</guimenu> - The preview area"
msgstr "<guimenu>F</guimenu> – förhandsvisningsområdet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"This area shows a preview of the graph as it will look if the user clicks on"
" the <guibutton>Insert</guibutton> or <guibutton>Apply</guibutton> at the "
"bottom of the panel, in area <guimenu>H</guimenu>."
msgstr ""
"Här visas en förhandsgranskning av grafen så som den kommer att se ut om du "
"klickar på <guibutton>Infoga</guibutton> eller "
"<guibutton>Tillämpa</guibutton> längst ned i panelen, i området "
"<guimenu>H</guimenu>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "<guimenu>G</guimenu> - The component properties selection area."
msgstr "<guimenu>G</guimenu> – området för val av egenskaper för delarna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"This area allows the user to change the graph by modifying the properties of"
" the component that is selected (highlighted in blue) in area "
"<guimenu>E</guimenu>. For components which have multiple properties these "
"may be grouped into related sets and placed on different tabs. By clicking "
"on the tabs at the upper left, a user can access the properties in each set."
msgstr ""
"Här kan du ändra grafen genom att justera egenskaperna för den del som är "
"markerad i blått i området <guimenu>E</guimenu>. Om delen har flera "
"egenskaper kan de grupperas efter ämne på olika flikar. Klicka på flikarna "
"längst upp till vänster för att visa egenskaperna i respektive grupp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "<guimenu>H</guimenu> - The second panel navigation buttons"
msgstr "<guimenu>H</guimenu> – navigeringsknapparna i den andra panelen"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If the guru is opened to create a new graph the buttons in this are act in "
"the same way as the buttons in the first panel, in area <guimenu>D</guimenu>"
" except that the <guibutton>Forward</guibutton> is now a "
"<guibutton>Back</guibutton> and takes the user back to the first panel."
msgstr ""
"Om du öppnar guiden för att skapa en ny graf fungerar knapparna här på samma"
" sätt som i den första panelens område <guimenu>D</guimenu>, men "
"<guibutton>Framåt</guibutton> ersätts av <guibutton>Tillbaka</guibutton> som"
" återgår till den första panelen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If the guru is opened to modify an existing graph the following buttons are "
"shown (as in the screenshot <xref linkend=\"fig-graphguru-panels\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"Om du öppnar guiden för att ändra en befintlig graf visas följande knappar "
"(se skärmbilden <xref linkend=\"fig-graphguru-panels\"/>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button will dismiss the <interface>Graph "
"Guru</interface> and return the user to the "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> worksheet, leaving the graph unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Knappen <guibutton>Avbryt</guibutton> stänger "
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface> och återgår till kalkylbladet i "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> utan att ändra grafen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The <guibutton>Apply</guibutton> Button"
msgstr "Knappen <guibutton>Tillämpa</guibutton>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The <guibutton>Apply</guibutton> button will dismiss the <interface>Graph "
"Guru</interface> and apply the changes to the current graph."
msgstr ""
"Knappen <guibutton>Tillämpa</guibutton> stänger "
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface> och tillämpar ändringarna på den "
"aktuella grafen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "<guimenu>K</guimenu> - The panel rearrangement handles"
msgstr "<guimenu>K</guimenu> – handtagen för att ändra panelernas storlek"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"These triple dots in various places of the two panels of the graph guru "
"indicate that the mouse can be used to change the size of the different "
"areas. These handles can be used by placing the mouse pointer above a "
"handle, clicking and holding with the primary mouse button, then dragging "
"the handle to a new position, and then releasing the mouse button."
msgstr ""
"De här tre punkterna på olika ställen i diagramguidens två paneler visar var"
" du kan ändra storlek på områdena med musen. Placera pekaren över ett sådant"
" handtag, klicka och håll ned den primära musknappen, dra handtaget till "
"önskad position och släpp sedan musknappen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The different parts of each panel of the <interface>Graph Guru</interface> "
"have been shaded with boxes of different colors and labeled with a letter in"
" <xref linkend=\"fig-graphguru-panels\"/>. The purpose of each of these "
"sections will be explained below: <_:variablelist-1/>"
msgstr ""
"De olika delarna av varje panel i <interface>Diagramguiden</interface> har "
"markerats med färgade rutor och bokstäver i <xref linkend=\"fig-graphguru-"
"panels\"/>. Nedan förklaras syftet med varje område: <_:variablelist-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Navigating the graph guru"
msgstr "Navigera i diagramguiden"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Graphs in <application>Gnumeric</application> are created using the "
"<interface>Graph Guru</interface>. The process involved in using this 'guru'"
" essentially follows the alphabetical labels presented in <xref "
"linkend=\"fig-graphguru-panels\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Grafer i <application>Gnumeric</application> skapas med "
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface>. Arbetet följer i stort sett de "
"bokstavsmarkerade områdena i <xref linkend=\"fig-graphguru-panels\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Data Pre-selection"
msgstr "Förhandsmarkera data"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Advanced users generally start by pre-selecting at least some of the data "
"they will use in their plots. However, this step requires a complete "
"understanding graphs and this step is not described here. <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-graphs-preselect\"/> will explain data preselection once the "
"rest of the graphing process has been explained."
msgstr ""
"Avancerade användare börjar ofta med att markera en del av data i förväg för"
" sina rittyper. Det kräver dock att du redan förstår hur grafer är "
"uppbyggda, så det beskrivs inte här. <xref linkend=\"sect-graphs-"
"preselect\"/> förklarar förhandsmarkering när resten av diagramarbetet har "
"gåtts igenom."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Launching the Graph Guru"
msgstr "Öppna diagramguiden"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The <interface>Graph guru</interface> can be started in two ways. One way to"
" start the <interface>Graph Guru</interface> is to click, with the primary "
"mouse button, on the toolbar graph button, <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject>"
" <imagedata fileref=\"figures/button-graph.png\"/> </imageobject> "
"<textobject> <phrase> The icon on the toolbar button which starts the graph "
"guru. </phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject>. Another way is to "
"select, from the <guimenu>Insert</guimenu> menu, the "
"<guimenuitem>Chart...</guimenuitem> menu item. Both approaches will launch "
"the <interface>Graph Guru</interface>."
msgstr ""
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface> kan öppnas på två sätt. Ett sätt att "
"starta <interface>Diagramguiden</interface> är att klicka med den primära "
"musknappen på diagramknappen i verktygsfältet <inlinemediaobject> "
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/button-graph.png\"/> "
"</imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Ikonen på knappen i verktygsfältet som "
"öppnar diagramguiden.</phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject>. Du kan "
"också välja i menyn <guimenu>Infoga</guimenu> menyalternativet "
"<guimenuitem>Diagram...</guimenuitem>. Båda sätten öppnar "
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Selecting the plot type, sub-type, and style."
msgstr "Välja rittyp, undertyp och stil."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The <interface>Graph guru</interface> opens to the first of two panels. The "
"areas of this panel are shown in the left hand side of <xref linkend=\"fig-"
"graphguru-panels\"/>. This panel enables the user to select the type of the "
"first plot in the chart, and its sub-type and style. To make a graph with "
"multiple plots, a user should start by selecting the first plot; subsequent "
"plots can be added later."
msgstr ""
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface> öppnas med den första av två paneler. "
"Områdena i panelen visas till vänster i <xref linkend=\"fig-graphguru-"
"panels\"/>. Här väljer du diagrammets första rittyp, dess undertyp och stil."
" Om grafen ska innehålla flera rittyper väljer du först den första; du kan "
"lägga till fler senare."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Picking the plot type"
msgstr "Välja rittyp"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The first area, area <guimenu>A</guimenu>, provides a list of the plot "
"types. The user can pick one of the types by placing the mouse pointer on "
"top of that appropriate entry in the list and clicking the primary mouse "
"button. The blue highlight indicates which plot type has been chosen. The "
"characteristics of the different plot types are explained extensively in "
"<xref linkend=\"sect-graphs-overview-types\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Det första området, <guimenu>A</guimenu>, visar en lista med rittyper. Välj "
"en typ genom att föra muspekaren till motsvarande post i listan och klicka "
"med den primära musknappen. Blå markering visar vilken rittyp som är vald. "
"Egenskaperna hos de olika rittyperna förklaras utförligt i <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-graphs-overview-types\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Picking the plot sub-type and style"
msgstr "Välja rittypens undertyp och stil"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The second area of the first panel of the <interface>Graph Guru</interface>,"
" labeled <guimenu>B</guimenu> in <xref linkend=\"fig-graphguru-panels\"/>, "
"presents one or more icons. The icons presented in this area will change "
"depending on what plot type is highlighted in area <guimenu>A</guimenu>. The"
" icons provide a way to select a sub-type of plot, for example, the icons "
"for the column plot type provide the choice between plotting columns of each"
" data series side-by-side or plotting these columns stacked upon each other."
" These icons may also provide a way to quickly select different styles for "
"the plot type, for example the icons for the line type provide a choice "
"between plotting a simple line or placing markers at the points along the "
"line. The sub-type cannot be changed in the next panel of the "
"<interface>Graph Guru</interface> without deleting the plot and creating a "
"new one. However, the style choices can be altered in the next panel. The "
"meaning of each of these icons is explained in <xref linkend=\"sect-graphs-"
"overview-types\"/> below grouped by plot type. If data has been pre-"
"selected, clicking on the <guibutton>Show Sample</guibutton> will present a "
"preview of the plot type in area <guimenu>B</guimenu>."
msgstr ""
"Det andra området i <interface>Diagramguidens</interface> första panel, "
"märkt <guimenu>B</guimenu> i <xref linkend=\"fig-graphguru-panels\"/>, visar"
" en eller flera ikoner. Ikonerna ändras beroende på vilken rittyp som är "
"markerad i området <guimenu>A</guimenu>. Med dem väljer du en undertyp. För "
"kolumner kan du till exempel välja om dataseriernas kolumner ska stå bredvid"
" varandra eller staplas. Ikonerna kan också användas för att snabbt välja "
"stil. För linjer kan du exempelvis välja en enkel linje eller markörer vid "
"datapunkterna. Du kan inte ändra undertyp i "
"<interface>Diagramguidens</interface> nästa panel utan att ta bort rittypen "
"och skapa en ny. Däremot kan du ändra stilen där. Innebörden av ikonerna "
"beskrivs nedan under respektive rittyp i <xref linkend=\"sect-graphs-"
"overview-types\"/>. Om du har markerat data i förväg kan du klicka på "
"<guibutton>Visa exempel</guibutton> för att förhandsgranska rittypen i "
"området <guimenu>B</guimenu>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Moving to the next panel"
msgstr "Gå vidare till nästa panel"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Once a plot type has been chosen in area <guimenu>A</guimenu> and an icon "
"selected in area <guimenu>B</guimenu>, the first panel has been completed. "
"Clicking on the <guibutton>Forward</guibutton> button will dismiss the first"
" panel of the <interface>Graph Guru</interface> and bring up the second "
"panel."
msgstr ""
"När du har valt en rittyp i området <guimenu>A</guimenu> och en ikon i "
"området <guimenu>B</guimenu> är den första panelen klar. Klicka på "
"<guibutton>Framåt</guibutton> för att stänga den första panelen i "
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface> och öppna den andra."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Configuring the plot"
msgstr "Konfigurera rittypen"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The second panel of the <interface>Graph Guru</interface> enables users to "
"configure the plot. This includes determining the values which will actually"
" be plotted, adding titles to various components, labels to the data series,"
" names to data categories, and changing the appearance of the different "
"components."
msgstr ""
"I den andra panelen i <interface>Diagramguiden</interface> kan du "
"konfigurera rittypen. Det innebär att välja vilka värden som ska ritas ut, "
"lägga till rubriker på olika delar, etiketter till dataserier och namn på "
"datakategorier samt ändra delarnas utseende."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The simplest way both to learn the hierarchy of components in "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> graphs and to understand the properties "
"which can be changed for each component is to work sequentially through all "
"of the components while both noting the components which can be added, "
"listed in the drop down menu when the <guibutton>Add</guibutton> button is "
"pressed, and observing the properties of the component which can be altered,"
" shown in the lower part of the panel, the area labeled <guimenu>J</guimenu>"
" in <xref linkend=\"fig-graphguru-panels\"/>. Each component in the "
"hierarchy can be selected in turn using the complete tree of all the "
"components presented in the top leftmost area, labeled <guimenu>F</guimenu>."
" Components can be selected by placing the mouse pointer over their name in "
"this tree and then clicking with the primary mouse button. The currently "
"selected component is indicated by the blue highlight on that line. Changing"
" the selected component will also change the properties listed in area "
"<guimenu>J</guimenu>. Tree nodes, indicated by arrowheads in front of the "
"name of a component, can be expanded or collapsed with alternative mouse "
"clicks."
msgstr ""
"Det enklaste sättet att lära sig både hierarkin mellan delarna i grafer i "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> och vilka egenskaper som kan ändras för "
"varje del är att gå igenom dem i tur och ordning. Lägg märke till vilka "
"delar som kan läggas till; de visas i rullgardinslistan när du klickar på "
"<guibutton>Lägg till</guibutton>. Studera också egenskaperna som går att "
"ändra i panelens nedre del, området <guimenu>J</guimenu> i <xref "
"linkend=\"fig-graphguru-panels\"/>. Du kan välja varje del i hierarkin från "
"trädet med alla delar längst upp till vänster, området <guimenu>F</guimenu>."
" För muspekaren över delens namn i trädet och klicka med den primära "
"musknappen. Den valda delen markeras med blått. När du väljer en annan del "
"uppdateras egenskaperna i området <guimenu>J</guimenu>. Noderna i trädet "
"markeras med pilspetsar framför respektive dels namn. Du kan expandera eller"
" fälla ihop dem genom att klicka med en sekundär musknapp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "<guimenu>Changing the component elements</guimenu>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Ändra grafens delar</guimenu>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The component elements of the graph can be changed using the buttons in area"
" <guimenu>G</guimenu>. Elements can be added, deleted or re-ordered."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ändra grafens delar med knapparna i området <guimenu>G</guimenu>. "
"Delar kan läggas till, tas bort eller ordnas om."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Adding component elements"
msgstr "Lägga till delar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"An element can be added by selecting the parent element in the hierarchy "
"presented in area <guimenu>F</guimenu> and then clicking and holding the "
"<guibutton>Add</guibutton> button. This action will reveal a drop down list "
"including all the possible elements that can be added. By moving the mouse "
"pointer onto the drop down list and releasing the mouse button while the "
"pointer is over an element, that element will be added. To add a plot to a "
"chart, it is necessary to navigate into the sub-menu to select the plot type"
" and then into that sub-menu to select a plot sub-type or style in a process"
" that mimics the process of selecting a plot discussed above."
msgstr ""
"Lägg till en del genom att välja dess överordnade del i hierarkin i området "
"<guimenu>F</guimenu> och sedan klicka och hålla ned knappen <guibutton>Lägg "
"till</guibutton>. En rullgardinslista visar då alla delar som kan läggas "
"till. För muspekaren till önskad del och släpp musknappen för att lägga till"
" den. Om du vill lägga till en rittyp i ett diagram går du vidare i "
"undermenyn och väljer rittyp. I nästa undermeny väljer du sedan undertyp "
"eller stil, på samma sätt som när du valde den första rittypen ovan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Deleting component elements"
msgstr "Ta bort delar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"An element can be deleted by selecting the element in the hierarchy "
"presented in area <guimenu>F</guimenu>, and then clicking the "
"<guibutton>Delete</guibutton> button below the hierarchy."
msgstr ""
"Ta bort en del genom att markera den i hierarkin i området "
"<guimenu>F</guimenu> och klicka på knappen <guibutton>Ta bort</guibutton> "
"under hierarkin."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Re-ordering component elements"
msgstr "Ändra ordning på delar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The order of some of the elements can be interchanged using the "
"<guibutton>Order</guibutton> button below the element hierarchy. For "
"example, if an element has two titles, the order of the titles could be "
"swapped. Similarly the vertical order of charts can be interchanged. The "
"effect on plots and series is different. For those elements, the order "
"button changes the stacking order in the front to back dimension. For "
"example, if a chart has a bar plot and a line plot, the order button will "
"change which of the two plots is visible in front of the other."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ändra ordningen på vissa delar med knappen "
"<guibutton>Ordning</guibutton> under delarnas hierarki. Om en del till "
"exempel har två rubriker kan du byta plats på dem. Du kan också ändra den "
"vertikala ordningen på diagram. För rittyper och dataserier ändrar knappen i"
" stället lagerordningen, från främst till längst bak. Om ett diagram till "
"exempel innehåller ett stapeldiagram och ett linjediagram kan du välja "
"vilket av dem som ska visas framför det andra."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "<guimenu>Configuring the properties of the Element</guimenu>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Konfigurera delens egenskaper</guimenu>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The bottom area of the second panel, area <guimenu>J</guimenu> in <xref "
"linkend=\"fig-graphguru-panels\"/>, allows the user to configure the "
"properties of each element in the hierarchy. When there are many properties,"
" they will be grouped into similar sets and placed on different tabs. The "
"detailed explanation of how to configure each property of each element will "
"be explained in <xref linkend=\"sect-graphs-elementProperties\"/> below."
msgstr ""
"I den andra panelens nedre del, området <guimenu>J</guimenu> i <xref "
"linkend=\"fig-graphguru-panels\"/>, kan du konfigurera egenskaperna för "
"varje del i hierarkin. Om en del har många egenskaper grupperas de efter "
"ämne på olika flikar. En detaljerad genomgång av hur varje egenskap ställs "
"in finns i <xref linkend=\"sect-graphs-elementProperties\"/> nedan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The second panel of the <interface>Graph Guru</interface> only allows two "
"types of actions to be performed: the hierarchy of component elements can be"
" modified or the properties of an element can be altered. "
"<_:variablelist-1/> Once the plot is sufficiently configured, it can be "
"placed on the worksheet to assess its appearance. The user can return to "
"this panel of the <interface>Graph Guru</interface> using the context menu "
"on the graph. The <interface>Graph Guru</interface> is dismissed by clicking"
" on the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"I den andra panelen i <interface>Diagramguiden</interface> kan du göra två "
"saker: ändra hierarkin över grafens delar eller ändra en dels egenskaper. "
"<_:variablelist-1/> När rittypen är tillräckligt konfigurerad kan du placera"
" den i kalkylbladet och bedöma utseendet. Du kan återgå till den här panelen"
" i <interface>Diagramguiden</interface> via grafens snabbmeny. Stäng "
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface> genom att klicka på "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Place the graph"
msgstr "Placera grafen"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"After exiting the <interface>Graph Guru</interface>, the user must place the"
" graph on a worksheet. Immediately after exiting the <interface>Graph "
"Guru</interface>, the mouse pointer will have changed to the thin cross-hair"
" cursor. The user can place the graph by moving the pointer over the "
"worksheet and clicking once with the primary mouse button. Alternatively, "
"the user can place and size the graph by determining two of the corners of "
"the graph. This is done by moving the pointer onto the worksheet to the "
"first corner, clicking and holding the primary mouse button, dragging the "
"mouse pointer to the opposite corner and releasing the mouse button."
msgstr ""
"När du har stängt <interface>Diagramguiden</interface> placerar du grafen i "
"ett kalkylblad. Direkt efter att du har stängt "
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface> ändras muspekaren till ett tunt "
"hårkors. För att placera grafen för du pekaren till önskad plats i "
"kalkylbladet och klickar en gång med den primära musknappen. Du kan också "
"placera grafen och ange dess storlek genom att markera två hörn. För pekaren"
" till det första hörnet, klicka och håll ned den primära musknappen, dra "
"pekaren till det motsatta hörnet och släpp musknappen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Modifying an existing graph"
msgstr "Ändra en befintlig graf"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"A graph which has already been created can be modified by clicking on the "
"graph with one of the secondary mouse buttons in order to invoke the context"
" menu and then selecting the <guimenuitem>Properties</guimenuitem> menu "
"entry. This will cause the second panel of the <interface>Graph "
"Guru</interface> to appear which will enable the user to make any desired "
"modifications. The use of the context menu was discussed in <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-graphical-overview-contextmenu\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ändra en befintlig graf genom att klicka på den med en sekundär "
"musknapp för att öppna snabbmenyn och sedan välja "
"<guimenuitem>Egenskaper</guimenuitem>. Då öppnas den andra panelen i "
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface>, där du kan göra önskade ändringar. "
"Snabbmenyn beskrivs i <xref linkend=\"sect-graphical-overview-"
"contextmenu\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Deleting a graph"
msgstr "Ta bort en graf"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"A graph which has been made can be deleted by invoking the context menu and "
"selecting the <guimenuitem>Delete</guimenuitem> menu item."
msgstr ""
"Ta bort en graf genom att öppna snabbmenyn och välja <guimenuitem>Ta "
"bort</guimenuitem>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Plot Types"
msgstr "Rittyper"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> graphs can include any of the plot types"
" presented below. The section for each type explains the overall concept of "
"the plot, gives an example, explains the data required for the plot type, "
"and explains the icons in the <interface>Graph Guru</interface> which allow "
"setting the plot sub-type and style."
msgstr ""
"Grafer i <application>Gnumeric</application> kan innehålla alla rittyper som"
" beskrivs nedan. Avsnittet om varje typ förklarar grundprincipen, visar ett "
"exempel och beskriver vilka data som krävs samt ikonerna i "
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface> där du väljer rittypens undertyp och "
"stil."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Area Plots"
msgstr "Ytdiagram"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Area plots present the numeric values of categorical data with the data "
"values of each series connected by a line and the area below the line "
"shaded. This type is directly analogous to the line plot type. Sequential "
"data values are considered to belong to different categories and are plotted"
" along the horizontal axis at equally spaced intervals. The data values from"
" different series are assigned to these categories based on the position of "
"the value in the series, for example, the second data value taken from each "
"series all share one category. The data values are plotted along the "
"vertical (Y) axis according to their numeric value and the particular sub-"
"type chosen for the area plot."
msgstr ""
"Ytdiagram visar numeriska värden för kategoridata. Värdena i varje dataserie"
" binds samman med en linje och området under linjen fylls med färg. Den här "
"typen fungerar på motsvarande sätt som linjediagram. Värden i följd "
"betraktas som tillhörande olika kategorier och ritas ut med jämna mellanrum "
"längs den vågräta axeln. Värden från olika dataserier kopplas till "
"kategorierna utifrån sin position i serien. Det andra värdet i varje serie "
"tillhör exempelvis samma kategori. Värdena ritas ut längs den lodräta (Y) "
"axeln efter sitt numeriska värde och den valda undertypen för ytdiagrammet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Area plot sub-types provide three options for relating the values from "
"different data series. The first sub-type plots each series independently "
"with the data value determining the vertical distance between each point and"
" the horizontal axis. The second sub-type plots the series stacked on each "
"other in a cumulative fashion with the data value of each series determining"
" the vertical distance from the point to the sum of the values in all the "
"previous series. For example, if the first series starts with values "
"<literal>{3.9, 4.2, ...}</literal>, the second series with values "
"<literal>{1.2, 3.5, ...}</literal>, and the third series with values "
"<literal>{3.1, 1.9, ...}</literal>, then the point value for the second "
"element of the third series will be plotted at 9.6 (since "
"<literal>9.6=4.2+3.5+1.9</literal>) along the vertical axis. The third sub-"
"type plots each series based on the proportional contribution of the value "
"to the total of all values in that category. Using the example above, the "
"three values would be plotted at 0.4375, 0.8020, and 1 because the intervals"
" between zero and each of these numbers is "
"<literal>0.4375=4.2/(4.2+3.5+1.9)</literal> for the first, "
"<literal>0.3645...=3.5/(4.2+3.5+1.9)</literal> for the second, and "
"<literal>0.1979...=1.9/(4.2+3.5+1.9)</literal> for the third, although, by "
"default, these numbers are presented as percentages on the vertical (Y) "
"axis."
msgstr ""
"Ytdiagrammets undertyper erbjuder tre sätt att visa värden från olika "
"dataserier i förhållande till varandra. Den första undertypen ritar varje "
"serie separat, där värdet avgör det vertikala avståndet mellan punkten och "
"den vågräta axeln. Den andra staplar serierna ovanpå varandra kumulativt. "
"Varje värde avgör då det vertikala avståndet från punkten till summan av "
"värdena i alla tidigare serier. Om den första serien till exempel börjar med"
" värdena <literal>{3.9, 4.2, ...}</literal>, den andra med <literal>{1.2, "
"3.5, ...}</literal> och den tredje med <literal>{3.1, 1.9, ...}</literal>, "
"placeras den andra punkten i den tredje serien vid 9.6 på den lodräta axeln,"
" eftersom <literal>9.6=4.2+3.5+1.9</literal>. Den tredje undertypen ritar "
"varje serie utifrån värdets proportionella andel av summan för kategorin. "
"Med exemplet ovan ritas värdena ut vid 0.4375, 0.8020 och 1. Avstånden från "
"noll till dessa värden är <literal>0.4375=4.2/(4.2+3.5+1.9)</literal> för "
"det första, <literal>0.3645...=3.5/(4.2+3.5+1.9)</literal> för det andra och"
" <literal>0.1979...=1.9/(4.2+3.5+1.9)</literal> för det tredje. Som standard"
" visas värdena dock som procenttal på den lodräta (Y) axeln."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Area plots do not have any pre-defined styles."
msgstr "Ytdiagram har inga fördefinierade stilar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "An example of area plots"
msgstr "Exempel på ytdiagram"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"A screenshot of a worksheet with a data table and a graph containing an area"
" plot."
msgstr ""
"En skärmbild av ett kalkylblad med en datatabell och en graf med ett "
"ytdiagram."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"This screenshot shows a table of data and three area plots. The data consist"
" of three series organized by row and starting with the words \"Widgets\", "
"\"Gadgets\", and \"Lumpets\". Each of these series has values in five "
"categories. The three graphs illustrate the three sub-types of area plots, "
"with the series plotted independently in the left plot, stacked in the "
"middle plot, and proportionately stacked in the right plot."
msgstr ""
"Skärmbilden visar en datatabell och tre ytdiagram. Data består av tre "
"dataserier ordnade i rader, med namnen ”Widgets”, ”Gadgets” och ”Lumpets”. "
"Varje serie har värden i fem kategorier. De tre graferna visar ytdiagrammets"
" tre undertyper: till vänster ritas serierna separat, i mitten staplas de "
"och till höger staplas de proportionellt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Each series in area plots can include three main elements and two error "
"elements, although only the value element is necessary. The series can have "
"a 'Name' element, which is a single text entry used to identify the series, "
"must have a 'Values' element, which is a sequence of numeric values, and may"
" have a 'Label' element, which is a sequence of text entries used to "
"identify the categories. All of these elements can be defined as references "
"to a region of the worksheet, as literally defined entries, or as formula "
"expressions which result in the correct type. The 'Label' element is shared "
"by all of the series. The legend added to an area plot identifies the "
"different series, by default using the entries of the 'Name' element of each"
" series. The two error elements include a list for errors in the positive "
"direction and one for errors in the negative direction."
msgstr ""
"Varje dataserie i ett ytdiagram kan innehålla tre huvudelement och två "
"felvärdeselement, men bara värdeelementet är nödvändigt. Serien kan ha "
"elementet ”Namn”, ett textvärde som identifierar serien. Den måste ha "
"elementet ”Värden”, en följd av tal, och kan ha elementet ”Etikett”, en "
"följd av textvärden som identifierar kategorierna. Elementen kan anges som "
"referenser till ett område i kalkylbladet, som uttryckliga värden eller som "
"formler som ger rätt typ av resultat. Alla serier delar på elementet "
"”Etikett”. Förklaringen som läggs till i ytdiagrammet identifierar serierna "
"och använder som standard värdena i varje series element ”Namn”. De två "
"felvärdeselementen innehåller listor med felvärden i positiv respektive "
"negativ riktning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The data in each area plot series"
msgstr "Data i varje serie i ytdiagrammet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Element"
msgstr "Element"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"A single textual element labeling the data series. These will be used in the"
" legend which may be displayed with the area plot."
msgstr ""
"Ett enskilt textvärde som namnger dataserien. Det används i förklaringen som"
" kan visas tillsammans med ytdiagrammet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "A series of numeric values."
msgstr "En serie numeriska värden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"A series of textual elements labeling each value. Generally, this series "
"will have as many entries as there were in the \"Value\" series. These "
"entries are shared by all the series in the area plot."
msgstr ""
"En serie textvärden som namnger varje värde. Serien har vanligtvis lika "
"många poster som serien ”Värde”. Alla dataserier i ytdiagrammet delar på "
"dessa etiketter."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Error (+)"
msgstr "Fel (+)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"A list of numeric values with as many elements as there were in the 'Value' "
"list. These values can be in the same units as the numeric values in the "
"'Value' list, can be proportions or can be proportions multiplied by one "
"hundred."
msgstr ""
"En lista med numeriska värden med lika många element som i listan ”Värde”. "
"Värdena kan anges i samma enhet som i listan ”Värde”, som proportioner eller"
" som proportioner multiplicerade med hundra."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Error (-)"
msgstr "Fel (−)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Area plots provide three icons to choose one of the three area plot sub-"
"types."
msgstr "Ytdiagram har tre ikoner för val av undertyp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Area plot sub-type and style options."
msgstr "Alternativ för undertyp och stil i ytdiagram."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"figures/chart_area_1_1.png\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase> The icon for an area plot of the sub-type with independent, "
"overlapping areas. </phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject>"
msgstr ""
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"figures/chart_area_1_1.png\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>Ikonen för ytdiagram med oberoende, överlappande ytor.</phrase> "
"</textobject> </inlinemediaobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The icon for an area plot of the sub-type with independent, overlapping "
"areas."
msgstr "Ikonen för ytdiagram med oberoende, överlappande ytor."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"figures/chart_area_1_2.png\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase> The icon for an area plot of the sub-type with stacked areas. "
"</phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject>"
msgstr ""
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"figures/chart_area_1_2.png\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>Ikonen för staplade ytdiagram.</phrase> </textobject> "
"</inlinemediaobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The icon for an area plot of the sub-type with stacked areas."
msgstr "Ikonen för staplade ytdiagram."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"figures/chart_area_1_3.png\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase> The icon for an area plot of the sub-type with stacked, "
"proportionate areas. </phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject>"
msgstr ""
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"figures/chart_area_1_3.png\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>Ikonen för proportionellt staplade ytdiagram.</phrase> </textobject>"
" </inlinemediaobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The icon for an area plot of the sub-type with stacked, proportionate areas."
msgstr "Ikonen för proportionellt staplade ytdiagram."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Bubble Plots"
msgstr "Bubbeldiagram"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The data values from three series of equal length are plotted on the "
"Cartesian (X-Y) plane, the value from the first series determining the "
"position of the plotted symbol center along the X axis, the value from the "
"second series determining the position of the plotted symbol center along "
"the Y axis, and the value of the third series determining the radius of the "
"circle plotted. Each triplet of series can be plotted with different symbols"
" but the data values of any series can be shared."
msgstr ""
"Värden från tre lika långa dataserier ritas ut i det kartesiska "
"(X-Y-)planet. Värdet i den första serien bestämmer symbolens mittpunkt längs"
" X-axeln, värdet i den andra bestämmer mittpunkten längs Y-axeln och värdet "
"i den tredje bestämmer den ritade cirkelns radie. Varje grupp om tre serier "
"kan ritas med olika symboler, men dataserierna kan dela värden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "An example of a bubble plot"
msgstr "Exempel på ett bubbeldiagram"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"A screenshot of a worksheet with two series of data, each with three lists, "
"and of the resulting bubble plot."
msgstr ""
"En skärmbild av ett kalkylblad med två dataserier som vardera innehåller tre"
" listor, samt det resulterande bubbeldiagrammet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/cells-1.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> "
"</imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of a worksheet with a "
"function.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/cells-1.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> "
"</imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Bild av ett kalkylblad med en "
"funktion.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/cells-2.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> "
"</imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of a worksheet with a function "
"referencing a block of cells.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/cells-2.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> "
"</imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Bild av ett kalkylblad med en funktion "
"som refererar till ett cellområde.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If myCellRange is defined as '$A$1:$B$500' and my_E_Constant is defined as "
"2.71828182845 then we can have:"
msgstr ""
"Om cellområdet myCellRange definieras som '$A$1:$B$500' och konstanten "
"my_E_Constant som 2.71828182845 kan vi skriva:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Opening Files"
msgstr "Öppna filer"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Opening an existing file into a <application>Gnumeric</application> workbook"
" requires working through the <interface>File Open</interface> dialog. The "
"user must select the file that they wish <application>Gnumeric</application>"
" to open, possibly specifying a file format and character encoding."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill öppna en befintlig fil i <application>Gnumeric</application> "
"använder du dialogrutan <interface>Öppna fil</interface>. Välj filen som "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> ska öppna och ange vid behov filformat "
"och teckenkodning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The steps required to open a file."
msgstr "Stegen för att öppna en fil."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Launch the <interface>File Open</interface> dialog."
msgstr "Öppna dialogrutan <interface>Öppna fil</interface>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"In the <guimenu>File</guimenu> menu, select the "
"<guimenuitem>Open</guimenuitem> menu item."
msgstr ""
"I menyn <guimenu>Arkiv</guimenu> väljer du menyalternativet "
"<guimenuitem>Öppna</guimenuitem>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Open the folder containing the desired file."
msgstr "Öppna mappen som innehåller filen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Navigate the folder hierarchy by double-clicking on the folders."
msgstr "Navigera i mappstrukturen genom att dubbelklicka på mapparna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Select the desired file within the folder."
msgstr "Markera filen i mappen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Click on the file name in the folder content area."
msgstr "Klicka på filnamnet i mappens innehållsområde."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "(Optional) Specify a file format type."
msgstr "(Valfritt) Ange filformat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "(Optional) Specify the character encoding."
msgstr "(Valfritt) Ange teckenkodningen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Click on the <guibutton>Open</guibutton> button."
msgstr "Klicka på knappen <guibutton>Öppna</guibutton>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The remainder of this section explains these steps in greater detail, first,"
" by describing the components in the <interface>File Open</interface> dialog"
" and, then, by explaining each of the steps above in greater detail."
msgstr ""
"I resten av avsnittet går vi igenom stegen mer ingående. Först beskrivs "
"delarna i dialogrutan <interface>Öppna fil</interface>, därefter förklaras "
"vart och ett av stegen ovan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Using the <interface>File Open</interface> dialog."
msgstr "Använda dialogrutan <interface>Öppna fil</interface>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Opening a file into a workbook is a relatively simple process. The only "
"complications come from using the <interface>File Open</interface> dialog to"
" find the desired file, from changing the automatic file format type "
"recognition system, or from specifying a different character encoding than "
"that chosen by <application>Gnumeric</application>. The first of these steps"
" will become intuitive once the user understands the functioning of the "
"dialog. The latter two steps are generally unnecessary and can be ignored by"
" most users."
msgstr ""
"Det är relativt enkelt att öppna en fil i en arbetsbok. Det kan bli mer "
"komplicerat om du behöver leta upp filen i dialogrutan <interface>Öppna "
"fil</interface>, ändra den automatiska identifieringen av filformat eller "
"ange en annan teckenkodning än den <application>Gnumeric</application> har "
"valt. Det första momentet blir enkelt när du har lärt dig hur dialogrutan "
"fungerar. De två senare behövs i regel inte och kan hoppas över."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The next section explains in detail the different components of the "
"<interface>File Open</interface> dialog and the subsequent section describes"
" each step in the process of opening a file."
msgstr ""
"Nästa avsnitt beskriver dialogrutan <interface>Öppna fil</interface> och "
"dess olika delar i detalj. Avsnittet därefter går igenom varje steg när du "
"öppnar en fil."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The components of the <interface>File Open</interface> dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutan <interface>Öppna fil</interface> och dess delar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The <interface>File Open</interface> dialog allows the user to open an "
"existing file into a <application>Gnumeric</application> workbook but "
"requires that the user find the folder containing the file, select the file,"
" and optionally define a file format type and a character encoding. The "
"dialog also allows the user to change the list of bookmark folders to "
"quickly access different parts of the file system."
msgstr ""
"I dialogrutan <interface>Öppna fil</interface> kan du öppna en befintlig fil"
" i en arbetsbok i <application>Gnumeric</application>. Du behöver leta upp "
"mappen som innehåller filen och markera den, och kan vid behov ange "
"filformat och teckenkodning. Du kan också ändra listan med bokmärkesmappar "
"för att snabbt komma åt olika delar av filsystemet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The <interface>File Open</interface> dialog first appears as is shown in "
"<xref linkend=\"fig-file-open-dialog-components\"/> which also shows a label"
" for each different component of the dialog."
msgstr ""
"Dialogrutan <interface>Öppna fil</interface> visas först som i <xref "
"linkend=\"fig-file-open-dialog-components\"/>, där även varje del av "
"dialogrutan är märkt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The <interface>File Open</interface> dialog with the component areas "
"labeled."
msgstr ""
"Dialogrutan <interface>Öppna fil</interface> med de olika områdena märkta."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"This screenshot depicts the 'File Open' dialog with the different areas "
"labeled."
msgstr ""
"Den här skärmbilden visar dialogrutan ”Öppna fil” med de olika områdena "
"märkta."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The different components of the <interface>File Open</interface> dialog, "
"shaded with boxes of different colors and labeled with a letter."
msgstr ""
"De olika delarna i dialogrutan <interface>Öppna fil</interface>, markerade "
"med olikfärgade rutor och bokstäver."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The components of the dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutans delar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> - The starting folder selection area."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> – Området där startmappen väljs."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"This area allows the user to begin navigating the filesystem by choosing a "
"starting folder. The navigation system in this dialog only allows users to "
"select sub-folders of this starting folder so the starting folder must "
"contain the desired file, possibly nested in one or more sub-folders."
msgstr ""
"Här kan du börja navigera i filsystemet genom att välja en startmapp. I "
"dialogrutan kan du bara välja undermappar till den mappen, så startmappen "
"måste innehålla filen du söker, eventuellt i en eller flera undermappar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The folders listed in this area include the standard folders provided by the"
" system and a number of folders added, as bookmark folders, by the user. The"
" standard folders provided by the system will vary for different machines "
"and system administrators may have disabled access to certain branches of "
"the filesystem. By default, the standard folders provided include the user's"
" 'Home' folder, the user's 'Desktop' folder, a folder pointing to the root "
"of the filesystem tree and folders for each of the removable storage devices"
" attached to the computer. The user's home folder, on GNU and other UNIX "
"like systems, this folder is usually known as <literal>~</literal> or "
"<literal>~user_account_name</literal> where the phrase "
"<literal>user_account_name</literal> represents the account name used by the"
" current user. This folder is often located at "
"<filename>/home/user_account_name/</filename> in the filesystem. The "
"'Desktop' folder is the folder which holds the files which are displayed in "
"the background of the user's window. The 'Filesystem' folder is the top of "
"the filesystem tree, which on GNU systems is also known as "
"<filename>/</filename>. The list also presents peripheral or external "
"devices. Below the standard folders, area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> has a separator and the bookmark folders selected"
" by the user. In <xref linkend=\"fig-file-open-dialog-components\"/> the "
"folder <filename>currentWork</filename> is a folder named by the user and "
"added to the list of bookmark folders."
msgstr ""
"Listan i det här området innehåller systemets standardmappar och mappar som "
"användaren har lagt till som bokmärkesmappar. Vilka standardmappar som visas"
" varierar mellan datorer, och systemadministratören kan ha inaktiverat "
"åtkomsten till vissa delar av filsystemet. Som standard ingår användarens "
"mapp ”Hem”, användarens mapp ”Skrivbord”, en mapp som pekar på filsystemets "
"rot samt mappar för alla flyttbara lagringsenheter som är anslutna till "
"datorn. I GNU och andra UNIX-liknande system brukar användarens hemmapp heta"
" <literal>~</literal> eller <literal>~user_account_name</literal>, där "
"<literal>user_account_name</literal> står för den aktuella användarens "
"kontonamn. Mappen finns ofta på "
"<filename>/home/user_account_name/</filename> i filsystemet. Mappen "
"”Skrivbord” innehåller filerna som visas på användarens skrivbord. Mappen "
"”Filsystem” är filsystemsträdets rot och kallas också <filename>/</filename>"
" i GNU-system. Listan visar också kringutrustning och externa enheter. Under"
" standardmapparna finns en avdelare i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> och användarens bokmärkesmappar. I <xref "
"linkend=\"fig-file-open-dialog-components\"/> är mappen "
"<filename>currentWork</filename> en mapp som användaren har namngivit och "
"lagt till i listan över bokmärkesmappar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "Understanding the file organization system."
msgstr "Filsystemets struktur."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"In order to understand how to change folders, it is first necessary to "
"understand the system by which documents are stored. This system is called "
"the 'filesystem'."
msgstr ""
"För att förstå hur du byter mapp behöver du först känna till hur dokument "
"lagras. Det kallas för filsystemet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"All documents are stored in a folder. Folders can contain files but can also"
" contain other folders. Any folder therefore can contain several sub-"
"folders, each of which may itself contain several sub-folders; the resulting"
" structure is called a nested 'tree' with the original folder being the "
"'relative root' of that tree."
msgstr ""
"Alla dokument lagras i mappar. En mapp kan innehålla filer och andra mappar."
" Den kan alltså ha flera undermappar, som i sin tur kan innehålla fler "
"undermappar. Den här strukturen kallas ett nästlat träd, där den "
"ursprungliga mappen är trädets relativa rot."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"In GNU and UNIX systems, all of the files are stored in folders organized in"
" a single, unified filesystem tree with a folder named "
"'<filename>/</filename>' at the absolute root of the tree. Every file is "
"accessible from this absolute root folder and, by default, this folder is "
"provided as the choice named <filename>Filesystem</filename> with an icon of"
" a disk drive in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> in the "
"<interface>File Open</interface> dialog."
msgstr ""
"I GNU- och UNIX-system lagras alla filer i mappar i ett gemensamt "
"filsystemsträd. Längst upp i trädet finns en mapp med namnet "
"'<filename>/</filename>', filsystemets absoluta rot. Alla filer går att nå "
"från den här rotmappen. Som standard visas den som alternativet "
"<filename>Filsystem</filename>, med en hårddiskikon i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> i dialogrutan <interface>Öppna fil</interface>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Navigating the directory tree from the single root folder would quickly "
"become burdensome and the <interface>File Open</interface> dialog provides "
"several other starting folders in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis>."
" Two starting folders which are commonly provided are the 'Home' and "
"'Desktop' folders for the current user."
msgstr ""
"Det skulle snabbt bli omständligt att navigera i katalogträdet från den enda"
" rotmappen. Därför erbjuder dialogrutan <interface>Öppna fil</interface> "
"flera andra startmappar i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis>. Två "
"vanliga startmappar är den aktuella användarens ”Hem” och ”Skrivbord”."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"In a complex computer system, the absolute root folder may be hidden from "
"the user and the starting folders accessible to the user may only provide "
"limited access to the filesystem. Jointly, the starting folders provided "
"should allow the users to access all the folders in which the user has "
"permission to store files and to the folders which are designed to be read "
"by the user."
msgstr ""
"I ett komplext datorsystem kan den absoluta rotmappen vara dold för "
"användaren, och startmapparna kan ge begränsad åtkomst till filsystemet. "
"Tillsammans bör de ge användaren åtkomst till alla mappar där hen får lagra "
"filer och till mappar som är avsedda att kunna läsas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Several starting folders may be provided when files can be opened from "
"different filesystems. This will be the case when filesystem on other "
"machines are accessible over a network or when "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> is running on operating systems whose "
"filesystems are not unified, such as the proprietary operating systems sold "
"by Microsoft in which each disk drive has its own root named, for example, "
"<filename>C:\\</filename> or <filename>D:\\</filename>."
msgstr ""
"Flera startmappar kan visas om filer kan öppnas från olika filsystem. Så är "
"fallet när andra datorers filsystem nås via ett nätverk eller när "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> körs på ett operativsystem vars "
"filsystem inte är enhetligt. I vissa proprietära operativsystem från "
"Microsoft har varje diskenhet till exempel en egen rotmapp med namnet "
"<filename>C:\\</filename> eller <filename>D:\\</filename>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Additional starting folders can be added as 'bookmark folders' by the users "
"themselves. These bookmark folders do not provide access to a different set "
"of folders but merely provide efficient access to a folder and its sub-"
"folders. These bookmark folders are easy to change to allow a user to work "
"efficiently. These bookmark folders are listed, in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">A</emphasis>, under the thin horizontal separator line. The "
"creation and deletion of these bookmark folders is explained below, in <xref"
" linkend=\"sect-file-open-dialog-bookmarks\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan själv lägga till fler startmappar som bokmärkesmappar. De ger inte "
"åtkomst till fler mappar, utan bara snabb åtkomst till en mapp och dess "
"undermappar. Bokmärkesmapparna är enkla att ändra så att du kan arbeta "
"effektivt. De visas i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis>, under den"
" tunna vågräta avdelaren. I <xref linkend=\"sect-file-open-dialog-"
"bookmarks\"/> beskrivs hur du skapar och tar bort bokmärkesmappar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">B</emphasis> - The folder hierarchy area."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">B</emphasis> – Området med mappträdet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"This area displays the folder hierarchy starting from the starting folder "
"selected in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> and ending in the "
"current folder, the folder whose contents are displayed in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">C</emphasis>, while displaying all the folders between the "
"two. This area changes dynamically as the user changes to new folders. In "
"the case shown in <xref linkend=\"fig-file-open-dialog-components\"/>, the "
"user has selected their 'Home' folder as the starting folder in area "
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> and has not navigated to any sub-"
"folders."
msgstr ""
"Här visas mappträdet från startmappen som valts i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> till den aktuella mappen, vars innehåll visas i "
"område <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis>. Alla mappar däremellan visas "
"också. Området uppdateras när användaren går till en annan mapp. I <xref "
"linkend=\"fig-file-open-dialog-components\"/> har användaren valt ”Hem” som "
"startmapp i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> och inte öppnat "
"någon undermapp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> - The folder content area."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> – Området som visar mappinnehållet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "This list of folders and files is filtered."
msgstr "Listan med mappar och filer är filtrerad."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Not all of the sub-folders and files present in the folder area are shown."
msgstr "Alla undermappar och filer i mappen visas inte."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Firstly, hidden folders and files, those that start with a leading period, "
"are not displayed by default. These can be shown by placing the mouse "
"pointer over area <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis>, clicking with one of"
" the secondary mouse buttons to raise the context menu, moving the pointer "
"onto the <guimenuitem>Show hidden files</guimenuitem> menu entry, and "
"clicking with the primary mouse button. This step will ensure that all the "
"folders are displayed."
msgstr ""
"Dolda mappar och filer, vars namn börjar med en punkt, visas inte som "
"standard. Du kan visa dem genom att föra pekaren till område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">C</emphasis>, klicka med en sekundär musknapp för att öppna "
"snabbmenyn, föra pekaren till menyalternativet <guimenuitem>Visa dolda "
"filer</guimenuitem> och klicka med primär musknapp. Då visas alla mappar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Secondly, the filtering rule defined in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> will limit the files displayed based on the "
"characteristics of these files. By default, a filtering rule is applied "
"which causes only those files present that have an extension commonly used "
"for spreadsheet files. The rule can be changed to display all the files "
"regardless of their extension, except possibly for the hidden files."
msgstr ""
"Filterregeln i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> begränsar också "
"vilka filer som visas, utifrån deras egenskaper. Som standard visas bara "
"filer med en filändelse som brukar användas för kalkylblad. Du kan ändra "
"regeln så att alla filer visas oavsett filändelse, möjligen med undantag för"
" dolda filer."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"This area displays the contents of the currently selected folder which is "
"the rightmost folder shown in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">B</emphasis>. "
"<_:warning-1/>"
msgstr ""
"Här visas innehållet i den valda mappen, alltså den mapp längst till höger i"
" område <emphasis role=\"bold\">B</emphasis>. <_:warning-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">D</emphasis> - The panel rearrangement handles."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">D</emphasis> – Handtag för att ändra panelernas "
"storlek och placering."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"These triple dots indicate that the mouse can be used to change the shape "
"and size of the different areas in the dialog. These handles can be used by "
"placing the mouse pointer above a handle, clicking and holding with the "
"primary mouse button, then dragging the handle to a new position, and then "
"releasing the mouse button."
msgstr ""
"De tre punkterna visar att du kan ändra storlek och form på dialogrutans "
"olika områden med musen. Placera pekaren på ett handtag, håll ned primär "
"musknapp, dra handtaget till en ny plats och släpp musknappen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">E</emphasis> - The bookmark folder list modification"
" buttons."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">E</emphasis> – Knappar för att ändra listan med "
"bokmärkesmappar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"These buttons will add or remove folders to or from the list of bookmark "
"folders in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis>. The "
"<guibutton>Add</guibutton> button will add the folder currently selected in "
"area <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis>. The <guibutton>Remove</guibutton>"
" button will remove any bookmark folder that is selected in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">A</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Med de här knapparna lägger du till eller tar bort mappar i listan över "
"bokmärkesmappar i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis>. Knappen "
"<guibutton>Lägg till</guibutton> lägger till mappen som är markerad i område"
" <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis>. Knappen <guibutton>Ta "
"bort</guibutton> tar bort den bokmärkesmapp som är markerad i område "
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> - The filter definition area."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> – Området där filter väljs."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"This area contains a drop down menu with the different filters defined by "
"the application. Filters are rules that limit the types of files which are "
"displayed in the folder content area, area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">C</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Det här området innehåller en rullgardinsmeny med programmets olika filter. "
"Filtren är regler som begränsar vilka filtyper som visas i området med "
"mappens innehåll, område <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"By default, the <interface>File Open</interface> dialog starts with a filter"
" named \"Spreadsheets\" which causes the folder content list to only show "
"files which are recognized as files that <application>Gnumeric</application>"
" could open."
msgstr ""
"Som standard använder dialogrutan <interface>Öppna fil</interface> filtret "
"”Kalkylblad”. Då visar listan över mappinnehåll bara filer som känns igen "
"som sådana <application>Gnumeric</application> kan öppna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The filter in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> can be changed by "
"clicking on the area to open the drop down list and then selecting the "
"filter named \"All files\". This filter applies no rules, essentially "
"disabling any filtering operation, and lists all the files in the currently "
"selected folder. Note, however, as explained in the warning given in the "
"section explaining area <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> above, that any"
" files starting with a leading period are not shown. To display such "
"'hidden' files, the user must use the context menu available in area "
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ändra filtret i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> genom att"
" klicka där, öppna rullgardinsmenyn och välja filtret ”Alla filer”. Det "
"filtret tillämpar inga regler, så filtreringen stängs i praktiken av och "
"alla filer i den valda mappen visas. Tänk ändå på att filer vars namn börjar"
" med en punkt inte visas, som varningen ovan i avsnittet om område <emphasis"
" role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> förklarar. Om du vill visa sådana dolda filer "
"öppnar du snabbmenyn i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">G</emphasis> - The file format type selection area."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">G</emphasis> – Området där filformat väljs."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"This area provides a drop down list of all the file formats provided by the "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> program itself and by all the currently "
"active plugins."
msgstr ""
"Här finns en rullgardinsmeny med alla filformat som tillhandahålls av "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> och de aktiva insticksmodulerna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"By default, <application>Gnumeric</application> is configured to "
"automatically recognize the type of each file selected by the user. This "
"recognition system is sophisticated and generally works. The best strategy "
"is to try opening the file using this automatic recognition strategy and, "
"only if the automatic recognition system fails, close the worksheet with the"
" mangled file and re-try to open the file a second time but manually "
"selecting the file type in the second attempt."
msgstr ""
"Som standard identifierar <application>Gnumeric</application> automatiskt "
"filtypen. Funktionen är avancerad och fungerar i regel. Prova först att "
"öppna filen med den automatiska identifieringen. Om den misslyckas stänger "
"du kalkylbladet med det felaktigt tolkade innehållet och försöker igen genom"
" att välja filtypen manuellt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The file formats which can be selected are those listed in <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-file-open-formats\"/> below. Each of these formats are "
"explained in detail in <xref linkend=\"sect-file-formats\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan välja filformaten som listas i <xref linkend=\"sect-file-open-"
"formats\"/> nedan. Varje format beskrivs närmare i <xref linkend=\"sect-"
"file-formats\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"If the file format type named \"Text import (configurable)\" is opened, this"
" will start the text import procedure. <xref linkend=\"sect-file-"
"textImport\"/> explains this procedure in complete detail."
msgstr ""
"Om du väljer filformatet ”Textimport (konfigurerbar)” startar textimporten. "
"I <xref linkend=\"sect-file-textImport\"/> beskrivs den i detalj."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">H</emphasis> - The character encoding selection "
"area."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">H</emphasis> – Området där teckenkodning väljs."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"This area provides a drop down menu which allows the user to specify the "
"encoding which <application>Gnumeric</application> must use to interpret the"
" characters in text files. This menu is only enabled for the two text file "
"formats: \"Comma or Tab Separated Values (CSV/TSV)\" and \"Text Import "
"(configurable)\". This menu is disabled for all other file types because "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> automatically detects the encoding for "
"those files."
msgstr ""
"I det här området finns en rullgardinsmeny där du anger vilken kodning "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> ska använda för att tolka tecknen i "
"textfiler. Menyn är bara tillgänglig för de två textformaten: ”Komma- eller "
"tabbseparerade värden (CSV/TSV)” och ”Textimport (konfigurerbar)”. För andra"
" filtyper är menyn inaktiverad, eftersom <application>Gnumeric</application>"
" identifierar kodningen automatiskt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"A character encoding is a system to relate the binary digits contained in a "
"computer file to the characters of a textual script. All computer files "
"consist only of binary digits so some system is required to determine this "
"relationship. Where early computers used simple encoding systems which only "
"supported the characters commonly used in English, most systems are now "
"standardizing on the UTF-8 encoding scheme which relates the binary digits "
"in computer files to characters defined in the Universal Character Set, a "
"set which is still being defined but will include all the characters in "
"every language and many other useful symbols for mathematics, science, music"
" and literature. <xref linkend=\"sect-file-textImport-complex-encoding\"/> "
"contains a brief explanation of character encoding, and discusses the "
"encodings available in <application>Gnumeric</application>."
msgstr ""
"En teckenkodning kopplar de binära siffrorna i en datorfil till tecknen i "
"ett skriftsystem. Eftersom alla datorfiler bara består av binära siffror "
"behövs en kodning för att tolka dem. Tidiga datorer använde enkla kodningar "
"som bara stödde tecken som ofta används i engelska. I dag standardiserar de "
"flesta system på UTF-8, som kopplar filernas binära siffror till tecken i "
"den universella teckenuppsättningen. Den utvecklas fortfarande men ska "
"omfatta alla språks tecken och många andra användbara symboler för "
"matematik, naturvetenskap, musik och litteratur. <xref linkend=\"sect-file-"
"textImport-complex-encoding\"/> ger en kort förklaring av teckenkodning och "
"beskriver vilka kodningar som finns i <application>Gnumeric</application>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The character encoding can be set using the drop down menu in area <emphasis"
" role=\"bold\">H</emphasis>. By default, the encoding is set for the locale "
"of the user. The locale is set by the operating system and defines the "
"language, time zone and other geographic related preferences of the user. "
"The character encoding is changed by clicking on the drop down menu button "
"in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">H</emphasis>, that is by placing the mouse "
"pointer over this menu and clicking on the primary mouse button, and then "
"navigating the menu to select the new encoding, that is by moving the mouse "
"through the menus and clicking on the name of the new encoding. "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> will then use this encoding to open the "
"text file."
msgstr ""
"Du väljer teckenkodning i rullgardinsmenyn i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">H</emphasis>. Som standard används kodningen för användarens "
"systemlokal. Operativsystemet styr lokalen, som anger språk, tidszon och "
"andra geografiska inställningar. Ändra kodningen genom att klicka på "
"menyknappen i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">H</emphasis> och sedan välja en"
" ny kodning i menyn. <application>Gnumeric</application> använder den när "
"textfilen öppnas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis> - The button area."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis> – Knappområdet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The button area provides two buttons, the <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> and "
"the <guibutton>Open</guibutton> buttons. Clicking the "
"<guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button will dismiss the dialog and return the "
"user to the worksheet. Clicking the <guibutton>Open</guibutton> button will "
"cause the selected file to be opened into a worksheet, using either the "
"automatic file format type detection or the file format type specified if "
"one has been selected, and using the character encoding scheme if one has "
"been selected."
msgstr ""
"Här finns knapparna <guibutton>Avbryt</guibutton> och "
"<guibutton>Öppna</guibutton>. Om du klickar på <guibutton>Avbryt</guibutton>"
" stängs dialogrutan och du kommer tillbaka till kalkylbladet. Om du klickar "
"på <guibutton>Öppna</guibutton> öppnas den markerade filen i ett kalkylblad."
" Då används antingen den automatiska identifieringen av filformat eller det "
"format du har valt, samt den teckenkodning du har angett."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The purpose of each labeled component in <xref linkend=\"fig-file-open-"
"dialog-components\"/> is explained below: <_:variablelist-1/>"
msgstr ""
"Nedan förklaras syftet med varje märkt del i <xref linkend=\"fig-file-open-"
"dialog-components\"/>: <_:variablelist-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"The procedure required to open a file into a workbook using this dialog is "
"presented next."
msgstr ""
"Därefter beskrivs hur du öppnar en fil i en arbetsbok med den här "
"dialogrutan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The procedure to open an existing file."
msgstr "Så öppnar du en befintlig fil."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Opening an existing file into a workbook requires selecting the folder "
"containing the desired file, selecting the file within this folder, and "
"optionally selecting the file format type and character encoding."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill öppna en befintlig fil i en arbetsbok väljer du mappen som "
"innehåller filen och markerar filen. Vid behov väljer du också filformat och"
" teckenkodning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "The procedure to open a file."
msgstr "Så öppnar du en fil."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">Using the Menus</emphasis>"
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">Via menyerna</emphasis>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Select, in the <guimenu><accel>F</accel>ile</guimenu> menu, the "
"<guimenuitem><accel>O</accel>pen</guimenuitem> menu item."
msgstr ""
"Välj menyalternativet <guimenu><accel>A</accel>rkiv</guimenu> → "
"<guimenuitem>Öpp<accel>n</accel>a</guimenuitem>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">Using the Standard Toolbar</emphasis>"
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">Via standardverktygsfältet</emphasis>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Click on the <guibutton>Open</guibutton> button: <guiicon> "
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/button-"
"open.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of "
"the open file button.</phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject> </guiicon>"
msgstr ""
"Klicka på knappen <guibutton>Öppna</guibutton>: <guiicon> "
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/button-"
"open.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Bild av "
"knappen för att öppna en fil.</phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject> "
"</guiicon>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">Using a Keyboard Shortcut</emphasis>"
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">Via ett kortkommando</emphasis>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
msgid ""
"Type the combination "
"<keycombo><keysym>Ctrl</keysym><keysym>o</keysym></keycombo>, typing both "
"keys simultaneously."
msgstr ""
"Tryck samtidigt på "
"<keycombo><keysym>Ctrl</keysym><keysym>o</keysym></keycombo>."
